ntained in this document, and with regards to any NBN/Internet availability at the property.','townhouse','Semaphore South',-34.84455712,138.47966256,5019,'SA','4/17 Paxton Street','Semaphore South',1,1,1,'Rental Property Network','Carport: 1'),(37,'Low Maintenance Living',470,'Just moments from Curlewis’ best amenities, your new home awaits! This charming property features a north and west orientation, inviting an abundance of natural light into the open-plan living, dining, and kitchen areas. Enjoy direct access to a private alfresco and backyard, perfect for relaxing and entertaining. <br/><br/>Highlights include:<br/>- 3 bedrooms, with the master bedroom boasting a walk-in robe and ensuite<br/>- Family bathroom with bathtub, shower, vanity, and separate toilet<br/>- Low-maintenance tiled floors in high-traffic areas, carpeted bedrooms<br/>- Double garage with internal and rear utility access<br/>- Ducted heating and a split system in the main living zone<br/><br/>Conveniently located just minutes from the new Shopping Centre, with a local Primary School and parks nearby, this home offers both comfort and convenience in the heart of Curlewis.<br/><br/>*All information offered by Bellarine Property is provided in good faith. It is derived from sources believed to be accurate and current as at the date of publication and as such Bellarine Property simply pass this information on. Use of such material is at your sole risk. Prospective tenants are advised to make their own enquiries with respect to the information that is passed on. Bellarine Property will not be liable for any loss resulting from any action or decision by you in reliance on the information.','house','Curlewis',-38.16630831,144.54632394,3222,'Vic','9 Love Street','Curlewis',2,3,2,'Bellarine Property','Garage: 2'),(38,'Yokine low maintenance living - Secure Townhouse on offer!',850,'I am pleased to present 4/54 Moulden Avenue, Yokine, WA 6060. Built in 1996, this well-maintained 3x2 double-story townhouse is situated on a shared 1,044 m² lot and features three bedrooms, two bathrooms, and three parking spaces.<br/><br/>Located 6km north of the Perth CBD, Yokine is an established suburb known for its proximity to the WA Golf Club, Yokine Reserve, and the Dog Swamp and Flinders Square retail hubs.<br/><br/>This move-in-ready, low-maintenance home includes:<br/><br/>- Kitchen: Spacious layout with gas cooking, an electric oven, a dishwasher, and ample storage.<br/>- Living Space: Bright interiors with separate dining and open living areas, complemented by an outdoor pergola.<br/>- Bedrooms: Master bedroom featuring an ensuite, private balcony, and built-in robes. The second bathroom includes a bathtub.<br/>- Security & Parking: Secure double garage, security doors, and a private exterior with full brick paving.<br/>- Additional Features: Storage hot water system and a built-in doggie door.<br/><br/>Please let me know if you would like to schedule a viewing or if you require further information.','townhouse','Yokine',-31.90017000,115.85109000,6060,'WA','4/54 Moulden avenue','Yokine',2,3,2,'Impel Property Group - NEDLANDS','Balcony, Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Living Areas: 2, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Toilets: 2, Pets Allowed'),(39,'Madison Grand - Unapologetic Luxury Has a New Address. Now Leasing – Residences in Southbank.',860,'This isn’t just renting. This is Madison Grand.<br/><br/>For those who demand more — the bold, the refined, the unapologetically ambitious — Madison Grand redefines luxury living in the heart of Southbank.<br/><br/>Rising 40 levels above the city, with sweeping cinematic views across the CBD, Port Phillip Bay and South Melbourne, Madison Grand combines ultra-luxury residences with six-star amenities, a world-class wellness experience, and an exclusive private social club — setting a new benchmark in elite urban