e family home',870,'Tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac in sought-after Eatons Hill, this light-filled home offers relaxed, easy living in a peaceful setting. Elevated to capture breezes year-round, it feels private, airy and welcoming from the moment you arrive. Designed for effortless indoor-outdoor flow, it\'s perfect for entertaining or unwinding by the pool. Enjoy the convenience of being within walking distance to buses, Eatons Hill Hotel and local shops. A spacious family home in a friendly, well-connected neighbourhood.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>• King-sized master bedroom with spa ensuite and walk-in robe<br/>• Three queen-sized bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>• Three separate internal living areas<br/>• Large dining area plus breakfast bar<br/>• Air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>• Insulated undercover outdoor entertaining area<br/>• Solar-heated saltwater pool with feature lighting<br/>• Fully fenced, low-maintenance yard<br/>• Generous storage throughout<br/>• Elevated 795sqm block capturing natural light and breezes<br/>• Walking distance to public transport, Eatons Hill Hotel and speciality shops<br/>• Located within highly regarded school catchments and private school bus routes<br/><br/>This property will not last long. Please note that only those that have viewed the property will have their applications processed.<br/><br/>Information contained on any marketing material, website or other portal should not be relied upon and you should make your own enquiries and seek your own independent advice with respect to any property advertised or the information about the property.','house','Eatons Hill',-27.33943255,152.94730591,4037,'Qld','23 Valencia Court','Eatons Hill',2,4,2,'McGrath Estate Agents Aspley','Garage: 2, Air Conditioning'),(41,'Renovated Family Home with Inground Pool in Prime Location!',980,'Welcome to 9 Bowman Ave, Castle Hill – a beautifully renovated family home offering space, comfort and lifestyle, complete with a sparkling inground swimming pool.<br/><br/>Set in a quiet, family-friendly street, this refreshed residence features four generous bedrooms, a modern bathroom, and a practical study nook – ideal for working or studying from home.<br/><br/>With recent upgrades throughout and fantastic outdoor space for entertaining, this home is ready for you to move straight in and enjoy.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Four well-sized bedrooms with new ceiling fans (3 x with built-ins)<br/>- Dedicated study nook<br/>- Renovated classic style kitchen with electric cooking and dishwasher<br/>- Central, well-maintained bathroom <br/>- Laundry with with additional 2nd toilet<br/>- Brand new Daikin split system air conditioning<br/>- New modern lighting throughout<br/>- Freshly painted exterior concrete area<br/>- Spacious lounge/rumpus area with sliding doors<br/>- Covered areas enhanced with new awnings for year-round comfort<br/>- New front privacy screen door<br/>- Auto Garage with multiple driveway car spots<br/>- Vertical blinds<br/><br/>Outdoor & Lifestyle Highlights:<br/>- Sparkling inground swimming pool – perfect for summer entertaining<br/>- Freshly laid new grass in the rear yard<br/>- Brand new Colorbond rear fence and new pine side fencing for added privacy<br/><br/>Exceptional Location & School Catchment:<br/>- Positioned in the heart of Castle Hill, this home offers outstanding convenience:<br/>- Within the catchment for Excelsior Public School & Crestwood High School<br/>- Minutes to The Hills Swimming & Fitness Centre (Waves)<br/>- Easy access to Castle Towers for shopping, dining and entertainment<br/>- Frequent bus services to major hubs and express routes into the Sydney CBD.<br/>- Close access to Sydney Metro and major road links (M2, Windsor Road) for quick travel around Sydney and beyond.<br/>- Surrounded by quality parks and family-friendly reserves<br/><br/>Located in the heart of Castle Hill, you\'ll enjoy close proximity to quality schools, parks, public transport and maj