m and a cafe on ground floor. <br/><br/>Would you like to inspect this property? Please register for an inspection below if one is available or give our office a call to discuss upcoming inspection times. It\'s important to ensure you are registered so that you can be notified of any changes to the inspection times or cancellations.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, Mosaic Property Management will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All interested parties should rely upon their own enquiries in order to determine whether or not this information is in fact accurate. Photos are used strictly for advertising purposes only and may not resemble the current property exactly.','apartment','Milton',-27.46903283,153.00580333,4064,'Qld','1505/33 Railway Tce','Milton',2,3,2,'Mosaic Property Group - Brisbane','Garage: 2'),(121,'Two Bedroom Townhouse in the Heart of Airlie Beach!',710,'This stylish fully furnished two bedroom townhouse offers sleek, modern living in a sought after location. Surrounded by beautiful rainforest, allowing you the privacy to unwind and enjoy the elements that this property has to offer.<br/><br/>A carport leads to a private entrance that flows into the spacious refurbished kitchen fitted with sleek appliances, and open plan living and dining area. The polished timber floors are impressive as they lead to a generous deck to enjoy the serenity. You will be impressed by the second level with two sizable bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes and their own private ensuites.<br/><br/>The features in this desirable property are endless, with A/C throughout, ceiling fans, mirrored robes, a separate toilet on the ground level, an internal laundry, and screened doors to enjoy the gentle breeze. You can stroll to town with the main street, public transport and the shopping centre only minutes walk away.<br/><br/>To register for an inspection or to apply, fo