stantly informed of inspections, updates and changes to your appointment. If you have any questions please click \'Email Agent\', ask your question and we will get back to you as soon as possible.<br/><br/>INTERESTED IN APPLYING? An application link will be sent to you after inspection or upon request. Copy the link into your browser to visit our applications portal. Find the property you would like to apply for, and send through your application! We can process applications prior to your inspection, so no need to wait until after viewing!<br/><br/>When logging in to submit your application, put your email address in and you will be EMAILED a pin. This will be emailed to you every time you log into 2Apply – it is a security step to ensure your account and personal information cannot be accessed by anyone else.','house','Marsden',-27.67692877,153.10043726,4132,'Qld','54A First Ave','Marsden',1,2,1,'Housemark','Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards, Pets Allowed'),(123,'Brand New And Ready For You To Enjoy!',540,'This beautifully presented 4-Bedroom family home in Armstrong Creek offers plenty of room for you to relax and entertain. You can enjoy the natural surrounds along Armstrong Creek or enjoy a day with friends in the park while the kids create their own fun at one of the many playgrounds peppered around the community. Close to local shops, schools and walking tracks.<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/><br/>- Open-plan light filled Kitchen/Living/Dining area with floorboards<br/>- Kitchen with Gas stove, Electric oven, Dishwasher and Walk-In-Pantry<br/>- Master bedroom with walk-in robe and ensuite<br/>- Three additional bedrooms with Built-In-Robes<br/>- Central bathroom with bath<br/>- Separate laundry with external entry<br/>- Ducted heating throughout with Split System in the Lounge<br/>- Double remote garage with internal access<br/>- Low maintenance backyard<br/><br/>Please register for an inspection by clicking on “Request Inspection” and you will be instantly informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your appointment.<br/><br/>Please apply for this property through the 2Apply link sent to you via email/SMS after the inspection. Please contact us directly if you would like to apply for this property prior to viewing.','house','Armstrong Creek',-38.22828424,144.37411076,3217,'Vic','30 Harriott Rd','Armstrong Creek',2,4,2,'Compass Real Estate VIC - BRUNSWICK WEST','Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1, Floorboards, Split-system Air Conditioning'),(124,'3x1 Home in the heart of Newman',625,'This 3 bedroom property is located close to everything that matters in Newman!<br/><br/>• 3 bedrooms, 1 bathroom<br/>• Air-conditioning in bedrooms 2 & 3 plus lounge room<br/>• Separate lounge and dining areas<br/>• Shower and bath<br/>• Low-maintenance backyard<br/>• Garden shed for storage<br/>• Walking distance to CBD and Newman Primary School<br/><br/>Call Realmark Pilbara\'s Residential Sales & Leasing Specialist Brett Philp on [REDACTED PHONE] today!<br/><br/><br/>* Please note, while care is taken this information is sourced from third parties and public sources, and areas and distances are approximate. Prospective clients should conduct their own investigations, as no warranty is given, and details may change.<br/><br/>','house','Newman',-23.35467345,119.72968860,6753,'WA','7 Windamarra Street','Newman',1,3,2,'Realmark Commercial Pilbara','Carport: 2'),(125,'Lovely 2 Bed Townhouse Walking Distance to Waterfront',585,'Welcome to 4/7 Tramore Street! This two bedroom townhouse in Margate features well-proportioned bedrooms, inviting living spaces, and a welcoming atmosphere throughout. This home is perfect for those seeking easy everyday living in a neat and well-presented setting.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• Open lounge/dining area with floating floors<br/>• Ceiling fan and split airconditioning<br/>• Newly renova