itioning<br/>- Master with walk in robe and ensuite<br/>- Large Patio<br/>- Floor to Ceiling tiled Bathrooms & Superior Timber Flooring in living areas.<br/>- Relax around the Lagoon Pool, Outdoor Cabana & BBQ dining facilities<br/>- Retreat to our Rooftop Entertainment Terrace<br/>- Secure Underground car park<br/>- Conveniently located only a 5 min walk to Westfield, the local Plaza, Clubs & Taverns<br/>- Short walk to Train or Tram across the road<br/>- Apartments are unfurnished.<br/> <br/>Apply For This Property Online: https://TheOnsiteManager.com/apply/21170645<br/>(Listing ID: 21170645 )<br/><br/><br/>','unit','Helensvale',-27.92120383,153.33761694,4212,'Qld','ID:21170645/30 Careel Close','Helensvale',2,2,1,'THEONSITEMANAGER - Queensland','Balcony, Garage: 1, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Intercom'),(127,'WANT SOME SPACE AROUND YOU?',600,'This 4 bedroom, 1 bathroom home with workshop is sitting on some large ground that usual so if you want some extra space for the kids to play, then this is for you!<br/><br/>Features in this property include polished jarrah floors, Split system air conditioning, insulation, gas connection, very good size bedrooms, security screen on doors, open plan family and dining area next to the kitchen. Large patio and decking for the BBQ area. Drive through access to the garage workshop in the rear.<br/><br/>Great location close to schools, shops, public transport and more<br/><br/>***BOOKING A VIEWING IS EASY!!***<br/>1) For more information please inquire and we will send you a comprehensive video walkthrough giving you the chance to apply without physically viewing the property<br/>OR<br/>2) Please submit you details and your preference for PRIVATE viewing times and we will be in touch<br/><br/>BOND: <br/>Need help with your bond? Did you know if you are an approved tenant with Investors Edge R/E you can pay your bond monthly with easyBondpay? Just ask us for details or visit www.easybondpay.com.au<br/><br/>IMPORTANT - Investors Edge is \'Covid-19 Conscious\'. All home open attendees may be asked qualifying questions regarding their health and their recent travel history prior to entry and are required to register their full name, phone number and email address prior. If you are feeling any flu like symptoms please refrain from attendance for an inspection. All of our properties are a \'no touch\' zone. Property viewings may be cancelled with little to no notice should circumstances change. <br/><br/>Disclaimer: This information is provided for general information purposes only and may be subject to change. No warranty or representation is made as to its accuracy and interested parties should place no reliance on it and should make their own independent enquiries.','house','Girrawheen',-31.84118000,115.84151000,6064,'WA','10 Amberton Ave','Girrawheen',1,4,4,'Investors Edge Real Estate - Perth','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Shed, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Workshop'),(128,'Stunning Apartment In Unbeatable Location',630,'Booking an inspection is easy - Simply click on the grey \"Book an Inspection Time\" button and choose your date and time and fill in your contact details in the boxes provided.<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: Inspection times do not go ahead unless you register to attend.<br/><br/>A luxury lifestyle and 5-star living await you in this large one-bedroom furnished apartment. Positioned within Milton Residences, a boutique complex boasting resort-style amenities, residents will enjoy endless convenience with cafes, restaurants, transport, Brisbane River and the CBD just moments away.<br/><br/>Adorned with high ceilings and floor-to-ceiling glass, the living and dining area flows out to a private, elevated balcony admiring sweeping views across Mt Coot-tha. Perfect for relaxing or entertaining, this indoor/outdoor retreat adjoins the galley-style kitchen appointed with stone benchtops, sleek cabinetry and stainless steel appliances.<br/><br/>Boasting floor-to-ceiling windows to draw in mountain views, the large bedroom features a mirrored built-in robe. Servicing the apartment is a modern bathroom and a separate laundry.<br/><br/>Featuring world-class facilities, residents and guests will enjoy the use of a rooftop terrace, sparkling swimming pool, BBQ entertaining area, gym, spa and sauna.<br/><br/>Only 1.5km to the CBD, this apartment is within easy walking distance of cafes, restaurants, farmer\'s markets, Brisbane Riverwalk, buses, train and CityCat. Only 5 minutes walk from The Barracks and Caxton Street dining/entertainment precinct, 9 minutes to Suncorp Stadium and moments from UQ and QUT an executive lifestyle awaits.<br/><br/>Please contact Shane Hurley to arrange your inspection today on [REDACTED PHONE].<br/><br/>Due to high levels of demand, if you are interested in this property please lodge your application via the following website: https://www.tenantapp.com.au/Rentals/Agency/PlaceKangarooPoint','apartment','Milton',-27.46942112,153.00496569,4064,'Qld','810/55 Railway Terrace','Milton',1,1,1,'Place - Kangaroo Point','Garage: 1, Study'),(129,'Large Family Home with Room to Explore',480,'This large family home is located on a double block on the northern end of the island. This property is located beside natural bushlands allowing for the perfect canvass to explore this amazing island.<br/>The home features:<br/>- 3 large bedrooms, 2 with BIR<br/>- Open Plan living and dining that opens out onto the large deck<br/>- Modern kitchen built for the chef at heart<br/>- Updated bathroom with full bath and separate shower<br/>- Large deck overlooking the yard<br/>- Huge under house storage<br/>- Rain water tank<br/>- Lawns are included as this is a double block<br/><br/>*** Photos will be updated in the coming days ***<br/><br/>This house is a must to inspect.<br/><br/>Disclosures:<br/>* No inspections will be arranged until an application is received in our office<br/>* Tenant is to pay for water, electricity, gas (where applicable), any satellite TV services & internet.<br/>* Prior to applying for this property please ensure you have conducted your own enquiries, with your preferred supplier, regarding the availability of NBN or any other services you may require. https://www.nbnco.com.au/connect-home-or-business/check-your-address','house','Russell Island',-27.65851942,153.38581815,4184,'Qld','37 Yacht Street','Russell Island',1,3,2,'Island Life Property Sales & Rentals - RUSSELL ISLAND','Balcony, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(130,'Perfectly Positioned - Bright and Airy 1 Bdrm ~ 1 Bath + Car Space - Walking Distance to University of Melbourne!!',540,'You can\'t miss this opportunity!!<br/><br/>Situated in an absolutely perfect location with stunning surrounds, this one bedroom apartment has all you need for independent city living!!<br/><br/>Featuring:<br/>- 1 bedroom with large mirrored built in robes<br/>- Separate Wall Heating in Bedroom AND in Open Plan Lounge<br/>- Split System in lounge (large enough to cool entire unit!)<br/>- Bathroom with large shower<br/>- Kitchen with dishwasher and plenty of cupboards/storage<br/>- Stunning Views from your own private balcony!<br/>- Secured Complex with your own underground car space with access to complex<br/><br/>Tram at your doorstop, walking distance to lovely parks and gardens, university within walking distance, museums and not to mention some of the best coffee shops and restaurants in Melbourne!<br/><br/><br/>APPLY ONLINE through realestate.com.au to fast track your interest in this amazing property & REGISTER ONLINE to be invited to our next scheduled inspection.<br/><br/>We look forward to seeing you there!','apartment','Carlton',-37.80234619,144.96416170,3053,'Vic','305d/604 Swanston Street','Carlton',1,1,1,'Aquire Real Estate','Garage: 1, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 1'),(131,'Spacious Home in Great Location - Gardener Included',680,'Located in the popular suburb of Dynnyrne, just minutes from Sandy Bay & the City, you will find this elevated three bedroom townhouse. The property features a large open plan living area with a new heat pump, a well appointed kitchen with plenty of storage space and stainless steel appliances including dishwasher. <br/><br/>Comprising three bedrooms, all with built-in robes and the master bedroom with an ensuite and access to the deck, there is a modern bathroom with bath and separate shower, plus the convenience of a separate toilet. A sunny deck with a lovely outlook and a single carport complete the package. <br/><br/>The grounds are maintained by a gardener, making this home perfect for someone looking for low maintenance living so close to all that Hobart & Sandy Bay has to offer. Don\'t miss out, enquire today. Available for a 12 month lease.','townhouse','Dynnyrne',-42.89910574,147.31340243,7005,'Tas','13/10 Waterworks Rd','Dynnyrne',2,3,1,'Southern Horizons Property','Balcony, Carport: 1, Deck, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(132,'The Standard By Aria!',860,'2 Bedroom, 1 Bathroom, 1 Car Space.<br/><br/>$860 per week with a rental increase to $920 per week as of 05/12/2026.<br/><br/>Date of last Rent Increase - 05/12/2025.<br/><br/>The Standard by Aria offers a new benchmark in lifestyle-oriented living with rooftop wine bar and coffee lounge, private dining and theatre rooms, spa and wellness centre, fitness gym and retail shops, including Lune Croissant from Melbourne and our very own wine bar on the ground floor!<br/><br/>All this coupled with a dedicated Building Management team and, as an Aria first, a concierge service will be available for all residents. Curating resident events, as well as in-house services & bookings to make your Standard of living unlike anything else you’ve experienced in Brisbane!<br/><br/>Residents will enjoy a lifestyle like no other with;<br/><br/>• 3 T