-in robe in the master and built-in robes in the second bedroom, providing ample storage and organisation space for all your needs.<br/> - The well-equipped kitchen features a modern oven, cooktop, complemented by a generous pantry, overhead cupboards, and a practical bench area ideal for casual meals and meal preparation.<br/> - Enjoy the versatility living area, including a formal lounge perfect for a casual living area that promotes a relaxed environment.<br/> - The outdoor entertaining spaces are perfect for hosting gatherings or enjoying quiet evenings, <br/> - The backyard is beautifully landscaped, offering a well-maintained lawn provides a serene outdoor retreat.<br/> <br/>The Point of Interest<br/>Located in the vibrant community of Wyndham Vale, 26 Oxford Way provides easy access to a range of local amenities, including shopping centres, parks, and recreational facilities. The property is zoned for Wyndham Vale Primary School and Swinburne Senior Secondary College, ensuring excellent educational options for families. Public transport options are readily available, connecting residents to nearby hubs and major roadways, making daily commutes and travel effortless. This neighborhood offers a balanced lifestyle with both convenience and community spirit.<br/> <br/>All stated dimensions are approximate only. Particulars given are for general information only and do not constitute any representation on the part of the vendor or agent. Any school zoning stated based on www.findmyschool.vic.gov.au as of 24/02/2026. Identification is required on entry to all private and public inspections.','house','Wyndham Vale',-37.89756200,144.61755100,3024,'Vic','26 Oxford Way','Wyndham Vale',1,2,1,'LJ Hooker - Property Point','Carport: 1'),(137,'CHARMING UNIT IN SMALL COMPLEX',440,'Inspire Real Estate is delighted to present this conveniently located, one bedroom unit to the rental market.<br/><br/>Look no further – this apartment is the one you have been looking for! <br/>Lo