isbane River, and stunning parklands right on your doorstep.<br/><br/>This is your opportunity to secure a spacious, private and superbly positioned apartment in one of Brisbane\'s most desirable suburbs.<br/><br/>Lease Terms:<br/>• 12-month lease preferred<br/>• Utilities not included<br/>• Water usage included<br/>• Building Pool will be out of use for renovation for a period in 2026. Set dates are to be determined - Tenant/s acknowledged and accepts this when entering into an application and/or lease agreement.<br/>• Pet friendly, upon application and Body Corporate and Owner approval<br/><br/>Inspections and Applications<br/>Please \"Request a time\" on the listing or contact Brooke on [REDACTED PHONE] or [REDACTED EMAIL] to book an inspection and/or request a link to the application portal via 2Apply.<br/><br/>*Every care and due diligence has been taken in the preparation of this listing. The agency and owner assume no responsibility for the accuracy of the content and encourage all prospective tenants to conduct their own research.','apartment','Teneriffe',-27.45407900,153.04446145,4005,'Qld','9/258 Arthur St','Teneriffe',2,2,1,'Rissman Property - NEWSTEAD','Garage: 1, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Study, Pets Allowed'),(145,'Resort style north facing 3 bedroom unit with balcony in the heart of Kimberley Estate',1400,'Situated in the heart of Kimberley Estate, Rosebery most popular community. This 3 bedroom apartment offers a convenient living, close to Sydney CBD, Eastern Suburb Beaches, Green Square Station, University of New South Wales, easy access to buses.<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>- 3 Bed 2 Bath 1 Parking<br/>- Spacious living/dining<br/>- Master bedroom with built in wardrobes and en suite<br/>- Great sized second & third bedroom with built-in wardrobes<br/>- Internal laundry with dryer<br/>- Pool, gym, sauna and squash court, building manager, 24-hour security, and beautifully maintained garden<br/><br/>For Inspection, please