/>Flexible furnished leases available for stays of three (3) months or longer.<br/><br/>This fully furnished Maidstone home is ideal for corporate relocations, families between homes, or those undertaking renovations who require a well-appointed residence with space, parking and connectivity.<br/><br/>About MadeComfy<br/><br/>MadeComfy curates high-quality furnished homes across Australia and New Zealand, offering comfort, convenience and professional management for extended stays. Our local team manages every detail to ensure a smooth, well-supported experience throughout your tenancy.','house','Maidstone',-37.78326240,144.88078238,3012,'Vic','63 Ringtail Circuit','Maidstone',3,4,2,'Key Flickers','Courtyard, Deck, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Living Areas: 1, Furnished'),(248,'Spacious Four bedroom plus Study Family Home',760,'Nestled at the rear of the church at 383 high street road. This well-maintained and spacious family home offers both comfort and convenience. With four generous bedrooms plus a study, there is plenty of room for a growing family or professionals needing extra space.<br/><br/>The home features ducted heating, split system in most bedrooms, the lounge, and the kitchen, ensuring year-round comfort. The large lounge and kitchen provide a welcoming space for entertaining, while the dedicated study room is perfect for those working from home.<br/><br/>A double carport offers secure parking for two vehicles, and the spacious backyard is perfect for families, offering plenty of room for children to play or for outdoor gatherings. Conveniently located, this property is close to schools, shops, public transport, and freeway access, making daily life a breeze.<br/><br/>This home is perfect for families or professionals looking for space and convenience in a fantastic location.<br/><br/>Bond: $3302.00<br/>Available: 20/03/2026<br/>Term: 12 months','house','Mount Waverl