r, the home will be fully fenced off, ensuring privacy and separate access.<br/><br/>This impressive near new residence offers space, comfort, and versatility in a convenient location close to local amenities.<br/><br/> Contact us today to arrange an inspection - this one won\'t last long!<br/>','house','Yagoona',-33.90361258,151.01004561,2199,'NSW','63A Brennan Road','Yagoona',4,4,1,'Ray White - Bankstown','Garage: 1'),(306,'Immaculate Family Home and a Convenient Location',590,'Welcome to 19 Allspice street, located in a prime position within walking distance of all amenities including schools, public transport, parklands and shopping centres. <br/><br/>ALL THE FEATURES YOU\'LL LOVE:<br/>- Spacious kitchen with electric cooking and ample bench and cupboard space<br/>- Open plan lounge / dining area with air-conditioning <br/>- Master bedroom with bathroom access, air conditioning and private built in patio/exercise room<br/>- Two-way bathroom: shower and bathtub with separate toilet<br/>- Internal laundry <br/>- Covered outdoor entertaining area <br/>- Fully fenced yards<br/>- Single carport with drive-through access<br/>- 2 x garden sheds<br/><br/>Contact us today to arrange an inspection - this one won\'t last long!<br/><br/>BOOK AN INSPECTION: Make sure you take advantage of it - Register today!<br/>TO APPLY: The easiest and fastest way to apply for this property is online through 2Apply! By registering, you will be informed of any updates, changes or cancellations to the inspection and no responsibility is accepted should they not be registered to attend. All other business after the inspection will be done by electronic means.<br/><br/>Please note there may be costs for connection of additional services. These include telephone, Foxtel (pay TV), Internet (if available NBN) and any other non-essential services. Tenants are advised to make their own enquiries with service providers for connection costs and availability of services.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: All info