ject to change due to availability of contractors and administration processes.','apartment','Acacia Ridge',-27.59128628,153.02352378,4110,'Qld','1/22 Limerick Street','Acacia Ridge',1,1,2,'LJ Hooker - Property Partners | Sunnybank Hills | Mount Gravatt','Air Conditioning, Furnished'),(308,'Inspection for Registered Clients Only',660,'UNFURNISHED - This stunning two bedroom apartments brings location and chic modern living perfectly together to offer a lifestyle second to none in ever popular West Melbourne right on the fringe of the CBD!<br/><br/>The Orchid at 55 Jeffcott Street, West Melbourne, is a near new boutique site showcasing light filled and spacious apartments in one of Melbourne’s premier locations. Comprised of two bedrooms each with built in robes, a contemporary central bathroom, sleek and functional kitchen and a large light filled living area complete with heating and cooling. Additional features include heating and cooling, video intercom access, a secure undercover car space and security entrance into the building.<br/><br/>Conveniently located opposite Flagstaff Gardens and within easy walking distance to some of the CBD’s exciting lifestyle attractions you are spoilt for choice. Moments to Flagstaff train station, great café’s and eateries, Melbourne central and Spencer street malls, Etihad stadium, Universities, Queen Victoria Market and so much more. Call today to book your inspection!<br/><br/>*Please note photos are indicative only.','apartment','West Melbourne',-37.81205124,144.95173105,3003,'Vic','202/55 Jeffcott Street','West Melbourne',1,2,1,'MICM - Melbourne CBD & Southbank','Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes'),(309,'Turn key ready in amazing location',900,'Enjoy a fabulous, fully furnished apartment on the edge of Melbournes CBD, offering the perfect combination of style, comfort, and convenience. Located in vibrant West Melbourne, youll be moments from cafes, restaurants, public transport, freeway access, and the citys best entertainment options.<br/><br/>This spacious apartment offers two sun-drenched, generously sized bedrooms, each beautifully appointed with a comfortable queen bed and built-in wardrobes providing excellent storage. The property is complemented by two stylish bathrooms, including a sleek ensuite to the master and a modern central bathroom, delivering both practicality and privacy. The expansive open plan living and dining zone creates an inviting space to unwind or entertain, all framed by stunning Melbourne city views.<br/><br/>The designer kitchen is fully equipped with a generous island bench and high-quality appliances, making cooking and entertaining effortless. Comfort is assured year-round with hydronic heating, air conditioning in the master and living areas, and ceiling fans throughout. Additional conveniences include a European laundry and parking for one car.<br/><br/>Residents also enjoy extensive facilities, including indoor and outdoor areas and a rooftop community garden. You simply need to bring your bag, everything else has been taken care of for you.<br/><br/>Booking an inspection is easy! Simply click on \"Request a Time\" to register your details for an inspection time that suits you. Alternatively, \"Get in Touch\" with our Liveability Agents to enquire today, we look forward to meeting you soon!<br/><br/>By registering, you will be instantly informed of any updates, changes, or cancellations to your appointment.<br/><br/>Applications are processed after inspections have been completed. A link to apply will be provided at the inspection.<br/><br/>','apartment','West Melbourne',-37.80553456,144.94807098,3003,'Vic','103/2 Hawke Street','West Melbourne',2,2,1,'MRE - SOUTH YARRA','Balcony, Deck, Garage: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Intercom, Furnished'),(310,'Comfortable Two Bedroom Home',590,'Positioned in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this well-presented north-facing home offers generous living space, nat