egant apartment is the last word in lifestyle for the busy professional, the downsizer, or couples. <br/><br/>The living spaces are open and easy-flowing, the private areas sumptuous, and come the weekend, the private balcony opens out from the living/dining area for a delightful indoor/outdoor hosting experience that includes breathtaking district views. For those larger soirees with colleagues or get-togethers with friends and family, there\'s a rooftop communal area with barbecue facilities. <br/><br/>The rest of the time, you get exclusive use of amenities including a heated indoor pool and private gymnasium. If you fancy a permanent holiday, this is your new home! Life simply doesn\'t get more convenient than it does in the Norwest precinct. <br/><br/>Features: <br/>• Sumptuous bedroom with built-in wardrobe and access to balcony<br/>• Sleek, contemporary kitchen featuring Caesar Stone waterfall island bench, stainless-steel appliances, breakfast bar, tiled splashbacks, soft-close cabinetry and ample preparation space<br/>• Large, open living and dining area opening out to your balcony<br/>• Fully-tiled, elegant family bathroom with combined bath and shower <br/>• Internal European-style laundry<br/>• Single car space with storage cage<br/>• Additional features: Ducted air-conditioning, downlights throughout<br/><br/>This superb apartment is an easy stroll to Norwest metro station and Market town, local parks, Norwest Business Park and buses. It\'s zoned for Bella Vista Public School and Crestwood High School, which are also within walking distance!<br/><br/>We look forward to welcoming you at the open home!<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst we deem this information to be reliable, the agent cannot guarantee its accuracy and does not accept responsibility for such. Interested parties should rely on their own inquiries.','apartment','Norwest',-33.72965925,150.95845707,2153,'NSW','511/100 Fairway Drive','Norwest',1,1,1,'Agius Property Group - NORWEST','Open Spaces: 1')