st every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained herein, Oliver Hume will not be held liable for any errors in the information supplied. All information is considered correct at the time of printing. Any interested parties should satisfy themselves in this respect. <br/><br/>This is a brand-new property. As with all newly built homes, there may be minor defects or outstanding works requiring attention, and builders or contractors may need access during the tenancy. Additionally, as the home has not been previously connected to the fibre optic / NBN network, please contact your preferred provider to arrange connection. Be aware this may take time and is the tenant’s responsibility.','house','Bellbird',-32.84774142,151.32098680,2325,'NSW','20 Caudalie St','Bellbird',2,4,2,'Oliver Hume Rental Subscription - Newcastle','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Rumpus Room, Toilets: 2'),(423,'Take Centre Stage With This Architectural Masterpiece, Ocean Views & Gas-Heated Pool',2750,'5-month maximum lease term<br/><br/>Enviably positioned in the elevated dress circle above Tamarama & Bronte beaches, this sensational 2-story beach house is designed for relaxed luxury family living and entertaining in generous spaces integrating effortlessly with the outdoors. Private & spacious with excellent cross-flow ventilation from sea breezes, it stands on a 240 sqm approx block with 2 outdoor entertainment areas, gas-heated mineral water swimming pool and sunny north aspect.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/><br/>- Within Bronte Public School Catchment<br/>- 300M to Tamarama beach <br/>- 450M to Bronte beach <br/>- Living/dining area flows to courtyard entertainers courtyard <br/>- Silestone/Smeg gas kitchen with wide island bench, plenty of storage<br/>- Integrated fridge & freezer plus full-size wine fridge<br/>- 2nd living area/ rumpus room opens to a covered terrace with 1