 a seamless connection between cooking, dining and family time.<br/> - The living area is generously sized and filled with natural light, offering an inviting space to relax and unwind. <br/>The open-plan design ensures flexibility for both family living and entertaining guests, while ducted heating and a split system provide year-round comfort. <br/>A second living area offers additional space ideal for a children\'s retreat, home office or formal lounge.<br/>- The bedrooms are well-proportioned and thoughtfully positioned to provide privacy and comfort.<br/>The master suite is complete with a walk-in robe and a private ensuite, creating a peaceful retreat for parents. <br/>- The remaining bedrooms all feature built-in robes and are serviced by a centrally located family bathroom with a full-sized bath, separate shower and quality fittings.<br/>- The main bathroom is finished in neutral tones with modern fixtures, offering both style and functionality for busy households. <br/>A separate toilet adds further convenience for families.<br/> - Outside, the home continues to impress with a low-maintenance and fully enclosed backyard, providing a secure space for children to play or for outdoor entertaining. <br/>The alfresco area is ideal for weekend barbecues or enjoying a quiet evening outdoors.<br/> <br/>• Four spacious bedrooms, including a master suite with walk-in robe and private ensuite for added comfort and privacy.<br/>• Two separate living areas, providing flexibility for families needing additional space to relax or work from home.<br/>• Modern open-plan kitchen with stainless steel appliances, island bench and walk-in pantry offering excellent storage and functionality.<br/>• Central family bathroom with full-sized bath, separate shower and separate toilet for everyday convenience.<br/>• Ducted heating and evaporative cooling to ensure year-round climate comfort.<br/>• Alfresco area perfect for outdoor dining and entertaining <br/>• Secure double lock-up garage with internal access for safe and convenient entry to the home.<br/>• Fully enclosed, low-maintenance backyard ideal for children and easy care living.<br/> <br/>Located within close proximity to local schools, parks, shopping facilities and public transport, this quality home offers an outstanding opportunity to enjoy comfortable living in one of Alfredton\'s most popular and growing neighbourhoods.','house','Alfredton',-37.56131320,143.78869364,3350,'Vic','19 Beldi Street','Alfredton',2,4,2,'McGrath Ballarat - BALLARAT CENTRAL','Open Spaces: 2, Living Areas: 2'),(425,'CHARMING 2 BEDROOM COTTAGE CLOSE TO THE HOSPITAL, SCHOOLS & SHOPS',500,'This delightful 2 bedroom cottage with a study is ready. Both bedrooms are spacious and include built in robes. Perfectly located in the peaceful suburb of West Bathurst, this home offers comfort, space, and convenience.<br/><br/>FEATURES INCLUDE<br/>- Large lounge with timber board floors and gas heating<br/>- Good sized family room for relaxing or entertaining<br/>- Modern kitchen with electric cooking and dishwasher<br/>- Split system air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>- Single carport<br/>- Large sized back yard<br/><br/>In order to view this property, please submit an Online Rental Application. Once your application has been processed, our Property Management team will be in touch to arrange an inspection','house','Bathurst',-33.41404709,149.56429145,2795,'NSW','13 Hill Street','Bathurst',1,2,2,'McGrath - BATHURST','Carport: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning'),(426,'Peaceful Living With Superb Garden Surrounds',510,'Located in a fantastic pocket of Heidelberg Heights. This charming home includes spacious living and dining areas with 2 split systems. And kitchen with dishwasher and gas cooktop. An adjoining study or third bedroom, additional two further bedrooms (master with floor to ceiling BIR), plus a central bathroom, which includes a separate shower and bath. A generous laundry provides side garden access