ay of cafes, bars, and restaurants within the QV square.<br/>-Education & Transit: Walking distance to RMIT, University of Melbourne, State Library, and Melbourne Central Train Station.<br/><br/>Living at QV1 gives you exclusive access to facilities that rival a luxury hotel:<br/>-Rooftop Pool: Swim with panoramic views of the Melbourne CBD.<br/>-Full-Scale Gym: Stay active without leaving the building.<br/>-Secure Entry: Intercom system and on-site management for peace of mind.<br/>Please note that amenities may be closed for some time due to a maintenance schedule with Building Management.<br/><br/>Contact Virginia [REDACTED PHONE] to arrange private inspection times.','apartment','Melbourne',-37.81014804,144.96621407,3000,'Vic','907/22-24 Jane Bell Lane','Melbourne',1,2,1,'Hileon Real Estate - MELBOURNE','Balcony, Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Vacuum System, Intercom'),(477,'jump for jindalee',460,'TO APPLY - please register or book an inspection or click the get in touch button. You will receive a link for the online application form.<br/><br/>Check out this 2 bedroom home located in a quiet street. Both bedrooms offering built in wardrobes. Ceiling fans and reverse cycle air conditioning in the property for maximum comfort all year around. <br/><br/>This property also offers a low maintenance fully fenced backyard.','duplex/semi-detached','Nowra',-34.89617946,150.61472250,2541,'NSW','8A Jindalee Crescent','Nowra',1,2,1,'Integrity Real Estate - Nowra','Open Spaces: 1'),(478,'Easy living in a great location!',470,'*APPLICATION & INSPECTION INFORMATION BELOW* <br/><br/><br/>Property Features: <br/>• Open plan living and dining area with split system air-conditioning<br/>• Private balcony off the living area<br/>• Great sized kitchen with plenty of cupboard space, electric cooking and a dishwasher<br/>• Additional storage area or study nook<br/>• Both bedrooms feature air conditioning and built in wardrobes<br/>