ought from the property owner for the keeping of any pets at the property. Consent must be provided before any pets are on the property.<br/><br/>Disclaimer<br/>Information contained herein is gathered from external sources we consider to be reliable.<br/>Whilst all care has been taken regarding all information compiled for this rental advertisement LJ Hooker Belconnen does not give any guarantee or warranty about the information provided and does not accept responsibility and disclaims all liabilities as to any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We advise prospective tenants to rely on their own investigations and in-person inspections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.<br/>','townhouse','MacGregor',-35.20563534,149.00207534,2615,'ACT','10/141 Macfarlane Burnet Avenue','MacGregor',1,3,1,'LJ Hooker - Belconnen','Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Split-system Heating'),(512,'Modern Coastal Home in Newport!',895,'Experience contemporary living at its finest in this impressive two storey residence, perfectly positioned in the sought-after Newport. Featuring 4 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and multiple versatile living areas, this home effortlessly combines space, style, and sophistication.<br/><br/>With a secure, landscaped yard, an elegant undercover alfresco for entertaining, and close proximity to shopping, transport, parks, and beaches, this property offers a lifestyle of comfort, convenience, and refined ease.<br/><br/>Featuring,<br/><br/>• 341m² corner block with side double gate access<br/>• 240m² under-roof living area, 2700 ceilings downstairs<br/>• Split air-conditioners in downstairs living area and all 4 bedrooms<br/>• Ceiling fans, security screens and roller blinds throughout<br/>• Caesarstone benchtops in kitchen, laundry and all bathrooms<br/>• Bright open-plan living, dining and second lounge room<br/>• Sliding doors to undercover alfresco for outside entertainment<br/>• Kitchen wi