hicle charger, and off street parking.<br/><br/>Situated around the corner from North Ashfield Woolworths and within the catchment area for local schools, this home is just moments from Ashfield Mall, Ashfield Station, parks, and a wide selection of cafes and restaurants, delivering both lifestyle and convenience in the Inner West.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- 4 bedrooms plus study<br/>- 3 modern bathrooms<br/>- 2 storey family home<br/>- Formal lounge plus combined living and dining area<br/>- Modern kitchen with Miele appliances<br/>- Covered entertaining deck<br/>- Fully ducted air conditioning<br/>- Solar panels for reduced electricity costs<br/>- Electric vehicle charger<br/>- Off street parking<br/>- Close to Ashfield Mall, transport, schools and parks<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: This advertisement contains information provided by third parties. While all care is taken to ensure otherwise, LJ Hooker Ashfield does not make any representation as to the accuracy of the information contained in the advertisement, does not accept any responsibility or liability and recommends that any client make their own investigations and enquiries. All images are indicative of the property only.','house','Ashfield',-33.88249978,151.13180954,2131,'NSW','80 Chandos Street','Ashfield',3,4,1,'LJ Hooker - Ashfield','Open Spaces: 1'),(518,'Lovely 2-Bedroom Brick Unit Available in Gatton',425,'This well-presented unit offers comfort, convenience, and low-maintenance living-perfect for singles, couples, or downsizers looking to be close to town.<br/>Property Features:<br/>• Modern kitchen with dishwasher and ample cupboard space<br/>• Open-plan living and dining area with air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>• Two spacious bedrooms with ceiling fans and built-in wardrobes<br/>• Neat and tidy bathroom with practical layout<br/>• Internal laundry for added convenience<br/>• Fully fenced private courtyard – ideal for relaxing or entertaining<br/>• Single automatic lock-up garage with