RA','Furnished'),(525,'Welcome home...',600,'This contemporary two-story townhouse offers a sophisticated blend of style and functionality, perfect for those seeking a low-maintenance, modern lifestyle. The light-filled upper level serves as the heart of the home, featuring an expansive open-plan living and dining area with a split-system air conditioner and seamless access to a private balcony. The gourmet kitchen is a standout, equipped with premium appliances, including a 90cm oven, a five-burner gas cooktop, and a brand-new dishwasher, all framed by sleek cabinetry and a designer tiled backsplash.<br/><br/>On the ground floor, you\'ll find a restful retreat comprising two generous bedrooms, each featuring its own private ensuite and built-in robes for ultimate convenience. The master suite is climate-controlled with its own split system, while the second bedroom enjoys direct outdoor access. Practicality is woven throughout the design with a dedicated laundry, clever under-stairs storage, and a single-car garage with internal access. Integrated security features like a video intercom and alarm system provide total peace of mind, while a ducted vacuum system adds an extra touch of luxury to this exceptional home.<br/><br/>Please note: Pets will be considered upon application - this property\'s backyard is fully fenced and also fully paved and would very-likely not be considered large enough for most outdoor roaming furry friends. Should you apply with a pet on your application we will assume that you have considered this prior, and that you have deemed the space suitable.','townhouse','Rosebud',-38.35563204,144.91014241,3939,'Vic','4/8 Wilson Street','Rosebud',2,2,1,'YPA Dromana - DROMANA','Garage: 1, Ensuite: 2'),(526,'Central Living',495,'Located in the heart of Blackburn, this apartment is filled with natural light and offers leafy privacy, yet a short walk from the transport hub.<br/><br/>Appointed with modern finishes, this is the perfect little home. The fully fitted kitchen comes with a gas cooktop, oven, and integrated dishwasher. Ample storage and pantry space make this area truly functional. Adjacent is the living and dining, with Split system heating/cooling, to make any season comfortable.<br/>The generous balcony is the perfect outdoor entertainer and relaxation hub.<br/><br/>The main bedroom comes with built-in robes, privacy windows, and carpet. Servicing the apartment is the modern central bathroom, with plenty of storage and benchtop space. This accommodation offers a remote-controlled secured car space.<br/>Conveniently located near Blackburn village, a short walk to Blackburn train station, Lake Sanctuary, just a short stroll to popular cafes and restaurants, with easy access to Eastern Freeway/Eastlink, Westfield Doncaster, and Box Hill Central.<br/><br/>Contact us today for an inspection.','apartment','Blackburn',-37.81906000,145.15109869,3130,'Vic','109/18 Queen Street','Blackburn',1,1,1,'Barry Plant - Croydon','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Intercom, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1'),(527,'Spacious Family Home in a Prime Augustine Heights Location',690,'Positioned in a fantastic pocket of Augustine Heights, this beautifully presented home at 63 Cardena Drive offers comfort, space, and convenience on a generous 528sqm fully fenced block. Freshly painted and featuring brand new carpet throughout, this property is ready for its next residents to move in and enjoy. With multiple living areas, quality finishes, and an excellent outdoor entertaining space, this home is perfectly suited for families seeking both functionality and lifestyle.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Four spacious bedrooms, all with built-in robes<br/>- Master bedroom with walk-in robe and private ensuite<br/>- Two well-appointed bathrooms<br/>- Large open-plan living and dining area<br/>- Separate second living area<br/>- Centrally located kitchen with quality appliances and ample