g the covered patio<br/>- Family bathroom featuring separate bath and shower with vanity, positioned adjacent to a separate toilet for added convenience<br/>- Internal laundry located off the hallway with direct external access<br/>- Expansive covered rear patio, ideal for outdoor entertaining<br/>- Single lock-up garage with internal access to the home<br/>- Covered front porch enhancing street appeal<br/>- Set on a low-maintenance allotment in a quiet cul-de-sac in Wilsonton, close to local schools, shopping centres and a short drive to the Toowoomba CBD<br/><br/>Welcome to 11 Crusader Court, Wilsonton a neat and well-laid-out home offering practical living spaces, generous outdoor entertaining and a convenient location close to everyday amenities.<br/><br/>The home comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms, all positioned along the hallway and serviced by the main bathroom for easy family living. The bathroom includes a separate bath and shower with vanity, and is positioned adjacent to a separate toilet for added convenience.<br/><br/>At the front of the home, a spacious separate living room provides a comfortable setting for relaxing or entertaining. Flowing through from here, the dedicated dining area adjoins the centrally located kitchen, creating a practical layout for daily living. The kitchen overlooks the covered rear patio, allowing for easy indoor-outdoor connection and visibility to the backyard.<br/><br/>An internal laundry is conveniently located off the hallway and offers direct external access.<br/><br/>Outdoor living is a highlight, with an expansive covered rear patio ideal for entertaining family and friends or enjoying quiet afternoons at home. A covered front porch enhances the homes street appeal, while the property sits on a low-maintenance allotment in a quiet cul-de-sac.<br/><br/>Vehicle accommodation is provided by a single lock-up garage with internal access to the home.<br/><br/>Positioned in the popular suburb of Wilsonton, the property is close to local schools, shopping centres and public transport, and only a short drive to the Toowoomba CBD offering comfort and convenience in a well-connected location.<br/><br/>LAWNS / GARDENS: Tenants to maintain lawns and gardens. <br/><br/>WATER: This property has a Water Efficient Certification, hence tenants to pay for all water used. <br/><br/>FAQs <br/>Preferred initial lease term: 6 or 12 months<br/><br/>Pets on Application <br/><br/>The Tenant must not, or allow any other person to, use or smoke tobacco or other smoke producing substances within any dwelling on the premises. For the purposes of this Special Term a dwelling contained on the Premises shall include any enclosed area, room or structure attached to the dwelling, including but not limited to any garage, sunroom or enclosed veranda. A dwelling shall include any structure on the Premises designed to be used as a residence for human habitation.<br/><br/>School-Aged Children? Copy and paste the link below into your browser for local school catchment areas http://www.qgso.qld.gov.au/maps/edmap','house','Wilsonton',-27.53374412,151.91755752,4350,'Qld','11 Crusader Court','Wilsonton',1,3,1,'REMAX Success - Toowoomba','Garage: 1, Pets Allowed'),(529,'Live where the action is and come home to calm.',550,'Just off the buzz of Glenferrie Road and footsteps from Hawthorn railway station, this oversized one-bedroom apartment puts you right in the sweet spot of Hawthorn living. Cafés, wine bars, boutiques, supermarkets, schools and university - it’s all at your doorstep. But inside? Peace, privacy and your own space to exhale.<br/><br/>The open-plan living and dining zone is generous (actually generous), finished with timber floors and flowing straight out to your own private enclosed balcony perfect for Sunday morning coffee or Friday night drinks. The kitchen means business too, with stone benchtops, a proper island bench on castors for the ultimate dinner party flexibility and plenty of storage to k