obe and split-system air conditioning.<br/>- Modern Bathrooms: Both bathrooms include premium fittings, with a combined laundry in the main bathroom.<br/>- Convenience: Secure car space, intercom security, visitor parking, and access to the complex\'s pool and games area.<br/><br/>Unbeatable Location:<br/>Nestled in the heart of Woolloongabba, just 3km from Brisbane\'s CBD, this apartment is surrounded by key amenities:<br/><br/>Stones Corner Village: Explore nearby shops, cafes, and vibrant community spaces.<br/>Transport Hub: Easy access to Buranda Train Station and major bus routes with walkway at the end of Regent St.<br/>Healthcare Precinct: Walking distance to the Princess Alexandra Hospital and a short commute to the Mater and Queensland Children\'s Hospitals.<br/>Future Growth: Close to the proposed Woolloongabba Train Station, part of the transformative Cross River Rail Project.<br/><br/>Lifestyle Perks: South Bank\'s dining, entertainment, and cultural precincts are just minutes away.','unit','Woolloongabba',-27.50014130,153.03855469,4102,'Qld','69/45 Regent St','Woolloongabba',2,2,1,'Rent Star - Brisbane','Open Spaces: 1'),(540,'YOUR NEW HOME AWAITS!',650,'Caloundra City Realty invites you to inspect this well designed home, situated within walking distance to Meridan College and just perfect for a couple or small family. <br/><br/>- Modern kitchen with plenty of cupboard space and a dishwasher included <br/>- Open plan tiled air conditioned dining and lounge area<br/>- Air conditioned main bedroom with a spacious walk in wardrobe and double vanity ensuite<br/>- Two more generous size bedrooms both with built in wardrobes<br/>- Ceiling fans throughout<br/>- Main bathroom complete with a shower, bathtub and separate toilet<br/>- Under stairs storage <br/>- Single lock up garage with space for a second car on the driveway<br/>- Fully fenced private courtyard <br/><br/>12 month lease and long term tenants preferred<br/><br/>*Applications can be submitted pri