ative studio space for creating, tinkering and fixing<br/>• The Patch resident\'s garden for tending to your own herbs and veggies<br/><br/>Move-in is made seamless with a choice of furnished or unfurnished apartments and all the renter-friendly details that set LIV communities apart, including:<br/>• Onsite maintenance, customer service and management; <br/>• Option to have internet and 100% renewable electricity switched on at move-in;<br/>• Pets welcome<br/>• Fridge, microwave, dishwasher, washing machine included<br/>• Freedom to paint walls, hang art and express your personality<br/>• Rental certainty and flexible lease terms<br/><br/>LIV Albert is surrounded by 20 hectares of parkland in Brunswick and only 6km north of Melbourne\'s CBD. Located between Clifton and Gilpin Parks, it forms a new village heart for Brunswick, a neighbourhood renowned for its community and diversity.<br/>A short stroll to Sydney Road, LIV Albert is interconnected, interwoven and inherently part of Brunswick.<br/><br/>• 0 min to Gilpin & Clifton Parks<br/>• 2 mins to Victoria Street buses<br/>• 2 mins to nearest café<br/>• 8 mins to nearest medical centre<br/>• 9 mins to Upfield Shared Path<br/>• 9 mins to Brunswick station<br/>• 12 mins to #19 tram to the CBD<br/>• 12 mins to Sydney Road shops & dining<br/><br/>LIV Albert is brought to you by Mirvac, the pioneering leader in creating communities exclusively for renters. Our properties are designed to foster community with exceptional shared spaces that enhance the lifestyle experience, continuing Mirvac\'s over 50-year legacy of quality and care.<br/><br/>If this apartment layout does not suit your needs, please enquire for more floorplans.<br/><br/>Internal images are not necessarily representative of the specific apartment listed. Views depicted are to be used as a guide only and are not to be relied on as representative of the final view. Views will vary depending on the level and location of the apartment. This online listing is