ront of the home, complete with a walk-in robe and a private ensuite<br/>• Central hallway connecting the additional bedrooms, main bathroom, and laundry for practical family living<br/>• Open-plan kitchen, dining & living area forming the heart of the home<br/>• Modern kitchen with island bench overlooking the living and dining spaces - ideal for entertaining<br/>• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow from the main living area to the covered patio<br/>• Private outdoor patio perfect for alfresco dining and weekend gatherings<br/>• Double lock-up garage with internal access for convenience and security<br/>• Well-zoned layout separating living and sleeping areas for privacy and comfort<br/><br/>This thoughtfully designed floor plan ensures natural movement throughout the home, making it perfect for families or professionals seeking space, style, and functionality.<br/><br/><br/>This is a fantastic opportunity to secure a spacious family home in a prime location. Don\'t miss out - homes like this don\'t last long!<br/><br/>Open homes are subject to change, so please ensure that you book into the inspection to receive SMS and email alerts about any changes.<br/><br/>Do I have to pay for water supplied to this property? Yes<br/>Do I have to maintain the lawns and gardens? Yes<br/>Is the property furnished or unfurnished? Unfurnished<br/>What is the lease term offered? 6 or 12 Months<br/><br/>**ARRANGE AN INSPECTION TIME ONLINE**<br/>By registering, you will be INSTANTLY informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your appointment. Please be aware that even though you may be booked in for an inspection, it does sometimes occur that the property may be leased prior to the time and date you have been given. If that occurs you will receive a text informing you of the cancellation.<br/>Please view the photos and any visual aids you can access thoroughly to ensure that this is a home you are very interested in before registering. Viewings are limited.<br/><br/>* Disclaimer: In preparing this information Coronis has used its best endeavors to ensure that the information contained herein is true and accurate, but accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability in respect of any errors, omissions, inaccuracies or misstatements that may occur. Prospective tenants and buyers should make their own enquiries to verify the information contained herein.<br/>Photos used in advertising may differ from the current state of the property. We endeavor to use the most up to date photography, however this may not be feasible to protect our current tenants\' privacy. Photos may include the use of virtual furniture.<br/>','house','Upper Coomera',-27.85420738,153.28543323,4209,'Qld','24 Dorretti Circuit','Upper Coomera',2,4,2,'Coronis Pacific Pines - PACIFIC PINES','Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 1'),(563,'Stylish Warehouse Conversion with Rooftop Terrace',900,'Positioned perfectly with a short walk to Fitzroy Gardens, Yarra Park, the MCG, access to public transport including West Richmond Station. Conveniently access shops, cafes, dining along Bridge Road, Victoria Street, plus more!<br/><br/>Set over three floors, the entrance level comprises a large open plan living & dining area with floorboards & extra high ceiling, further leading to an alfresco courtyard. The kitchen with ample storage and bench top space, as well as gas stove and dishwasher. An original warehouse fire door conceals the ground-floor bedroom with walk-in robe.<br/><br/>The next floor features the main bedroom with 3.5m pitched ceiling, with ceiling fan, split system cooling & heating plus plantation shutters. The sparkling central bathroom with large mirror over vanity, shower over bath as well as laundry area.<br/><br/>The top level features the rooftop terrace, with its electric louvre roof pergola, the perfect space for outdoor entertaining whilst soaking in the amazing views towards the city lights. <br/><br/>Further benefits include one off-street car park..<br/><br/>INSPECTING IS EASY - Simply scroll down the page to the ‘INSPECTIONS’ subheading and click ‘REQUEST A TIME’ to book a date and time or submit your enquiry.<br/><br/>Please ensure you register your details prior to attending the inspection. Once registered, we can keep you updated with available inspections times and any changes or cancellations. So don\'t miss out, book an inspection today!<br/><br/>To submit an application for this property, simply click the “Get in Touch” button and we will respond with instructions on how to apply.','townhouse','Richmond',-37.81341078,144.99117188,3121,'Vic','22 Wrede Pl','Richmond',1,2,1,'Area Specialist Dynamic','Carport: 1, Courtyard, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Dishwasher'),(564,'Where Style Meets Everyday Ease',580,'From the moment you step inside, the intelligent floorplan becomes apparent. The master suite is privately positioned and generously proportioned, complete with a walk-in robe and well-appointed ensuite, creating a true retreat at the end of each day. Two additional bedrooms, each fitted with built-in robes, provide flexibility for family living, guests or a dedicated home office.<br/><br/>At the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen, living and dining zone has been designed to bring people together. The kitchen makes an immediate statement with its impressive 900mm gas cooktop, electric oven and dishwasher, a complete suite suited to both everyday cooking and entertaining. Ample cabinetry and bench space provide generous storage, while the walk-in combined pantry and laundry further enhance functionality, keeping the main kitchen area streamlined and organised. <br/><br/>Ducted heating and cooling throughout ensures year-round comfort, maintaining a consistent and pleasant environment no matter the season. <br/><br/>Outdoors, the property continues to impress. A fully enclosed, low-maintenance yard offers privacy and peace of mind, ideal for those seeking minimal upkeep without sacrificing outdoor space. The undercover entertaining area provides the perfect setting for weekend gatherings, evening meals or simply enjoying the fresh air in comfort.<br/><br/>Completing the package is a double lock-up garage with remote entry and internal access, offering both security and convenience, an increasingly sought-after feature in modern homes.<br/><br/>Apply Here! https://snug.com/apply/raywhitealbury','house','Thurgoona',-36.03235066,147.00655462,2640,'NSW','1/149 Birchgrove Crescent','Thurgoona',2,3,2,'Ray White - Albury North','Garage: 2'),(565,'Well-Located 3-Bedroom Villa in Prime Yokine Location',720,'Situated in the sought-after suburb of Yokine, this well-presented 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom villa offers convenience and comfort, with a bus stop at the doorstep and shops just five minutes away. <br/><br/>Featuring built-in robes to all bedrooms, open-plan living with split system air-conditioning, an enclosed rear courtyard with pergola, renovated bathroom, separate laundry, paved front courtyard, and private carport. <br/><br/>Close to the Western Australian Golf Club and quality schools. <br/><br/><br/>***Please note the lessor makes no representations about the availability of telephone lines, internet lines or any other communications services to the premises. The tenant must make their own enquiries regarding the availability, cost and/or installation of those services.<br/> <br/>***TO ARRANGE A VIEWING PLEASE CLICK ON THE \'CONTACT THE AGENT\' BUTTON OR THE \'BOOK INSPECTION\' BUTTON AND YOU WILL BE SENT AN INSTANT REPLY TO REGISTER FOR THE SCHEDULED VIEWING/S***<br/> <br/>***BEWARE OF SCAMS ONLY ARRANGE PROPERTY VIEWINGS THROUGH US, NOT DIRECTLY WITH ANYONE CLAIMING TO BE THE OWNER.<br/> <br/>***HOME OPEN TIMES ARE SUBJECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT NOTICE.*** Please be on time so you have sufficient time to fully view the property and ensure that it meets your requirements as viewing times cannot be extended, so as not to cause delays for the next home open. See You There.**','townhouse','Yokine',-31.89910494,115.85560664,6060,'WA','5/23 Thurlow Avenue','Yokine',1,3,1,'LJ Hooker - Property Experience','Garage: 1'),(566,'LARGE ONE-BEDROOM CLOSE TO UNSW Available for rent!',690,'Situated in the popular Quinella Gardens complex, this well-presented one-bedroom apartment is conveniently located only footsteps from the University of NSW, NIDA & the diverse Kingsford/Kensington retail precinct. With the new light rail at your doorstep, enjoy easy access to the CBD, Centennial Park, the Entertainment quarter, renown Eastern Suburbs beaches & more.<br/><br/>Key features include;<br/>- Stylish kitchen with stainless steel appliances, stone bench tops & ample storage space.<br/>- Open plan living/dining leading to a leafy entertainers balcony<br/>- Spacious bedroom with built in wardrobe<br/>- Chic fully-tiled bathroom with bathtub & shower<br/>- Internal Laundry with Dryer<br/>- Lock-up Garage<br/><br/>About the Location:<br/>- 150m to Foodworks Supermarket<br/>- 400m to UNSW<br/>- 400m to Light Rail Station<br/>- Bus services to CBD & beaches at your doorstep<br/><br/>For more information please contact Infinity Property Agents on (02) 9699 9179!','apartment','Kensington',-33.91315154,151.22512177,2033,'NSW','35/274 Anzac Parade','Kensington',1,1,1,'Infinity Property Agents - Alexandria','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Built-in Wardrobes'),(567,'BRAND NEW LUXURY 5 BEDROOM DUPLEX WITH INGROUND SWIMMING POOL AND JACUZZI',1800,'Experience the pinnacle of contemporary living in this architecturally designed, brand new five-bedroom luxury duplex. Showcasing premium finishes, expansive interiors and resort-style outdoor entertaining, this exceptional residence has been crafted for families who appreciate quality, space and sophistication.<br/><br/>Ground Floor Features:<br/><br/>• Two generous living areas offering flexibility for formal and infor