ntre, Flemington Markets, DFO Homebush and Flemington railway station, providing unbeatable access to shopping, dining, fresh produce and convenient transport options.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>Two spacious carpeted bedrooms with built-in wardrobes<br/>Open kitchen with stainless steel appliances and dishwasher<br/>Generous carpeted living area<br/>Large contemporary bathroom<br/>Spacious outdoor entertainer\'s balcony<br/>Split system air conditioning<br/>Internal laundry<br/>Single car space<br/><br/>ONLINE enquiry policy - All email & online enquiries received from this website will not be attended to if a number & email address are not provided.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: The information presented has been furnished from sources we deem to be reliable. We have not verified whether or not the information is accurate and do not accept any responsibility to any person and do no more than pass it on. All interested parties should rely on their own enquiries in order to determine the accuracy of this information.<br/>','unit','Homebush',-33.86149279,151.06525372,2140,'NSW','12/11-19 Mandemar Avenue','Homebush',1,2,1,'Riverbank Real Estate - MERRYLANDS | PEMULWUY','Open Spaces: 1'),(572,'Generous Indoor-Outdoor Living in Sought-After Mosman Crest',985,'Located in the well-maintained Mosman Crest building, this spacious apartment in a secure complex offers comfortable living with a large private terrace and convenient access to Mosman Village, Bridgepoint Shopping Centre and public transport.<br/><br/>The open plan living and dining area flows onto an expansive outdoor terrace. Both bedrooms include built-in wardrobes and terrace access, with the second bedroom suitable for a home office setup. The apartment also includes a modern gas kitchen, full bathroom with bathtub, separate internal laundry and ducted air conditioning.<br/><br/>- Two bedrooms with built-ins<br/>- Large private terrace with electric awning<br/>- Gas kitchen with granite benchtops<br/>- Bathroom with full bathtub<br/>- Secure building with lift access<br/>- Single secure car space<br/>- Lock-up storage room<br/>- Ducted air conditioning<br/><br/>Conveniently located close to shops, transport and local amenities.','house','Mosman',-33.82405992,151.24357451,2088,'NSW','11/8-10 Clifford Street','Mosman',1,2,1,'Built to Rent Group - Sydney & Melbourne','Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Intercom, Pets Allowed'),(573,'North Facing, Leafy Elevated Outlook, 1KM Bondi Beach',1350,'Impeccably presented and peacefully positioned, this light-filled Art Deco residence is tucked away within a secure boutique block of only six. Located in one of Bondi\'s most coveted leafy pockets, the home effortlessly blends heritage charm with modern functionality. High ceilings and polished timber floors enhance the spacious interiors, flowing seamlessly to a private, North-facing balcony with an elevated, leafy outlook.<br/><br/>Features:<br/><br/>Bright and airy interiors, north-facing balcony<br/>Open plan living and dining, timber floors, air conditioning <br/>Gourmet electric kitchen, fridge, stone benches, dishwasher, island bench <br/>Contemporary main bathroom with a separate bath<br/>Master bedroom with ensuite, a generous second bedroom, both with wardrobes <br/>One car space, laundry provisions in the bathroom <br/>One common wall, boutique block of only 6<br/>A short stroll to the iconic surf, vibrant cafes, and world-class dining of Bondi Beach<br/><br/>Please register for inspection updates via Snug, as changes or cancellations may occur to inspection times.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: All information contained herein, including the description, floor plan, and images, is gathered from reliable sources. We have no reason to doubt its accuracy; however, we cannot guarantee it. All interested parties should make and rely upon their inquiries. This property is unfurnished unless otherwise stated.','apartment','Bondi Beach',-33.88915360,151.26405662,2026,'NSW','4/124 Francis Street','Bondi Beach',2,2,1,'PPD Property Management - COOGEE','Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Pets Allowed'),(574,'Kanimbla Family Home',700,'This private, family home in well sought after suburb, Kanimbla is located less than 10 minutes from the CBD and in close proximity to schools and amenities.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/><br/>* Generous kitchen with plenty of cupboard space, pantry and dishwasher.<br/>* Separate living (air conditioned) and dining areas.<br/>* Fully fenced private yard (hedge maintenance included)<br/>* Spacious main bedroom with ensuite bathroom, split system air con, built-in robes and carpet<br/>* Three more air-conditioned bedrooms with built in robes and carpets <br/>* Large bathroom with separate bath tub, toilet, shower and powder room<br/>* Fully security screened<br/>* Double carport with remote access<br/>* Garden Shed<br/>* Internal laundry <br/>* Undercover outdoor entertainment area<br/>* Pet friendly except carpeted bedrooms.<br/><br/>Tenant responsible for lawn maintenance and utilities.<br/>Water usage charges apply.<br/><br/>Please apply online by selecting \"Apply\" button or go to our website www.felixgrasso.com.au for further information.<br/><br/>Inspections are by appointment only, please send email enquiry or call Felix Grasso Real Estate on 40519677 to arrange a viewing.<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>We have in preparing this advertisement used our best endeavours to ensure the information contained is true and accurate, but accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability in respect to any errors, omissions, inaccuracies or misstatements contained. Prospective purchasers should make their own enquiries to verify the information contained in this advertisement.','house','Kanimbla',-16.91832024,145.72197755,4870,'Qld','1 Sailfish Close','Kanimbla',2,4,2,'Felix Grasso Real Estate - Cairns','Carport: 2, Air Conditioning, Ensuite: 1, Pets Allowed'),(575,'Spacious Family Home in Prime Melton South Location',450,'Spacious family home on a large block in Melton South, directly opposite Melton South Primary School and close to shops and Melton Train Station.<br/><br/>Featuring four bedrooms with built-in robes, two bathrooms, separate toilet, lounge, kitchen with ample storage, and open-plan meals area. Additional features include a laundry with external access, 2-car lock-up garage, and a large backyard.<br/><br/>Perfect for families seeking space and convenience.<br/><br/>*FIRST INSPECTION AVAILABLE 14TH MARCH*','house','Melton South',-37.70697900,144.57572600,3338,'Vic','2 Porter Street','Melton South',2,4,2,'Platinum Real Estate - Victoria','Open Spaces: 2'),(576,'Stylish & Private 2-Bedroom Granny Flat',500,'This well-presented double-storey 2-bedroom granny flat offers comfort and practicality with its own private access and low-maintenance yard. Downstairs features tiled flooring for easy care living, along with convenient under-stair storage, while upstairs is fitted with stylish floorboards. Both bedrooms include built-in wardrobes, and the property is equipped with ducted air conditioning for year-round comfort. With its own private yard space and thoughtful layout, this home is perfect for those seeking privacy and modern convenience.<br/><br/>Key Locations:<br/>• 2 minute drive to Airds Village Shopping Centre<br/>• 2 minute drive to John Warby Public School<br/>• 3 minute drive to Airds High School<br/>• 8 minute drive to Campbelltown Station<br/>• 9 minute drive to Campbelltown Hospital<br/>• 10 minute drive to Macarthur Square Shopping Centre<br/>• 12 minute drive to Minto Mall<br/><br/>Disclaimer: While Raine & Horne has provided the above information to the best of their ability, we encourage buyers and investors to conduct their own due diligence.<br/>','flat','Airds',-34.08507825,150.83097862,2560,'NSW','7A Throssell Street','Airds',1,2,2,'Raine & Horne Leppington-Austral',NULL),(577,'Ground floor - two bedroom unit.',500,'This ideally located ground floor unit is only a short walk from cafes, restaurants, walking tracks and Botanical gardens and features:<br/><br/>* Fully furnished (please note that furniture may differ from the photos)<br/>* Modern kitchen with electric oven/cooktop and dishwasher<br/>* Generous, air conditioned living area<br/>* Two, spacious air conditioned bedrooms<br/>* Combined bathroom/laundry<br/>* Allocated carpark<br/>* Sparkling inground pool in complex.<br/><br/>Tenant to arrange electricity and internet connection<br/>Water usage included in rent<br/><br/>Please apply online by selecting \"Apply\" button or go to our website www.felixgrasso.com.au for further information.<br/><br/>Inspections are by appointment only, please send email enquiry or call Felix Grasso Real Estate on 40519677 to arrange a viewing.<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>We have in preparing this advertisement used our best endeavours to ensure the information contained is true and accurate, but accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability in respect to any errors, omissions, inaccuracies or mis-statements contained. Prospective applicants should make their own enquiries to verify the information contained in this advertisement.','unit','Edge Hill',-16.90097377,145.74503015,4870,'Qld','10/50 - 56 Woodward Street','Edge Hill',1,2,1,'Felix Grasso Real Estate - Cairns','Carport: 1, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Dishwasher, Furnished');
INSERT INTO `data` VALUES (578,'Park view apartment: 2 well-separated bedrooms, ensuite & built-in desk | 2 weeks rent free*',925,'Sign a new lease today and enjoy exclusive rent-free offers: <br/>• 2 Weeks Free on 12 Month Lease*<br/>• 4 Weeks Free on 24 Months Lease*<br/>• 1 Week Free on 6 Month Lease*<br/><br/>Book a private tour today: https://www.livmirvac.com/book-a-tour<br/><br/>A furnished residence with all the benefits of apartment living such as easy upkeep, onsite management and maintenance, outstanding shared spaces and parkland at your door. The open floorplan incorporates a kitchen island, built-in desk with chair, balcony and two queen-sized bedrooms including one with its own ensuite. <br/><br/>This pet-friendly, furnished apartment includes: <br/>• Two queen beds and mattresses, 4 bedside tables, couch, armchair, coffee table, entertainment unit, desk chair, dining table with 4 chairs plus outdoor table with 2 chairs <br/>• Appliances included in the rent <br/>• Option to have internet and 100% renewable electricity switched on at move-in <br/>• Rental certainty and flexibility <br/>• Parkland at your doorstop and Sydney Road just beyond. <br/>• Option to add a carpark* <br/><br/>Live your way and rent all together different at LIV Albert - a neighbourhood of studio, 1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments with truly green credentials. Enjoy life in a space perfectly formed to always feel like home, no matter who you are or how your life changes.<br/><br/>Shared resident spaces are designed to nurture community and wellbeing and include:<br/>• Bookable private dining rooms and Alfresco for entertaining<br/>• Rec Room and Rumpus room for casual group gatherings<br/>• Gym, Laundrette and a versatile Conservatory that doubles as pilates or yoga studio<br/>• Work Space for productive spaces to work, meet, study and focus<br/>• Makery workshop/creative studio space for creating, tinkering and fixing<br/>• The Patch resident\'s garden for tending to your own herbs and veggies<br/><br/>Move-in is made seamless with a choice of furnished or unfurnished apartments and all the renter-friendly details that set LIV communities apart, including:<br/>• Onsite maintenance, customer service and management; <br/>• Option to have internet and 100% renewable electricity switched on at move-in;<br/>• Pets welcome<br/>• Fridge, microwave, dishwasher, washing machine included<br/>• Freedom to paint walls, hang art and express your personality<br/>• Rental certainty and flexible lease terms<br/><br/>LIV Albert is surrounded by 20 hectares of parkland in Brunswick and only 6km north of Melbourne\'s CBD. Located between Clifton and Gilpin Parks, it forms a new village heart for Brunswick, a neighbourhood renowned for its community and diversity.<br/>A short stroll to Sydney Road, LIV Albert is interconnected, interwoven and inherently part of Brunswick.<br/>• 0 min to Gilpin & Clifton Parks<br/>• 2 mins to Victoria Street buses<br/>• 2 mins to nearest café<br/>• 8 mins to nearest medical centre<br/>• 9 mins to Upfield Shared Path<br/>• 9 mins to Brunswick station<br/>• 12 mins to #19 tram to the CBD<br/>• 12 mins to Sydney Road shops & dining<br/><br/>LIV Albert is brought to you by Mirvac, the pioneering leader in creating communities exclusively for renters. Our properties are designed to foster community with exceptional shared spaces that enhance the lifestyle experience, continuing Mirvac\'s over 50-year legacy of quality and care.<br/>If this apartment layout does not suit your needs, please enquire for more floorplans.<br/><br/>Internal images are not necessarily representative of the specific apartment listed. Views depicted are to be used as a guide only and are not to be relied on as representative of the final view. Views will vary depending on the level and location of the apartment. This online listing is indicative only and is not an offer or a contract.<br/><br/>*Displayed pricing is per week and excludes optional add-ons such as parking and furniture. Add-ons are subject to availability. Please reach out to the LIV team for further information.<br/><br/>*Terms & Conditions<br/>• 2 Weeks Free on 12 Month Lease: https://www.livmirvac.com/termsconditions-albert-twoweeksfree-feb26<br/>• 4 Weeks Free on 24 Months Lease: https://www.livmirvac.com/termsconditions-albert-fourweeksfree-feb26<br/>• 1 Week Free on 6 Month Lease: https://www.livmirvac.com/termsconditions-albert-oneweekfree-feb26','apartment','Brunswick',-37.76759090,144.95277713,3056,'Vic','413/395 Albert Street','Brunswick',2,2,2,'Mirvac - Albert, Brunswick','Balcony, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1, Gym, Intercom, Rumpus Room, Workshop, Pets Allowed'),(579,'Modern Two Bedroom Apartment For Lease',820,'Open Agency & Partners proudly presents this two bedroom apartment in a boutique complex neighbouring Sydney Olympic Park. This complex is a nearly new stunning release and one of Sydney\'s newest luxury living and lifestyle communities that bring a constellation of pleasures. <br/><br/>Property features:<br/>- Tiled open plan living and dining area flowing to the balcony<br/>- Spacious bedrooms with floorboards and built-ins, master with ensuite<br/>- Study room<br/>- Gourmet kitchen with stainless steel appliances, gas cooking and ample cupboard storage<br/>- Modern bathrooms with floor-to-ceiling tiles and frameless walk-in shower<br/>- Internal laundry with dryer<br/>- Security basement parking<br/>- Landscaped common area with playground and pool<br/><br/>Inspection as advertised.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: All information contained herewith, including but not limited to the general property description, price and the address, is provided to Open Agency & Partners by third parties. We have obtained this information from sources we believe to be reliable; however, we cannot guarantee its accuracy. The information contained herewith should not be relied upon and you should make your own inquiries and seek advice in respect of this property or any property on this website.','apartment','Lidcombe',-33.84833935,151.05999692,2141,'NSW','601/6 Shale Street','Lidcombe',2,2,1,'360 Property Manager - North Strathfield','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Intercom, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Study'),(580,'Neat, Sweet & Complete - With Your Own Backyard',400,'** APPLY IN ADVANCE **<br/><br/>Applying is easy. All applications can be completed online through the 2Apply platform. Simply click on the \"Get in Touch\", \"Apply Online\", or \"Make an Enquiry\" links and complete the required information.<br/><br/>Enjoy relaxed, low-maintenance living in this charming 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom unit tucked away in a quiet pocket of Oonoonba. Offering a practical layout with a light-filled living area, functional kitchen, and a private rear deck overlooking your own backyard, this home provides comfort and convenience at an affordable price. Perfect for those looking for a peaceful retreat while still being close to local shops, schools and transport.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Two well-sized bedrooms<br/>- One bathroom<br/>- Air-conditioned<br/>- Separate, light-filled living area<br/>- Private rear deck - perfect for relaxing<br/>- Fully fenced rear yard<br/>- Low-maintenance living<br/>- Quiet and convenient location<br/><br/>Please note; All parties should make and rely upon their own enquiries in order to determine the accuracy of the information supplied. While every caution is taken, some file photographs may have been taken some time ago. Page & Pearce accepts no liability for any loss sustained due to inaccuracy or omission.','apartment','Oonoonba',-19.30028278,146.82162987,4811,'Qld','2/26 Keenan Street','Oonoonba',1,2,2,'Page & Pearce - Townsville','Deck, Air Conditioning, Floorboards'),(581,'Three bedroom home in the heart of Preston',750,'Please note, rent is paid monthly - $3,259 per calendar month ($750 per week).<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned in the heart of Preston, this well-presented home offers comfortable, low-maintenance living in a highly convenient location. Featuring a light-filled living area, well-equipped kitchen, three generous bedroom(s), modern bathroom with shower (no bath tub). Split System heating and cooling for year-round comfort. Enjoy being just moments from Preston Market, local schools, and Preston railway station, with shops, cafes, and parklands all close by. Enquire today to arrange an inspection.','house','Preston',-37.73665300,144.99260900,3072,'Vic','516 Murray Road','Preston',1,3,3,'Nelson Alexander - Reservoir','Carport: 1, Open Spaces: 2'),(582,'Modern Renovated 2-Bedroom Unit in Quiet Location – Walk to Shops',500,'Positioned in a quiet and private location, this beautifully refreshed 2-bedroom unit offers comfort, convenience, and modern living. Recently updated with brand new carpet, new roller blinds, new vanity, and a new toilet, the home presents fresh and ready for its next tenant.<br/><br/>The well-designed layout features a modern renovated kitchen, a bright bathroom, and built-in wardrobes in both bedrooms. With a peaceful setting and friendly neighbours, this property is ideal for tenants seeking a quiet and well-maintained place to call home.<br/><br/>Conveniently located just moments from local shops, a service station, and public amenities, the property offers easy everyday living while maintaining a relaxed residential atmosphere.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• 2 spacious bedrooms with built-in wardrobes<br/>• 1 well-maintained bathroom with new vanity and toilet<br/>• Fresh new carpet throughout<br/>• New single roller blinds installed<br/>• Modern renovated kitchen with ample storage<br/>• Light-filled living area<br/>• Private end unit in a quiet complex<br/>• Carport parking for 1 vehicle<br/>• Close to shopping centre, local shops, and service station<br/>• Friendly and quiet neighbours<br/><br/>* Please note the laundry is a shared space, you are welcome to put your own washing machine in the shared space.','villa','Wyoming',-33.40951464,151.35166516,2250,'NSW','4/16 Pemell Street','Wyoming',1,2,1,'LJ Hooker - Gosford/Lisarow','Carport: 1, Built-in Wardrobes'),(583,'Apartment for rent',850,'Stylish, Light-Filled Apartment in the Heart of Campsie<br/><br/><br/>Welcome to 213/8 Sunbeam Street, Campsie - a beautifully positioned apartment offering comfort, convenience, and lifestyle all in one.<br/><br/><br/><br/>Whether you\'re a small family, professional couple, or downsizer, this home ticks every box.<br/><br/> Property Features<br/>*Generous bedrooms with built-in wardrobes<br/><br/>*Modern bathroom with quality fittings<br/><br/>*Contemporary kitchen with ample storage & stainless-steel appliances<br/><br/>*Open-plan living & dining area filled with natural light<br/><br/>*Private balcony - perfect for morning coffee or evening relaxation<br/><br/>* Air-conditioning for year-round comfort<br/><br/>*Secure parking space<br/><br/>*Secure building with intercom access<br/><br/>* Prime Location Benefits<br/><br/><br/>Situated in a quiet yet ultra-convenient pocket of Campsie:<br/><br/>* Walking distance to Campsie Shopping Village<br/><br/>* Close to Campsie Train Station<br/><br/>*Minutes to Coles, restaurants, cafés & essential services<br/><br/>* Nearby local schools and childcare<br/><br/>*Easy access to public transport & major roads<br/><br/>* Close to parks and recreational areas<br/><br/><br/><br/>Enjoy the vibrant multicultural dining scene and the relaxed suburban lifestyle while being only a short commute to Sydney CBD 13km .','apartment','Campsie',-33.92162073,151.10262178,2194,'NSW','213/8 Sunbeam','Campsie',2,2,1,'Land & Lease Realty - Lakemba','Garage: 1, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(584,'Easy-Care 2-Bedroom Villa in Quiet Complex - Close to Golf, Shops & CBD',700,'This neat 2-bedroom villa offers a relaxed and low-maintenance lifestyle in a quiet complex of just nine dwellings, creating a comfortable and easy place to call home. With a functional layout, generous room sizes and a private courtyard, it provides practical everyday living with the bonus of lock-up-and-leave convenience. Perfectly positioned close to golf, shopping, transport and only minutes from the CBD, it delivers outstanding accessibility in a well-connected location.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• Good-sized lounge room with plenty of natural light<br/>• Combined kitchen and dining area<br/>• Practical kitchen with oven, stove top, dishwasher, large fridge recess, ample cupboard space and pantry<br/>• Spacious master bedroom with three-door built-in robe<br/>• Second bedroom with built-in robe<br/>• Modern bathroom with single basin vanity and shower<br/>• Separate toilet for added convenience<br/>• Generous laundry with functional layout<br/>• Secure, enclosed private courtyard<br/>• Undercover carport<br/>• Reverse ducted air conditioning for all year round comfort<br/>• Small complex of only nine residences<br/><br/>Located Nearby:<br/>• Short stroll to the prestigious West Australian Golf Course<br/>• Close to local amenities including post office, medical centre, mini-mart and chemist<br/>• Yokine Primary School, Servite College, St Kieran Catholic Primary School, Carmel School<br/>• Just over 2km to Dog Swamp Shopping Centre<br/>• Approximately 750m to public transport<br/>• Approximately 6km to Perth CBD<br/><br/>If you have any queries, please do not hesitate to contact Vanesa Terzic on [REDACTED PHONE]<br/><br/>Holdsworth Real Estate processes all applications online through the 2Apply app. To attend the home open, please register. After attending the viewing, you\'ll receive an SMS with a link and we recommend following the prompts to complete your application. Please note the property must be viewed by either the applicant or a person acting on their behalf prior to submitting an application.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst every care has been taken with the preparation of the particulars contained in the information supplied, accuracy cannot be guaranteed. Prospective tenants should make their own enquiries to satisfy themselves in all respects. Holdsworth Real Estate will not be held liable for any errors in typing or incorrect information contained herewith.','villa','Yokine',-31.89504754,115.85110521,6060,'WA','2/112 Moulden Avenue','Yokine',1,2,1,'Holdsworth Real Estate - Mount Hawthorn','Carport: 1, Courtyard, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Toilets: 1'),(585,'Spacious Family Home with Pool - $750 Per Week',750,'Welcome to 80 Merchiston Street, Acacia Ridge - a beautifully presented home available for lease at $750 per week. Combining comfort, space, and style, this property is perfectly suited to families and working professionals seeking a well-appointed residence.<br/><br/>The home features three generously sized bedrooms, offering plenty of room for rest and privacy. A well-designed main bathroom, complemented by two separate toilets, ensures convenience for busy households.<br/><br/>Stunning hardwood flooring flows throughout the home, adding warmth and timeless appeal to the interiors.<br/><br/>Step outside and enjoy your own private swimming pool - ideal for cooling off during warmer months or hosting family and friends.<br/><br/>This property offers more than just a place to live - it delivers a relaxed and enjoyable lifestyle. Don\'t miss the opportunity to secure this fantastic home. Enquire today to arrange your inspection.','house','Acacia Ridge',-27.58895479,153.01589771,4110,'Qld','80 Merchiston Street','Acacia Ridge',1,3,3,'Ray White - Acacia Ridge','Garage: 3, Toilets: 2'),(586,'Comfortable Family Living in Convenient White Hills Location',530,'Positioned in a popular and convenient pocket of White Hills, 31 Derrimut Road offers a well-designed home combining comfort, practicality, and low maintenance living. The home features three well sized bedrooms, all with built-in robes, serviced by a central bathroom with separate toilet for added convenience. A spacious living room welcomes you upon entry, creating a warm and relaxing space for everyday living. The functional kitchen includes a pantry and dishwasher, flowing seamlessly into the adjoining dining area, perfect for family meals or entertaining. A dedicated laundry with linen storage further enhances the home\'s practicality. Located just moments from Epsom Village, Epsom Primary School, Bendigo Botanical Gardens, and only a short drive to Bendigo CBD, this property offers a fantastic lifestyle opportunity.<br/><br/>Available from<br/>Bond: $2302<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• Three spacious bedrooms with built-in robes <br/>• Modern bathroom featuring a bathtub with separate toilet<br/>• Spacious light-filled living room including an electric wall heater<br/>• Updated kitchen with pantry, dishwasher, modern appliances and ample bench space and adjoining dining area<br/>• Fully fenced, low-maintenance yard offering secure outdoor space with minimal upkeep required including a garden shed<br/>• A nice veggie garden patch/plot for someone who loves planting their own veggies<br/>• An outdoor brick barbeque grill in the yard<br/>• Undercover double car port<br/><br/>INSPECTIONS (Please check your junk inbox)<br/>Please select the \'request a time\' or \'get in touch\' option to receive an email invitation to register for the next inspection. By registering, you will receive notifications of any future inspections and cancellations. Please confirm your attendance for the inspection via the email received.<br/><br/>APPLICATIONS<br/>Applications are to be submitted via 2Apply http://www.2apply.com.au/agency/rwbendigo or by visiting the Ray White Bendigo website https://raywhitebendigo.com.au<br/><br/>APPLICATION PROCESS<br/>Please ensure applications are fully complete with contactable references to avoid delays in processing your application.<br/>Upon application approval, contact will be made to arrange initial payment and leases to be signed. If this process is delayed, the property may be offered to the next applicant.<br/>If you no longer wish to be considered for the property, please ensure you withdraw your application or contact us to withdraw your application.','house','White Hills',-36.72086628,144.31391896,3550,'Vic','31 Derrimut Road','White Hills',1,3,2,'Ray White - Bendigo','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Secure Parking, Shed, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(587,'Secure and Convenient Living in the Heart of Carnegie!',500,'This lovely one bedroom apartment is perfectly positioned in the heart of Carnegie, offering comfort, security, and everyday convenience. Enjoy walking distance to vibrant cafes, restaurants, public transport including Route 67 tram, Carnegie Train Station, Koornang Park, the local library, and much more.<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>* Secure building entrance<br/>* Light filled living area with sliding glass door opening onto a private balcony.<br/>* Modern open plan kitchen with gas cooking and dishwasher<br/>* Spacious bedroom with built in robes, wall panel heater, and access to a second balcony<br/>* Stylish modern bathroom<br/>* European laundry<br/>* Video intercom system<br/>* Undercover car space with remote controller<br/>* Storage cage<br/><br/>an excellent opportunity for those seeking low maintenance living in a prime location.','apartment','Carnegie',-37.88685768,145.05870878,3163,'Vic','107/6 Morton Street','Carnegie',1,1,1,'Ascend Real Estate - Doncaster East','Balcony, Garage: 1, Remote Garage, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Intercom, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1'),(588,'Love at first sight',1020,'Perfectly positioned in the heart of Fairlight with Manly’s beaches and pulsing lifestyle hub only a heartbeat away, this pristine character apartment provides an idyllic have