ly renovated kitchen and bathroom, complemented by a neat, manicured garden that creates a welcoming first impression and a relaxing outdoor retreat.<br/><br/>The brand-new kitchen has been thoughtfully designed with functionality in mind, featuring a dishwasher, electric induction cooktop, ample bench space, and generous cabinetry for storage. The open plan living area is fitted with split system heating and cooling to ensure year-round comfort. The renovated bathroom mirrors this modern feel with quality fixtures and a clean, timeless finish and dedicated laundry space.<br/><br/>Two spacious front bedrooms include built-in robes and ceiling fans for added comfort, while a third bedroom or study at the rear provides versatility for families or professionals. Adding further appeal is a separate backyard study pod, an ideal private workspace for those working from home, pursuing creative projects, or seeking a quiet retreat.<br/><br/>Additional conveniences include a second outdoor toilet, a low-maintenance backyard perfect for relaxing or entertaining, and remote gate access to secure off-street parking for peace of mind.<br/><br/>Superbly located, the home is within walking distance of both Merri and Westgarth railway stations , providing excellent public transport options. Easy access to Tram Route 86 along High Street Westgarth makes commuting effortless. Enjoy the convenience of vibrant cafés, restaurants, and boutique shopping along High Street’s lively precinct, including Westgarth Palace cinema.<br/><br/>This is a fantastic opportunity to secure a well-appointed, move-in-ready home in one of Northcote’s most sought-after pockets.<br/><br/>Inspections as advertised. Don\'t miss your opportunity to inspect!','house','Northcote',-37.77893900,144.99589300,3070,'Vic','95 Union Street','Northcote',1,3,1,'MOSS ESTATE AGENTS - NORTHCOTE','Open Spaces: 1, Dishwasher, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Toilets: 2'),(684,'Veggie Patch, Fireplace & Plenty of Space to Play!',670,'Enjoy guest parking off the driveway and a generous lounge and dining area warmed by a stylish gas log fireplace. The classic kitchen with breakfast bar connects to a casual meals area and opens to a covered alfresco, flowing through to a north-facing backyard complete with a vegetable garden.<br/>The flexible layout includes a ground floor bedroom with built-in wardrobe, separate sitting room, bathroom and study (or potential fourth bedroom), plus two robed bedrooms upstairs serviced by a second bathroom.<br/><br/>Additional features include reverse cycle heating and cooling, high ceilings, laundry, garden sheds, single garage, single carport and extended side driveway.<br/>Positioned within walking distance to St John Vianney\'s Primary School and Wellington Secondary College, and close to Waverley Gardens Shopping Centre, Monash University, EastLink and the Monash Freeway for effortless commuting.','house','Mulgrave',-37.93378800,145.16317400,3170,'Vic','53 Police Road','Mulgrave',2,3,2,'Ray White Judd White Group Forest Hill','Carport: 1, Garage: 1'),(685,'2 BEDROOM UNIT - FULLY FURNISHED',350,'Move right in to this tidy and meticulously kept two-bedroom unit, located just a short walk to the centre of town! Located in a quiet complex with water included. Comfort is ensured with split system heating/cooling, washer and dryer supplied in the bathroom/laundry combo and fridge! Enquire today to register your interest.','unit','Lakes Entrance',-37.87604322,147.99745715,3909,'Vic','5/1 Jemmeson Street','Lakes Entrance',1,2,1,'King and Heath First National - Lakes Entrance','Carport: 1'),(686,'RENOVATED TWO BED APARTMENT',490,'Situated directly across the road from Monash Medical Centre, is this charming renovated two bedroom apartment, the location is ideal for medical professionals, students, or anyone seeking easy access to all of Clayton\'s amenities.<br/><br/>Key Features include:<br/><br/>- Renovated kitchen with gas cooking<br/>- Two spacious bedrooms with built in robes<br/>- Renovated bathroom<br/>- Floor boards in living area<br/>- One car space<br/>- Heating<br/>- Located in quiet block<br/><br/>Cold water usage included in the rent due to bulk hot water service for the entire complex which is billed separately<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/><br/>Just steps away from Monash Medical Centre<br/>A short distance from Monash University Clayton campus<br/>Short walk to Clayton Station and central Clayton<br/><br/>This unit offers a fantastic opportunity for a convenient lifestyle in the heart of Clayton. Don\'t miss out!<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this advertisement, Barry Plant Docklands will not be held liable for any errors or omissions. All interested parties should rely upon their own enquiries.','apartment','Clayton',-37.91980500,145.12053200,3168,'Vic','10/259 Clayton Road','Clayton',1,2,1,'Barry Plant - Docklands & Melbourne','Open Spaces: 1, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 1'),(687,'Linden Cottage – A Rare Piece of Beechworth History',410,'Steeped in rich local history, Linden Cottage was originally constructed in the mid-1800s as part of the Methodist Church buildings, serving for many years as the church manse. Alongside the church itself, it proudly stands as one of Beechworth’s earliest permanent dwellings.<br/><br/>Over the years, the property was thoughtfully extended and adapted, blending its heritage charm with modern convenience. Today, Linden Cottage offers a unique opportunity to secure a character-filled home just a short stroll from the heart of Beechworth.<br/><br/>Inside, the cottage features:<br/>    •    A welcoming lounge complete with a cosy wood fire and split system for year-round comfort<br/>    •    A charming updated kitchen and dining area<br/>    •    A combined, modernised bathroom and laundry<br/>    •    A comfortable master bedroom, with built in storage<br/><br/>Outdoors, the property continues to impress with a spacious deck ideal for entertaining or simply enjoying the surrounds. The secure, low-maintenance yard includes a garden shed and ramped access, making it both practical and private.<br/><br/>24A Ford Street is not only a delightful residence but also a rare chance to live in a tangible piece of Beechworth’s story. With its heritage character, modern updates, and unbeatable location just moments from cafés, shops, and walking trails, this property is ready to be cherished by its next custodian.','house','Beechworth',-36.36150826,146.68476810,3747,'Vic','24A Ford Street','Beechworth',1,1,1,'Property Collective Real Estate - BEECHWORTH','Fully Fenced, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Shed, Air Conditioning, Floorboards, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Toilets: 1'),(688,'TWO BEDROOM TOWNHOUSE LOCATED IN SOUTH DUBBO.',425,'This 2 Bedroom townhouse is located close to Boundary Road Shops, South Dubbo Tavern, Schools and only a short drive to Dubbo CBD. <br/>- Generous sized lounge and dining area<br/>- Kitchen complete with walk-in pantry. <br/>- Two spacious bedrooms. <br/>- Three way bathroom. <br/>- Single Garage with automatic door. <br/>- Large Laundry.<br/>- Ample storage throughout. <br/>- Ducted evaporative cooling. <br/>- Bottle gas point<br/>- Private Paved courtyard.<br/><br/>When applying with Dubbo Real Estate Agency, please note the following:<br/>- Applications are to be submitted online via realestate.com.au<br/>- If you are unable to use the online application, you can download a paper application from our agency website.<br/>- Everyone aged 18 or older must submit an application and be a leaseholder.<br/>- Applications without adequate ID and income evidence won\'t be processed<br/>- Please submit your application before inspecting the property.<br/>- Please register for the inspection you plan to attend.<br/>- Out of area applicants should have a c