om with the continuation of granite benchtops, ample cupboard space.<br/><br/>Outside features two common areas fitted with open fireplace, pizza oven and BBQ area with 6 burner BBQ designed for year-round use.<br/>The photos do not do this apartment justice – it has to be seen to be well and truly appreciated.','apartment','Albury',-36.07649935,146.90630522,2640,'NSW','6/554 Thompson Street','Albury',1,1,1,'HM Property Group Albury','Carport: 1, Courtyard, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Toilets: 1'),(696,'Brand New, Fully Furnished, One-Bedroom Apartment with Utilities Included!',495,'Don’t miss the opportunity to rent a brand new, all inclusive, spacious, 1 Bedroom apartment within building of 5. <br/>This property comes fully furnished PLUS high-speed internet, electricity and water bills are included!<br/><br/>Simply pack your bags and settle in.<br/><br/>Important: Single Occupancy Only<br/>Please note that due to Brisbane City Council and Fire Safety Regulations, these apartments are strictly for single occupants. Couples, families, and overnight guests are not permitted.<br/><br/>ROOM #1 $495 <br/>ROOM #2 LEASED<br/>ROOM #3 $510 <br/>ROOM #4 LEASED<br/>ROOM #5 $500<br/><br/>KEY FEATURES:<br/>-All-inclusive living expenses!<br/>-Fully furnished with high-quality, modern furniture throughout.<br/>-Air conditioning & ceiling fans. <br/>-Ceiling fans.<br/>-Smart Storage! Including floor-to-ceiling built-in wardrobes to maximize space and minimize mess.<br/>-Secure electronic door locks for keyless entry.<br/>-Security System.<br/>-Equipped kitchenette.<br/>-Smart TV.<br/>-Private courtyard OR balcony.<br/><br/>SOLE OCCUPANCY: Designed for single occupancy only. No couples, children or pets allowed.<br/><br/>MICRO APARTMENT: Enjoy the privacy of your own securely accessed bedroom, bathroom, kitchenette, living area, and outdoor space within a property of 5 Micro Ap