PERTIES, PLEASE REGISTER TO INSPECT-<br/><br/>1. Click on the book inspection button on each property through realestate.com<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection time<br/>3. If no time is offered, please register so we can contact you once a viewing is arranged. To register you can email [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/>4. Changes or cancellations may occasionally occur due to unforeseen circumstances or if the property is leased. For notifications of these cancellations, please ensure you have registered your details for the property you are interested in.<br/>**You will be required to enter the inspection code to apply for the property**','house','Buff Point',-33.23075101,151.53689961,2262,'NSW','12 Cox Close','Buff Point',1,3,2,'PropertyCo','Garage: 2'),(776,'STYLISH BAYSIDE LIVING NEAR THE BEACH',990,'Perfectly positioned near the sparkling foreshore of Hampton Beach, this stylish single-level residence offers low-maintenance luxury in one of Bayside’s most coveted pockets. Freshly repainted and featuring newly polished timber floorboards throughout, this inviting, light-filled villa unit combines contemporary comfort with timeless appeal. A spacious open-plan living and dining zone connects seamlessly through bi-fold doors to a sun-drenched courtyard, ideal for alfresco entertaining. The sleek central kitchen features stone benchtops, stainless-steel appliances and ample storage, while accommodation includes a generous master bedroom with walk-in robe and ensuite, a second bedroom with built-in robes, and a versatile third bedroom or home office. Additional features include a modern central bathroom, separate toilet and laundry, split-system heating and cooling, and a single garage. With the beach just minutes away, perfect for morning swims, evening strolls or weekend picnics, and Hampton Street’s vibrant café and shopping strip and Brighton Beach train station both within easy reach, this residence captures the very best of relaxed Bayside living. <br/><br/>*Pl