h separate laundry and powder room. Upstairs is three carpeted bedrooms, master has large walk in robe and ensuite, the other two bedrooms have built in robes, and all have split systems. Central bathroom with large walk in shower and toilet. Storage room also included and secure parking. All this is only a short stroll to Leo\'s Supermarket, Woolworths, the restaurant hub of Kew and trams.<br/><br/><br/>Arranging an inspection time is easy!<br/>Simply click \'Book Inspection\' button to register for an inspection, or use the \'Contact Agent\' facility. By registering, you will instantly be informed of any updates, changes or cancellations to your appointment. Applications will be accepted after you have attended an open for inspection.','townhouse','Kew',-37.80230977,145.02949114,3101,'Vic','4/73 Princess Street','Kew',2,3,2,'Miles Real Estate - Ivanhoe','Courtyard, Garage: 2, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Floorboards'),(785,'Spacious Living',900,'Please note, rent is paid monthly - $3,911 per calendar month ($900 per week).<br/><br/>If space is what you\'re after, your search is over. This modern villa unit comprises of three bedrooms (all with BIRs) master with own bathroom facilities, separate formal lounge area, main separate bathroom, bright spacious kitchen with plenty of storage gas facilities, open plan overlooking meals/living area, and main bathroom facilities. Features central heating throughout, air conditioning, two toilets, great laundry and remote double lock up garage. Close to public transport and Station Street shops/restaurants.','unit','Northcote',-37.77390020,145.01302391,3070,'Vic','2/204 Mitchell Street','Northcote',1,3,1,'Nelson Alexander - Carlton North','Carport: 1'),(786,'Sophisticated 4 Bedroom Home with a Low-Maintenance Edge',780,'Impeccably proportioned and exceptionally presented, this 4-bedroom, 3-lounge residence embodies the most refined family lifestyle, flaunting a low-maintenance edge with exemplary comforts throughout a beautifully considered design. Each corner resonates with purpose and indulgence, with its elegant and orchestrated layout feeling as intimate as it is abundantly spacious.<br/><br/>It instantly feels more revered with a position raised from the street, simultaneously enhancing the privacy of its foremost interiors. Once inside, its formal and rumpus lounge spaces surround an open family, dining, and kitchen area, instantly becoming the heart of the home with its balanced proportions and family-focused functionality. An island-bench kitchen exudes sophistication with premium appliances and ergonomic space, moving outdoors to a covered terrace, edged by tiered low- maintenance gardens for maximum enjoyment with minimal fuss.<br/><br/>The four robed bedrooms all feature ceiling fans and individual split-system comforts, separated into parents\' and children\'s wings away from social noise. The master features a fitted walk-through robe to a full-sized ensuite with a king-sized shower, while the remaining bedrooms surround a bathroom, toilet, and laundry. Attention extends to every practical detail, including multiple split-system units, solar power, a storage shed, a rainwater tank, gated boat/caravan parking, and a double garage with rear access.<br/><br/>Set in a family-friendly enclave just metres from buses, Langwarrin South shops, Langwarrin Primary, and Elisabeth Murdoch College, it enjoys close proximity to Karingal Hub, Peninsula Private Hospital, Langwarrin Flora & Fauna Reserve, The Gateway Shopping Centre, and Mornington Peninsula Freeway access. <br/><br/>Distinctive, spacious, and elegantly practical. Make it yours today.<br/><br/>**** SPA NOT INCLUDED*****<br/><br/>Please note: Photo ID is required at all inspections.','house','Langwarrin',-38.16553400,145.18457600,3910,'Vic','8 Trentham Way','Langwarrin',2,4,2,'Ray White - Langwarrin','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Outside Spa, Remote Garage, Secure Pa