room, perfect for individuals or couples looking for a cozy and comfortable living space. With an attached garage available, parking will never be an issue, providing you with convenient and secure storage for your vehicle. Stay cool during summer months with the split system air conditioning, ensuring maximum comfort all year round.<br/><br/>Location couldn\'t be more ideal, as this property is conveniently situated close to transport options. Enjoy easy access to trains, trams, and buses, making commuting a breeze. Being just a stone\'s throw away from Malvern Central Shopping Centre means you have everything you need right at your doorstep. Take advantage of the various shops, restaurants, and entertainment options available, ensuring you always have something to do without having to venture far from home.<br/><br/>Photo ID may be requested at this inspection prior to entry.<br/> <br/>INSPECTIONS:<br/>To book an inspection, please click on “Request a Time” you will then be able to select a date and time that is suitable for you.<br/> <br/>All inspection times are subject to change or cancellation. Please ensure to register your attendance to receive updates regarding the inspection status. Should we need to cancel an inspection or lease a property prior to the next scheduled inspection, we will inform you via email to ensure that you are kept well informed.<br/> <br/>APPLICATIONS:<br/>Following receipt of your enquiry or inspection booking, you will receive an email which enables you to apply via 2Apply. Should you wish, you can submit your Online Tenancy Application prior to the inspection. Please note, your application can be withdrawn following the inspection should you find that the property does not meet your needs.<br/> <br/>If you have any questions regarding this listing or any other Barry Plant Eastern Group properties for rent, please contact the Barry Plant Listing Agent or Property Manager.','house','Malvern',-37.86243552,145.02744914,3144,'Vic','17/1