ge, light-filled living area, creating the ideal space for relaxing or entertaining guests.<br/><br/>Heart of the home are two beautifully appointed kitchens, finished with quality fittings and ample storage - perfect for those who love to cook, host, or simply enjoy the practicality of extra space. Refrigerated heating and cooling ensure year-round comfort, while additional storage solutions and a secure double garage add to the home\'s everyday functionality.<br/><br/>Set in a sought-after and peaceful location, this impressive property offers a rare opportunity to enjoy a brand new, high-end home in one of Mickleham\'s most desirable areas.<br/>Photos are illustrative .','house','Mickleham',-37.56434636,144.88970085,3064,'Vic','54 Honeypot Circuit','Mickleham',3,4,2,'Brik Realty PTY LTD','Garage: 2, Ensuite: 2, Toilets: 3'),(865,'Spacious & Stylish Home!!!',480,'This beautifully presented three-bedroom home offers a perfect blend of comfort, space, and modern functionality, making it ideal for families, couples, or professionals seeking a quality property for lease. Thoughtfully designed with practical living in mind, the home delivers a relaxed, low-maintenance lifestyle with generous proportions throughout.<br/><br/>• The property features three well-sized bedrooms, all designed to provide comfort and privacy, with built-in wardrobes to most rooms. The master bedroom includes a private ensuite, creating a peaceful retreat, while the remaining bedrooms are serviced by a modern main bathroom finished with quality fixtures and fittings.<br/><br/>• At the heart of the home is a light-filled open-plan living and dining area, perfect for everyday living and entertaining. This space flows seamlessly into a contemporary kitchen equipped with ample storage, generous bench space, and modern appliances to suit busy households. Large windows allow natural light to fill the home, enhancing the warm and welcoming atmosphere.<br/><br/>• Additional features include air conditi