rty with our agency.<br/>Should your application be successful you will be required to leave one weeks rent as a holding deposit upon approval - we are a cashless office so the deposit will be required in the form of a bank cheque or money order from Australia Post. The initial deposit is non refundable but does come off the balance owed when you sign your tenancy agreement - the total payment required for all tenants entering into a tenancy agreement is 2 weeks rent in advance and 4 weeks bond that is held in trust by the rental bond board, this payment must be made by bank cheque or money order from Australia Post and all subsequent rental payments by direct debit from your bank account.','house','Campbelltown',-34.07334229,150.82466315,2560,'NSW','2 Mitchell Street','Campbelltown',1,3,1,'Harcourts The Property People - CAMPBELLTOWN','Garage: 1'),(910,'Spacious and Full Of Natural Light',630,'It\'s easy to see why this estate is called the ROYAL. Stylishly spread with intelligent design over two levels, these remarkable properties offer luxurious surfaces, quality fittings and ample space for small or large families.<br/><br/>These properties feature carpet throughout, open and bright living and dining areas with split system heating and cooling, large fully equipped kitchens with stainless steel appliances and landscaped private outdoor living spaces that are perfect for entertaining or relaxing. <br/><br/>These family homes have 3 large bedrooms, featuring good natural light, BIR\'s and central bathroom, and sparkling en-suite and walk-in robe to the master bedroom.<br/><br/>All properties have a secure garage and driveway space.<br/><br/>Situated off Wright Street, this property is within walking distance to park lands, a short 3 minute drive to Sunshine Station, 5 minute drive to Sunshine Market Place, access to buses, only a short train trip into the CBD and plenty more!<br/><br/>Now, an opportunity to call one of these beautiful houses your home!<br/><br/>Be