king for a spacious and comfortable home. The property includes mirror sliding built-in robes, a dishwasher, ducted heating, evaporative cooling , tiles & floorboards, and a double remote-control garage.<br/><br/>Located at a great location walking distance to Kallo Town Centre, this property offers a large backyard with plenty of space for outdoor activities. The interior features a well-designed kitchen, stylish flooring, and a light-filled living area.<br/><br/>. 4 Bedrooms<br/>· 2 Bathrooms<br/>· Double Remote-Control Garage<br/>· Choice of Theatre Room/formal lounge<br/>· Walk in Pantry<br/>· 900mm Stainless Steel Rangehood<br/>· 900mm stainless Steel Cooktop/Oven<br/>· Stainless Steel Dishwasher<br/>· Stone Benchtops throughout<br/>· Ducted Heating<br/>· Evaporative Cooling<br/>· NBN Ready<br/>. Walking distance to shops and schools<br/>. Close to public transport<br/><br/>What are you waiting for.??<br/><br/>Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to lease this beautiful property in a convenient location.<br/>Contact us today to arrange a viewing!','house','Kalkallo',-37.52973582,144.96478959,3064,'Vic','13 Mckane Street','Kalkallo',2,4,2,'Home & Key Real Estate','Garage: 2'),(1164,'UNIQUE APARTMENT IN GARDEN SETTING',500,'A secluded, landscaped oasis provides a huge garden setting for this spacious, ground floor apartment nestled quietly at the rear. Impeccably presented, this superb single level home is an indoor/outdoor hidden treasure where the impressive garden with entertainment deck virtually equals the stylish interior space. <br/><br/>The light filled layout offers two sizable bedrooms with built in robes, open plan living and dining area with French doors overlooking the courtyard, immaculate kitchen with stainless steel appliances, central bathroom, separate toilet, European laundry and reverse cycle heating/cooling. Including covered car space and visitor parking, this unique apartment is conveniently located near Rosanna Village and Northland shopping, Austin Hospital, Shelley Park, La Trobe University and public transport.<br/><br/>Simply click \'Book Inspection\' button to register for an inspection, or use the \'Contact Agent\' facility. By registering, you will instantly be informed of any updates, changes or cancellations to your appointment. Applications will be accepted after you have attended an open for inspection.','apartment','Heidelberg Heights',-37.74032174,145.05279501,3081,'Vic','8/23 McEwan Road','Heidelberg Heights',1,2,1,'Miles Real Estate - Ivanhoe','Carport: 1, Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Floorboards'),(1165,'Mudgee Townhouse',600,'This immaculately maintained home offers comfort, convenience, and easy-care living - ideal for a busy working couple seeking a modern lifestyle.<br/><br/>The property features:<br/><br/>- 3 bedrooms, all with built-ins, and carpet<br/>- Master has an ensuite<br/>- Main bathroom has shower, toilet, & large bathtub<br/>- Open plan living, dining <br/>- Eat-in kitchen with dishwasher & gas cooking<br/>- Outside covered entertaining area<br/>- Ducted air conditioning<br/>- Internal laundry with access to outside<br/>- Gas HWS<br/>- Water tank, & town water<br/>- Single automatic garage with storage & internal access<br/>- Available mid-March 2026<br/><br/>This well-appointed home combines modern comfort with low-maintenance ease - simply move in and enjoy.<br/><br/>Contact Raine & Horne on 6379 6668 to book your inspection today.<br/><br/>','townhouse','Mudgee',-32.59928407,149.59310320,2850,'NSW','1/12 Gundys Lane','Mudgee',2,3,2,'Raine & Horne - Gulgong','Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(1166,'Stunning New Family Home.',460,'This brand new stunning family home features 4 bedrooms with built in wardrobes.<br/>Designer bathrooms feature the most modern fittings and lots of natural light.<br/>Beautiful open kitchen living area opening onto backyard.<br/>Be the first to rent this beautiful home and make it your own.<br/>To arrange an inspection please call [REDACTED PHONE]<br/> or register on line for inspections available.','house','Thornhill Park',-37.72344126,144.63056178,3335,'Vic','7 Cranberry Crescent','Thornhill Park',2,4,1,'Guardian Property & Asset Management - Melbourne','Garage: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Floorboards, Living Areas: 1, Pets Allowed'),(1167,'Luxurious Apartment with Breathtaking Views',1400,'Set over two levels on the top floor of the \'Edo\' security building, this luxurious apartment is set against a beautiful city backdrop with panoramic views over St Mary\'s Cathedral through to the City.<br/><br/>The apartment boasts 113 square meters of space with a modern indoor & outdoor living, incorporating designer finishes.<br/><br/>Only a short walk to the best amenities the city can offer, the apartment features;<br/><br/>Secure Building<br/>Sleek Finishes in all rooms<br/>Full Bathroom<br/>Full Ensuite Bathroom<br/>Modern Kitchen<br/>Internal Laundry<br/>Reverse cycle air-conditioning<br/>Undercover Security Car Space + Storage cage','apartment','Woolloomooloo',-33.87314832,151.21684493,2011,'NSW','308/76-88 Crown Street','Woolloomooloo',2,2,1,'Laing Real Estate - Elizabeth Bay','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes'),(1168,'18/66-72 Booner Street, Hawks Nest',550,'Experience the ultimate in coastal living with this two-bedroom residence featuring rooftop living for entertaining. <br/>Close to cafe\', shops and transport, you\'ll love the convenience and relaxed atmosphere this property provides, simply move in and start enjoying beach side living at its best. <br/>','unit','Hawks Nest',-32.67344273,152.18010651,2324,'NSW','18/66-72 Booner Street,','Hawks Nest',1,2,1,'Hawks Nest Beach Realty - Hawks Nest','Balcony, Courtyard, Garage: 1, Remote Garage, Swimming Pool - Inground, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Living Areas: 2, Rumpus Room, Toilets: 1, Furnished'),(1169,'Big on Space, Easy on Rent – Unfurnished Studio That Stands Out',565,'Designer finishes, lifestyle-focused amenities, and just 2 Metro stops from the CBD.<br/><br/>The Apartment:<br/>This open-plan studio is the perfect solution for effortless city living. <br/><br/>• Washer, dryer, dishwasher, fridge, oven and induction cooktop included<br/>• Split System and built-in storage<br/>• Contemporary finishes and natural light throughout<br/><br/>The Amenities:<br/>Your apartment is just the beginning. As a resident of Local: Kensington, you’ll enjoy access to a range of top-tier lifestyle spaces rarely seen in private rentals.<br/>• Fully equipped 24-hour gym and yoga studio<br/>• Big Screen room, Games room and Resident Lounge<br/>• Coworking spaces and private dining rooms<br/>• Outdoor heated pool, BBQ area and pet wash station<br/>• Secure bike storage and electric car share<br/>• On-site parking available (additional cost)<br/><br/>The Location:<br/>Enjoy the best of Kensington at your doorstep:<br/>• 2 Metro stops to the CBD<br/>• Minutes from Woolworths and local cafés<br/>• Easy access to parks, bike paths and public transport<br/> <br/>Why Local: Kensington?<br/>Unlike standard private rentals, Local: Kensington offers beautifully maintained apartments, hotel-style amenity access, and a community-driven living experience — with onsite management and flexible lease options.<br/> <br/>Ready to move in?<br/>Book your tour today or visit LocalKensington.com.au to explore available studio, 1, 2, and 3-bedroom layouts.<br/><br/>Floor plans and renders are for illustrative purposes only. Terms and conditions apply.','apartment','Kensington',-37.79472285,144.93462601,3031,'Vic','B113/348 Macaulay Road','Kensington',1,1,2,'Kensington BTR - Local Residential','Balcony, Courtyard, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Floorboards, Gym, Intercom, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Pets Allowed'),(1170,'Spacious 4 Bedroom Home in Wollert',600,'TO APPLY: please click \"Get in touch\" or \"Enquire\" & a link will be sent to you. Please also register for each inspection to be kept up to date with changes.<br/><br/>Safety First:<br/><br/>The safety of our tenants is our top priority. In accordance with the Residential Tenancies Act, this property has undergone Gas, Electrical, and Smoke Alarm safety checks and was deemed compliant as of the listing date. Copies of the compliance reports will be made available to successful applicants upon request, as per the Residential Tenancies Act. <br/><br/>Don\'t Miss Out on This Beautiful Family Home!<br/><br/>This stunning 4-bedroom home boasts an abundance of natural light throughout, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The spacious living areas are perfect for family gatherings and entertaining guests. The modern kitchen is equipped with high-quality appliances and ample storage space, making meal preparation a breeze.<br/><br/>Each of the four generously sized bedrooms features openable windows, allowing for plenty of fresh air and natural light. The master bedroom includes a private ensuite for added convenience. The home is fitted with evaporative cooling and ducted heating, ensuring year-round comfort.<br/><br/>The property also includes a double car space, providing secure parking for your vehicles. The low-maintenance yard is perfect for those who enjoy outdoor living without the hassle of extensive upkeep.<br/><br/>Located in the desirable suburb of Wollert, this home is close to shops and public transport, making daily errands and commuting a breeze. Enjoy the convenience of nearby facilities and the vibrant local community. <br/><br/>To apply, please click \"Get in touch\" or \"Enquire\" & a link will be sent to you. Please ensure each adult completes an application form, which includes 100 points of ID for each applicant. We complete thorough reference checks on all applicants including the verification of ID through the appropriate authorities. It is compulsory for all our renters to conduct a National Tenancy Data (NTD) base Check. Please register for each inspection for priority access & to inform our agents of your attendance. This will ensure you are kept up to date with any information regarding the property & any changes or cancellations of inspection times. To be kept informed of future inspections, please click \"Contact Agent\".<br/><br/>Photo ID is required for entry.<br/><br/>Covid safe policy applies.','house','Wollert',-37.60825446,145.01183344,3750,'Vic','5 Yalmy Avenue','Wollert',2,4,2,'Harcourts Rata & Co','Garage: 2, Ducted Heating, Evaporative Cooling');
INSERT INTO `data` VALUES (1171,'Spacious 2 Bed Apartment - Modern Complex with Pool & Gym',750,'This modern 2 bedroom apartment is in a beautifully landscaped apartment complex centrally located to the Hurstville CBD. Short walk to Hurstville Stations, public transport and schools. Offering the security, comfort and low maintenance of apartment living.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>* Large open plan living & dining area<br/>* 2 spacious bedrooms with built-ins<br/>* Modern bathroom with separate shower and bath<br/>* En-suite in master bedroom<br/>* Ducted air-conditioning in unit<br/>* Private balcony off living area<br/>* Single lock-up garage<br/>* Pool and gym facilities<br/><br/>***TO INSPECT THIS PROPERTY YOU MUST REGISTER YOUR INTEREST***<br/>Registering allows us to advise you of time changes and cancellations.','unit','Hurstville',-33.96417231,151.09391351,2220,'NSW','13/323 Forest Road','Hurstville',2,2,1,'Belle Property - St George','Open Spaces: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1, Intercom'),(1172,'Stylish Living Awaits at 8/148 Smith Street, Larrakeyah',720,'Discover your dream home in this stunning residential unit located in the heart of Larrakeyah. This spacious property boasts a large open plan living area that seamlessly connects to a generous balcony, offering breathtaking water views – perfect for entertaining or enjoying a quiet evening.<br/><br/>The modern kitchen is a chef\'s delight, featuring stone benchtops and a dishwasher for effortless meal preparation. Retreat to the master bedroom, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite featuring a walk-in shower. The second bedroom also includes built-in wardrobes, providing ample storage for all your needs.<br/><br/>Additional highlights include a huge pool in the complex, ideal for those warm tropical days, and a large internal laundry with extra storage space. With two secure car parks, convenience is at your fingertips. Don’t miss out on this fantastic opportunity to secure a lifestyle of comfort and elegance!<br/>','unit','Larrakeyah',-12.45549519,130.83439608,820,'NT','8/148 Smith Street','Larrakeyah',2,2,2,'Real Estate Central','Carport: 2'),(1173,'PEACEFUL & PRIVATE TOWNHOUSE',460,'Positioned to the rear of a well maintained complex with only three townhouses on the block, this property has been recently updated with new flooring throughout, a fresh coat of paint and offers a private and peaceful lifestyle with a terrific undercover patio.<br/><br/>- Generous lounge on arrival that will host an array of furniture arrangements, <br/>- Two brilliantly sized bedrooms, both with built in robes,<br/>- Full family bathroom will separate toilet and laundry facilities, <br/>- Open plan kitchen and dining with the kitchen boasting gas cooking, ample storage and breakfast bar for informal dining, <br/>- Refrigerated cooling and gas heating for your comfort, <br/>- Extensive and private all weather pergola to enjoy in every season, <br/>- Spacious and secure yard with manicured grounds and gardens and garden shed for your convenience, <br/>- A single lock up garage with remote access and with additional car space should you require.<br/><br/>With public transport close by and a great selection of schools, shopping centres and sporting facilities right at your doorstep, we welcome your inspection.','townhouse','Wodonga',-36.11934768,146.85659149,3690,'Vic','3/16 KYLE COURT','Wodonga',1,2,2,'Sell Buy Rent - Wodonga','Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Gas Heating, Split-system Air Conditioning'),(1174,'Stylish Urban Living in Surry Hills/ CBD',795,'Stylish Inner-City Living – Prime Surry Hills Location<br/><br/>Located in the heart of Surry Hills, this well-presented apartment at 77/6–18 Poplar Street offers comfort, convenience, and lifestyle. Set within a secure complex, it features a light-filled open-plan living and dining area, a modern kitchen with quality appliances, and a spacious bedroom with built-in wardrobes.<br/><br/>Enjoy being just moments from Crown Street\'s cafés, restaurants, and transport options, with Prince Alfred Park and Central Station within easy walking distance. Perfect for professionals seeking vibrant inner-city living.<br/><br/>Features:<br/><br/>- Heated Swimming pool & Gym <br/>- Located in the heart of Surry Hills<br/>- Light-filled open-plan living and dining area<br/>- Modern kitchen with quality appliances<br/>- Spacious bedroom with built-in wardrobe<br/>- Secure building with intercom access<br/>- Internal laundry, large balcony of lounge space<br/>- Walk to Crown Street dining, transport & Prince Alfred Park<br/>- Seconds to Hyde Park & St James station','apartment','Surry Hills',-33.87800447,151.21276865,2010,'NSW','77/6-18 Poplar Street','Surry Hills',1,1,1,'JK Agency - WOOLLAHRA','Open Spaces: 1'),(1175,'BRAND NEW FAMILY HOME',550,'This brand new home is located within close proximity to Darley Plaza, Darley Medical center, Darley Primary School, Darley Park , Lerderderg Gorge & great freeway access<br/>Additional amenities within the area include Bacchus Marsh hospital, Maddingley Park & bacchus Marsh Grammar<br/>Indulge in the exceptional comfort & modern luxury that comes with living in a newly built home<br/>Offering four bedrooms, the master has an ensuite & walk-in robe, the remaining bedrooms are fitted with built-in robes and central bathroom, both showers inclusive of a shower niche<br/>The open plan contemporary kitchen & living will impress, with large 40 mm stone benchtops inclusive of an island bench offering all-round access, feature window & quality appliances such as a dishwasher for easy clean up<br/>A second living area with the versatility of a formal lounge, family room, kids retreat or home office<br/>Double sliding back doors open up the spacious rear yard with pre-laid lawn<br/>Additional features include ample storage and high ceilings throughout, ducted heating & evaporative cooling, a sizeable laundry, double remote control garage, security alarm system, double glaze windows, solar system, rainwater system, <br/>Inspection by registration only, so please ensure you register in order to be advised of upcoming inspections and confirm your inspection once booked to avoid missing out<br/><br/>','house','Darley',-37.66269488,144.42750130,3340,'Vic','21 Meridie Way','Darley',2,4,2,'Ray White Bacchus Marsh - BACCHUS MARSH','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1, Evaporative Cooling, Toilets: 2'),(1176,'Convenient Location - 6 Month lease',520,'Please refer below for inspection instructions.<br/><br/>This well-maintained two-bedroom unit is perfectly situated on a generous, low-maintenance block, providing both comfort and convenience. The unit boasts expansive living and dining areas filled with natural light, perfect for entering and brand new split aircon installed for comfortable living. <br/><br/>Both bedrooms are generously sized and come with built-in robes, while the kitchen is equipped with quality appliances, including gas cooking. The central bathroom, complemented by a separate toilet, enhances functionality. Floorboards throughout add a touch of warmth, while heating ensure year-round comfort. The property also offers a single lock-up garage, as well as a private outdoor area, perfect for relaxation or entertaining. <br/><br/>Located just moments from Mitcham Shopping Centre, Eastland Shopping Centre, and Ringwood Square Shops, including Costco and ALDI, this unit provides easy access to Antonio Park, Simpson Park, Mullauna Secondary College, and Antonio Park Primary School. The convenience of nearby public transport options, including Mitcham Station, buses, and quick access to Eastlink, makes commuting effortless. <br/><br/>**To Inspect**<br/><br/>To book an inspection, click either the ‘Request Online Inspection Link’ or ‘Get in Touch’ then select ‘Request an Inspection’ to enter your details. An inspection invitation will then be sent to you via our application platform. If there are no available inspection times, or you cannot attend the listed time, please send an enquiry or contact the leasing agent for further assistance. Please note ‘add to plan’ is not booking into the inspection.<br/><br/>**Please Note** <br/><br/>Open for Inspection times and property availability is subject to change without notice. We highly recommend registering for an inspection you are going to attend to avoid disappointment for cancellations. If you are registered for an inspection, you will be notified by SMS if the inspection is cancelled. <br/><br/>**Caution** <br/><br/>Marshall White has exclusive leasing rights to this property. We do not advertise on Gumtree, Facebook Marketplace or any other social media platforms. Please beware of scammers and apply only via the official advertising link using the Snug platform.','townhouse','Mitcham',-37.81523900,145.20184400,3132,'Vic','2/40 Cook Road','Mitcham',1,2,1,'Marshall White - Manningham','Fully Fenced, Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating'),(1177,'Spacious Amazing 2 Bedroom Apartment FOR RENT',850,'Melbourne Quater 628 Flinders Street, Docklands<br/>Enjoy city living at Dockland\'s most prestigious property developed by Lendlease. The luxury apartment comes with an emphasis on style, sophistication, and security, this exclusive new home offer:<br/>- Spacious bedroom with mirrored robes and fantastic view<br/>- Split system air conditioning<br/>- Security intercom system<br/>- European kitchen appliances: Cooktop, Oven & Dishwasher<br/>- Modern style bathroom fittings and design<br/>- Timber flooring in the living areas<br/><br/>Retreat to three levels of sophisticated luxury at Club MQ and escape every day with exclusive resort-style amenities such as:<br/><br/>• 25-metre indoor swimming pool<br/>• Spa <br/>• Sauna<br/>• Steam room<br/>• Multi-purpose gym<br/>• Yoga and function rooms<br/>• 20-seat theatrette<br/><br/>The perfect location offers a direct connection to Melbourne Free Tram Zone and Southern Cross Station. Take the free-city tram from your doorstep to work and enjoy the convenience of the city with a major supermarket and DFO within easy walking distance.<br/><br/>Designed by award-winning architect firm Fender Katsalidis Architects, one-two-and three- bedroom apartments offer refined city living with elegant interior finishes, and expansive views of the CBD skyline and beyond.<br/><br/>Please register your interest!','apartment','Docklands',-37.82128464,144.95351145,3008,'Vic','3213/628 Flinders Street','Docklands',1,2,2,'Jalin Realty Australia Pty Ltd - Melbourne','Balcony, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Intercom'),(1178,'Stylish and affordable',440,'This light and bright apartment is at the end of a cul de sac on two sides and just moments from parks, train/tram and shops.<br/><br/>PROPERTY IS UNFURNISHED <br/><br/>Featuring:<br/>- Secure entrance<br/>- Sunny lounge with split system heating and cooling<br/>- Kitchen has gas cooking<br/>- Bedroom with built in wardrobes<br/>- Bathroom comprises of shower over bath<br/>- Communal laundry<br/>- Off street parking for one car<br/><br/>Located directly next to the secluded Inverness Avenue Reserve and just moments to Armadale Train Station and High Street cafes and Malvern Central.<br/><br/>Whilst every care is taken, Wilson Agents will not be held liable for any misprints of this advertisement and the applicant/s acknowledge that in applying for the property they are accepting the premises in the condition in which they viewed the home.<br/><br/>For scheduled inspections, please use the \"BOOK AN INSPECTION\" or \"EMAIL THE AGENT\" buttons and we will contact you to arrange a suitable time.','apartment','Armadale',-37.86045095