n on display is perfectly embodied in the kitchen as it blends function and form while delivering substantial volume and preparation space for the aspiring chef.<br/><br/>A master bedroom with BIR and private ensuite is joined by a secondary bedroom with BIR and main bathroom access.<br/><br/>Positioned on the cusp of the north’s lifestyle and entertainment district, sit within walking distance of the cultural commons of Lygon Street, Brunswick Street, and Smith Street, while remaining only a stone’s throw from Melbourne Central.<br/><br/>● Substantial use of glass<br/>● Relaxed, yet refined<br/>● Spacious dimensions<br/>● Easy-living emphasis','apartment','Carlton',-37.80564711,144.96183201,3053,'Vic','1901/28 Bouverie Street','Carlton',2,2,2,'First National - Burwood','Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Furnished'),(1336,'Contemporary apartment in the heart of epping',790,'Perfectly located in the heart of Epping, is this elegant two bedroom apartment in a highly sought after boutique complex. With a contemporary design that is enhanced by the finest of finishes throughout, this luxury 2nd floor apartment sets a new standard when it comes to executive and convenient lifestyle. It is only a short walk to shops, Coles supermarket, buses, restaurants and other amenities.<br/><br/>- Spacious open plan sun filled living and dining area with vibrant timber flooring<br/>- 2 generous sized bedrooms with built-ins and ensuite to main<br/>- Stylish gas kitchen with 80mm thick benchtops and appliances<br/>- Ducted and zoned air conditioning throughout<br/>- Ultra-modern bathrooms with abundant mirrored cabinetry<br/>- Internal laundry with dryer<br/>- Security building with video intercom and lift access<br/>- Large entertainer\'s balcony with district views<br/>- One basement car space and storage cage<br/>- Within catchment of quality schools including Epping Heights Primary, Epping Boys High, Cheltenham Girls and Carlingford High School<br/>- Easy access