rish Primary School <br/>* Westmead Hospital, Westmead Private and The Children\'s Hospital all a short drive or bike ride away. <br/><br/>If you are planning on attending one of our inspections, please ensure you register online so that you can be notified of any updates, changes, or cancellations.','apartment','North Rocks',-33.79086313,151.00113453,2151,'NSW','208/27-33 North Rocks Road','North Rocks',1,1,1,'Belle Property Beecroft | Carlingford','Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Built-in Wardrobes, Intercom'),(1355,'Waterfront Living',500,'Discover this 3-bedroom waterfront home in the coastal village of Primrose Sands. This property offers the opportunity for those wanting to have a balanced lifestyle between work and enjoyment, where coming home every day feels like a holiday. <br/><br/>The open plan living area with wooden beams, and modern updates looks out from the dining area to the crystal-clear waters. The area is kept comfortable year-round with both a wood heater and split-system air conditioner. The kitchen is well appointed to take advantage of the expansive views with peninsular breakfast bar, electric cooker and corner pantry. <br/><br/>The master bedroom is positioned to take advantage of the views, a wooden ceiling fan for those balmy evenings, and large walk-in robe. The bedrooms are all generously sized with roman blinds continued throughout. With two decked patio areas, the living space can be continued outside where every evening can be enjoyed. <br/><br/>The large surrounding yard includes a garden shed for those needing additional storage. With direct access to the beach, taking a stroll will be a regular occurrence with ease. If you enjoy swimming, boating, surfing, fishing, walking and more than this property is the perfect choice with all of these activities right at your fingertips. <br/><br/>The beautiful community of Primrose Sands is well serviced by a local coffee van, takeaway and general store, RSL, and more. Primrose Sands presents an enviable lifestyle that has beaches and lifestyle positioned within a commutable distance to Hobart and the township of Sorell is a mere 20 minutes away, where you\'ll find everything you need for modern living.<br/><br/>Available for a 6 or 12-month lease term initially with the possibility of renewal. At any stage before or throughout this tenancy, the tenant will be required to seek the owner\'s consent using the approved form to keep a pet at the premises.<br/><br/>Physical inspections are required and we would be happy to arrange something with you. Please register your interest by way of enquiry. We look forward to showing you this beautiful property you might very well call home.','house','Primrose Sands',-42.89349014,147.68690248,7173,'Tas','747 Primrose Sands Road','Primrose Sands',1,3,2,'Homelands Property - Sorell & Southern Beaches','Deck, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1'),(1356,'Modern, Sophisticated Living',530,'TO APPLY: please click \"Get in touch\" or \"Enquire\" & a link will be sent to you. Please also register for each inspection to be kept up to date with changes.<br/><br/>Safety First:<br/><br/>The safety of our tenants is our top priority. In accordance with the Residential Tenancies Act, this property has undergone Gas, Electrical, and Smoke Alarm safety checks and was deemed compliant as of the listing date. Copies of the compliance reports will be made available to successful applicants upon request, as per the Residential Tenancies Act.<br/><br/>Don\'t miss this opportunity to secure a charming 3-bedroom home in the heart of Lalor. With built-in wardrobes in each bedroom, ample storage space is guaranteed. The property features brand new floorboards throughout, providing a warm and inviting atmosphere.<br/><br/>The home is equipped with split system heating and cooling, ensuring comfort in all seasons. Step outside to a lovely pergola area, perfect for outdoor entertaini