y!<br/><br/>This charming 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home offers an abundance of natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Each bedroom features built-in wardrobes, providing ample storage space. The living areas boast beautiful floorboards, adding a touch of elegance to the home.<br/><br/>The modern kitchen is equipped with quality appliances and plenty of bench space, perfect for preparing family meals. The open-plan living and dining area is ideal for both entertaining guests and relaxing with loved ones. A double car space is also included, ensuring convenience for the occupants.<br/><br/>Located in the heart of Lalor, this property is close to shops and public transport, making daily errands a breeze. Enjoy the convenience of nearby facilities and easy access to everything you need. <br/><br/>To apply, please click \"Get in touch\" or \"Enquire\" & a link will be sent to you. Please ensure each adult completes an application form, which includes 100 points of ID for each applicant. We complete thorough reference checks on all applicants including the verification of ID through the appropriate authorities. It is compulsory for all our renters to conduct a National Tenancy Data (NTD) base Check. Please register for each inspection for priority access & to inform our agents of your attendance. This will ensure you are kept up to date with any information regarding the property & any changes or cancellations of inspection times. To be kept informed of future inspections, please click \"Contact Agent\".<br/><br/>Photo ID is required for entry.<br/><br/>Covid safe policy applies.','house','Lalor',-37.65890300,145.00671000,3075,'Vic','3 Lynette Crescent','Lalor',2,3,2,'Harcourts Rata & Co','Open Spaces: 2, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards'),(1358,'Cosy two bedroom unit !',400,'Cosy two bedroom unit close to local amenities.<br/><br/>Property features:<br/><br/>- modern kitchen with electric cooking,<br/>- combined dining and lounge room,<br/>- two bedrooms, on