feature tiling, complementing the modern aesthetic carried throughout the home. An internal laundry adds further practicality, making this renovated residence an exceptional opportunity for tenants seeking comfort, convenience and style in one of Clayfield’s most sought-after pockets.<br/><br/>Property features:<br/><br/>- Fully renovated two-bedroom unit<br/>- Contemporary kitchen featuring a gas stove, electric oven, dishwasher, breakfast bar and a stylish feature splashback<br/>- Open-plan kitchen and living area complete with split system air-conditioning, and laminate flooring<br/>- Generously sized master bedroom with ceiling fan and built-in wardrobe<br/>- Second bedroom equipped with ceiling fan and built-in wardrobe<br/>- Stunning main bathroom with oversized shower and feature tiling<br/>- Internal laundry for added convenience<br/>- Security doors and screens throughout<br/><br/>Location:<br/><br/>59 Bonney Avenue is ideally positioned in the heart of Clayfield, approximately 7km from the Brisbane CBD. The property enjoys close proximity to local cafés, boutique retailers and everyday conveniences, with Nundah Village and Toombul precinct just minutes away. Excellent transport options include frequent bus services along Sandgate Road and nearby rail access at Eagle Junction and Clayfield stations, providing direct connectivity to the CBD and Brisbane Airport. Residents also benefit from easy access to Kalinga Park and the Kedron Brook bikeway, delivering green space and recreation within a well-connected inner-north setting.<br/><br/>Important Information for Applicants:<br/>Whilst paper applications are available, for ease of use and fast turnaround time we strongly suggest submitting an online application using the above apply button. This will also allow applications to be transferred to multiple properties. <br/><br/>Rental Payment Options:<br/>We use SimpleRent for all rental payments. The options are:<br/>Simple Rent Direct Debit<br/> From Bank Account: $1.65 per transaction<br/>Credit Card (Visa/Mastercard): 1.98% per transaction<br/>AMEX: 4.4% per transaction<br/>Simple Rent Pay Today - Free Option for Rent Payments<br/>This is a push payment, requiring you to use your tenancy login to manually initiate payments via the SimpleRent platform.<br/>Free payments are available only from a bank account.<br/>Note: Credit card payments will incur a 1.98% surcharge.<br/><br/>','unit','Clayfield',-27.42481668,153.04722487,4011,'Qld','3/59 Bonney Avenue','Clayfield',1,2,2,'Aurora Property - Brisbane North','Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Floorboards, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Toilets: 1'),(1360,'Modern Comfort Meets Classic Charm in Nambour - 2 Bedroom Gem with Private Deck',560,'Located at 2/4 Mount Pleasant Rd, Nambour, this delightful two-bedroom home combines modern convenience with classic character. <br/><br/>- 2 bedrooms with ample natural light<br/>- 1 bathroom<br/>- 1-car park in carport, additional open car space on driveway (2 in total)<br/>- Air conditioning in the main living area for year-round comfort<br/>- Lock-up storage under home<br/>- Private deck - ideal for relaxing or entertaining<br/>- Modern finishes blended with charming character features<br/><br/>Enjoy the convenience of being close to local schools, shops, cafes, and public transport, making daily life simple and stress-free.<br/><br/>*Property is not fully fenced. <br/><br/>PLEASE READ CAREFULLY - HOW TO APPLY:<br/><br/>Once you have inspected the property you will receive an email from our agency on how to apply. 2Apply is an online tenancy application system that makes applying for rental properties quick and easy. To ensure we are protecting our Owner\'s we DO NOT take sight unseen applications.<br/><br/>- The advertised Open Home times are the only inspections that are available at present; we cannot accomodate to private viewings.<br/>- Please ensure that you register your details to receiv