asy flow between the main living zones, making everyday living both comfortable and functional.<br/><br/>The kitchen is well-appointed and centrally located, offering ample storage and bench space to make meal preparation simple and efficient.<br/><br/>Both bedrooms are generously sized and designed with comfort in mind, providing peaceful retreats away from the main living areas.<br/><br/>Step outside and enjoy the benefit of a low-maintenance setting, while being just moments from local shops, schools, public transport, and only a short drive to Glenorchy and Hobart CBD. This home delivers both lifestyle and convenience in one appealing package.<br/><br/>Property Features Include:<br/>- 2 spacious bedrooms<br/>- Well-appointed bathroom<br/>- Light-filled living area<br/>- unctional kitchen with ample storage<br/>- Grounds maintained by gardener<br/>- Convenient Montrose location close to amenities<br/>- Off-street parking available<br/>- Lockup garden shed<br/><br/>This property offers comfortable living in a highly accessible location – perfect for those seeking convenience and easy living.<br/><br/>Rent: $500pw<br/>Bond: $2,000<br/>Available: 02/03/2026<br/>Lease Term: 12-months with potential to renew','house','Montrose',-42.82575574,147.26649680,7010,'Tas','517 Main Rd','Montrose',1,2,2,'4one4 Property Co. - GLENORCHY','Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes'),(1366,'LARGE MODERN TOWNHOUSE - BRIDGE FREE OCEAN ACCESS',900,'LARGE MODERN TOWNHOUSE - BRIDGE FREE OCEAN ACCESS<br/>$900 per week<br/>This exquisite 3-bedroom modern masterpiece oozes luxury, offering everything you could possibly want and need in a home. Modern kitchen with high spec finish, private marina berth, bridge free access to the Broadwater, great master with ensuite and generous walk-in robe. This tranquil paradise will captivate the soul and have you never wanting to leave.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>Luxury living on 3 levels<br/>Double remote controlled lockup garage with storage<br/>Vogue kitche