TLY informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your property appointment.<br/>If no one registers for an inspection time then that inspection may not proceed.<br/>DON\'T MISS OUT, Book for an inspection time today by clicking the blue \'Book an Inspection time\' button on the right.<br/>*Important* Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, Coastal will not be held liable for any errors in typing of information. All information is considered correct at the time of advertising.','house','Currumbin Valley',-28.22582042,153.36839147,4223,'Qld','1644 Currumbin Creek Road','Currumbin Valley',4,4,2,'COASTAL °','Garage: 2, Furnished'),(1445,'Live the laid-back coastal lifestyle you’ve been dreaming of in beautiful Kewarra Beach',800,'Positioned in a quiet, family-friendly street, this well-maintained home offers space, comfort, and exceptional practicality — just minutes from the beach.<br/>Designed for easy living, the home features cool tiled flooring throughout and full air-conditioning to keep you comfortable all year round. Whether you\'re a family needing room to move, a couple seeking extra space, or someone with a boat or multiple vehicles, this property delivers.<br/>Property Highlights:<br/>• 3 generous, light-filled bedrooms<br/>• Central bathroom with functional layout<br/>• Fully air-conditioned throughout<br/>• Low-maintenance tiled floors across the entire home<br/>• Oversized lock-up garage — perfect for a boat, trailer, or multiple vehicles<br/>• Pets considered upon application<br/>Enjoy the convenience of being close to local schools, shopping facilities, parks, and the stunning beachfront. Everything you need is right at your doorstep while still enjoying the peace of coastal living.<br/>Homes in this location don’t last long.<br/>Contact us today to arrange your inspection and secure your slice of beachside living.','house','Kewarra Beach',-16.79619206,145.67504807,4879,'Qld','75 Moore Road'