operty, please follow this link - https://snug.com/apply/nestarealty<br/>Alternatively, you can receive an application link by submitting an enquiry below. Once your application has been submitted, we respectfully ask that you do not contact our office to confirm receipt of your application unless you have not received a confirmation email within 24 hours of submission.<br/>(inspection information at the bottom of the description)<br/><br/>**IMPORTANT**<br/>Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, NESTA Realty will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All information is considered correct at the time of printing.','house','Tarneit',-37.85126556,144.62607027,3029,'Vic','10 Pump St','Tarneit',2,4,1,'NESTA Realty','Garage: 1'),(1458,'Cosey townhouse available soon',580,'This cosey 3 bedroom townhouse is new to the market after a long term tenancy and wont last long so get in quickly to make it yours?<br/><br/>With ducted reverse cycle air conditioning the home provides year round comfort.<br/><br/>All bedrooms have ceiling fans and built in wardrobes while the master bedroom also boasts ensuite and walk in wardrobe. The comfortable study nook upstairs has it\'s own balcony where you can enjoy a cuppa and read a book or you can relax in the undercover alfresco area downstairs overlooking your own private fully fenced yard!<br/><br/>With shops, childcare, schools and transport at your doorstep this home provides convivence and comfort and is a must to inspect!<br/><br/>** Please note photos are indicative only, you must inspect prior to applying<br/>** Anniversary of last rent increase on the property is 01/01/2025','townhouse','Doolandella',-27.61366978,152.98508177,4077,'Qld','3/30 Falso Pl','Doolandella',2,3,1,'Colibri Realty - UNDERWOOD','Garage: 1'),(1459,'Two Bedroom Unit',620,'•Open plan living and dining area filled with natural light<br/>•Modern kitchen with electric cooking, ample bench space and generous storage<br/>•Neatly presented bathroom featuring a full-sized bathtub<br/>•Well-sized bedrooms complete with built-in wardrobes<br/>•Convenient internal laundry<br/>•Secure single lock-up garage<br/>•Sunny balcony ideal for relaxing <br/>•Prime lifestyle location<br/><br/>This property is managed by Dalton Partners The Junction 4969 3500.<br/><br/>To view our properties you must register for an inspection time. To register either click the book inspection button or hit email agent to be directed to book. If you do not register we cannot notify you of any changes, new times or cancellations.','unit','Merewether',-32.94123645,151.74407117,2291,'NSW','1/72 Selwyn Street','Merewether',1,2,1,'Dalton Partners - The Junction','Balcony, Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes'),(1460,'Fully Furnished Studio in Prime North Melbourne Location',445,'Located on sought-after Arden Street, North Melbourne, this fully furnished studio apartment offers unbeatable convenience with a tram stop located directly outside the building, providing easy and direct access to Melbourne CBD, Melbourne University and the Royal Melbourne Hospital precinct.<br/><br/>Perfect for students, medical professionals and city commuters, this well-presented studio combines comfort, functionality and excellent public transport connectivity.<br/><br/>\"Prospective renters are required to register for the open-for-inspection to view the property. This ensures they are promptly notified of any changes or cancellations to the scheduled inspection.\"<br/><br/>Use this link to APPLY NOW! https://our.property/5Hof','apartment','North Melbourne',-37.80035403,144.94624485,3051,'Vic','4/168 Arden Street','North Melbourne',1,1,2,'Dingle Partners - Melbourne','Furnished'),(1461,'Peaceful cul-de-sac living in Oxenford',1200,'A beautifully presented, newly renovated home offering space, privacy and relaxed family living.<br/>• 4 generous bedrooms<br/>• Private master retreat with walk-in robe & ensuite<br/>• 3 Modern bathrooms<br/>• Multiple living & dining areas<br/>• Spacious kitchen with electric cooktop & ample storage<br/>• Ducted zoned air-conditioning<br/>• Ceiling fans & security screens throughout<br/>• Extended high-set double carport<br/>• Resort style inground pool <br/>• Large covered alfresco entertaining area<br/>• Fully fenced yard<br/>• Landscaped gardens with artificial turf around pool<br/><br/>EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY OR FOLLOW WEBSITE PROMPTS TO GET IN TOUCH.<br/>Please note: We do not accept 1Form applications. To apply, please select \'Apply\' on the listing via realestate.com.au.<br/><br/>IMPORTANT: Prospective tenants are required to view the property in person prior to submitting an application.<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: We have, in preparing this advertisement, used our best endeavours to ensure the information contained is true and accurate. However, we accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, or misstatements that may occur. Prospective tenants should make their own enquiries to verify the information contained in this advertisement.','house','Oxenford',-27.89885426,153.29873270,4210,'Qld','2 Dorchester Court','Oxenford',3,4,2,'Harcourts Inspire - OXENFORD','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Floorboards, Pets Allowed'),(1462,'Three bedroom family brick home with spacious yard!!',750,'Century 21 The Parks Realty would like to invite you to this thre bedroom brick family home featuring the following:<br/><br/>+ 3 great-sized bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes<br/>+ Main bedroom complete with private ensuite<br/>+ Large living area with split-system air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>+ Great-sized kitchen with ample bench and storage space<br/>+ Electric cooking stove top<br/>+ Separate dining area – perfect for family meals<br/>+ Modern main bathroom with generous space<br/>+ Combination of carpet and tiles throughout<br/>+ Great-sized undercover outdoor area – ideal for entertaining<br/>+ Massive backyard with garden shed<br/>+ Secure lock-up carport plus ample additional parking space<br/>+ Internal laundry for added convenience<br/><br/>This well-appointed home offers space, comfort, and practicality – perfect for families or anyone looking for room to move!<br/><br/>Close to school, shops and other amenities | Call to book your inspection online','house','Bossley Park',-33.85630475,150.87646696,2176,'NSW','51 Bettong Crescent','Bossley Park',2,3,3,'Century 21 - The Parks Realty','Carport: 1, Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning'),(1463,'Near New & Ready to call HOME!',600,'TO APPLY: please click \"Get in touch\" or \"Enquire\" & a link will be sent to you. Please also register for each inspection to be kept up to date with changes.<br/><br/>Safety First:<br/><br/>The safety of our tenants is our top priority. In accordance with the Residential Tenancies Act, this property has undergone Gas, Electrical, and Smoke Alarm safety checks and was deemed compliant as of the listing date. Copies of the compliance reports will be made available to successful applicants upon request, as per the Residential Tenancies Act.<br/><br/>Located in one of Mernda\'s most sought after pockets this Like New spectacular property has been built with style, practicality and comfort in mind.<br/><br/>Displaying an array of commodities the exceptional home offers 4 excellent sized bedrooms including elegant ensuite and walk in robe to master and remaining bedrooms serviced with built in robes and central sparkling bathroom with separate Bathtub.<br/><br/>Flaunting an abundance of space, you will love the modern spacious Kitchen/Meals Zone offering Large Stone Benchtop, plenty of storage space, Stainless Steel appliances with Gas Cooking and Dishwasher.<br/><br/>Further highlights and additions include:<br/>- Theatre Room/2nd Living Area<br/>- Ducted Heating & Cooling<br/>- Easy to maintain Front & Rear Yards <br/>- Remote Garage with Internal Access.<br/>- Full sized Separate Laundry<br/><br/>All this within moments of Public Transport, Local Shops, Schools, Facilities including Mernda Central College, Mernda Town Centre and Short Drive to Westfield Plenty Valley.<br/><br/>This is not just a property but a lifestyle!<br/><br/>Inspection WILL impress!<br/><br/>To apply, please click \"Get in touch\" or \"Enquire\" & a link will be sent to you. Please ensure each adult completes an application form, which includes 100 points of ID for each applicant. We complete thorough reference checks on all applicants including the verification of ID through the appropriate authorities. It is compulsory for all our renters to conduct a National Tenancy Data (NTD) base Check. Please register for each inspection for priority access & to inform our agents of your attendance. This will ensure you are kept up to date with any information regarding the property & any changes or cancellations of inspection times. To be kept informed of future inspections, please click \"Contact Agent\".<br/> <br/>Photo ID is required for entry.<br/> <br/>Covid safe policy applies.','house','Mernda',-37.60038428,145.08431395,3754,'Vic','9 Castello Street','Mernda',2,4,4,'Harcourts Rata & Co','Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1'),(1464,'PREMIUM COASTAL LIVING IN THE HEART OF BURLEIGH',2650,'A beautifully furnished home that captures the ease and elegance of a premium coastal lifestyle, where relaxed living and effortless entertaining come naturally.<br/><br/>Step inside to discover a calm, modern interior filled with natural light. The inviting living and dining zones create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, perfectly designed for both everyday comfort and hosting friends and family.<br/><br/>Seamlessly connecting indoors to out, the home opens to a private wellness-inspired retreat. Here, you\'ll find a sparkling saltwater pool, outdoor shower, and a 2-seater infrared Nook sauna — creating your own personal sanctuary. The generous alfresco area is equipped with a built-in BBQ and double-door fridge, making outdoor entertaining a breeze. With multiple spaces to sit, gather or unwind — including a cozy outdoor firepit nook — this is a home designed to embrace the very best of Burleigh living.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>* 13.7kW solar system for energy efficiency<br/>* Saltwater swimming pool with outdoor shower<br/>* 2-seater infrared Nook sauna<br/>* Spacious alfresco entertaining area with BBQ & double-door fridge<br/>* Separate media/recreation room<br/>* Outdoor firepit nook for year-round enjoyment<br/>* Open plan living and dining area with air-conditioning<br/>* Spacious study / 4th Bedroom<br/>* Large kitchen with butler\'s pantry<br/>* Separate laundry<br/>* Fully fenced back yard<br/>* Low maintenance grounds<br/>* Fully furnished<br/><br/>* Short walk to Burleigh Beach, cafes, restaurants, schools and public transport<br/>* Just a 5-minute drive to Stockland Shopping Centre and other major amenities<br/><br/>Offering lifestyle, comfort and effortless coastal charm, this exceptional home presents a rare opportunity to experience all that Burleigh Offers.','house','Burleigh Waters',-28.09046150,153.42927232,4220,'Qld','70 Wedgebill Parade','Burleigh Waters',3,4,3,'Kingfisher Realty - Burleigh Heads','Deck, Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 2, Intercom, Living Areas: 2, Toilets: 1'),(1465,'Live Steps from Cafés, Shops & the Sand',660,'This beautifully positioned three-bedroom townhouse offering relaxed coastal living just steps from what makes Trinity Beach such a desirable place to live. Set in a small, private complex with a swimming pool, this home is perfect for families or professionals seeking comfort, convenience and an easy lifestyle in one of the Cairns Northern Beaches\' most sought-after suburbs.<br/><br/>Inside, you\'ll find three generous bedrooms, a well-appointed bathroom and the added convenience of a second toilet downstairs, ideal for household flow and busy mornings. The functional layout provides comfortable living and entertaining spaces that complement everyday needs.<br/><br/>Location is exceptional — this home is within easy walking distance to local shops, cafés and quality dining options along Trinity Beach Road and the Esplanade, where you can enjoy a beach-side café coffee or dinner with ocean views just minutes from your front door. There are also nearby primary and secondary schooling options, with public transit access across the Northern Beaches making commuting a breeze. Trinity Beach itself is just a short stroll away, offering safe swimming, scenic walks and sun-drenched afternoons by the water. <br/><br/>This is your chance to live the ultimate Trinity Beach lifestyle.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>- Three bedrooms<br/>- One bathroom plus separate downstairs toilet<br/>- Shared swimming pool in complex<br/>- Spacious, functional living areas<br/>- Walking distance to shops, cafés & restaurants<br/>- Close proximity to Trinity Beach and Esplanade<br/>- Easy access to local schools and public transport','unit','Kewarra Beach',-16.78694224,145.69769953,4879,'Qld','5/17 Trinity Beach Road','Kewarra Beach',1,3,1,'Cairns Beaches Realty - Kewarra Beach','Carport: 1, Courtyard, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Toilets: 2'),(1466,'Stylish Townhouse with Courtyard and Pool in Complex!',820,'Stylishly renovated throughout, privately positioned, and featuring a great 2 level layout this large townhouse includes 3 bedrooms, 2 new bathrooms, a stunning new kitchen and open-plan main living area, 2 car spaces and a fully-fenced courtyard and outdoor entertaining area. <br/><br/>Situated in a spacious and well-maintained complex with pool, and within walking distance of the Lakeshore Shopping Centre, public transport, and the numerous parklands that surround the area. Easy and convenient access to motorway and less than a 10-15 minute drive to Sunshine Plaza, Maroochydore CBD, and a choice of pristine Sunshine Coast beaches.<br/><br/> - Large and fully renovated 3 bedroom townhouse with huge courtyard<br/><br/> - Spacious, open-plan kitchen, living and dining area with new timber look flooring throughout<br/><br/> - Stunning new kitchen features stone benchtops and quality appliances including dishwasher<br/><br/> - Air-conditioned main bedroom with private balcony, walk-in robe and sleek new ensuite<br/><br/> - All bedrooms with ceiling fans, 2 additional bedrooms with built-in robes<br/><br/> - Stylish new main bathroom with walk-in shower, separate toilet<br/><br/> - Internal laundry and powder room/3rd toilet on lower level<br/><br/> - Freshly painted, new carpets throughout<br/><br/> - Ceiling fans and plenty of storage cupboards throughout<br/><br/> - Covered outdoor entertaining area with large fully fenced courtyard<br/><br/> - Single garage with internal access and additional car space in front of garage<br/><br/> - Spacious, well-maintained complex with pool and spa<br/><br/> - Great Buderim location within walking distance of parks, shops and public transport<br/><br/> - Water usage included in rent (no charge to tenants)<br/><br/>To inspect or attend an advertised inspection time please enquire online (and say that you will be attending) or call (07) 5444 6106 to register your attendance. Unless there are names registered for an inspection we will not attend the property.<br/><br/>Property Code: 205<br/>','townhouse','Buderim',-26.66544478,153.06430492,4556,'Qld','3/11-21 Lakeshore Avenue','Buderim',2,3,2,'Marquee Property','Balcony, Courtyard, Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Outside Spa, Swimming Pool - Inground, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1'),(1467,'Beautiful 4-Bedroom Country Home - Ocean & Rural Views',750,'Enjoy the best of both worlds with this stunning 4-bedroom plus study country home offering breathtaking ocean and rural views. Perfectly designed for space, comfort, and flexibility, this property provides a peaceful lifestyle retreat without compromising on modern convenience.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>• Ocean views to the east, combined with picturesque countryside surrounds<br/>• Expansive open plan living and dining area filled with natural light<br/>• Spacious master bedroom positioned on the main level, complete with ensuite and private deck<br/>• Dedicated study/home office area on the upper level<br/>• Step down to a generous second living area, ideal for families or guest separation<br/>• Three additional well-sized bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes<br/>• Central bathroom servicing the lower level<br/>• Large garage plus separate storage room<br/>• Reverse cycle ducted heating and cooling for year-round comfort<br/>• Fenced yard <br/><br/>Thoughtfully designed with multiple living zones, this home is perfect for families, multi-generational living, or those working from home. The elevated position captures stunning outlooks from multiple vantage points, creating a peaceful and private sanctuary.<br/><br/>If you\'re looking for space, views, and versatility in a beautiful country setting - this home is a must to inspect.','house','Millingandi',-36.89887596,149.84084755,2549,'NSW','151 Woodlands Lane','Millingandi',2,4,1,'Sails Real Estate - Merimbula','Garage: 1, Ensuite: 1'),(1468,'Stylishly Renovated Apartment in Prestigious Prahran Location - FULLY FURNISHED',575,'Discover a renovated, fully furnished apartment on one of Prahran\'s most prestigious tree-lined boulevards. Combining modern updates with classic charm, this residence offers spacious, light-filled living enhanced by freshly painted interiors, modern wallpaper, sheer curtains, and elegant floorboards. The living area opens seamlessly to a private west-facing balcony, perfect for soaking in the sunset.<br/><br/>The immaculate new kitchen showcases high-quality appliances, sleek tapware, a designer splashback, updated benchtops, and cabinetry, complete with an integrated washer/dryer machine for added convenience. A generous double bedroom features built-in robes and a captivating city outlook, while the refurbished tiled bathroom exudes luxury with a bathtub and refined gold fixtures. Comfort is assured year-round with split-system heating and cooling (small wall heater not operational). The property also includes parking on title and a security entrance.<br/><br/>Positioned in one of Prahran\'s most sought-after streets, this home offers immediate access to High Street and Hawksburn Village, Orrong Park, Malvern Road trams, and the vibrant Chapel Street precinct. With boutique shopping, world-class dining, and nightlife at your doorstep, alongside effortless CBD access, this apartment delivers the ultimate in convenience and sophistication.<br/><br/>An exceptional opportunity for modern living in a premier location.<br/><br/>**PLEASE NOTE THIS PROPERTY IS FULLY FURNISHED**','apartment','Prahran',-37.84991507,145.00800875,3181,'Vic','30/43 Grandview Grove','Prahran',1,1,1,'Belle Property - South Yarra','Open Spaces: 1, Furnished'),(1469,'BRIGHT AND SPACIOUS APARTMENT IN SUPERB LOCATION',580,'PLEASE NOTE: Open for Inspection Times and Property Availability are subject to change or cancellation. If you wish to be notified of any cancellations or changes please register your details for an inspection<br/><br/>Offering generous dimensions and flooded with natural light, this elevated apartment is perfectly positioned in one of Prahran\'s most sought after locations waiting for the ideal tenant.<br/><br/>In a quiet boutique block, the property is immaculately maintained featuring an entry hall, spacious sun drenched living and dining room, modern kitchen featuring meals area and concealed dishwasher, generous master bedroom with built in robes, second double bedroom with built in robes and views, and central bathroom with separate W/C.<br/><br/>Further features include ducted heating/cooling, undercover car space, laundry facilities and security entry.<br/><br/>The location is unbeatable for an inner-city lifestyle only moments from High Street shops and restaurants, Prahran Market, Victoria Gardens, Chapel Street and all forms of public transport.<br/><br/>This is a perfect home, not to be missed!','apartment','Prahran',-37.85444728,145.00592780,3181,'Vic','6/123 Chomley Street','Prahran',1,2,1,'Belle Property - St Kilda','Carport: 1, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating'),(1470,'Modern Comfort, Prime Underwood Location',700,'Positioned in a highly convenient pocket of Underwood, this well appointed home at 18 Springwood Road offers comfort, space, and exceptional accessibility. Designed for easy living, the property combines modern upgrades with practical layout and generous indoor and outdoor areas.<br/><br/>Inside, you will immediately notice the brand new polished timber flooring, adding warmth and style throughout the upper level. The home is fully equipped with air conditioning in every room, including the lounge and all bedrooms, ensuring year round comfort. Ceiling fans are also installed throughout, providing additional ventilation and efficiency.<br/><br/>The spacious layout offers a functional kitchen with ample cupboard space, flowing seamlessly into the dining and lounge areas. Natural light fills the home, creating a welcoming and relaxed atmosphere ideal for families or professionals seeking both comfort and convenience.<br/><br/>Downstairs features a secure garage along with a separate storage room, providing excellent additional space for tools, equipment, or hobby use. The large backyard offers plenty of room for outdoor enjoyment, entertaining, or simply relaxing in your own private space.<br/><br/>Location is a major highlight of this property. With easy access to the M1 and Gold Coast Highway, commuting to Brisbane CBD or the Gold Coast is seamless. Major shopping centres, local schools, parks, and public transport options are all within close reach, making day to day living simple and efficient.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• Air conditioning in all rooms including lounge and bedrooms<br/>• Ceiling fans throughout<br/>• Brand new polished timber flooring<br/>• Functional kitchen with ample storage<br/>• Spacious lounge and dining areas<br/>• Large backyard<br/>• Downstairs garage<br/>• Additional storage room downstairs<br/>• Excellent road access<br/>• Direct access to M1 and Gold Coast Highway<br/>• Convenient commute to Brisbane City and Gold Coast<br/><br/>If you are looking for a comfortable, upgraded home in a location that connects you effortlessly to everything South East Queensland has to offer, this property is well worth your inspection.','house','Underwood',-27.61061393,153.11952224,4119,'Qld','18 Springwood Road','Underwood',1,3,4,'Focal Real Estate - Underwood','Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 3'),(1471,'Spacious, Stylish & Superbly Located Ground-Floor Apartment - FURNISHED',850,'Privately positioned at the rear of a neat boutique block, this unexpectedly large ground-floor apartment offers low-maintenance living in quiet, leafy surrounds.<br/>Recently renovated throughout, the home features plush charcoal carpet, crisp white walls and a welcoming entry hall with built-in cabinetry-setting the tone for the space and sophistication within.<br/>A bright and generous living/dining area with matte flooring flows seamlessly to a substantial decked courtyard, perfect for year-round outdoor entertaining. The contemporary country-style kitchen impresses with quality Smeg and Omega appliances, abundant storage and a casual meals area.<br/>Both the main and second bedrooms are double-sized, fitted with built-in wardrobes and framed by leafy outlooks. The stylish central bathroom includes a bath, separate shower and convenient laundry facilities.<br/>Additional features include: Split-system heating & cooling in the living/dining room and main bedroom, secure intercom entry, carport parking space, quiet boutique block, large private courtyard. Also an option to be unfurnished.<br/>All of this is just a short, picturesque walk to Caulfield Park, Alma Village, public transport and a great selection of local shops.<br/>A superb lifestyle opportunity-be quick to inspect!<br/>','apartment','Caulfield North',-37.86726000,145.01747700,3161,'Vic','3/5 Beresford Street','Caulfield North',1,2,1,'Belle Property - Albert Park','Courtyard, Deck, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Dishwasher, Floorboards, Furnished'),(1472,'A Perfect Parkside Gem',620,'In a perfect park side position just across from Kleinert Reserve in the Knox Central Primary School zone, this pristine 3 bedroom residence offers a beautiful renovated interior with stunning timber floors, generous lounge featuring a gas fireplace, casual meals and spotless kitchen featuring quality appliances (incl. a dishwasher), 3 bedrooms with BIRs, modern bathroom, separate toilet, and laundry with external access. Outdoor options include a well-sized undercover decking area perfect for entertaining and an expansive garden at the rear; while air conditioning, ceiling fans (incl. in bedrooms), and ample driveway parking are other features.<br/><br/>Only moments to Fairhills High School, Studfield, Knox District Centre, and Knox City shops, Boronia and Bayswater train stations, Chandella Reserve, and Knox Community Gardens.<br/><br/>Please note: The initial rental agreement for this property will be a 15 month term as this is our Office\'s new standard lease term for all new agreements unless otherwise negotiated.<br/><br