age<br/>- Large remote double lock-up garage with storage and internal access<br/>- Stunning oversized inground pool featuring a pool pavilion and slide<br/>- Expansive covered patio areas wrapping around kitchen and living zones overlooking the pool<br/>- Fully fenced yard with front gate and intercom access for privacy and security<br/>- Concreted playing court perfect for basketball, scooters or outdoor activities<br/>- Children’s playground area creating the ultimate family backyard<br/>- Charming cabana/gazebo retreat<br/>- Dedicated fire pit entertaining area<br/>- Peaceful location close to schools, shops, parks, transport and M1 access<br/> <br/>Apply For This Property Online: https://TheOnsiteManager.com/apply/21170627<br/>(Listing ID: 21170627 )<br/><br/><br/>','house','Nerang',-27.99935342,153.30992161,4211,'Qld','60 Koola Drive','Nerang',4,5,2,'THEONSITEMANAGER - Queensland','Garage: 2, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Intercom, Pets Allowed'),(1480,'Bright, Spacious and Perfectly Positioned for Easy Living',470,'This well designed modern double storey townhouse shows how easy and practical modern living can be. Positioned in a highly convenient pocket, the home offers a low maintenance lifestyle with generous space, natural light, and a layout that works well for everyday life.<br/><br/>Downstairs features a proper entry that leads to two generous bedrooms, both fitted with built in robes and split system air conditioning. These rooms work well for family members, guests, or a home office setup. The central bathroom on this level includes a separate bath and shower, along with a toilet, making it ideal for shared living. A separate utility room adds extra convenience for day to day household needs. Secure internal access leads through to a large double garage that comfortably fits two vehicles.<br/><br/>Upstairs opens into a spacious living and dining area filled with natural light and supported by a split system air conditioner for year round comfort. The kitchen is well positioned within the space and offers ample bench space and storage, making it practical for everyday cooking and entertaining. The living area flows out to a welcoming balcony that overlooks the garden, creating a relaxed space to unwind or enjoy fresh air. This level also includes a large linen storage area for added practicality. The master bedroom is well sized and features a walk in robe and a private ensuite.<br/><br/>The home is designed to capture good sunlight throughout the day and benefits from excellent cross ventilation. It is easy to maintain and well suited to modern living.<br/><br/>The location is ideal for families and tenants alike. A bus stop is right outside, with Harpley Town Centre across the road. Wyndham Vale Station and Werribee Station are a short drive away. A primary school is nearby, and secondary and high schools are within walking distance. The area is great for walking circuits, and Harpley Lake, currently under development, will soon offer more outdoor options. Upcoming freeway connections make access to Melbourne and Geelong easy, placing the home centrally between both cities.','townhouse','Werribee',-37.91381552,144.61231209,3030,'Vic','45 Kagan Walk','Werribee',2,3,2,'Mantello Real Estate - Werribee','Garage: 2'),(1481,'Spacious 2-Bed Home with Triple Garage!',430,'Discover comfortable coastal living at 9 Satellite Crescent, Venus Bay VIC 3956 — a neatly presented 2-bedroom, 1-bath house available for lease at $430 per week. This home offers a practical layout with one generous living area, providing an easy flow for everyday living and entertaining. Natural light and coastal breezes make this a welcoming seaside retreat for couples, small families, or professionals relocating to the region. The property’s standout features are its exceptional vehicle and storage capacity: a three-car garage plus up to six open parking spaces, ideal for households with multiple vehicles, boats, trailers or for trade and hobby use. With a single bathroom and separate toilet facilities, the home is organized for convenience and low-maintenance living. The compact, efficient floorplan maximizes usable space and presents a blank canvas to add your own touches.<br/><br/>Located in the serene Venus Bay community, this residence provides easy access to sandy beaches, local shops and cafes, and the relaxed coastal lifestyle the area is known for. While enjoying quiet residential streets, you’re still within reach of essential amenities and regional transport links, making commutes and weekend getaways straightforward. For investors or long-term tenants, this property delivers strong rental appeal thanks to its desirable coastal location and impressive parking/storage capacity — features much sought after in seaside markets. Whether you’re seeking a comfortable home or a high-demand rental asset, the property presents solid potential for long-term occupancy. To inspect this property we do require an application which can be submitted via realestate.com.au — this practical Venus Bay home won’t stay available for long.','house','Venus Bay',-38.70319868,145.82941616,3956,'Vic','9 Satellite Crescent','Venus Bay',1,2,9,'Alex Scott & Staff - Venus Bay','Deck, Fully Fenced, Garage: 3, Open Spaces: 6, Secure Parking, Shed, Study, Furnished'),(1482,'The Brief: Stylishly Refreshed Two-Bedroom Home',540,'Its Addressed:<br/><br/>This beautifully updated two-bedroom home offers light-filled interiors, modern finishes and a low-maintenance lifestyle in an exceptionally convenient location. Thoughtfully redesigned to suit today’s living, the property combines comfort, practicality and style.<br/><br/>A generous concrete forecourt at the front provides ample off-street parking and easy access. Inside, the spacious living area flows seamlessly into the meals zone and opens out to a newly created outdoor entertaining space and refreshed garden — perfect for relaxing weekends or hosting family and friends.<br/><br/>Crisp white finishes and contemporary décor enhance the sense of space and natural light throughout the home. The updated kitchen features twin sinks, a striking splashback and refreshed cabinetry, offering both functionality and visual appeal for everyday cooking.<br/><br/>Ideally positioned within walking distance to Noble Park Shopping Village, Noble Park Train Station, Noble Park Primary School, Noble Park Secondary College and the Aquatic Centre, the home also provides easy access to the Monash Freeway and EastLink for convenient commuting.<br/><br/>For more Real Estate in Noble Park contact your Area Specialist.<br/><br/>Note: Every care has been taken to verify the accuracy of the details in this advertisement, however, we cannot guarantee its correctness. Prospective tenants are requested to take such action as is necessary, to satisfy themselves with any pertinent matters.','unit','Noble Park',-37.97242331,145.17533129,3174,'Vic','3/49 Leonard Avenue','Noble Park',1,2,1,'Area Specialist - Victoria','Garage: 1'),(1483,'Family home with pool!',1000,'Situated on an elevated 1,477m² block in a highly desirable location, this home offers the ultimate family lifestyle.<br/><br/>Step inside to discover an inviting interior adorned with elegant architecture and thoughtful design. The open-plan layout seamlessly connects the living areas, allowing for easy entertaining and family gatherings. Large French windows fill the home with natural light, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere.<br/><br/>The heart of the home is the beautifully designed kitchen, equipped with modern appliances and ample storage. Enjoy meals in the adjoining dining area or step out onto the expansive deck for alfresco dining, surrounded by lush greenery.<br/><br/>Property highlights:<br/>• Four spacious bedrooms with built-in robes, a/c and ceiling fans.<br/>• Modern kitchen with ample storage, walk-in pantry and stainless steel dishwasher.<br/>• Dedicated meals area plus a sepa