 private ensuite and walk-in robe. The thoughtfully separated second bedroom is serviced by its own bathroom, enhancing privacy and making it ideal for professionals, small families or investors seeking strong rental appeal.<br/><br/>* PROPERTY IS UNFURNISHED<br/><br/>Key Property Features include:<br/>* Brand new plush carpet and fresh paint throughout<br/>* Light-filled open-plan living and dining<br/>* Updated kitchen with new bench-tops and oven<br/>* Two well separated spacious bedrooms<br/>* Master bedroom with an ensuite<br/>* Additional bathroom for convenience<br/>* Generously sized balcony<br/>* Elevated position with pleasant suburban views<br/>* Secure single car space<br/>* Well maintained Gym onsite <br/><br/>Perfectly positioned within the catchment for Indooroopilly State High School, and close to transport options, Indooroopilly Shopping Centre, local cafes and the University of Queensland, this apartment combines lifestyle, convenience and value in a highly sought-after suburb.<br/><br/>Please register online today for an inspection.','unit','Indooroopilly',-27.50152867,152.97448675,4068,'Qld','27/27 Station Road','Indooroopilly',2,2,1,'Dixon Estate Agents - TOOWONG','Garage: 1'),(1600,'MODERN TERRACE IN PRIME LOCATION',1250,'Please note, rent is paid monthly - $5,432 per calendar month ($1250 per week).<br/><br/><br/>This historic residence that has been meticulously renovated, offers family living in a prime location close to Rathdowne and Nicholson Street Villages, schools and public transport. <br/><br/>Entry is to a wide hallway with dark wooden floors, which opens into a large dining and lounge space. The dining room has an ornamental open fireplace, and both rooms have ornate Victorian plaster detail. In the centre of the house is a fully renovated kitchen with loads of storage space, walk in pantry and a large stainless steel gas cooker. <br/><br/>Opening from the kitchen is an informal living/ home office area, with north facing windows and access to a sunny outdoor entertainment area with lawn. To the rear is a functional bathroom with shower over bath, storage and a separate laundry. <br/><br/>Upstairs comprises a huge master bedroom with dressing area and floor to ceiling robes, a stunning ensuite bathroom with double shower, mirror storage, vanity and WC. <br/><br/>There are two further bedrooms with robes and loads of light. <br/><br/>Plasma televisions connected with Fetch TV in the lounge room and main bedroom (Foxtel can be added via existing outlet), and the latest Sonos music system throughout the house (all controlled by your smart phone). Other features include modern touch-screen alarm system with panic button (2 controllers), hydronic heating throughout, a large AC unit to the second level, ornamental fire places, loads of storage and quality fittings.','house','Carlton North',-37.78545200,144.97622000,3054,'Vic','472 Station Street','Carlton North',3,3,1,'Nelson Alexander - Carlton North','Carport: 1'),(1601,'Spacious Family home',620,'*** Please note the rent will increase to $640.00 per week as of the 21/07/2026 ***<br/><br/>Welcome to 38 Cairns Road, Camira - your ideal family home! This charming 3-bedroom house offers a perfect blend of comfort and functionality, set on a generous 1116 sqm block.<br/><br/>The spacious interior features a well-designed floor plan, including a cozy dining room perfect for family meals. The inviting living spaces are complemented by tasteful home decor, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere.<br/><br/>Enjoy the convenience of a single bathroom and an additional toilet, ensuring ample facilities for your family. With three carport spaces, parking is never a hassle.<br/><br/>Step outside to discover a beautiful backyard, complete with lush grass and vibrant vegetation. The outdoor patio is perfect for entertaining or simply relaxing in nature, while the porch adds an extra touch of charm to this lovely home.<br/><br/>Located in a peaceful neighborhood