 take you to our online application form through Ignite / Realestate.com. We have paper applications available in the office, however, online applications are preferred.<br/><br/>OPEN HOMES-<br/>Interested applicants must view the property before approval. Please follow the link below, \"Register for Inspection,\" to book an upcoming open home.<br/><br/>Please contact Brooke Gibson at our office on 4934 4111, if you require any further information about this property.<br/><br/>Read Less','house','East Maitland',-32.75500068,151.57974094,2323,'NSW','63 Flinders Street','East Maitland',1,3,2,'River Realty - Thornton',NULL),(1681,'Step Outside and Stroll to Everything',300,'Compact, convenient living just minutes from the centre of St Helens - this semi furnished unit offering the ease of being able to walk to shops and local amenities.<br/><br/>Inside, there\'s a open plan living area and a practical kitchen with an upright electric stove and good cupboard storage. Step out the back to a covered spot that\'s perfect for a quiet cuppa and a bit of fresh air.<br/><br/>You\'ll find two bedrooms, a neat bathroom with shower recess and vanity, plus a laundry area with trough.<br/><br/>Please note: due to the property\'s location, pets are not permitted.<br/><br/>Available from 12 April 2026<br/>Rent: $300 per week<br/>2 bedrooms','unit','St Helens',-41.33078134,148.24691060,7216,'Tas','14/2 Tasman Highway','St Helens',1,2,2,'Harcourts - St Helens',NULL),(1682,'TOP FLOOR TWO BEDROOMS UNIT',490,'AVAILABLE NOW. This well-presented top floor two bedroom unit offers comfortable and convenient living in a quiet, well maintained block with long term tenancies.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- Generous, tiled living area<br/>- Spacious eat in kitchen<br/>- Internal laundry<br/>- Carpeted bedrooms<br/>- Balcony off the main bedroom<br/><br/>Ideally located just an 11 minute walk to Lakemba Station, local shops, and schools, this property is perfect for those seeking both comfort and convenience.<br/><br/><br/>','unit','Lakemba',-33.92653969,151.07756991,2195,'NSW','4/19 Willeroo Street','Lakemba',1,2,1,'Knapton & Co Pty Limited - Lakemba','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 1'),(1683,'Low Maintenance Living',470,'Modern elegance meets everyday convenience in a beautifully designed unit. This inviting property features a unique character that enhances its appeal. The heart of the home lies in the open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area, creating a harmonious space for relaxation and entertainment. This residence features two comfortable bedrooms and a well-appointed bathroom, thoughtfully designed to maximise comfort and functionality, with a communal laundry adds to the practicality of everyday living. Culinary enthusiasts will appreciate the sleek under-bench oven, allowing for seamless meal preparation that flows effortlessly into the dining and living areas. With split system heating and cooling, comfort is guaranteed year-round. The master bedroom is a true haven, complete with built-in robes that provide ample storage space while maintaining a clean and modern aesthetic. The second bedroom also offers built-in robes, ensuring a tidy & organised environment. This home has been recently renovated, showcasing stylish floorboards that add warmth and sophistication throughout. A car space provides convenience for your vehicle. Embrace the tranquillity of the Reservoir neighbourhood while enjoying easy access to amenities. Just moments away, you\'ll find Reservoir Primary School and Reservoir High School. Ruthven Train Station is on the doorstep with Reservoir Train Station down the road, making commuting effortless. Northland Shopping Centre is nearby, fulfilling all your shopping, leisure, and recreational needs with ease.','unit','Reservoir',-37.70935000,145.00978200,3073,'Vic','2/29 Macartney St','Reservoir',1,2,1,'D R Property Management - Richmond','Carport: 1'),(1684,'Beachside Living with Modern Comfort & Prime Location',440,'Perfectly positioned to embrace Frankston\'s vibrant coastal lifestyle, this beautifully renovated ground-floor apartment offers the perfect blend of sleek modern finishes and convenience. With direct access to the Kananook Creek Walking Trail leading to the stunning Frankston foreshore, and just a short stroll to the CBD, beaches, and renowned local dining, this home is ideal for those who value style, comfort, and location. Adding to its appeal, the property is located within the Frankston High School Zone, making it an excellent choice for families as well as professionals<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/> • Fully renovated ground-floor apartment with modern fit-out<br/> • Open-plan living and dining flowing to a private decked courtyard<br/> • Stylish new kitchen with induction cooktop, under-bench oven, dishwasher, and excellent storage<br/> • Split-system heating and cooling for year-round comfort<br/> • Ceiling fans and electric panel heaters to both bedrooms<br/> • Two spacious bedrooms with built-in robes<br/> • Ultra-modern combined bathroom/laundry with timber vanity, shower-over-bath, toilet, and washing machine included<br/> • Carport for secure off-street parking<br/> • Complex pool for residents to enjoy<br/> • Walking distance to Frankston Beach, Olivers Beach, Frankston Pier, Olivers Hill Boat Ramp, Frankston Regional Foreshore & Playground, and Frankston Yacht Club<br/> • Close to popular eateries including Waves on the Beach, Sofias Frankston, Frankston Waterfront Restaurant, and One Pear Tree Café<br/><br/>Offering low-maintenance living in a sought-after beachside location, this home is available to enjoy the very best of Frankston\'s coastal lifestyle.<br/><br/>***It is a requirement of entry to all Ray White Frankston Rental Inspections that a valid photo ID is presented to the Leasing Agent. Information not limited to name and ID number may be recorded in accordance with our Privacy Policy.***<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst every c