ut in a separate family area, a place for parents in a flexible formal lounge...and a bonus kids’ retreat or study to make life complete. Vastly versatile with a quiet master suite (with a walk-in robe and designer ensuite) topping the quiet bedroom wing, this family-wise design has a robe-fitted bedroom for each of the kids. <br/>Coolly contemporary with a quality curation of sleek stone benchtops (waterfall-edge for the massive 6-seat island bench), Oak wide board floors, and bonus storage including a walk-in linen press and walk-in pantry, this centrally heated and cooled home offers more outdoors too...including an oversize double auto-garage. With a creative landscape adding to the architectural appeal out front, the property has an all-weather al fresco area overlooking a kids’ paradise backyard complete with shed. <br/>A few lazy blocks to Sandringham Secondary College, and a happy skip to Grange Rd Kindergarten, also within the zone for Sandringham Primary School just beyond the Acorn Patch parklands, the village, beach and station within an easy walk and local shops and supermarket close by. <br/>Inspections will impress!','house','Sandringham',-37.94709900,145.01932700,3191,'Vic','38 Kenneth Street','Sandringham',2,4,2,'Buxton - Sandringham','Deck, Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Shed, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Floorboards, Gas Heating, Study'),(1690,'Fully-Furnished Studio Apartment in Heart of Lower North Shore',520,'Offering an immensely convenient and effortless lifestyle presenting a renovated, sunlit interior with ample privacy and a leafy green outlook. This stunning home is perfect for the busy executive or those looking for their own space. Fully furnished with everything you need and situated in an excellent location completing the package, with city buses just footsteps away, RNS Hospital and major transport hubs within short walking distance. <br/><br/>- Generous combined living and dining space flooded with natural light<br/>- Sleek updated kitchen with electric stove and ample storage space<br/>- Large private balcony with water glimpses; Timber flooring throughout<br/>- Undercover car space, shared laundry room, lift access and intercom<br/>- Choice of nearby Chatswood, Artarmon and St Leonards train stations<br/>- Moments to RNS Hospital, North Sydney TAFE, major Sydney CBDs','studio','Greenwich',-33.81788788,151.18160097,2065,'NSW','104/284 Pacific Highway','Greenwich',1,3,1,'Belle Property - Lane Cove','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Broadband Internet Available, Dishwasher, Floorboards, Intercom, Living Areas: 1, Furnished, Pets Allowed'),(1691,'3 BEDROOM FAMILY HOME WITH STUDY',580,'This bright low maintenance home features:<br/> <br/> - Master bedroom complete with ensuite and walk in robe<br/> - Remaining two bedrooms with built in robes<br/> - Spacious kitchen with island bench, stainless steel appliances including dishwasher and stone benches<br/> - Open plan tiled living and dining area with split system A/C<br/> - Study with built in robe<br/> - Main bathroom with bath and toilet<br/> - Separate laundry with built in cupboard<br/> - Ducted heating<br/> - Remote garage with internal and rear access<br/> - Low maintenance garden<br/><br/> <br/> Enjoy the central location and easy access to Princes Highway, M1, Officer Train Station, local primary and secondary schools, shops and parks.<br/><br/>To arrange an inspection please call Anne on [REDACTED PHONE].<br/><br/>Please note: Photo ID is required for all inspections.<br/><br/>*Inspections are subject to change without notification. Please contact the agent or check open home times on websites prior to attending the open home.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this advertisement, VHLS Property Management wil