 renowned for its lush landscaped grounds and peaceful garden paths. Residents enjoy full access to a heated indoor pool, spa, and a high-end gymnasium housed within the heritage clubhouse. Cancel your gym membership; it is all conveniently right here for you within a secure, well-maintained community.<br/><br/>Experience the effortless \"lock-up-and-leave\" lifestyle with world-class on-site amenities. You are steps away from the vibrant St Ives village for your morning coffee or evening dining, and perfectly positioned for elite schooling, including Masada College, Brigidine, and St Ives High, plus a stroll to multiple bus services. <br/><br/>Features you will love:<br/>• Massive 249sqm Floorplan: An expansive layout rarely seen for lease, offering a sense of scale and privacy that rivals a standalone home with the benefits of effortless resort-style apartment living. <br/>• Open plan living dining area elevated by high shadowline ceilings and floor-to-ceiling sliding doors that frame the serene green outlook.<br/>• The Entertainer\'s Dream: A massive North-East facing terrace perfect for year-round alfresco dining or twilight cocktails against a serene green backdrop.<br/>• Gourmet Chef\'s Kitchen: Outfitted with premium Miele gas appliances, sleek Caesarstone benchtops, and designer polyurethane soft-close cabinetry.<br/>• Executive Master Suite: Features direct balcony access, air conditioning, and a stunning ensuite boasting a deep freestanding bathtub for total relaxation.<br/>• Internal laundry, includes dryer <br/>• Secure intercom entry, with lift access<br/>• Undercover secure single car space<br/><br/>Resort-Style Amenities:<br/>• Lush landscaped grounds, peaceful garden paths<br/>• Full access to an indoor heated pool, spa, and a high-end gymnasium and relaxation zones in the heritage clubhouse; cancel your gym membership; it\'s all conveniently right here for you.<br/>• Secure, well-maintained complex with a strong community feel<br/><br/>Location Bene