INSERT INTO `data` VALUES (1789,'Near New Beachside Apartment in Broadbeach',1250,'Experience refined coastal living in this near new apartment within the boutique Marella by Mosaic residence in Broadbeach. Positioned directly opposite Nikiforides Family Park and only moments from the beach, this thoughtfully designed home captures ocean breezes, natural light, and elevated views. Generous interiors and full-height glazing create a seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a private balcony, offering a sophisticated yet relaxed beachside lifestyle.<br/><br/>Ready to move in, the apartment comes with a fridge, washing machine, and dryer included.<br/><br/>Property features<br/>* Two spacious bedrooms and two contemporary bathrooms<br/>* Master bedroom with walk-in robe and elegant ensuite<br/>* Second bedroom with built-in robe and ceiling fan<br/>* Designer kitchen with stone benchtops, premium Bosch appliances, and fridge included<br/>* Open plan living and dining flowing to private balcony with ocean and city outlook<br/>* Double glazed floor-to-ceiling windows and doors<br/>* Ducted and zoned air conditioning throughout<br/>* Separate internal laundry with storage, washing machine and dryer included<br/>* One secure basement car space<br/>* Video intercom security system<br/><br/>Residents enjoy exclusive access to resort-style facilities including a pool, spa, gymnasium, sauna, steam room, BBQ area, private dining and lounge spaces, wine room, surfboard storage and bicycle racks.<br/><br/>Location<br/>* Short walk to the patrolled beaches of Broadbeach<br/>* Close to cafés, restaurants and retail within the Broadbeach precinct<br/>* Minutes to Pacific Fair Shopping Centre<br/>* Easy access to the G:link light rail network<br/>* Nearby Gold Coast Convention and Exhibition Centre<br/>* Close to dining and entertainment at The Star Gold Coast<br/><br/>Schools in catchment<br/>* Broadbeach State School<br/>* Merrimac State High School<br/><br/>Please note, the furniture shown in the photos is for illustration purposes only. The apartment comes with a fridge, washing machine, and dryer included.<br/><br/>This is an exceptional opportunity to secure a premium beachside residence in one of the Gold Coast most desirable lifestyle locations. Contact Grace at [REDACTED PHONE] to arrange a viewing. <br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>All information provided in this advertisement is deemed reliable but not guaranteed. The availability, rental terms, and pricing of the property are subject to change without notice. Prospective tenants are encouraged to verify all details and conduct their own due diligence. The landlord or property manager is not responsible for any discrepancies or errors in the information presented.','apartment','Broadbeach',-28.02263399,153.43034884,4218,'Qld','504/146 Surf Parade','Broadbeach',2,2,1,'Square Real Estate - BRISBANE CITY','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ensuite: 1, Floorboards, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 2'),(1790,'Ground Floor Gem',700,'** PLEASE CLICK ON \"REQUEST A TIME\" OR \"ORGANISE AN INSPECTION\" TO REGISTER FOR AN INSPECTION**<br/><br/>Positioned on the ground floor of a brand-new boutique complex, this pristine and stylish apartment delivers refined contemporary living in an exceptionally convenient location.<br/>A welcoming entrance hall introduces a thoughtfully designed interior where open-plan living unfolds seamlessly to a private courtyard, creating a perfect balance of indoor comfort and outdoor enjoyment. The sleek kitchen is beautifully appointed with gas cooktop, electric oven, dishwasher and generous bench and storage space, all complemented by split-system heating and cooling for year-round comfort. The main bedroom features a walk-in robe and elegant ensuite, while the second bedroom is fitted with built-in robes and serviced by a sparkling central bathroom. A cleverly integrated European laundry, secure video intercom entry and car stacker parking further enhance the home’s functionality.<br/>Set within a quiet, intimate complex just moments from Carnegie Station, vibrant cafés and local shopping, this residence offers a lifestyle of ease and connectivity.<br/><br/>APPLYING FOR THIS PROPERTY<br/><br/>We have a strict ‘inspect before apply’ policy at Woodards. You or someone on your behalf must inspect the property before you submit an application. When applying for a property, the applicant accepts the condition of the home as to when they viewed the property.<br/><br/>We donate a portion of our fee from every property transaction to the Woodards Foundation to support people experiencing homelessness, family violence and social isolation.','apartment','Carnegie',-37.88661868,145.05477732,3163,'Vic','2/2A Truganini Road','Carnegie',1,2,1,'Woodards - Carnegie','Courtyard, Garage: 1, Built-in Wardrobes, Intercom, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating'),(1791,'Timeless elegance in a prime locale',670,'Beyond its timelessly elegant façade and full-length verandah, this captivating home in a premier street is full of character and appeal. Chocolate timber floors and soft neutral tones create a welcoming ambience in the open-plan living and dining room, overseen by a stylish kitchen appointed with an island breakfast bar, stainless-steel appliances, and terrific storage.<br/><br/>Three light-filled bedrooms are nestled together for ease, complemented by a modern bathroom featuring a bathtub, rain shower, and a towel cupboard. French doors open to reveal a private courtyard featuring a large covered alfresco zone with heating and a television—providing an idyllic setting for relaxing outdoors and enjoying the company of family and friends. Property features include ducted heating, split system air conditioning, solar electricity, a garden shed, a remote-control garage, and off-street parking.<br/><br/>Delivering unbeatable convenience, catch the bus from Mitcham Road, let the kids walk to Mitcham Primary School and Mullauna College, or enjoy some fresh air at Halliday Park. Enjoy swift access to Mitcham’s shopping precinct with a Coles supermarket, restaurants, cafes, and railway station; Mitcham Private Hospital and several child care centres; the Eastern Freeway/EastLink, Blackburn Lake Sanctuary, numerous parks and walking trails, and major shopping centres including Eastland Ringwood, Box Hill Central, and Westfield Doncaster.','house','Mitcham',-37.80584179,145.18839233,3132,'Vic','5 Compton Street','Mitcham',1,3,2,'Jellis Craig - Whitehorse','Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1'),(1792,'Spacious Double-Storey Family Home in Prestigious Gated Community',1300,'Available for rent in an exclusive, secure community, this impressive double-storey home offers generous living spaces, modern conveniences, and plenty of accommodation for a growing family.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>Living & Entertaining: Open-plan lounge and dining area, study area, plus additional foyer and sitting space downstairs.<br/><br/>Kitchen: Modern kitchen with island bench, walk-in pantry, oven, gas cooktop, and dishwasher.<br/><br/>Bedrooms: 5 large bedrooms – 3 upstairs and 2 downstairs. All with mirrored built-in robes; 2 upstairs with walk-in robes and private ensuites.<br/><br/>Bathrooms: 2 ensuites in master bedrooms, main bathroom upstairs with shower and bath, plus a guest bathroom downstairs.<br/><br/>Comfort & Efficiency: Ducted air-conditioning with multiple zones and solar panels.<br/><br/>Laundry: Internal laundry with space for storage.<br/><br/>Parking: Automatic double garage with internal access, plus extra driveway parking.<br/><br/>Technology: NBN ready, Smart Lock, and more!<br/><br/>Outdoor Living: Front and rear upstairs balconies, low-maintenance backyard with alfresco area, spa, and rainwater tank.<br/><br/>Location: Close to bus stops, Norwest Metro Station, Norwest Marketown, and the Norwest & Castle Hill business hubs.<br/><br/>This home is perfect for families seeking space, convenience, and a premium lifestyle.<br/><br/>Don’t miss out – this premium family home won’t stay on the market for long!<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Information contained in this listing is correct at the time of publication. Prospective tenants should make their own enquiries and inspections to verify all details. Images are for illustration purposes and may not represent the exact property.','house','Norwest',-33.72707991,150.97054472,2153,'NSW','79 Regalia Close','Norwest',4,5,2,'Vision Property Investment Group','Balcony, Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ensuite: 2, Floorboards, Rumpus Room, Study, Toilets: 2, Pets Allowed'),(1793,'Rare 4 bedroom home in Bargara',670,'This property features;<br/>• Four bedrooms, all with built-in robes<br/>• Two bathrooms including ensuite to the master<br/>• Two toilets for added convenience<br/>• Detached double garage plus hardstand area<br/>• Central kitchen connecting formal and informal living spaces<br/>• Fully fenced 685m2 block<br/>• Side access suitable for boat or caravan storage<br/>• Quiet cul-de-sac position a short walk to the ocean<br/>Freshly painted inside with modern fixtures.<br/>Sight unseen applications are accepted.<br/><br/><br/>\"Disclaimer: The information provided in this rental listing is deemed reliable but not guaranteed. All potential tenants are encouraged to verify the accuracy of the information provided and conduct their own due diligence before entering into any rental agreement. The landlord or property management company is not responsible for any inaccuracies or omissions in the listing. All terms and conditions of the rental agreement are subject to negotiation and approval by both parties. Thank you for considering this rental property.\"','house','Bargara',-24.84281214,152.47537851,4670,'Qld','7 Endeavour Court','Bargara',2,4,2,'Coronis Bundaberg','Garage: 2'),(1794,'Spacious Family Home in Sought-After Kalkie',710,'Situated in the popular suburb of Kalkie, this well-appointed family home offers comfort, space, and convenience. Just 15 minutes from Bargara Beach and only 4 minutes from St Luke\'s Anglican School, this home is perfectly positioned for families.<br/><br/>Featuring:<br/><br/>4 Bedrooms – Each with air conditioning and built-in robes<br/>Master Suite – Walk-in robe and private ensuite<br/>Main Bathroom – Includes a bath, separate shower, and separate toilet<br/>Multiple Living Spaces – Two separate living areas plus an outdoor entertaining area<br/>Well-Equipped Kitchen – Electric appliances, including a dishwasher<br/>Additional Features – Garden shed, fully fenced yard, and a double attached garage<br/><br/>This home offers everything you need for comfortable family living in a fantastic location!','house','Kalkie',-24.84733813,152.38080632,4670,'Qld','5 Cartwright Court','Kalkie',2,4,2,'McGrath - Bundaberg | Bargara | Wide Bay','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Living Areas: 2, Pets Allowed'),(1795,'Bushland Retreat for Rent',480,'Escape to your own peaceful sanctuary on beautiful Molloy Island. Nestled amongst native bushland, this charming two-bedroom home offers privacy, elevated treetop views, and a truly nature-immersed lifestyle. Wake to birdsong, enjoy sunset wildlife sightings from the verandah, and unwind under star-filled skies from your private balcony.<br/>Blending rustic warmth with modern comfort, the home features stunning timber wall panelling, exposed beams, and sun-filled living spaces, complemented by updated vinyl flooring and reverse-cycle air conditioning upstairs and downstairs. Ideal for those seeking quiet living surrounded by nature, this unique property is available on a 12-month lease with the option to extend.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom<br/>• Upstairs parent retreat with private balcony<br/>• Open-plan living with timber features<br/>• Kitchen with new electric stove & ample storage<br/>• Reverse-cycle air conditioning (upstairs & downstairs)<br/>• Dining/sunroom with beautiful morning light<br/>• Study nook or built-in workspace<br/>• Mezzanine loft (storage or occasional retreat space)<br/>• South-facing verandah overlooking reserve bushland<br/>• Outdoor fire pit & raised garden beds<br/>• Carport<br/>• Bore water to tank<br/>• Peaceful wildlife setting with abundant birdlife<br/><br/>A truly special bush escape offering privacy, serenity, and connection to nature.<br/>Contact us today to arrange a viewing.','house','Molloy Island',-34.26555000,115.20965000,6290,'WA','16 Dalton Way','Molloy Island',1,2,2,'Augusta Real Estate First National - Augusta','Balcony, Courtyard, Deck, Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1'),(1796,'$750 One-bedroom apartment with one carpark available now! Unfurnished',750,'Looking for quality, comfort and ample living space? You\'ve found the right place, and it\'s also undeniably stylish. The location can be considered one of the most effortlessly convenient in Brisbane. Walking out the door you are minutes from arriving at the vibrant West End cafe and restaurant scene. Not much longer in the other direction and you will be in the heart of the South Bank parklands. You are also a short walk away from several bus stops, South Brisbane train station, or the South bank city-cat terminal. The entire Cultural Center precinct and South Bank is easily within reach. <br/><br/>This fantastic one-bedroom apartment located in the spacious and Luxurious Brisbane One apartments is everything you need for perfect inner city living. <br/><br/>APARTMENT FEATURES<br/>1 Luxury bedroom<br/>1 Luxury Bathroom <br/>1 Carpark<br/>Air con & Ceiling Fans<br/>Chefs kitchen with gas cook top<br/><br/>COMPLEX FEATURES<br/>Swimming pool <br/>Gym<br/>Onsite management<br/>24 hour security guard<br/>Entertain friends with BBQ facilities and sundeck by the pool <br/>Free secure visitor car parking<br/><br/>Please email [REDACTED EMAIL] if you have any enquires.','apartment','South Brisbane',-27.47362254,153.01357550,4101,'Qld','1 Cordelia St','South Brisbane',1,1,1,'Song Properties - Brisbane','Balcony, Garage: 1, Outside Spa, Secure Parking, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Gas Heating, Gym, Intercom'),(1797,'5 Bedrooms double brick duplex',1300,'5 Bedrooms double brick duplex<br/>* 2 storey duplex with living room (all tiding floor throughout)<br/>* 5 bedrooms (all bedrooms with built-in robes)<br/>* 4 bathrooms <br/>* Modern kitchen with gas cooking<br/>* Int laundry<br/>* LUG + front and backyard<br/><br/>Available on Now','duplex/semi-detached','Auburn',-33.85093786,151.01893927,2144,'NSW','17A Stanhope Street','Auburn',4,5,1,'E A Realty','Garage: 1, Ensuite: 2, Toilets: 4'),(1798,'Furnished Lovely Home!',950,'This bright one bedroom located level 13 of Eminence with stunning Port Botany view.<br/>Gunyama Park Aquatic & Recreation Centre right at face front. Green Square Public School and Community Spaces just cross the road.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>* Bright one bedroom with build in wardrobe, queen bed and adjustable table.<br/>* Designed kitchen with Luxury appliances<br/>* Spacious balcony view through Mascot to Part Botany port<br/>* Indoor swiming pool, spa, sauna, gym<br/>* Podium gardens and a BBQ area at Level 1<br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>','apartment','Zetland',-33.90730348,151.20699401,2017,'NSW','1304/5 Joynton Avenue','Zetland',1,1,2,'Raine & Horne - St Leonards',NULL),(1799,'Convenient 2-Bedroom Duplex with Private Yard',450,'Positioned in a convenient and well-connected pocket of Boronia Heights, this low-maintenance duplex offers comfort, practicality and easy everyday living. Ideal for a professional couple or single tenant, the home provides a functional layout with private outdoor space.<br/><br/>The tiled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is air-conditioned for year-round comfort and flows seamlessly to a fully enclosed backyard with an extendable covered area, perfect for outdoor entertaining. Designed for easy living, the home combines indoor comfort with manageable outdoor space.<br/><br/>Property Highlights:<br/><br/>- 2 bedrooms | 1 bathroom | 1 remote single garage<br/><br/>- Master bedroom with air-conditioning, ceiling fan & built-in wardrobe<br/><br/>- Second bedroom with ceiling fan<br/><br/>- Large bathroom with spacious shower<br/><br/>- Open-plan tiled living, dining & kitchen area<br/><br/>- Air-conditioning to main living area<br/><br/>- Kitchen with gas cooktop & dishwasher<br/><br/>- Fully enclosed backyard with extendable covered entertaining area<br/><br/>- Remote single garage with internal access<br/><br/>- Laundry located in garage with additional storage cupboard<br/><br/>Offering low-maintenance living in a practical layout, this duplex is well suited to tenants seeking comfort and convenience in a quiet residential setting.<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/><br/>- Park Ridge Shopping Centre (Coles & specialty stores): approx. 3 km<br/><br/>- Grand Plaza Shopping Centre (Browns Plains): approx. 5 km<br/><br/>- Local primary school (Boronia Heights State School): within 700 m<br/><br/>- Local secondary school (Browns Plains State High School): approx. 6 km<br/><br/>- Public transport options (bus services): within 500 m<br/><br/>- Quick access to major arterial roads for commuting<br/><br/>Providing comfort, convenience and a low-maintenance lifestyle, this Boronia Heights duplex presents an excellent leasing opportunity in a well-established neighbourhood.<br/><br/>To book an inspection or apply for the property please use the following link:<br/><br/>https://snug.com/apply/cottageassetrealestate','house','Boronia Heights',-27.68853522,153.01746466,4124,'Qld','2/51A Parklands Drive','Boronia Heights',1,2,2,'Cottage Asset Real Estate - ARANA HILLS','Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning'),(1800,'Supremely spacious with a brilliant big balcony',700,'Your search is over! This very spacious modern apartment is definitely one of the more impressive ones you\'ll see. There is a great open-plan space with a huge living and dining room stepping out to a big under cover balcony with leafy views. <br/><br/>The quality kitchen has stone benchtops and stainless-steel appliances, European laundry, two double-sized bedrooms (BIRs), a semi-ensuite marble-trimmed bathroom with shower-over-the-bath. Features include: Reverse-cycle air conditioner, secure car space, storage cage and video-monitored entry. <br/><br/>Perfectly positioned for the good life close to trams, Ripponlea Village and Station, St Kilda Botanical Gardens and beach. This is the perfect place to call home!','apartment','Elwood',-37.87557570,144.99133489,3184,'Vic','13/135 Brighton Road','Elwood',1,2,1,'Belle Property - St Kilda','Carport: 1'),(1801,'Modern, Light-filled & Convenient',750,'Positioned high on Level 10 in the sought-after ‘Lotus’ building, this contemporary apartment offers refreshed and light-filled interiors, with an excellent floorplan, natural air-flow and dual balconies all within a resort-style security building.<br/><br/>* Recently refreshed interiors including new Air-conditioning<br/>* Enjoy elevated district views and abundant natural light throughout.<br/>* Spacious open-plan living and dining area flowing onto multiple, versatile external areas<br/>* Quality stone kitchen, stainless steel appliances, gas cooktop & ample storage<br/>* Two Generous bedrooms with built-in wardrobes; master with ensuite and secondary balcony access<br/>* Sleek bathroom with quality fittings; Internal laundry<br/>* Secure basement parking<br/>* Resort-style building with multiple childrens playgrounds, BBQ areas, swimming pools and lift accessSecure building with intercom & lift access<br/>* Ideal location, footsteps to Rockdale railway station and short walk to Rockdale Plaza and King Street Plaza.<br/><br/>For further details or to schedule an inspection please contact LJ Hooker on 9597 6144','apartment','Rockdale',-33.95420653,151.13623922,2216,'NSW','1010/3 Keats Avenue','Rockdale',2,2,1,'LJ Hooker - Rockdale','Open Spaces: 1'),(1802,'Family Home in the Heart of Hendra',1700,'Welcome to 93 Mein Street, Hendra!<br/><br/>A beautifully presented family residence offering generous space, comfort, and effortless indoor-outdoor living, set in one of Hendra\'s most tightly held and convenient pockets.<br/><br/>Positioned in a quiet, tree-lined street and framed by established greenery, this spacious two-level home delivers a warm and welcoming presence from the moment you arrive. Freshly updated interiors blend seamlessly with modern finishes, creating a move-in-ready home ideal for growing families or professionals seeking space and flexibility.<br/><br/>Light-filled living areas are designed for everyday ease, with an open-plan layout anchoring the heart of the home. Large windows invite in natural light and breezes, while the seamless flow to the outdoor entertaining area creates the perfect setting for weekend gatherings, relaxed family living, or quiet evenings at home.<br/><br/>Upstairs, the generous master suite offers a private retreat complete with ensuite and built-in wardrobe. Four additional well-proportioned bedrooms are serviced by a modern family bathroom, providing ample accommodation for larger families, guests, or those working from home.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• Master bedroom with built-in robes<br/>• 4 additional spacious bedrooms<br/>• 2 well-appointed bathrooms<br/>• Multiple living areas with open-plan design<br/>• Air-conditioning and ceiling fans for year-round comfort<br/>• Modern kitchen with ample storage, quality appliances, and generous bench space<br/>• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to covered entertaining area<br/>• Fully fenced yard - ideal for families<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/>• Situated in a sought-after Hendra pocket<br/>• Close to public transport options including bus and rail<br/>• Moments from Racecourse Road cafés, shops, and lifestyle precincts<br/>• Easy access to parklands, arterial roads, and Brisbane Airport<br/>• Within proximity to quality schools and childcare<br/>• Approximately 7km to Brisbane CBD<br/><br/>This is a rare opportunity to secure a spacious, family-friendly home in one of Brisbane\'s most desirable inner-north suburbs.<br/><br/>Inspecting is a must, this family home will go quick! <br/><br/>Don\'t miss your chance to enjoy the Hendra lifestyle.<br/><br/>++ PLEASE ENQUIRE WITH YOUR CONTACT DETAILS TO REGISTER FOR AN INSPECTION AND RECEIVE AN APPLICATION LINK ++','house','Hendra',-27.42462865,153.06749728,4011,'Qld','93 Mein Street','Hendra',2,5,2,'Ray White - Ascot',NULL),(1803,'Furnished Studio Apartment in Kangaroo Point!',400,'*Please note the photos are for advertising purposes and the floor plan/photos/furniture may vary between the different units.*<br/><br/>This studio apartment is available for lease only 2.4 kilometres to the city, surrounded by public transport including the bus, ferry and soon to be Cross River Rail and the walking bridge to the city. Mater Public and Private hospitals, private and public schooling, bikeways, River walkways and so many restaurants and cafes make this such a perfect position.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>• Studio Apartment <br/>• 1 bathroom<br/>• Incredible central location<br/>• 450m from the Gabba<br/>• Laundry (shared with one other apartment)<br/>• Fully furnished <br/>• Air conditioning<br/>• All utilities included in weekly rent <br/><br/>Building facilities:<br/>• Pool<br/>• BBQ<br/>• Indian restaurant<br/><br/>Want to register for the next available inspection time? Simply scroll to \'Inspections\' and register to attend or \'get in touch\' and send through your enquiry and we will reply via email with all of the available inspection times, and also keep you up to date as new times become available. It\'s important that you register to attend any rental inspections so that we can keep you up to date with any time changes, delays or cancellations.<br/><br/>Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing. Harcourts Solutions will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information including alterations made to the property, and any inclusions that may not be represented in this advertisement. All interested parties should rely upon their own enquiries to determine whether or not the property and utilities (including available internet options) are suitable for their needs.','apartment','Kangaroo Point',-27.48203924,153.03550532,4169,'Qld','51b/747 Main Street','Kangaroo Point',1,1,2,'Harcourts Solutions',NULL),(1804,'COASTAL CHARM & PRIVATE RETREAT – FULLY SELF-CONTAINED LIVING IN ELLIOTT HEADS',485,'Welcome to this charming and private one-bedroom residence, ideally positioned in the peaceful coastal suburb of Elliott Heads. Offering a relaxed lifestyle just moments from the beach, this well-presented home combines comfort, simplicity, and practicality — perfect for singles or couples seeking a quiet retreat near the ocean.<br/>Step inside and enjoy the light-filled open-plan living and kitchen area, enhanced by warm timber flooring and a functional layout. The spacious kitchen provides ample bench space, generous cabinetry, and a breakfast island — making meal preparation both easy and enjoyable. Large windows invite natural light throughout, creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere.<br/><br/>The generously sized bedroom offers a peaceful sanctuary, complete with ceiling fan, air conditioning, and plenty of space for storage and furnishings. The bathroom is neat and functional, while the internal laundry adds everyday convenience.<br/><br/>Outside, you\'ll appreciate the expansive yard space surrounded by established greenery, providing privacy and room to relax outdoors. Whether enjoying the coastal breeze or entertaining friends, this property offers a tranquil setting to call home.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• 1 spacious bedroom with ceiling fan & air conditioning<br/>• Light-filled open-plan living and kitchen area<br/>• Functional kitchen with ample storage & breakfast island<br/>• Neat and practical bathroom<br/>• Internal laundry for added convenience<br/>• Timber flooring throughout living areas<br/>• Private entry with peaceful surrounds<br/>• Generous yard space with established greenery<br/>• Quiet and private coastal location<br/><br/>LOCATION HIGHLIGHTS:<br/>• Located in the peaceful seaside suburb of Elliott Heads<br/>• Just minutes to Elliott Heads Beach and scenic coastline<br/>• Close to local café, convenience store & takeaway options<br/>• Surrounded by parks, walking tracks & natural reserves<br/>• Relaxed coastal lifestyle with community atmosphere<br/>• Short drive to Bundaberg CBD for major shopping, schools & services<br/><br/>DISTANCE TO FACILITIES (APPROX):<br/>• Elliott Heads Beach: 1.2 km<br/>• Elliott Heads General Store & Café: 1.1 km<br/>• Elliott Heads State School: 1.5 km<br/>• Bundaberg CBD: 21 km<br/>• Bundaberg Airport: 24 km<br/>• Bargara Beach & Esplanade: 18 km<br/><br/>Pets: Upon Application<br/><br/>Rental Details: $485 per week<br/><br/>Tenancy Applications must be completed in full (with all required documentation) in order for the commencement of the application process to begin.<br/>• We offer a 48 hour approval process to complete tenancy applications. To avoid delays in processing your application, please ensure references and employers are aware of your application and will expect a confirmation request from our Agency.<br/>• General Tenancy Agreements are to be signed and Bond paid within 24 hours of receiving paperwork from your Property Manager.<br/>• 2 Weeks Rent is required to be paid before keys will be released.<br/>• Office hours are Monday – Friday 8.30am-5pm <br/>• Office hours: Monday – Thursday - 8.30am - 5pm Friday, 8:30am – 4:00pm <br/><br/>At LJ Hooker Bundaberg, our Professional Property Management Team specializes in managing and maintaining investment properties. If you\'re an investor looking for expert property management, contact us today on [REDACTED PHONE]','house','Elliott Heads',-24.91386987,152.49013292,4670,'Qld','48 Welch Street','Elliott Heads',1,1,2,'LJ Hooker - Bundaberg',NULL),(1805,'Urban Living in the Heart of Footscray!',650,'Combining superb resident amenities with a vibrant retail and dining precinct, Victoria Square is an unparalleled riverside residential address that is reshaping Melbourne\'s inner western skyline.<br/>- Two bedrooms both with BIR<br/>- Master with built in study nook <br/>- Two bathrooms<br/>- European Laundry<br/>- Bright and modern kitchen with quality fittings and appliances<br/>- Living room opening to the balcony with views over Melbourne and beyond<br/>- 1x undercover Car space <br/><br/>Victoria Square delivers an exceptional standard of contemporary urban living, welcoming residents with a grand, hotel inspired foyer, intercom entry, and the convenience of an on site building manager. Amenities include indoor pool, gym and an elevated sky garden offering panoramic views across the neighbourhood. Not to mention an outdoor running track, games, theatre and function rooms. <br/>Perfectly positioned, it places you within moments of Footscray Railway Station, multiple bus routes, the vibrant Footscray Market and fitness trails along the Maribyrnong River. Enjoy access to Highpoint Shopping Centre, Victoria University, Docklands precinct, CBD, Footscray Community Arts Centre and the New Footscray Hospital.<br/>Families will value the premium education options with sought after zoning for Footscray City Primary School and Footscray High School.<b