eilings are a highlight.<br/><br/>Boasting opulent luxury throughout, you enter the property via a stunning brick-arched hallway. Here on the ground floor you will find two generous classic bedrooms with restored fire places, spacious integrated wardrobes and full height ceilings. A stunning bathroom with twin basins, separate semi frame-less shower and a deep luxury bath are sure to impress. A separate laundry is also a feature. The hallway opens to an designer kitchen complete with Blanco Oven and stainless steel appliances, glass splashback and butler\'s pantry.<br/>Stone bench tops incorporating a breakfast bar lead seamlessly to a superbly proportioned open plan family meals area and informal lounge room with access to a stunning well-proportioned private courtyard.<br/><br/>Upstairs, you will find two further bedrooms (one master) with integrated wardrobes. A luxurious bathroom with oversize shower and twin basins are also sure to impress. A feature of this property is a spacious separate study/home office featuring full cabinetry and writing desk. Features include Daikin Inverted heating/cooling throughout, polished timber floors, low-maintenance front and rear yards, quality fixtures and fittings, and generous storage throughout.<br/><br/>Situated in a sought-after pocket of Fitzroy North and located a stone\'s throw away are all modes of public transport, shops, restaurants, cafes, parkland and other amenities one could wish for in an ideal locale.','house','Fitzroy North',-37.77989271,144.98426331,3068,'Vic','126 Holden Street','Fitzroy North',2,4,2,'Nelson Alexander - Flemington',NULL),(1817,'Comfortable Family Living in a Convenient Glenfield Location',750,'Positioned in a quiet residential pocket of Glenfield, this well-maintained home offers practical design, generous space, and everyday convenience. Ideal for families or working professionals, the property provides a balanced combination of comfort and accessibility.<br/><br/>Property Features<br/>+ T