n private retreat. Surrounded by established palms and lush greenery, the backyard offers a tranquil setting complete with a covered patio and pergola - perfect for alfresco dining and warm Broome evenings. The sparkling swimming pool enhances the resort-style feel of the home.<br/><br/>Located in the highly sought-after Cable Beach area, you\'ll enjoy close proximity to the beach, local cafés and the relaxed coastal lifestyle Broome is known for.<br/><br/>Available mid April at $1,350 per week.','house','Cable Beach',-17.95511000,122.21964000,6726,'WA','17 Taiji Road','Cable Beach',2,4,2,'Hutchinson Real Estate - Broome','Carport: 2, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(1903,'Large Home - Seaside Suburb',750,'Large family home in a seaside suburb <br/>Freshly painted with new carpets<br/>4 bedrooms<br/>2 bathrooms<br/>Separate living and lounge areas<br/>Air conditioning to tiled living area and master bedroom<br/>Patio directly outside dining space<br/>Rear fenced in yard<br/>Attached double garage with internal access door<br/>Close to bus routes, parks, the beach, and only a short drive to a shopping centre <br/><br/>Take the time to go for a drive past the property to check out the street, suburb, shops and school if any. We recommend you do this prior to viewing the interior of the property.<br/><br/>TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY and to select your preferred inspection time click the button BOOK INSPECTION and enter your details to instantly register.<br/>','house','Glenfield',-28.68105642,114.61434272,6532,'WA','27 Neptune Corner','Glenfield',2,4,2,'Professionals - Geraldton',NULL),(1904,'Modern Family Home in a Top Location',720,'This spacious home in the popular Springfield Lakes location is a must see: <br/><br/>Property features: <br/><br/> *4 bedrooms, two bathrooms & 2 living areas <br/><br/>* Master bedroom featuring ensuite and walk in robe <br/><br/>* Double internal access garage <br/><br/>* Contemporary kitchen, with stone bench tops, gas cooktop, stainless steel app