 dedicated car spaces and includes quarterly garden maintenance in the lease.<br/><br/>- The large living area opens directly onto an alfresco BBQ area and a level sun-drenched backyard<br/>- Fully renovated gourmet kitchen with quality appliances including a dishwasher<br/>- Two renovated bathrooms, main with bathtub <br/>- Three bedrooms all with built in robes, ceiling fans, main with split system air conditioning<br/>- Lavious separate dressing room, which can double as a study area<br/>- Modern integrated laundry facilities on the lower level bathroom<br/>- Polished flooring upstairs, tiled flooring downstairs<br/>- Sun drenched, low maintenance, private tropical garden with quarterly maintenance included in the lease<br/>- Two car spaces, and the property is within easy access to Lane Cove National Park, local shops, and a range of transport options<br/><br/>Open Home Times: Please note that open times are subject to change. Please confirm on the day via our website https://rwayrealtychatswood.com/properties/for-rent/open-for-inspection.<br/><br/>','duplex/semi-detached','Chatswood',-33.79530050,151.16792126,2067,'NSW','11A Range Street','Chatswood',2,3,2,'Ray White AY Realty Chatswood','Open Spaces: 2'),(2017,'Studio for Rent - Convenient & Modern Living',330,'Located on the 2nd floor, this well-presented studio offers comfortable and low-maintenance living.<br/>Features include:<br/>- Timber flooring throughout<br/>- Modern kitchen & bathroom<br/>- Allocated car space<br/>- Close to public transport<br/>Ideal for those seeking convenience and easy access to local amenities.<br/>Email your enquiry to [REDACTED EMAIL]','studio','Auburn',-33.84432496,151.03966637,2144,'NSW','140/95 STATION ROAD','Auburn',1,1,1,'Laing + Simmons Auburn | Lidcombe - AUBURN','Open Spaces: 1'),(2018,'BRAND NEW TWO BEDROOM HOME AWAITS YOU! REGISTER NOW TO APPLY AND INSPECT!',580,'PLEASE CLICK ON ‘REQUEST AN INSPECTION TIME\' TO VIEW OUR REGULAR TIMES OR TO REQUEST A TIME.<br/><br/>AP