uring comfort in every season.<br/>Low maintenance and ideally located close to shops and local amenities, this property presents a practical rental opportunity in a sought after position.','house','Cohuna',-35.81245993,144.22720043,3568,'Vic','2 King George Street','Cohuna',2,2,2,'Charles L King & Co - Cohuna','Toilets: 2'),(2023,'Charming 4 Bedroom Queenslander',540,'This well-presented 4 bedroom Queenslander offers space, character and comfort in one of the area\'s most sought-after suburbs.<br/><br/>This charming home features a separate office, making it perfect for anyone needing extra space. <br/>The main bedroom includes built-in cupboards, while the remaining bedrooms are fitted with quality stand-alone wardrobes.<br/><br/>The home offers a comfortable air-conditioned living room, ideal for relaxing year-round, and security screens throughout for added peace of mind and airflow.<br/><br/>The heart of the home is the spacious kitchen, complete with a built-in pantry and plenty of room for meal preparation and storage.<br/><br/>Located in the popular suburb of Tinana, you\'ll enjoy a convenient lifestyle close to schools, shops, parks, and just minutes from Maryborough\'s CBD.<br/><br/>Apply Today!<br/>NOTE: Please apply for one property at a time online. <br/>Only fully completed applications will be considered, and shortlisted applicants will be invited to a viewing. <br/>Entry without an agent is not permitted.<br/>','house','Tinana',-25.55262884,152.67847475,4650,'Qld','7 High Street','Tinana',1,4,1,'Ray White Maryborough','Open Spaces: 1'),(2024,'SPACIOUS FAMILY HOME IN CONVENIENT LOCATION',490,'IMPORTANT: PLEASE REGISTER<br/>You will be sent a reminder of the inspection time. Or if no times yet scheduled, you will be notified of inspection times or any changes or cancellations to existing open for inspection times that you are registered for. This is important as open for inspections are often cancelled for numerous reasons!<br/><br/>This well presented and spacious family home offers multiple living areas and plenty of room for the whole family to enjoy. With a practical floorplan and generous backyard, it’s ideal for those seeking comfort and convenience.<br/> <br/>Located just minutes from Werribee CBD, freeway access, public transport, Eagle Stadium, childcare facilities, popular schools, parks and recreation reserves, everything you need is within easy reach.<br/> <br/>Key features:<br/>- Four spacious bedrooms<br/>- Master bedroom with walk in robe and private ensuite<br/>- Built in robes to remaining bedrooms<br/>- Large formal lounge upon entry<br/>- Open plan kitchen and dining area<br/>- Additional second living area<br/>- Central family bathroom<br/>- Ducted heating<br/>- Evaporative cooling<br/>- Abundance of natural light<br/>- Single remote control garage<br/>- Generous backyard<br/> <br/>Offering space, functionality and a convenient location, this home is ready for its next renters.<br/><br/>HOW TO APPLY FOR THIS PROPERTY:<br/>Simply send an enquiry for this property and you will be sent a direct link to apply for this property.<br/>Alternatively, you can go to the P Di Natale website, click on the RENT tab, search for the property you wish to apply for and then click the APPLY NOW button.<br/><br/>NOTE: You will need to apply this way as we do not accept any other forms of applications.<br/>','house','Werribee',-37.90145115,144.63777710,3030,'Vic','4 Montana Drive','Werribee',2,4,2,'P Di Natale Real Estate','Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Built-in Wardrobes, Ducted Heating, Evaporative Cooling'),(2025,'Stylish, light fillled, luxury apartment.',660,'In the heart of Melrose Park you\'ll be welcomed by light-filled interiors, generous proportions, and premium finishes. The open-plan living and dining flow seamlessly into the winter garden for the perfect indoor-outdoor living. Enjoy the convenience of cafes, children\'s play areas, and a future supermarket all just moments away. This luxury apartment with premium finishes and a sleek designer kitchen offers ultimate comfort and style, perfect for contemporary living. <br/><br/>- Spacious interiors <br/>- Study<br/>- Internal laundry <br/>- High-end kitchen appliances and stylish finishes <br/>- Secure building with parking <br/>- Lush parklands, green spaces, and playgrounds <br/>- Future shopping village with diverse retail options <br/>- Excellent transport links <br/>- Sustainable living in a thriving community Selling','apartment','Melrose Park',-33.80946254,151.06674719,2114,'NSW','108/3 Bundil Boulevard','Melrose Park',1,1,1,'Pello  - Northern Suburbs','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Built-in Wardrobes, Study, Pets Allowed'),(2026,'Open Plan Living',550,'This large home, with several living areas is perfect for the whole family. <br/><br/>Featuring:<br/>- 4 Bedroom home (3 bedrooms with BIR)<br/>- Master bedroom with WIR<br/>- 2 bathrooms<br/>- Spacious backyard with garden shed for all necessities <br/>- Front room which could be utilised as study, home office, kids playroom, 3rd living, parents retreat, or more! <br/>- Tiled floors throughout, offering easy cleaning<br/>- Carpet in bedrooms<br/><br/>This property is available on a 12-month Lease.<br/>* Inspections will only be offered after an application has been submitted and processed. Application forms can be downloaded from our website, or a paper copy is available from our agency.<br/>','house','Tatura',-36.42580918,145.23284395,3616,'Vic','24 Killarney Cres','Tatura',2,4,3,'Janelle Puppa Real Estate - SEYMOUR','Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 2, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Shed, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Evaporative Cooling, Living Areas: 2, Rumpus Room'),(2027,'Modern Family Living in the Heart of Fraser Rise',550,'The Home<br/>This beautifully designed 188m² residence offers a perfect blend of space, comfort, and modern functionality. Whether you\'re a growing family or a professional seeking extra room, this floorplan is tailored for an effortless lifestyle.<br/><br/>✅ Master Suite: Located on the first floor for ultimate privacy, featuring a spacious 3.0m x 4.5m layout, a private balcony, and a walk-in robe (WIR) leading to a sleek ensuite.<br/><br/>✅ Spacious Living: An expansive open-plan living and dining area (5.7m x 5.9m) provides the perfect hub for family gatherings.<br/><br/>✅ Gourmet Kitchen: Equipped with a walk-in pantry (WIP) and a dedicated dishwasher (DW) space, this 2.6m x 5.5m kitchen is a chef’s dream.<br/><br/>✅ Additional Bedrooms: Three further well-sized bedrooms (two with built-in robes) are serviced by a central family bathroom and separate powder room.<br/><br/>✅ Climate & Comfort: Featuring air conditioning and a secondary family retreat on the first floor.<br/><br/>Key Features<br/>✅ Secure Parking: Double car garage (5.8m x 5.6m) with internal access.<br/><br/>✅ Smart Storage: Includes a dedicated store room and additional linen/cupboard space.<br/><br/>✅ Outdoor Living: Low-maintenance backyard with a clothesline already installed.<br/><br/>✅ Connectivity: High-speed FTTP Opticomm connection available, ideal for working from home.<br/><br/>The Location<br/>✅ Situated in one of Melbourne’s most promising growth corridors, Fraser Rise offers a peaceful, community-focused lifestyle.<br/><br/>✅ Schools: Zoned for excellent local schools including the upcoming Wiyal Primary (2026) and Springside West Secondary College.<br/><br/>✅ Convenience: Minutes away from the established retail hubs of Caroline Springs Square and Watergardens.<br/><br/>Recreation: Close proximity to the future Plumpton Aquatic and Leisure Centre and local parklands.<br/><br/>To book an inspection time, please click \"CONTACT AGENT.\" <br/>You will receive an automatic email back with a link to book an inspection time. By registering for an inspection, you will be instantly informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your appointment.<br/><br/>Once you have inspected the property, you will be sent a link to apply online by our agency or you can choose to click the \"APPLY\" link on this webpage.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst all care has been taken in preparation, no responsibility is accepted for the accuracy of the information contained herein. All information (including but not limited to the property area, floor size, price, address & general property description) within this advertisement is provided as a convenience to you, and has been provided to R&W Plus by third parties. Interested persons are advised to make their own enquiries, seek legal advice and satisfy themselves in all respects.','house','Fraser Rise',-37.69261679,144.71383771,3336,'Vic','103 Modena Road','Fraser Rise',2,4,2,'R & W Plus - VIC','Garage: 2, Dishwasher, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Pets Allowed'),(2028,'The Perfect Balance of Convenience & Tranquillity',575,'**TO BOOK A TIME TO INSPECT, SIMPLY CLICK ON BOOK AN INSPECTION TIME OR EMAIL AGENT TO BE NOTIFIED OF INSPECTION TIMES. BY REGISTERING, YOU WILL BE INSTANTLY INFORMED OF ANY UPDATES, CHANGES OR CANCELLATIONS FOR YOUR APPOINTMENT. IF YOU DO NOT REGISTER FOR AN INSPECTION, ACCESS MAY NOT BE PROVIDED**<br/><br/>Ideally located for a vibrant lifestyle surrounded by cafés, culture, and colour, this bright one-bedroom apartment on the fifth floor sits just moments from the iconic Smith Street. Featuring an impressive oversized balcony (approx. 18sqm), it offers the perfect balance of indoor-outdoor living.<br/><br/>Set within the boutique Cherry complex, designed by Rothelowman, this stylishly updated home opens into a central living and dining area with a flexible layout that invites you to make it your own. The expansive balcony provides two separate zones ideal for entertaining, unwinding, or cultivating a lush pot plant garden.<br/><br/>The sleek kitchen is appointed with a mirrored splashback, stainless steel benchtop, high-gloss cabinetry, and premium appliances including an integrat