 Park precinct, this spacious top-floor one-bedroom unit is perfectly positioned to maximise natural light and capture beautiful ocean breezes — you couldn\'t ask for a better location. Just a short stroll to Tallebudgera Creek and only two minutes by car to Burleigh Beach, you\'ll enjoy the very best of coastal living. Local shops are conveniently located at your doorstep, including a fantastic café for your morning coffee. Positioned at the end of the building and facing northeast, the unit offers added privacy, reduced noise, and an abundance of natural light throughout the day.<br/><br/>Set within a well-maintained complex, this apartment combines comfort, convenience, and lifestyle in one appealing package.<br/><br/>Property Features Include: <br/>- Large master bedroom with built-in robes and private balcony access<br/>- Combined bathroom and laundry with dryer included<br/>- Spacious kitchen with dishwasher and ample storage<br/>- Light-filled living area with air-conditioning<br/>- Two balconies, perfect for relaxing or entertaining<br/>- Boutique block of just 15 units with secure entry<br/>- In-ground swimming pool<br/>- Secure basement parking<br/><br/>This is an excellent opportunity to secure a bright and airy home in one of the area\'s most desirable pockets.<br/><br/>Register for an inspection today!<br/><br/>Disclaimer: <br/>All information (including but not limited to the property area, floor size, price, address and general property description) is provided as a convenience to you, and has been provided to LJ Hooker by third parties. LJ Hooker is unable to definitively confirm whether the information listed is correct or 100% accurate. LJ Hooker does not accept any liability (direct or indirect) for any injury, loss, claim, damage or any incidental or consequential damages, including but not limited to lost profits or savings, arising out of or in any way connected with the use of any information, or any error, omission or defect in the informatio