verlooking the fully fenced, low-maintenance yard-designed for relaxed living without the upkeep.<br/><br/>Beyond the home, the location connects you to the very best of the Lake Macquarie region. You\'ll be close to Watagans National Park, Trinity Point Marina, Awaba Mountain Bike Park, and the lake\'s stunning foreshore. The exciting new Cedar Mill Lake Macquarie entertainment precinct and the upcoming Watagan Park Town Centre-with Woolworths, Snap Fitness and more-are set to further enhance lifestyle convenience. Dining favourites like Bistro Eden and 8@Trinity are just minutes away, with schools including Avondale School, Cooranbong Public, Heritage College, St John Vianney Primary and Avondale University all within easy reach.<br/><br/>Commuters will appreciate being only 60–70 minutes to Sydney\'s outskirts, 50 minutes to Newcastle CBD, and 30–40 minutes to the Hunter Valley, placing city access and wine country escapes within effortless reach.<br/><br/>A modern home with dual-living potential, energy efficiency and a lifestyle-rich location-this property delivers it all.<br/><br/>*Features You\'ll Love*<br/><br/>- Self-contained granny flat<br/>- Corner block <br/>- Rooftop solar installed<br/>- Ducted air conditioning in main home; split cycle in the granny flat<br/>- Modern kitchen with 90cm gas cooktop<br/>- Main bedroom with walk-in-robe and ensuite<br/>- Alfresco overlooks fully fenced, low maintenance yard<br/>- All rooms with built-in robes<br/>- Close to Watagan National Park, Lake Macquarie, Trinity Point and Awaba Mountain Bike Park<br/>- Close to the new Cedar Mill Lake Macquarie entertainment precinct currently under development<br/>- Close to new Watagan Park Town Centre featuring Woolworths, Snap Fitness and more (coming end of 2025)<br/>- Excellent dining nearby: Bistro Eden and 8@Trinity; close to shops and walking tracks<br/>- Close to Avondale School, Heritage College, St John Vianney Primary, Cooranbong Public School and Avondale University