essionalsnowra.com.au/wp-content/uploads/sites/59/2021/01/2021-Professionals-PM-application-points-of-ID.pd','house','Huskisson',-35.03944701,150.66993790,2540,'NSW','15 Morton Street','Huskisson',1,3,2,'Professionals Nowra - Nowra','Fully Fenced, Open Spaces: 2, Shed, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Floorboards, Living Areas: 1, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Toilets: 2, Pets Allowed'),(2138,'Family Home In Beveridge!',480,'RENT: $480.00 P.W - $2,086.00 PCM<br/>BOND: $2,086.00<br/>LEASE TERM: 12 MONTHS<br/>AVAILABLE: NOW<br/><br/>SUBMIT AN ENQUIRY TO REGISTER FOR AN INSPECTION NOW TO BE NOTIFIED OF ANY UPDATES.<br/><br/>Master bedroom featuring an ensuite and walk in robe.<br/>Three (3) additional bedrooms each with built-in robes.<br/>Open plan kitchen/meals/living area.<br/>Modern and spacious kitchen featuring a dishwasher, stainless steel appliances and a walk in pantry.<br/>Bathroom with shower, bath & separate toilet.<br/>Ducted heating throughout.<br/>Refrigerated cooling throughout.<br/>Double garage with remote access.<br/><br/>Additional features include:<br/>Solar panels.<br/>Bosch security alarm.<br/>Double glazed windows. <br/>Flyscreens and security door.<br/>Plantation shutters.<br/>Holland blinds. <br/>Full size laundry.<br/>Downstairs powder room.<br/>Floorboards throughout living and kitchen.<br/>Open plan living.<br/>Low maintenance backyard with fake grass.<br/>Situated in the sought-after Lyra Estate, moments from schools, parklands & future amenities.<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: INSPECTION TIMES CAN BE CHANGED PLEASE CHECK THE INTERNET PRIOR TO ALLOCATED TIME.','house','Beveridge',-37.47140606,144.98759466,3753,'Vic','21 Spafield Road','Beveridge',2,4,2,'Ray White - Craigieburn','Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating'),(2139,'This very solid 3 bedroom family home offers a lot more than you may think',420,'Comprising:<br/><br/>• 3 bedrooms with built-in robes. Master with walk-in robe<br/>• 1 bathroom<br/>• Double garage and workshop area <br/>• Gas heating and remote control A/C for year round comfort <br/>• Open kitchen and meals <br/>• Low maintenance backyard <br/>• Within easy reach of shops, schools, buses and other amenities<br/><br/>For more information or to arrange an inspection please contact Wilsons Property Management Team on 5222 1922.','house','Corio',-38.06808692,144.34778180,3214,'Vic','57 Cloverdale Drive','Corio',1,3,2,'Wilsons Real Estate - Geelong','Garage: 2, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Gas Heating'),(2140,'Beautiful Coastal Home for Rent – Carlton',485,'Beautiful Coastal Home for Rent – Carlton<br/><br/>Enjoy relaxed coastal living in this beautifully presented home in Carlton, just minutes from the beach and only a short 10-minute drive to Sorell.<br/><br/>This charming property features:<br/><br/>Two generous queen-sized bedrooms, both with built-in robes<br/><br/>Updated kitchen with modern finishes<br/><br/>Brand new carpet throughout<br/><br/>Spacious lounge room plus a convenient study nook<br/><br/>Reverse cycle heat pump for year-round comfort<br/><br/>Large 14,700L water tank<br/><br/>Step outside and you\'ll find even more to love. The home includes a separate bungalow-style laundry area with additional storage, a lovely flat and fully fenced yard, and established fruit trees. Entertain or unwind on the large deck - perfect for relaxing and enjoying the peaceful surroundings.<br/><br/>This delightful home offers comfort, space, and lifestyle in a sought-after coastal location.<br/><br/>For all enquiries or to arrange an inspection please contact Alison on [REDACTED PHONE] or [REDACTED EMAIL]','house','Carlton',-42.86833272,147.63972239,7173,'Tas','37 Moomere Street','Carlton',1,2,2,'Kate Storey Realty - SORELL',NULL),(2141,'Renovated Beauty with Contemporary Charm',600,'Located approximately 1.5km from the CBD, public transport and local schools, this charming weatherboard home offe