cy/RayWhiteDrouin','house','Warragul',-38.15280740,145.93896993,3820,'Vic','161 Sutton Street','Warragul',1,3,1,'Ray White - Drouin','Garage: 1'),(2142,'Just bring your clothes!',480,'Recently renovated, this fully furnished inner city studio apartment is ideal for the working individual looking for an easy-care property within walking distance to all that Toowoomba\'s CBD has to offer! <br/>Just bring your clothes!<br/>Situated on the fifth floor of the building with gorgeous views over the city.<br/>This air-conditioned apartment offers a stylish kitchenette with single sink, cooktop, microwave and fridge, a large bedroom/sitting area with double bed wall mounted LCD TV, built in wardrobe and bathroom with walk-in shower.<br/>With power and water included in the rent, you only need to arrange Wi Fi at the tenants cost. <br/>You will also have access to the shared outdoor swimming pool, spa, and entertaining area with BBQ and gym all located on the 3rd floor. <br/>There\'s also laundry facilities on the bottom level of the building, as well as your car space. <br/>','apartment','Toowoomba City',-27.56341638,151.95351393,4350,'Qld','507/532 Ruthven Street','Toowoomba City',1,1,1,'Jenkins Real Estate - TOOWOOMBA CITY','Open Spaces: 1, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Gym, Furnished'),(2143,'Beachside Lifestyle',670,'Immaculately presented throughout, this spacious apartment offers free flowing interiors whilst being conveniently located only moments to Cronulla\'s beautiful beaches, restaurants and cafes.<br/><br/>High Points<br/><br/>- Open plan living and dining with timber flooring <br/>- Neat & tidy kitchen with ample storage and bench space<br/>- Private balcony flows from living and dining<br/>- Two great sized bedrooms, main with mirrored built in robe<br/>- Well proportioned bathroom with separate bath and shower<br/>- Internal laundry facilities, balcony access from main bedroom<br/>- Single registered car space<br/>- Moments t