t-tha, or proximity to the University of Queensland — all contributing to a balanced, active and social lifestyle.<br/><br/>Positioned within a secure, well-maintained complex, 4/38 Nelson Parade offers a light-filled and welcoming space designed for easy, low-maintenance living. The thoughtfully designed layout features open-plan living and dining areas that flow effortlessly, creating the perfect environment for relaxing at home or entertaining guests. <br/><br/>The kitchen provides practical storage and functionality, while the spacious outdoor area offers a peaceful retreat to unwind after a long day. This residence is ideal for professionals, students or those seeking a safe, convenient and stylish place to call home.<br/><br/>*Photos are of a similar apartment in the complex. Please ensure you inspect the property and or request a video walk through. <br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Spacious bedrooms with built-in wardrobes<br/>- Main bedroom with walk-in robe and ensuite<br/>- Main bathroom with shower over bath and laundry alcove<br/>- Light-filled open plan living and dining area<br/>- Modern, functional kitchen with ample storage, gas stove, quality appliances, dishwasher and stone benchtops<br/>- Large, covered balcony– perfect for relaxing or entertaining<br/>- Air conditioning in the living area and the main bedroom<br/>- Secure lock-up garage or dedicated car space<br/>- Quiet, secure and well-maintained complex<br/><br/>Lease terms:<br/>- This property comes unfurnished only<br/>- 12-month leases preferred<br/>- Tenants are liable to pay for all utilities including water usage<br/>- The last rent increase was on the 31/03/2025<br/><br/>Applications:<br/>- Please click the APPLY button on the listing; or,<br/>- Complete an online application via 2Apply; or,<br/>- Request a PDF application from our office<br/><br/>Inspections:<br/>- Times will be listed, and we strongly suggest you register your details, so that should we need to cancel the inspection