nience and vibrant inner-city living.<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned just moments from Hawksburn Village, Malvern Road and High Street’s renowned shops, cafés and restaurants, with public transport right at your doorstep, this well-presented residence offers lifestyle and connectivity in one of Melbourne’s most sought-after precincts.<br/><br/>Inside, the apartment features:<br/> • A light-filled open-plan living and dining area with expansive windows capturing abundant natural light<br/> • Functional kitchen with generous storage, gas cooktop and oven/griller<br/> • Two spacious bedrooms, both with built-in robes and large windows<br/> • Central bathroom with shower over bath<br/> • Heating in the living area for year-round comfort<br/> • Off-street car space with convenient rear laneway access<br/><br/>With trams at your doorstep and Hawksburn Station within easy walking distance, you’ll enjoy effortless access to Melbourne’s premier dining, shopping and entertainment hubs.<br/><br/>Newland Property Group has taken every precaution to ensure the information contained herein is true and accurate; however, we accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability for any errors, omissions or inaccuracies. Prospective renters should make their own enquiries to verify the information provided.','apartment','Prahran',-37.84899075,145.00877234,3181,'Vic','8/670 Malvern Road','Prahran',1,2,1,'NewLand Property Group Australia','Open Spaces: 1, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards, Pets Allowed'),(2153,'Brand New Family spacious Home at 37 Coach House Street, Cobbitty',840,'Be the first to enjoy this beautifully presented brand new home, ideally positioned in a quiet and growing pocket of Cobbitty. Designed with comfort and practicality in mind, this modern residence offers generous space, quality finishes and low-maintenance living.<br/><br/>Perfect for families or professionals seeking a stylish and functional home, this property delivers both indoor