d convenience in a thriving community.','house','Clyde North',-38.11505923,145.34687573,3978,'Vic','38 Moroak Crescent','Clyde North',2,3,1,'OBrien Real Estate - Cranbourne','Garage: 1, Remote Garage, Built-in Wardrobes'),(2180,'Family Living with Brand-New Pool in Prime Mermaid Waters Location - Unfurnished',1400,'Positioned in one of the most sought-after streets in Mermaid Waters, this well-presented 3-bedroom home offers comfort, space and lifestyle convenience just minutes from the coast.<br/><br/>Designed for easy living, the property features a spacious open-plan kitchen and living area with stylish floorboards throughout these zones, complemented by ducted air conditioning for year-round comfort. The well-appointed kitchen includes a walk-in pantry, ideal for those who love to cook and entertain.<br/><br/>The master bedroom is complete with a walk-in robe and private ensuite, while the additional bedrooms are generously sized and serviced by a central bathroom.<br/><br/>Step outside to enjoy the sparkling pool, perfect for relaxing or entertaining, surrounded by easy-care gardens and a spacious yard. A sizable shed is located at the rear of the home, offering additional storage or workspace.<br/><br/>Please note: The garage is not included in the tenancy and will be locked off for the duration of the lease.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>Unfurnished<br/>Ducted air conditioning<br/>Inground swimming pool<br/>3 bedrooms, master with walk-in robe and ensuite<br/>Spacious open-plan kitchen with walk-in pantry<br/>Floorboards in kitchen and living areas<br/>Easy-to-maintain gardens<br/>Large shed<br/>Double carport<br/><br/>Conveniently located within walking distance to local shops, cafes, restaurants and public transport, and only a short 5-minute drive to Pacific Fair Shopping Centre and the Gold Coast\'s stunning beaches, this home offers the perfect blend of lifestyle and convenience.<br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>*** IMPORTANT! REGISTER TO INSPECT PROPERTIES ***