garden canopy of Oak, Mango, and Kaffir Lime trees. With zoned ducted air conditioning and a double garage, this home offers a rare level of quality and comfort for the discerning executive family seeking a long-term retreat in a secure, park-like setting.<br/><br/>Accommodation Features:<br/><br/>• Architect-led renovation by Duncan Sanby of Utz Sanby<br/>• Inspired by the design cues of Richard Neutra, one of the most important modernist architects of the 20th Century<br/>• Elevated entry welcomes single-level living, elements of glass, wood and stone throughout<br/>• Stunning Ironbark flooring, extra high ceilings accentuated by louvre windows<br/>• Open plan formal lounge and dining rooms, flowing family living, meals and kitchen<br/>Kitchen features a stainless-steel preparation bench and island adjoined to casual dining<br/>• Smeg dual-fuel freestanding oven/cooktop, delivers 7 gas hobs and separate oven cavities<br/>• Bosch dishwasher, hidden walk-in pantry within designer cabinetry wall<br/>• Zoned ducted air conditioning, gas heater connection, fireplace crafted by a stonemason<br/>• Sprawling main bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe, stacking sliders open to the privacy of Cedar slats<br/>• Light-filled, fully tiled ensuite bathroom with rain shower and towel warmer<br/>• Fourth bedroom with a built-in Murphy bed, ensuite bathroom and independent gated side access<br/>• Study opens to side terrace, ideal nursery/5th bedroom, alarm system<br/>• Basement-style remote double garage<br/><br/>External Features:<br/>• North-west rear, secure frontage<br/>• Pedestrian access via video intercom, fob-activated driveway access<br/>• Western Red Cedar used on the exterior of the home and front fence<br/>• Outdoor terrace accessed from the lounge and dining rooms<br/>• Paved entertaining terrace overlooks pool and deep garden<br/>• Plumbed gas barbecue connection point<br/>• Rear garden features English and American Oak trees, as well as mango, lemon and kaffir lime trees