iet sitting area.<br/><br/>The modern kitchen sits at the heart of the home, flowing seamlessly through to the internal laundry and out to the rest of the residence. With 2.5 bathrooms, busy mornings are made simple, and the double garage provides secure parking and additional storage.<br/><br/>Located just moments from well-regarded schools including Upper Coomera State College and Coomera Anglican College, plus local shops, parklands and transport options, this address offers true lifestyle convenience. Easy access to the M1 places Brisbane and the Gold Coast within comfortable reach.<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>- 3 spacious bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and ceiling fans<br/>- Air conditioning to the master bedroom and main living area<br/>- Multiple living areas for flexible family living<br/>- 2.5 bathrooms including private master ensuite<br/>- Modern kitchen with quality fixtures and ample storage<br/>- Internal laundry for everyday convenience<br/>- Double lock-up garage with secure access<br/>- Close to schools, shopping precincts, parklands and public transport<br/>- Quick access to the M1 for effortless commuting<br/><br/>This is an outstanding opportunity to secure a quality home in a thriving Upper Coomera community. Homes of this calibre in such a convenient location don’t last long – enquire today to arrange your inspection.<br/><br/>Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, Housemark will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information including alterations made to the property, and any inclusions that may not be represented in this advertisement. All interested parties should rely upon their own enquiries in order to determine whether or not the property and utilities (including available internet options) are suitable for their needs.<br/><br/>Interested? What do you do now? <br/><br/>To book your inspection simply click on \'Email Agent\' or the \'Book inspection\' Button. By regi