y access to Dynon Road and CityLink make commuting effortless.<br/><br/>PLEASE ENSURE YOU REGISTER TO ATTEND OR REQUEST AN INSPECTION.<br/>Click on the \"Book Inspection or \"Request an Inspection\" button and follow the prompts to Register. This will also ensure that you are advised of any changes, updates or cancellations to inspection times.<br/>Please monitor this advertisement for inspection times. All inspection times are subject to cancellation or change up until three (3) hours prior to the advertised time. All Lease Terms are 12 months unless otherwise specified. Parking Permits are usually available for most properties however, please contact the local council before applying for the property.<br/><br/>','house','Footscray',-37.79709500,144.90108400,3011,'Vic','64 Newell Street','Footscray',2,5,4,'Village Real Estate','Carport: 4'),(2280,'SPACIOUS FOUR BEDROOM HOME',800,'Offering space, comfort and functionality, this four-bedroom home is designed for easy modern living with multiple living zones and quality inclusions throughout.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>- Four bedrooms with built-in wardrobes to all<br/><br/>- Master suite with walk-in robe and private ensuite<br/><br/>- Spacious open plan living and dining area flowing from the kitchen<br/><br/>- Well-appointed kitchen complete with butler’s pantry<br/><br/>- 900mm upright gas stove and oven<br/><br/>- Separate theatre room<br/><br/>- Ducted air conditioning<br/><br/>- Covered alfresco area<br/><br/>- Good-sized backyard<br/><br/>Conveniently located approximately 513m from Doohan Reserve, 1.5km from Oran Park Anglican College and 1.6km from Oran Park Podium, this home offers easy access to parks, schools and shopping.<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER - If you do not register to inspect, we cannot guarantee an agent will attend the open house as we are unable to notify you of any changes or cancellations.<br/><br/>Register your interest online and you will receive the application link via text message an