ion:<br/><br/>• Body Corporate by-laws apply<br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/>PROPERTY TERMS:<br/><br/>- Maintaining the property within its designated lot is required, including gardens and lawns where applicable.<br/><br/>- The property is water-efficient, and tenants will be required to reimburse water usage charges during the tenancy to the property owner in accordance with the water rates designated by the supplier/council.<br/><br/>- Smoking is prohibited on the premises.<br/><br/>- Unless otherwise specified, all gas, electricity, internet (NBN) and phone connections where applicable are at the discretion and cost of tenants. Please conduct your research regarding associated connection times and fees.<br/><br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/>INSPECTIONS<br/><br/>Please note that attending a viewing is not mandatory to apply for this property. <br/><br/>Applications may be submitted without an inspection.<br/><br/>To arrange an inspection, please click the “Book Inspection” button online or contact our office directly to discuss a suitable time. Registering for an inspection ensures you receive timely updates regarding any changes or cancellations.<br/><br/>Important: Residents may utilise private security cameras in occupied properties. These may be active during inspections.<br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/>APPLICATIONS<br/><br/>We offer two application options for your convenience:<br/> <br/> 1. Online Application (Recommended)<br/>Apply via 2Apply using the “Apply Now” button included in the link sent following your enquiry.<br/> <br/> 2. Manual Application<br/>Email or call our office to request a manual RTA Rental Application Form (Form 22) which can then be submitted via email or in person in our office.<br/><br/><br/>All applications are subject to tenancy database checks through Equifax and TICA in accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 and Australian Privacy Principles.<br/><br/>⸻<br/><br/>PAYMENTS & SECURITY<br/><br/>Opulence Property Group will never request payment from you prior to formal 