10382733,149.18121942,4740,'Qld','16 Chester Crescent','Andergrove',3,4,2,'White Picket Real Estate - MACKAY','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 2, Living Areas: 2, Toilets: 3'),(2379,'Enjoy the North Avoca Lifestyle',730,'This well-presented three-bedroom home offers comfort, space and easy living. All bedrooms are carpeted and feature built-in wardrobes, while the bright, separate living room includes a split system air conditioner and beautiful wooden flooring throughout the home. The neat and tidy kitchen provides ample cupboard storage and adjoins the dining area, creating a practical layout for everyday living. The bathroom is well-appointed with a double vanity and a bath with shower, ideal for families. <br/><br/>Step outside to a partly uncovered deck, perfect for relaxing or entertaining, plus the added convenience for a single garage. Positioned in the sough-after coastal suburb of North Avoca, the home is just minutes from the stunning shores of North Avoca Beach. Enjoy easy access to local cafes, parks and schools, with the vibrant lifestyle hub of Terrigal only a short drive away, offering an array of restaurants, boutiques and waterfront dining. <br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• Three bedrooms<br/>• Split system aircon<br/>• Double sink in bathroom<br/>• Single garage<br/>• Water tank will not be in use<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: All information contained herein is gathered from sources we believe to be reliable. However, we cannot guarantee its accuracy and interested persons should rely on their own inquiries. Details are subject to change without further notice<br/><br/>WOULD YOU LIKE TO ATTEND OUR INSPECTION? YOU MUST REGISTER<br/><br/>1. Click on the BOOK INSPECTION button available on each property through brandproperty.com.au or on realestate.com.au<br/><br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection time.<br/><br/>3. If no time is offered, please register so we can contact you once a viewing is arranged. To register you can simply hit the email agent button and submit your details.<br/><br/>4. Changes or cancellations may occasionally occur due to unforeseen circumstances or if the property is leased. For notifications of these cancellations please ensure you have registered your details for this property.<br/><br/><br/>','house','North Avoca',-33.45468520,151.43892786,2260,'NSW','32 Surf Rider Avenue','North Avoca',1,3,1,'Brand Property - Central Coast','Garage: 1'),(2380,'Quite house close to shops, schools, university and beach',700,'This unit provides an ideal accommodation for people who want a quiet place to live with a fully fenced backyard in an ideal location close to shops, university, school and hospital.<br/><br/>This unit consists of 2 good sized bedrooms with built-in robes and ceiling fans. Good size lounge area with built in shelving. The main bathroom includes a bath with shower overhead and a separate toilet. Built-in linen cupboard to bathroom for storage space. Open plan kitchen/ dining area with ceiling fan to lounge area. Open air off street parking on a quiet street. Good size backyard with small garden shed and easy to maintain gardens. Fully fenced, private back yard with grassed and concrete areas. Great outdoor undercover area for entertaining.<br/><br/>This house offers convenience and comfort, in a secluded and peaceful environment with privacy and space. <br/><br/>The house is a 20 min walk or a 6 min drive to Mountain Creek shops and only a 7 min drive to Mooloolaba beach. 8 min drive to Kawana Shopping Centre. 9 min drive to University of the Sunshine Coast. 13 min drive to Sunshine Plaza and Sunshine Coast University Hospital.<br/><br/>- Lease: 12 months <br/>- Pets: Upon application <br/><br/>APPLICATION PROCESS<br/>You can apply for this property by clicking the ‘get in touch’ button on this advertisement. You will receive a link for the 2Apply application from. The service is free and is designed to help you streamline the process. It is essential that a fully completed application form is sent so that we are able to process it promptly. You can also apply for the property before viewing it by following the same process noted above.<br/><br/>The electronic format (above) is the quickest way to apply and for your application to be processed. However, should you wish to apply manually, an application form can be found at the following link. https://www.palmpropertymanagement.com.au/tenants<br/>If you are applying manually, please ensure the following: <br/>1. The completed and signed application with ALL supporting documents are emailed to [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/>2. Please do not send us multiple emails with supporting documents. Please provide all documentation in one email. <br/>3. If you application is not complete, do not submit it. Please complete ALL applications FULLY before submitting as this could cause delay in processing your application. <br/><br/>BOOKING AN INSPECTION <br/>You can book in for the next inspection through this advertisement. We ask that you do not attend the inspection if you are unwell as we reserve the right not to allow persons displaying flu like symptoms to enter the property. <br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing Palm Property Management will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. Interested parties should conduct independent research and due diligence to verify the accuracy of the information provided. Palm Property Management takes no responsibility for any errors or omissions and cannot be held accountable for any loss or damages incurred by any party as a result of the information provided.','unit','Mountain Creek',-26.70131791,153.10299065,4557,'Qld','2/16 Doolooma Street','Mountain Creek',1,2,1,'Palm Property Management - MOOLOOLABA','Fully Fenced, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 1, Pets Allowed'),(2381,'Two Bedroom I Two Bathroom I Two Car Parking',840,'Features Include:<br/><br/>• Large open plan tiled living areas that lead onto a leafy private balcony<br/>• Located on level 3 with lift access to the car parking<br/>• Master Bedroom with built-in and en-suite fully tiled bathroom<br/>• Second bedroom is study size, no built-in<br/>• Well-equipped gas kitchens that feature quality appliances including dishwasher<br/>• Fully tiled second bathroom, no bathtub<br/>• Reverse cycle air conditioner in living room only<br/>• 2x side by side undercover car space with remote control access<br/>• NBN internet<br/>Development is ideally positioned close to railway stations of both Killara and Lindfield. The apartments promise a convenient lifestyle, with green lush lawn and landscaping finishing off this unique development.<br/><br/>Surrounding Area:<br/>-8 Minute walk to Killara Train Station<br/>-Gordon Shopping Village, includes Woolworths and specialty shops<br/>-Swain Gardens, Marian Street Theatre<br/>-Child Care Centres, Medical Centres, 24/7 Gym<br/>-Catchment area for Killara High School','unit','Killara',-33.77139178,151.16155242,2071,'NSW','57/1 Killara Avenue','Killara',2,2,2,'Asset Advantage - Crows Nest','Balcony, Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Intercom, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Pets Allowed');
INSERT INTO `data` VALUES (2382,'Dual Master Bedrooms with Ensuites | Solar | Ducted Air-Conditioning | Multiple Living Areas',950,'Positioned in a tightly held pocket of Ormeau Hills, this standout residence combines high-end finishes, smart design, and impressive proportions to deliver effortless family living. With soaring 2.7m ceilings, two ensuited bedrooms, multiple living zones and ducted air-conditioning throughout, this home offers the space and comfort every growing family dreams of.<br/><br/>The open-plan living and dining area flows beautifully to the alfresco, while the sleek island kitchen with walk-in pantry and quality appliances anchors the home. A separate media/family room offers flexibility for movie nights, work-from-home or a private kids’ retreat.<br/><br/>Four spacious bedrooms are thoughtfully positioned, including two with private ensuites - ideal for multi-generational living or guests. The master suite at the rear enjoys privacy, a large robe and a stylish ensuite. With a full family bathroom, guest powder room, walk-in linen and a separate laundry, this floor plan has been designed for real life.<br/><br/>A wide double garage, solar, and easy-care yard round out the package - but there’s so much more to see. This home truly needs to be experienced in person. Don’t miss the chance to step inside and fall in love.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- Master bedroom with built-in robe, ceiling fan, and private ensuite<br/>- Second bedroom with built-in robe, ceiling fan, private ensuite, and built-in desk<br/>- Two additional bedrooms with built-in robes and ceiling fans<br/>- Spacious second living area with ceiling fan<br/>- Open-plan living, dining, and kitchen<br/>- Well-appointed kitchen with electric stove, dishwasher, large walk-in pantry, and ample storage<br/>- Separate laundry with linen cupboard and external access<br/>- Main bathroom featuring bathtub, shower, vanity, plus separate powder room<br/>- Ducted air conditioning and ceiling fans throughout the home<br/>- Covered outdoor entertaining area with low-maintenance yard<br/>- Fully fenced, flood-free block <br/>- 2.7m high ceilings<br/>- Solar<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/>- 190m to nearest Bus Stop<br/>- 4 min walk to Hilltop Park<br/>- 6 min walk to Landsdowne Park<br/>- 2 min drive to Sparrow Early Learning Ormeau Hills<br/>- 6 min drive to Ormeau State School<br/>- 6 min drive to Ormeau Marketplace & Ormeau Centre (Woolworths, Australia Post, Chemist Warehouse, Aldi (opening soon) and much more)<br/>- 8 min drive to Ormeau Village Shopping Centre (Coles, Amtan Medical, Amcal Pharmacy and much more)<br/>- 8 min drive to Livingston Christian College<br/>- 8 min drive to LORDS<br/>- 8 min drive to Ormeau Train Station<br/>- 9 min drive to Ormeau Woods State High School<br/>- 30 min drive to Gold Coast<br/>- 35 min drive to Brisbane CBD<br/><br/>Please note:<br/>If you haven’t registered online, we won’t be able to let you know about any changes or cancellations to inspection times.<br/><br/>Before Applying:<br/>Please make sure to check with your preferred provider regarding the availability of NBN or any other services you may need at the property.<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>While we’ve done our best to ensure the information provided is accurate, we take no responsibility for any errors or omissions. All interested parties are encouraged to do their own research to confirm the details in this listing.<br/><br/>Photos used in advertising may differ from the current state of the property. We endeavour to use the most up to date photography, however this may not be feasible to protect our current tenants\' privacy. Photos may include the use of virtual furniture.','house','Ormeau Hills',-27.80139749,153.25026260,4208,'Qld','20 Adelaide Crescent','Ormeau Hills',3,4,2,'KRS Properties Sales & Management','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Living Areas: 2'),(2383,'Five-bedroom duplex designed for the extended family in mind with two master bedrooms with ensuites, indoor and outdoor kitchens!!',1350,'Lots of space and storage and an easy walk to local shops, parklands and bus. This would suit a large or extended family.<br/><br/>- Impressive gas kitchen with stone benchtops and lots of cupboard space<br/>- Spacious lounge and separate formal dining area.<br/>- Two master bedrooms with walk-in robes and ensuites<br/>- Four generous bedrooms all with built-ins<br/>- Stylish main bathroom and additional powder room downstairs.<br/>- Beautifully tiled and timber floors throughout.<br/>- Fabulous outdoor entertaining area with outdoor kitchen<br/>- Good internal storage spaces<br/>- Ducted air-conditioning throughout<br/>- Video intercom and alarm system<br/>- Lock up garage and enough driveway parking for 2 cars','house','Dundas Valley',-33.79644627,151.04687042,2117,'NSW','37A Moffatts Drive','Dundas Valley',4,5,2,'McGrath - Beecroft','Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Built-in Wardrobes'),(2384,'Brilliant and Bold, Best in Brookwater!!',1100,'From the moment you arrive, this exceptional split-level executive residence makes a statement of refined luxury and effortless scale. Located on one of Brookwater\'s most premier streets and set upon a meticulously landscaped 880sqm allotment, the home strikes a perfect balance between grand entertaining and low-maintenance living-all while capturing the tranquil, resort-style essence for which Brookwater is renowned.<br/><br/>Designed for the Modern Entertainer<br/><br/>At the heart of the home, a light-filled open-plan sanctuary awaits. The stylish gourmet kitchen-complete with premium stainless-steel appliances and a freestanding gas cooktop-serves as the social hub, overlooking the dining and living zones. Beyond the glass, the transition to outdoor living is seamless. Relax under the covered alfresco area with glimpses of the Greg Norman-designed golf course, or take a dip in the sparkling saltwater pool, all framed by total privacy.<br/><br/>A Private Retreat<br/><br/>The master suite is a masterclass in relaxation, featuring a spacious walk-around robe and a spa-inspired ensuite with dual vanities and a deep soaking tub. With four generous bedrooms and two distinct living areas, there is ample space for the family to grow, play, and unwind. The property also boasts one of the largest backyards in Brookwater, offering plenty of space for children to play or to unwind with a glass of wine around the firepit.<br/><br/>Exceptional Features<br/><br/>• Gourmet kitchen with high-end gas cooking, dishwasher, and expansive preparation area<br/>• Two spacious living areas<br/>• Open-plan dining and living area<br/>• Four extra-large bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes<br/>• Master wing featuring a luxury ensuite with bath, separate shower, walk-around robe, and private external access<br/>• Teenage retreat/lounge room<br/>• Large internal laundry with additional storage<br/>• Double remote garage with internal access<br/>• Outdoor oasis with inground saltwater pool and spacious backyard<br/>• Year-round comfort with split-system air conditioning and premium finishes throughout<br/>• Freshly painted roof, ready for solar installation<br/>• Convenient access to the golf course, directly across the road from the 16th fairway<br/><br/>The Location & Community<br/><br/>Located approx 25km from Brisbane, Brookwater is more than a suburb-it\'s a lifestyle. As a member of the Brookwater Homeowners\' Club, you will enjoy manicured streetscapes and exclusive access to green spaces. You are moments from Orion Springfield Central, elite medical facilities, express rail links, and a variety of private and public schools, ensuring you never have to sacrifice convenience for peace.<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: Please submit an enquiry to register for a viewing time online. If you do not register online, we cannot notify you of any time changes or cancellations to inspections. Prior to applying for this property please ensure you have conducted your own enquiries, with your preferred supplier, regarding the availability of NBN or any other service you may require.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: We have in preparing this advertisement used our best endeavours to ensure the information contained is true and accurate, but accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability in respect to any errors, omissions, inaccuracies or misstatements contained. Prospective renters should make their own enquiries to verify the information contained in this advertisement.','house','Brookwater',-27.65361401,152.89795800,4300,'Qld','52 Birchwood Crescent','Brookwater',2,4,2,'Ray White - ROCHEDALE','Garage: 2'),(2385,'Family Home Offering Space & Comfort in Convenient Location',700,'IMPORTANT: Please ensure that you register to attend by clicking \'Request an Inspection\'. <br/>By registering, we can keep you informed of any changes or cancellations to the appointment. You\'ll be invited to apply after you\'ve attended an inspection. <br/><br/>Welcome to 41 Ironwood Street, Redbank Plains - a well-designed family home offering space, comfort and modern upgrades in a convenient location.<br/><br/>Designed for practical everyday living, this home features a flowing open-plan layout complemented by a second living area - perfect for families needing flexibility, a kids\' retreat or work-from-home space.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Open plan kitchen, dining & living area<br/>- Additional separate living space<br/>- Brand new modern kitchen with electric cooking & dishwasher (to be installed)<br/>- Air-conditioned main living area<br/>- Air-conditioned master bedroom<br/>- Master bedroom with private ensuite<br/>- Three additional bedrooms with built-in robes & ceiling fans<br/>- Separate internal laundry<br/>- Undercover outdoor entertaining area<br/>- Double remote garage with internal access<br/>- Generous fully fenced yard<br/><br/>The spacious backyard offers plenty of room for children to play or for weekend entertaining, while the undercover alfresco area creates the perfect extension of indoor living.<br/><br/>Positioned in a family-friendly pocket of Redbank Plains, close to local schools, parks and shopping amenities, this home presents a fantastic opportunity for tenants seeking comfort and convenience.<br/><br/>*Water usage charges apply','house','Redbank Plains',-27.66939138,152.83985664,4301,'Qld','41 Ironwood Street','Redbank Plains',2,4,2,'Ray White - Springfield','Garage: 2'),(2386,'Secure Living in ormeau!',730,'Modern 3-bedroom home in a secure gated complex with access to a communal pool. Featuring a single garage, 2 bathrooms, air conditioning to the master bedroom, lounge and upstairs hallway, plus a compact, low-maintenance rear yard. Ideal for easy, low-fuss living.<br/><br/>This property is available for a 6-month lease only.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• 3 bedrooms<br/>• 2 bathrooms<br/>• Single lock-up garage<br/>• Air conditioning to master bedroom, lounge & upstairs hallway<br/>• Secure gated complex<br/>• Access to communal swimming pool<br/>• Compact, low-maintenance rear yard<br/>• Modern finishes throughout<br/>• Water usage is included in the rent<br/><br/><br/>Located in The Sanctuary on Pascoe Road, the property offers convenient access to shops, schools, parks and the M1 for easy commuting to Brisbane or the Gold Coast.<br/><br/>** ARRANGE AN INSPECTION TIME ONLINE** <br/>** REGISTRATION REQUIRED **<br/><br/>By registering, you will be INSTANTLY informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your appointment. Please be aware that even though you may be booked in for an inspection, it does sometimes occur that the property may be leased prior to the time and date you have been given. If that occurs, you will receive a text informing you of the cancellation. Once registered, you will receive and email from our agency as to the guidelines of entry. Please ensure you read them and adhere to them strictly. Please view the photos and any visual aids you can access thoroughly to ensure that this is a home you are very interested in before registering. Due to the current situation, open homes are attendance limited, if you are unable to register for an inspection, register your interest and you will be notified when/if another open is scheduled.<br/><br/>** IF YOU DO NOT REGISTER FOR YOUR PRIVATE APPOINTMENT, YOU WILL NOT BE PERMITTED TO ENTER **<br/><br/>Disclaimer: In preparing this information LJ Hooker has used its best endeavours to ensure that the information contained herein is true and accurate, but accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability in respect of any errors, omissions, inaccuracies or misstatements that may occur. Prospective tenants and buyers should make their own enquiries to verify the information contained herein. *On application, pending owner approval.<br/><br/>Photos used in advertising may differ from the current state of the property. We endeavour to use the most up to date photography, however this may not be feasible to protect our current tenants\' privacy. Photos may include the use of virtual furniture.<br/>','duplex/semi-detached','Ormeau',-27.76499623,153.24260304,4208,'Qld','18/152-164 Pascoe Road','Ormeau',2,3,2,'LJ Hooker Ormeau','Carport: 1, Deck, Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1'),(2387,'Parkside Living at Its Finest..',930,'Enjoy uninterrupted views and a relaxed lifestyle in this well-presented home, ideally positioned directly opposite peaceful green parklands.<br/><br/>The property offers three generous bedrooms, including a spacious master suite complete with walk-in robe, private ensuite, and a balcony overlooking the park. The remaining two bedrooms feature built-in robes and are serviced by a centrally located bathroom with a full-size bathtub.<br/><br/>A functional, well-appointed kitchen flows seamlessly into the open-plan living and dining area, while the front-facing lounge room captures calming park outlooks.<br/><br/>Outdoors, an undercover entertaining area provides the perfect space for year-round enjoyment and double car garage. <br/><br/>Combining space, comfort, and an enviable outlook, this home presents an excellent opportunity in a highly desirable location.<br/><br/><br/>*****INSPECTIONS MAY BE CANCELLED OR RESCHEDULED – PLEASE REGISTER TO INSPECT TO ENSURE YOU ARE NOTIFIED IN THE EVENT THAT AN INSPECTION IS CANCELLED****','house','Maribyrnong',-37.77182600,144.87621500,3032,'Vic','9 Nayook Lane','Maribyrnong',2,3,2,'BigginScott Moonee Ponds','Balcony, Garage: 2, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Floorboards'),(2388,'32 William Street, Forbes NSW 2871',550,'This beautifully presented 3-bedroom family home, located in South Forbes features:<br/><br/>. Spacious 3-bedrooms, all with built-in robes<br/>. Open-plan living and kitchen area with stainless steel appliances including dishwasher<br/>. Modern bathroom<br/>. Laundry with 2nd toilet for convenience<br/>. Large double garage with remote access<br/>. Fully fenced yard with established lawns and gardens<br/>. Reverse cycle air conditioner, ceiling fans and gas heating <br/><br/>Contact Michael Robinson & Co today on 6852 3134 to arrange an inspection.<br/>(Only pre-approved applications before any inspections of the property)<br/><br/>','house','Forbes',-33.39451854,148.00974160,2871,'NSW','32  William Street','Forbes',1,3,2,'Michael J Robinson & Co - FORBES','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Shed, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Floorboards, Gas Heating, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Toilets: 2'),(2389,'6-8 Months Lease Available - Timeless California Bungalow with Poolside Entertaining',1400,'Please refer below for inspection instructions.<br/><br/>***6-8 month lease only. Includes pool and garden maintenance! <br/><br/>A timelessly elegant 1926 California Bungalow, updated for contemporary family life, this four-bedroom, two-bathroom classic is gently nestled within an exquisite, north-facing garden allotment of 780 square metres that culminates in sundrenched, poolside entertaining. Located in a premium Surrey Hills position that offers zoning for Camberwell High School, Canterbury Girls Secondary College as well as excellent private school access. <br/><br/>Privately sheltered behind established gardens and well elevated above the streetscape, the home opens to reveal an impressive entrance hall set under a lofty double height void, before flowing around a striking curved wall to its open-plan crescendo. Extending outdoors to paved poolside dining and entertaining that is superbly sheltered by a string of established Silver Birches while drawing the northern sun, the open plan is anchored by a modern stone-topped kitchen with a large pantry and a bold entertainers’ spirit. <br/><br/>Introducing streams of natural light from all directions and framing verdant outlooks at every opportunity, the home also features a separate lounge room, built-in robes or cabinetry in each bedroom, a pair of contemporary bathrooms and a powder room, while further highlights include driveway parking for two vehicles, ducted heating, air conditioning and volumes of storage that includes plenty of cupboards, under the stairs, in the roofline and the laundry. Set within one of Surrey Hills’ most esteemed tree-lined pockets just moments from Union Road and Union Railway Station for easy private school access, as well as Maling Road’s café scene and glorious local parkland.<br/><br/>**To Inspect**<br/><br/>To book an inspection, click either the ‘Request Online Inspection Link’ or ‘Get in Touch’ then select ‘Request an Inspection’ to enter your details. An inspection invitation will then be sent to you via our application platform. If there are no available inspection times, or you cannot attend the listed time, please send an enquiry or contact the leasing agent for further assistance. Please note ‘add to plan’ is not booking into the inspection.<br/><br/>**Please Note** <br/><br/>Open for Inspection times and property availability is subject to change without notice. We highly recommend registering for an inspection you are going to attend to avoid disappointment for cancellations. If you are registered for an inspection, you will be notified by SMS if the inspection is cancelled. <br/><br/> **Caution** <br/><br/>Marshall White has exclusive leasing rights to this property. We do not advertise on Gumtree, Facebook Marketplace or any other social media platforms. Please beware of scammers and apply only via the official advertising link using the Snug platform.','house','Surrey Hills',-37.82083700,145.09479100,3127,'Vic','94 Empress Road','Surrey Hills',2,4,2,'Marshall White - Boroondara','Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating'),(2390,'Modern Luxury Living in the Heart of Banya',850,'If you\'re looking for a home that combines character, comfort and fantastic location, this property is a must see. Built in 2023, this immaculately presented residence offers contemporary style, premium finishes, and low maintenance living, perfect for those seeking comfort and quality.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>3 bedrooms <br/>2 modern bathrooms, including a luxurious main bathroom with bathtub<br/>Dishwasher<br/>Smart Home Features<br/>1 secure single car garage<br/>Ceiling fans throughout<br/>Ducted air conditioning for year round comfort<br/>High quality fixtures and fittings throughout<br/>Light filled open plan living and dining area<br/><br/>Step outside and enjoy your own private retreat featuring:<br/><br/>Outdoor Patio area ideal for alfresco dining<br/>Fully fenced, low maintenance yard<br/>NOTE - SPA not available for use.<br/><br/><br/>This near new home combines functionality and style, offering easy living in a growing, family friendly community.<br/><br/>* 12-month lease available<br/>* $850.00 per week<br/><br/>Located in Banya within the growing Aura community, the neighbourhood has been thoughtfully planned around lifestyle and connection. With parks, schools, transport links, and local amenities continuing to develop nearby, it\'s a friendly area that\'s ideal for those seeking comfort, convenience, and a sense of community.<br/><br/>Don\'t miss your opportunity to secure this beautifully maintained home in a prime location. <br/><br/>*Disclaimer: Whilst every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of these particulars, no warranty is given by the owner or the agent as to their accuracy. Interested parties should not rely on these particulars as representations of fact but must instead satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise.','house','Banya',-26.82659935,153.05386535,4551,'Qld','13 Cape Barren Circuit','Banya',2,3,2,'Lachlan Anderson Real Estate - CALOUNDRA','Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(2391,'2 bed, 1 bath 1 car , In the heart of Bridge Rd,',610,'RentBetter Property ID: 266197 (quote when calling)<br/><br/>APPLY: Send through an enquiry and you\'ll receive the link to apply<br/><br/>Homely, RENOVATED, stylish Apartment above shop<br/><br/>Centrally located in the heart of Bridge Rd, Richmond<br/><br/>This beautifully renovated apartment offers you 2 bedrooms with  robes, modern appliances in its modern kitchen.<br/><br/>Featuring 3m high ceilings, large living room, new split system cooling/heating and bathtub.<br/><br/>You can also obtain up to Council parking permit if required.<br/><br/>Has excellent public transport options at your front door<br/><br/>Everything such as local Restaurants, Cafes, Retail stores and even the MCG within walking distance.<br/><br/>Gas cooking<br/><br/>new Split 3.5 kw air conditioner , cool/heat<br/><br/>Washing machine<br/><br/>Dishwasher<br/><br/>Shower over bath<br/><br/>Very close to public transport Trains and Trams<br/><br/>1 car park is available* entry from rear lane way Corns pl, next door<br/><br/>Lease is for Apartment Rear OF 137 Bridge Rd, Richmond 3121<br/><br/>Please submit expression of interest for property inspection out side of planed OFI,<br/><br/>Inspection Date: <br/>by appointment, date will be updated shortly<br/><br/><br/><br/>***Will go fast, ideal location***','apartment','Richmond',-37.81786383,144.99442071,3121,'Vic','Rear/137 Bridge Road','Richmond',1,2,1,'RentBetter','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Split-system Heating'),(2392,'Style, comfort and alluring views!',800,'Desirably positioned in the exclusive Upper West Sides Madison Building this stylish apartment offers a luxurious lifestyle of low-maintenance ease.<br/><br/>Inspiring views including iconic Marvel Stadium are captured from the private balcony and throughout the light-filled open-plan living/dining area and gourmet stone-topped kitchen. Enjoy the comfort of 2 robed bedrooms, master with luxe ensuite and chic mainbathroom bathroom.<br/><br/>Boasting a prominent location, just a stones throw to Southern Cross Station, Direct Factory Outlet, walking distance to Coles, Flagstaff Gardens, Etihad Stadium, Docklands, shopping, cafes and restaurants and tram right on your doorstep.<br/><br/>Booking an inspection is easy! Simply click on \"Request a Time\" to register your details for an inspection time that suits you. Alternatively, \"Get in Touch\" with our Liveability Agents to enquire today. We look forward to meeting you soon!<br/><br/>By registering, you will be instantly informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your appointment.<br/><br/>Applications are processed after inspections have been completed. A link to apply will be provided at the inspection.','apartment','Melbourne',-37.8150826