e location. Contact us today to schedule a viewing and make this property your new home!','house','Gray',-12.49469700,130.98356900,830,'NT','20 Dillon Circuit','Gray',1,3,2,'Freedom Property - JH Team','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Split-system Air Conditioning, Pets Allowed'),(2457,'Prime Location in Caroline Springs',530,'Welcome to 241/73 Lake Street, Caroline Springs - a stunning house available for lease that combines modern living with picturesque water views. This property is perfect for those seeking a comfortable and stylish home in a vibrant community.<br/><br/>The spacious interior features a large open plan kitchen and meals area, ideal for entertaining or enjoying family time. The kitchen is equipped with a dishwasher, making clean-up a breeze. The master bedroom boasts an ensuite, providing a private retreat for relaxation.<br/><br/>Enjoy the convenience of a European style laundry and secure parking, ensuring your daily routines are hassle-free. The split system air conditioning keeps the home comfortable year-round, while the balcony offers a perfect spot to unwind and take in the serene surroundings.<br/><br/>This property is situated in an urban setting with easy access to local amenities, parks, and schools. The waterfront location enhances the charm of this home, making it a desirable place to live.<br/><br/>Price is upon application. Don\'t miss the opportunity to make this beautiful house your new home. Contact us today for more information or to arrange a viewing.','house','Caroline Springs',-37.72943348,144.74406209,3023,'Vic','241/73 Lake Street','Caroline Springs',2,2,1,'Sweeney Estate Agents - Footscray & Yarraville','Balcony, Garage: 1, Secure Parking'),(2458,'CLEAN UNIT IN GREAT LOCATION',470,'* Gas Ducted Heating and Split System Cooling <br/>* Private Enclosed Courtyard <br/>* Single Remote Access Garage <br/><br/>This beautiful townhouse is in a prime location, nearby to Geelong Ring Road Access, Shopping Centres and Public Transport. <br/><br/>Step inside this modern home to neutral tones throughout, a spacious kitchen, dining and living area with internal access to the single garage. <br/><br/>The kitchen boasts stainless steel appliances, dishwasher and ample cupboard and bench space, and opens through a sliding door to the private enclosed courtyard. <br/><br/>There are two bedrooms, both of good size and with built in wardrobes. The bathroom is central with separate bath and shower and central in the home. The property also has a separate toilet and laundry. <br/><br/>There is gas ducted heating and split system cooling to ensure comfort year-round, and the single garage with remote access provides easy off-street secure parking. <br/><br/>This property is sure to impress, register your interest to inspect this lovely home today! <br/><br/>** PLEASE NOTE - this property is also available for private inspections, please call (03) 5282 4351 - to schedule your inspection time **','unit','Bell Park',-38.10813536,144.33545207,3215,'Vic','5/45 Bruce Street','Bell Park',1,2,1,'ReleasePM','Garage: 1, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Split-system Air Conditioning, Pets Allowed'),(2459,'Duplex in great location!',570,'Duplex in Central Lakes Estate. Close to Hospital, Schools, Tafe and Woolworths shopping centre. 3 Bedrooms, Ensuite and Study. Built-Ins in all. The open plan kitchen is complete with Dishwasher. Double remote lockup garage with internal access. Duplex is Air Conditioned.<br/><br/>**PROPERTY IS GETTING NEW PAINT AND CARPET THROUGHOUT - PHOTOS DO NOT REFLECT THIS**','duplex/semi-detached','Caboolture',-27.07518626,152.97016776,4510,'Qld','1/187 Summerfields Dr','Caboolture',2,4,2,'Caboolture Realty - Caboolture','Garage: 2'),(2460,'Your Forever Family Home - Pool, Space & Style in Alderley',960,'To apply or stay updated, register via the Image Property website at www.imageproperty.com.au, or use the ‘Get In Touch’ or ‘Enquire’ options on REA. If you do not register, you will not receive updates on inspection times, cancellations, or property availability.<br/><br/>Be the first to inspect this immaculately presented four-bedroom family home in the heart of Alderley! Boasting an entertainer\'s paradise with open plan living and kitchen, covered outdoor entertaining area and exquisite pool; this one has everything you have been looking for and you will want to make this one your \"forever after\" home.<br/><br/>Located in a quiet street only moments from Alderley train station.<br/><br/>Confirmed School Zones: Wilston State School and Everton Park State High School<br/><br/>Take a Virtual stroll through the property by clicking the 3D Tour button below.<br/><br/>Property Features: <br/>Featuring downstairs.<br/># Large tiled open plan living and dining area overlooking the entertaining area<br/># Sliding bi-fold doors opens onto the paved entertaining area with a ceiling fan<br/># Well-appointed modern kitchen including stainless steel dishwasher, gas cooking and butler\'s pantry<br/># Beautifully presented lap pool with regular pool services included<br/># Low maintenance pet friendly backyard<br/># Separate study or media room<br/># Ducted air conditioning throughout<br/># Double remote lock up garage<br/># Separate powder room<br/># Internal laundry<br/><br/>Featuring upstairs.<br/># Second good sized living room or kid\'s play area<br/># Master bedroom suite boasts grand ensuite bathroom including spa bath, walk in robe and covered balcony<br/># Three good sized bedrooms<br/># Modern bathroom with separate bath<br/># Separate toilet<br/># Blinds installed throughout<br/><br/>** PETS CONSIDERED UPON APPLICATION **<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: <br/>Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, Image Property will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All interested parties should rely upon their own enquiries in order to determine whether or not this information is in fact accurate. <br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: <br/>Legislation states that you must read the General Tenancy Agreement inclusive of any special terms prior to proceeding through our approval process. If applicable, you will receive this in due course, however please contact our office if you do need this at any stage.','house','Alderley',-27.42531247,153.00483012,4051,'Qld','60 Alderley Avenue','Alderley',2,4,2,'Image Property - Brisbane Northside','Garage: 2'),(2461,'Heart Of Reservoir',650,'Located in and amongst the Oakhill Estate. This three bedroom unit, will be sure to impress. Comprising of three bedrooms, all with laminate flooring, main bedroom with walk in robe and ensuite. Separate living and dining area. Kitchen with ample cupboard space gas appliances and overlooking a ever spacious secure courtyard. Other features to this home include gas ducted heating throughout, secure alarm, remote lock up garage. All within close proximity to public transport and local amenitites.','unit','Reservoir',-37.71841161,145.01602614,3073,'Vic','2/13 O\'Dowd Street','Reservoir',2,3,2,'hockingstuart - Preston','Carport: 1, Garage: 1, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 2'),(2462,'Boutique Block Living | Furnished 2BR Near Beach, Trams & Cafés',750,'Please Note: Open for inspection times and property availability are subject to change or cancellation. To receive updates on any changes, please register your details prior to attending an inspection.<br/><br/>Elevated on the first floor at the rear of a charming 1950s block surrounded by beautifully maintained communal gardens, this furnished apartment offers the generous proportions and solid build quality synonymous with classic homes.<br/><br/>Bathed in natural light and enjoying leafy outlooks throughout, the home welcomes you via a central hallway with polished floorboards that flow into an ultra-spacious living and dining area complete with gas heating - creating a warm and inviting space to relax or entertain.<br/><br/>The kitchen is thoughtfully designed with excellent storage and functionality, featuring a dedicated dining zone with built-in table and banquette seating - perfect for meals, working from home or casual gatherings.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>- Two generous bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>- Oversized light-filled living and dining area with gas heater<br/>- Kitchen with integrated dining space and banquette seating<br/>- Central bathroom with shower-over-bath and laundry facilities<br/>- Polished floorboards<br/>- Secure parking space included<br/>- Positioned at the rear of the block for added privacy<br/>-Water is INCLUDED IN RENT!<br/><br/>Ideally located toward the leafy end of Tennyson Street, the apartment is just moments from St Kilda Botanical Gardens and within walking distance to trams along Brighton Road, as well as the vibrant shopping, dining and café precincts of Carlisle Street and Acland Street, plus the beach.<br/><br/>Offering space, character and a move-in ready lifestyle in one of the area\'s most desirable pockets, this is an excellent opportunity for tenants seeking comfort, convenience and classic charm.<br/><br/>*** Furnished Property Disclosure – Belle Property St Kilda & Brighton ***<br/>Please note that this property is advertised as furnished. The photos used in this listing are not reflective of the furniture provided as part of the lease. <br/>As per our instructions to owners, the following items will be provided : Bed(s) and mattress(es); Fridge; Washing machine (if laundry taps are installed); Bedside table/s; Sofa(s); Coffee table; TV; TV unit; Dining table and chairs.<br/><br/>Please be aware that items such as linens, pillows, quilts, sheets, towels, cutlery, crockery, cookware, glassware, decorative items, or stationery are not standard inclusions in furnished rentals managed by Belle Property St Kilda and Brighton.<br/>Any such items left at the property are at the owner\'s discretion. If you require confirmation of specific furnishings, we strongly recommend contacting our agency prior to submitting your application.','apartment','Elwood',-37.87286987,144.98640411,3184,'Vic','9/3 Tennyson Street','Elwood',1,2,1,'Belle Property - St Kilda','Open Spaces: 1, Built-in Wardrobes, Furnished'),(2463,'Elevated Bright and Spacious Two Bedroom - Close to Transport',630,'APPLICATION APPROVED // DEPOSIT TAKEN This modern two bedroom unit above a retail shop with separate entrance is situated in the heart of Camberwell and benefits from the best of everything Toorak Rd has to offer, from the cafes and restaurants to the convenience of the local Cafe, gourmet supermarket, beauty salons, home ware shops and the list goes on. With trams at your doorstep and Burwood train station just a short walk this property offers the perfect combination of convenience and style. There are floor boards throughout, the stylish kitchen has stone bench tops, stainless steel appliances including gas cook top and dishwasher. There is a fantastic rectangular shaped open plan living/dining area with reverse cycle air conditioner that allows for a flexible use of space and opens onto the fantastic private deck. Both bedrooms are a good size and have built in wardrobes and reverse cycle air conditioning. The central bathroom has a separate shower and bath tub. Additional features include ducted heating, separate laundry, separate powder room, balcony off master bedroom and two outdoor deck areas. Don\'t miss this opportunity to benefit from a fresh and clean build with the convenience to match.<br/>Parking permit available for parking in Glencairn Avenue.','apartment','Camberwell',-37.84846911,145.08044229,3124,'Vic','1205a Toorak Road','Camberwell',1,2,2,'Belle Property - Glen Iris','Balcony, Deck, Fully Fenced, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Floorboards, Intercom, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Split-system Air Conditioning'),(2464,'Put simply, welcome to Adamstown',940,'Low-maintenance living meets smart, modern updates in this beautifully refreshed four-bedroom, two-bathroom home, perfectly positioned close to everything Adamstown has to offer. Freshly painted internally and thoughtfully improved throughout, this is a home designed for easy, comfortable living.<br/><br/>Inside, the open-plan layout creates a welcoming and practical living space, complete with air conditioning, updated vinyl plank flooring, and ceiling fans throughout the home for year-round comfort. Plantation shutters are also due to be installed, adding both privacy and a polished finish. The renovated kitchen features sleek finishes, quality appliances, and excellent storage, making it as functional as it is stylish.<br/><br/>All four bedrooms are well-sized and privately positioned, each fitted with ceiling fans and offering flexibility for families, guests, or those working from home. The brand-new main bathroom presents beautifully with modern finishes, while the second bathroom adds further convenience for busy households.<br/><br/>Step outside and you’ll find the true highlight — a fantastic covered deck perfect for entertaining, overlooking a plunge pool and a dedicated seating area that could easily be utilised as a fire pit zone. A second fenced, sun-drenched yard on the northern side provides additional outdoor space for kids, pets, or a veggie garden.<br/><br/>Located within walking distance to Adamstown cafés, shops and schools, and just minutes to The Junction, Merewether Beach, Westfield Kotara, Fernleigh Track and Adamstown Station, this home offers lifestyle and convenience in equal measure.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>-Fully updated four-bedroom, two-bathroom home<br/>-Freshly painted internally<br/>-Brand-new main bathroom plus second bathroom<br/>-Open-plan living with air conditioning and modern flooring<br/>-Ceiling fans throughout<br/>-Plantation shutters to be installed<br/>-Renovated kitchen with quality app