e flows effortlessly onto a private balcony, creating the perfect setting for morning coffee or relaxed evening entertaining.<br/>The sleek kitchen combines functionality and style, complete with an electric stovetop, dishwasher and ample storage to meet all your everyday needs.<br/>Accommodation comprises three generously sized, carpeted bedrooms, split systems in each room providing warmth and comfort throughout. The master bedroom is thoughtfully appointed with its own split system and a private ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms are serviced by a modern central bathroom.<br/>With the added benefit of a secure single garage car space, this brand new home delivers the perfect blend of comfort, style and practicality, all within easy reach of local shops, schools, parklands and public transport.','house','Heidelberg Heights',-37.74294700,145.05074800,3081,'Vic','2/11 Shelley St','Heidelberg Heights',2,3,1,'Melbourne Leasing','Garage: 1'),(2554,'Brand New Family Oasis in Sunnybank Hills – Fully Renovated, Spacious, and in Top School Catchment!',1050,'Step inside this stunning, fully renovated family home that truly has it all! Every detail has been refreshed, from the brand new kitchen and sparkling new bathrooms to fresh paint and stylish finishes throughout. With multiple split system air conditioners, year-round comfort is guaranteed for the whole family.<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned in the highly sought-after Sunnybank Hills State School catchment—Queensland’s top-ranked primary school—this home is ideal for families who want the very best for their children. Enjoy four generous bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, two modern bathrooms (plus two separate toilets), and expansive living zones including a huge rumpus room for family fun.<br/><br/>The open-plan kitchen is the heart of the home, seamlessly connecting to light-filled living and dining spaces. Entertain, relax, or work from home in absolute comfort, with multiple split system air conditioners and a do