. A dedicated study nook further adds flexibility, ideal for working from home, study sessions or managing household tasks.<br/><br/>Comfort is assured year-round with air-conditioning in both the lounge room and master bedroom, complemented by ceiling fans throughout the home to maintain airflow and energy efficiency.<br/><br/>Stepping outside, the covered patio creates an inviting outdoor entertaining area, perfect for weekend barbecues or relaxed afternoons with family and friends. The fully fenced yard provides privacy and security, making it suitable for children to play safely while remaining low maintenance. A double lock-up garage completes the package, offering secure parking and additional storage options.<br/><br/>This home combines a practical floor plan, modern inclusions, and a sought-after location just minutes from schools, shops, and dining, offering families comfort, convenience, and lifestyle appeal.<br/><br/>Features we think you will love:<br/>- Three bedrooms with built-in-robes<br/>- Main bedroom features ensuite and built-in-robes<br/>- Two bathrooms with separate toilet<br/>- Separate carpeted lounge room<br/>- Combined spacious living/dining room<br/>- Study nook<br/>- Modern kitchen fitted with stainless steel fixtures<br/>- Air-conditioning in lounge room and main bedroom, <br/>- Ceiling fans throughout<br/>- Situated in a quiet street<br/>- Covered Patio<br/>- Double lock up garage<br/>- Fully fenced yard<br/><br/>Breakdown of each room:<br/>Master Bedroom (1):<br/>– Airconditioned & Ceiling fan<br/>– Built-in Wardrobe<br/>– Ensuite Attached<br/>– Carpeted<br/><br/>Bedroom 2 & 3:<br/>– Ceiling fan<br/>– Built-in Wardrobe<br/>– Carpeted<br/><br/>Kitchen<br/>– Large fridge space <br/>– Dishwasher<br/>– Oven<br/>– Electric Cooktop<br/><br/>School Zone:<br/>Meridan State College<br/>Talara Primary College<br/><br/>If you have any questions about this property, please see FAQ\'s below:<br/><br/>FAQ<br/><br/>Can we have pets?<br/>– Yes, pets a