e wine fridge, all perfectly attuned to both entertaining and everyday enjoyment.<br/><br/>Two beautifully scaled bedrooms combine sitting areas, extensive built-in storage and access to sublime bathrooms. Each designer sanctuary features sculptural curved showers with Calacatta finger tiles, modern pedestal basins, marble accents and Ivory Travertine flooring, while the main ensuite elevates indulgence with a freestanding bathtub.<br/><br/>Further appointments include climate control, underfloor heating and heated towel rails to the bathrooms, floating cabinetry in the living zone and a walk-in dressing area to the main bedroom. <br/><br/>Fronting level one with lift access at the door, side-by-side basement parking and a roller-door storage unit, this exceptional residence delivers secure, low-maintenance luxury. Its prized position places boutique shopping, fine dining, cinemas, city transport and the beachfront all within easy reach, the very requisites of blue-chip Brighton living.','apartment','Brighton',-37.91440929,144.99336609,3186,'Vic','5/15 Well Street','Brighton',2,2,2,'Buxton - Brighton','Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning, Dishwasher'),(2766,'Neat & Tidy 3-Bedroom Home with Large Backyard',450,'**** IMPORTANT INFORMATION FOR PROSPECTIVE RENTERS ****<br/>Please carefully read the following instructions before proceeding with any further actions. <br/><br/>We require you to inspect the property before you are able to submit an application.<br/><br/>To book an inspection via realestate.com.au, click on the \"Request an Inspection\" button.<br/>To book an inspection via Domain.com.au, click on the \"Book with Inspect Real Estate\" button.<br/>To book via RayWhiteBallarat.com.au, click on the \"book an Inspection\" button.<br/><br/>Once you have inspected the property you will be given a code which will allow you to submit an application for the property if you choose to do so.<br/>Applications received with missing or insufficient information are not able t