ind and recharge under the Brisbane sky. Here you\'ll find:<br/>• The wellness club with yoga, sauna, outdoor and indoor gyms;<br/>• A pool deck with outdoor lap pool and spa;<br/>• Versatile living spaces: diner, rumpus room, common room, games room and media room;<br/>• Shared places to work, study, meet and focus;<br/>• A private dining room with butler\'s kitchen;<br/>• Outdoor entertaining with barbecues, green spaces, a bush tucker garden and pet retreat with pet wash.<br/><br/>Settle into your new life seamlessly with our services and support, including:<br/>• On-site repair and maintenance manager, customer service and management;<br/>• Secure parcel acceptance and storage for online deliveries;<br/>• Your choice of secure leases and terms;<br/>• Electricity and high-speed broadband access from move in;<br/>• Fridge, microwave, dishwasher, oven, washing machine and dryer included in the rent;<br/>• Pets welcome;<br/>• Optional furniture packages;<br/>• Freedom to hang art, paint walls and make your home your own.<br/><br/>LIV Anura is located on Skyring Terrace near the riverfront in Newstead, just 2km north-east of Brisbane CBD.<br/><br/>Delivering a new village heart for the Newstead neighbourhood, it\'s moments to fashionable cafés and dining, and also:<br/>• 300m to the CityGlider bus stop;<br/>• 600m to Woolworths Newstead and Gasworks Plaza;<br/>• 3-minute walk to Waterfront Park and the riverwalk;<br/>• Short stroll to Total Fusion Platinum Newstead, Studio Pilates and many more health and fitness options;<br/>• 15-minute walk to the design boutiques and dining spots of James Street, Fortitude Valley;<br/>• 7-minute drive to Howard Smith Wharves.<br/><br/>LIV Anura is Brisbane\'s first community built especially for renters brought to you by Mirvac, the pioneering leader in creating communities exclusively for renters. LIV communities are founded on principles of long-term security and fairness, social connection and stand-out experiences, delivered t