s and generous storage<br/>- Two comfortable bedrooms, main with built-in robe and sitting nook outlook<br/>- Neatly presented bathroom plus European laundry off the kitchen<br/>- Crisp white interiors with plantation shutters<br/>- Air conditioning and ceiling fans<br/>- Garage space steps from entrance plus second parking bay<br/>- Pets considered upon application<br/>- 6-month lease with option to renew','apartment','Warriewood',-33.69182845,151.28922806,2102,'NSW','15/153 Garden Street','Warriewood',1,2,2,'McGrath Pittwater - Avalon Beach','Carport: 1, Garage: 1, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Living Areas: 1, Pets Allowed'),(2975,'In the heart of the Mount Buller alpine region',600,'23 Changue Rd - Merrijig <br/><br/>Enjoy the ultimate alpine lifestyle just minutes from Mount Buller and its world-class ski slopes.<br/><br/>This spacious 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom rental is perfectly suited for larger families or groups seeking comfort, convenience, and year-round adventure. With generous living areas and plenty of room for everyone to unwind, it\'s an ideal base for people who work at Mt Buller and families who love the snow. <br/><br/>More features:<br/>• Upstairs Master bedroom with spa bath ensuite and study nook<br/>• Open-plan living, dining and kitchen with premium European appliances<br/>• Powder room, laundry & dedicated drying room <br/>• Expansive deck with BBQ and entertaining area<br/>• Wood fireplace <br/>• Ceiling fans, multiple split-system air conditioners, and wall heaters for year-round comfort<br/>• Large undercover carport plus extra parking<br/>• Ample wood storage & 210L Gas Bottle storage<br/>• Stunning Mt Buller views<br/>• Storeroom with secure lock-up workshop<br/><br/>Contact our Property Management Team today on [REDACTED PHONE] for an inspection. Please apply for the property on RealEstate.com <br/><br/>**Disclaimer**<br/>All information about the property has been provided to Ray White by third parties. Ray White has not verified the information and does not warrant its accuracy or completeness. Parties should make and rely on their own enquiries in relation to the property.','house','Merrijig',-37.11126091,146.35472325,3723,'Vic','23 Changue Road','Merrijig',3,4,1,'Team Canavan Ray White - Mansfield','Carport: 1, Ensuite: 3'),(2976,'Cute Home in a Great Location',490,'You may apply online here: https://bit.ly/3pSLjlI<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- 3 bedrooms with new carpet to be installed prior to tenancy <br/>- Open plan living & kitchen<br/>- Air conditioner <br/>- Undercover deck <br/>- Large yard with 2x sheds <br/>- Updated bathroom <br/>- Great location, walk to school, town or the beach<br/><br/>Lease Details:<br/>$490 per week<br/>$1960 bond<br/>Pets will be considered upon application','house','West Ulverstone',-41.14968128,146.15752329,7315,'Tas','80 Josephine Street','West Ulverstone',1,3,2,'Harcourts Ulverstone & Penguin',NULL),(2977,'HIDDEN GEM IN BUNINYONG',450,'PRD EXPRESS APPROVAL PROPERTY - Inspect the property in the comfort of your home with our 3D Virtual Tour.<br/>Once you have reviewed all photos, simply apply by clicking the \'Apply Now\' button on our website.<br/>Alternatively enter your details by clicking the \"Get in touch\" button on this page and you will receive information on how to apply.<br/>Your application will be processed within 3-5 business days by our Leasing team, then submitted to the Rental Provider<br/>If your application has been shortlisted we will schedule a private inspection.<br/><br/>PRD Ballarat is proud to present for lease 209 Nolan Street, Buninyong!<br/><br/>• 3 Bedrooms: 3 bedrooms, all with built in robes<br/>• Family Bathroom: Offering shower, bath, vanity and toilet.<br/>• Kitchen: 900MM Gas cooktop and oven, dishwasher and ample storage. All appliances are stainless steel.<br/>• Separate dining area leading out to rear decking area<br/>• Separate lounge room.<br/>• Heating/cooling: Split system heating and cooling to the lounge area<br/>• Full laundry off the decking area.<br/>• Rear alfresco area, perfect for entertaining and casual dining.<br/>• Enclosed rear yard with low maintenance lawns and plants<br/>• Landscaped front yard with well-established plants/lawns.<br/>• Parking: Lock up shed to the rear of the block with ample driveway space for additional vehicles<br/>• Walking distance to Buninyong Village<br/>• Close to local Schools and shops<br/>• Short drive to Delacombe Town Centre.<br/>• Short drive to Ballarat City Centre.<br/>• Close to upcoming Education and Shopping Precincts.<br/>• 12 Month lease term.<br/>• Pets upon application.<br/><br/>Please note: It is the responsibility of the renter to check/research availability of internet access at any property.','house','Buninyong',-37.65662710,143.87765630,3357,'Vic','209 Nolan Street','Buninyong',1,3,2,'PRD - Ballarat','Garage: 2'),(2978,'Stunning Family Home',950,'Apply via TApp <br/>t-app.com.au/c21pereira <br/><br/>A must to inspect this large family home. <br/><br/>Freshly painted throughout this home offers featuring many living areas. Lounge room with French doors & dining room. Family room off the kitchen plus separate rumpus room with closed study. Open kitchen with Caesar-stone, stainless steel appliances & dishwasher. Massive master bedroom with \"his and hers\" walk-in robe & ensuite. <br/><br/>Additional features include ducted air conditioning throughout spectacular dining pavilion, plus a separate barbecue area with pitched roof pergola. Triple garage with internal access to the home. <br/><br/>- 4 Bedrooms <br/>- Built in robes <br/>- Ensuite and walk in robe to main bedroom <br/>- Ducted Air Conditioning <br/>- Rumpus Room <br/>- Stainless steel appliances <br/>- Dishwasher <br/>- Large Pergola <br/>- Fully fenced private back yard <br/>- Triple Garage with internal access <br/>- Short walk to transport and schools <br/><br/>** No registration required to attend the open house. You will be checked on arrival. <br/><br/>*Century 21 Pereira Group believes all information contained herein is accurate at the time of advertising. However, we encourage interested parties to conduct their own enquiries.','house','Harrington Park',-34.03063034,150.74850068,2567,'NSW','12 Harrison Avenue','Harrington Park',2,4,3,'Century 21 Pereira Group - HARRINGTON PARK','Open Spaces: 3'),(2979,'Newport Station. Lifestyle & Convenience Combined',490,'Perfectly positioned in a quiet, well-maintained complex, this stylish apartment offers low-maintenance living with quality finishes and everyday convenience.<br/>Features include:<br/>• One bedroom with built in robe<br/>• Light filled open plan living & dining area, seamlessly extending to a charming Juliet balcony <br/>• Modern kitchen complete with dishwasher<br/>• Central bathroom with toilet<br/>• European laundry<br/>• Ducted heating and cooling throughout for year-round comfort<br/>• Automatic blinds for added ease and privacy<br/>• Secure car space plus storage cage<br/>Situated in the vibrant suburb of Newport, you’ll enjoy:<br/>• Walking distance to Newport Railway Station for an easy CBD commute<br/>• Close proximity to local cafés, restaurants and boutique shops<br/>• Easy access to Williamstown waterfront and parklands<br/><br/>WE KINDLY RECOMMEND REGISTERING FOR INSPECTIONS AND/OR CHECKING TIMES ON THE INTERNET 24 HOURS PRIOR TO BE KEPT UPDATED OF CANCELLATIONS.','apartment','Newport',-37.84212482,144.88211799,3015,'Vic','19/4 Mason Street','Newport',1,1,1,'Jas Stephens Real Estate','Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Floorboards, Intercom, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 1'),(2980,'BRAND NEW SHARED ACCOMMODATION',375,'With an emphasis on design, functionality and flow, here is your chance to secure a unique shared accommodation opportunity. There are 3 rooms to choose from.<br/><br/>Featuring quality fixtures and fittings throughout, spacious bedroom with an ensuite, built in robe and a private courtyard. The property is fully furnished and the bedroom comes with a queen bed and mattress, a flat screen TV, a bed, side table, tall boy, couch and bar fridge. Each room also has its own split system unit. The internal common kitchen is fully furnished and comes with all new appliances. The front and rear yards have been fully landscaped.<br/><br/>This property offers all you would need in a share home. All bills are included. <br/><br/>***Inspect by pre-registration only, attendance limits are capped and all attendees must be pre-registered, please contact the agent to secure your spot. Failure to pre-register will result in refusal of entry***','house','Bonshaw',-37.59689739,143.81194461,3352,'Vic','1/29 Webb Road','Bonshaw',1,1,1,'Buxton - Ballarat','Garage: 1, Living Areas: 1'),(2981,'Entertainers deck - Great Location - Air Conditioning',700,'Ray White Holland Park is proud to present 51 Keats Street Cannon Hill. The super location of this 3 bedroom home puts you a stones throw away from public transport, Westfield Carindale, Gateway Motorway and many sought after local schools. Some of the great features include:<br/><br/>- Huge eat in kitchen with plenty of room for a large dining table<br/>- Air conditioned living room with ceiling fan and large built in cabinetry<br/>- All 3 bedrooms feature ceiling fans, built in robes and flyscreens<br/>- Great size bathroom, shower over bath and additional 2nd powder room<br/>- Rear covered entertainers deck with a private tropical outlook<br/><br/>Additional features include an internal laundry and 1 lockup garage.<br/><br/>***Please note - the rent will increase to $750 per week after the first 2 months***<br/><br/>TO INSPECT & APPLY Click on the \'\'Request an Inspection\'\' button and follow the prompts. You will then receive an email from Snug listing either inspection times for you to register or advising there are no inspections currently available. Should another inspection time be opened, you will be notified at that time. We encourage you to submit your application online via Snug. Please visit our company website \'\'Ray White Holland Park\'\', drop the search status to \'\'Rent\'\' and then find your property address and then click on \'\'Apply for this Property.\'\'','house','Cannon Hill',-27.47104309,153.08993399,4170,'Qld','51 Keats Street','Cannon Hill',1,3,1,'Ray White Holland Park - HOLLAND PARK','Balcony, Deck, Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Pets Allowed'),(2982,'2 Bedrooms Apartment- brand‑new floorboards',580,'This stylish sixth‑floor apartment delivers the perfect blend of modern comfort and low‑maintenance living in one of Kensington’s most desirable pockets. Inside, the home has been beautifully refreshed with brand‑new floorboards, creating a warm and contemporary feel throughout the open‑plan living and dining area. while sliding doors open to a private balcony—ideal for morning coffee or unwinding after a long day. The sleek, modern kitchen features stainless steel appliances and excellent storage, making everyday living effortless.<br/>Two generous double bedrooms with built‑in robes provide peaceful retreats, serviced by a stylish central bathroom. Secure building entry and an allocated car space add convenience and peace of mind, completing an exceptional lifestyle package.<br/>Step outside and you’re moments from the vibrant cafés, shops, and tram routes along Macaulay Road, with South Kensington Station and the leafy surrounds of Holland Park even closer—everything you need is right at your doorstep.','apartment','Kensington',-37.79741898,144.92614564,3031,'Vic','609/72 Altona Street','Kensington',1,2,1,'Pagan Real Estate - TRAVANCORE','Open Spaces: 1'),(2983,'Renovated Perfection in a Prime Lifestyle Hub',630,'Experience the best of Marrickville living in this beautifully transformed Studio Apartment. Architecturally refreshed with a clean, contemporary aesthetic, the home features floating floors, a designer-inspired kitchen, and updated bathroom. <br/>Positioned for ultimate convenience, you are minutes away from the Enmore Road precinct, leafy parks, and seamless transport links. It\'s an ideal low-maintenance lifestyle.<br/><br/>Completely renovated studio apartment<br/>Modern kitchen with updated appliances<br/>New Built-in and storage cupboards<br/>Stylishly renovated bathroom<br/>Clean throughout<br/>Floating floors for a sleek, contemporary feel<br/>Share Laundry<br/>Close to schools, parks, shops, restaurants, and bars<br/>Easy access to public transport<br/><br/>All registration via snug.com , any enquires to [REDACTED EMAIL] or [REDACTED PHONE]. All Applications Welcome on snug.com, Inspections by appointment or Open For Inspection','studio','Marrickville',-33.90465389,151.16108184,2204,'NSW','4/68 illawarra Road','Marrickville',1,3,2,'Ray White - Dulwich Hill',NULL),(2984,'Stunning Brand New 4 Bedroom Home Close to Beautiful Local Beaches',590,'Be the first to call this stunning four-bedroom home in Burrum Heads home. Ideally located close to beautiful local beaches and the ever-popular Burrum River, this brand new residence offers the perfect blend of modern comfort and relaxed coastal lifestyle.<br/><br/>The spacious master bedroom is privately positioned and features air conditioning, a walk-in robe and a stylish ensuite. The remaining three bedrooms are all generously sized and include built-in robes and ceiling fans, ensuring comfort all year round.<br/><br/>The main bathroom is thoughtfully designed with quality fixtures and fittings, complete with a bath for relaxing at the end of the day.<br/><br/>At the heart of the home, the modern kitchen showcases gas cooking and a dishwasher, seamlessly flowing into the open plan living and dining area. A separate media or living room provides valuable additional space, ideal for movie nights, home workspace or a quiet sitting room.<br/><br/>Step outside to the undercover patio, perfect for entertaining or enjoying your morning coffee while overlooking the fully fenced backyard. The property also includes a double lock-up garage and low-maintenance gardens for easy living.<br/><br/>Offering space, style and an enviable coastal location, this brand new home presents an outstanding opportunity to enjoy everything Burrum Heads has to offer.<br/><br/>*Please note: Our office accepts applications before inviting any prospective applicant to an inspection*<br/><br/>Applications are submitted via Snug.com or Click Get in Touch to ensure you don\'t miss out on calling this new to market property your home.<br/>If you have any questions or would like to chat about the property, please call our office on [REDACTED PHONE] so we can further assist you.<br/>**Full terms and conditions of tenancy agreement available from the office**<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, Harcourts Ignite will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All interested parties should rely upon their own enquiries in order to determine whether or not this information is in fact accurate.','house','Burrum Heads',-25.18875023,152.61234493,4659,'Qld','12 Ocean Edge Road','Burrum Heads',2,4,2,'Harcourts - Hervey Bay','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(2985,'Fully Renovated 3 Bedroom Home with Pool and Entertaining Area',1350,'This beautifully fully renovated 3- bedroom home offers modern comfort , stylish finishes and the perfect outdoor entertaining area. Located close to schools , parks and walking distance to Matraville Shops and a short distance to Westfield Shopping Centre. <br/><br/>Features Include :<br/>• 3 Bedrooms with built in wardrobes<br/>• Modern fully renovated kitchen with quality appliances and plenty of storage<br/>• Air Conditioning<br/>• Floorboards in living areas<br/>• Renovated Bathroom <br/>• Swimming Pool <br/>• BBQ Area <br/>• Bar Area perfect for outdoor entertaining <br/>• LUG with two outdoor car spaces<br/>All enquiries contact Nicole Watson [REDACTED PHONE] [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/><br/>','house','Matraville',-33.95564775,151.23131315,2036,'NSW','221 Beauchamp Road','Matraville',1,3,3,'Ray White Park Coast East','Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Floorboards, Toilets: 2');
INSERT INTO `data` VALUES (2986,'Spectacularly Renovated Home With Pool and Panoramic Views',2800,'Discover the perfect blend of luxury and tranquility in this remarkable 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom haven with panoramic water views and a sparkling pool. Recently renovated to the highest standards, this home boasts brand new appliances, offering you a lifestyle of comfort and sophistication.<br/><br/>- Renovated with the highest quality materials<br/>- Brand new kitchen with Swiss appliances <br/>- Four bedrooms plus a study<br/>- Ducted air-conditioning throughout - every room individually controlled<br/>- Double glazed windows and doors throughout<br/>- Beautiful open plan Living & Dining<br/>- Multiple Balconies with magnificent views of Sailors Bay<br/>- Pool with water views<br/>- Long term 2-year lease available<br/><br/>This property is more than just a house; it\'s a place where memories are made and cherished. Every living space and bedroom boasts sensational views of Sailors Bay. Don\'t miss the opportunity to call this stunning abode your own. Experience the epitome of modern luxury with every convenience at your fingertips. <br/><br/>In the interest of protecting our tenants against leaking of any personal data, please only pay your holding deposit to our agency upon receiving approval from DiJONES Real Estate. You will then receive a remittance, in the form of a trust account receipt, from DiJONES to confirm receipt of your deposit.','house','Castlecrag',-33.80168039,151.22703474,2068,'NSW','50 Linden Way','Castlecrag',3,4,2,'DiJones - Neutral Bay','Balcony, Garage: 2, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(2987,'Stunning beach setting, this spacious sun-drenched residence features a large balcony.',600,'This spacious sun-drenched residence features a large balcony. Walk to the breathtaking Narrabeen beach and opposite a tranquil lake setting. Short distance to shops, restaurants, cafes and transport.<br/><br/>Features:<br/><br/>- One double sized bedroom<br/>- Well appointment bathroom with shower over bath<br/>- Light filled kitchen with gas cooking<br/>- Large combined lounge and dining<br/>- Spacious balcony<br/>- Off street single parking<br/>- Internal laundry within bathroom<br/>- Perfectly positioned to Narrabeen surf beach.<br/><br/>In the interest of protecting our tenants against leaking of any personal data, please only pay your holding deposit to our agency upon receiving approval from DiJONES Real Estate. You will then receive a remittance, in the form of a trust account receipt, from DiJONES to confirm receipt of your deposit.<br/>','apartment','Narrabeen',-33.70586200,151.30250640,2101,'NSW','4/127 Lagoon Street','Narrabeen',1,1,1,'DiJones - Neutral Bay','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1'),(2988,'Newly Renovated 4 Bedroom Home',1450,'Set on a sun-drenched block in a sought-after pocket of Frenchs Forest, this single level home is ideal for families seeking space, comfort, and convenience. Recently renovated, the home presents like new inside and offers bright, versatile living just moments from Skyline Shops, Forestway Shopping Centre, local schools, and City, Chatswood, and Beaches bus transport.<br/><br/>The home features four bedrooms, a tidy bathroom with additional W/C, formal lounge and dining areas, plus a sunroom. A spacious kitchen with gas cooktop and ample storage opens to an outdoor entertaining deck overlooking a level, child-friendly grassed yard.<br/><br/>Additional comforts include reverse cycle air conditioning, gas heating, internal laundry, and a single carport. <br/><br/>Available for lease now – don\'t miss this opportunity in a highly sought after location, close to local shops, transport, parks, and Northern Beaches Hospital.<br/>','house','Frenchs Forest',-33.74931701,151.24235912,2086,'NSW','17 Harmston Avenue','Frenchs Forest',2,4,1,'LJ Hooker - Dee Why','Carport: 1, Toilets: 3'),(2989,'Beautiful Family Sanctuary * Please note this property is only available for short term lease only *',1450,'* Please note this property is only available for short term lease only *<br/><br/>This beautifully maintained character home is set on a sprawling 944sqm block, surrounded by lush, mature greenery for ultimate privacy and tranquility. The residence exudes classic charm with its soaring ceilings, polished timber floors, and an elegant facade. <br/><br/>This property is unfurnished<br/><br/>The property features the following:<br/><br/>• 4 generous size bedrooms<br/>• Open plan kitchen and dining<br/>• Modern kitchen with Miele appliances, ample storage and a breakfast bar<br/>• Beautiful living room upstairs <br/>• Teenagers retreat downstairs<br/>• 2 extra multi-purpose rooms downstairs with extra storage<br/>• Well appointed bathroom with separate toilet<br/>• Air conditioning to all bedrooms and living rooms including teenagers retreat downstairs<br/>• Sprawling deck for entertaining<br/>• Stunning pool for those hot summer days<br/>• 4 car carport with the height to fit a caravan<br/>• Room to put seating under a beautiful sprawling tree<br/>• Fully fenced yard<br/><br/>Close to shops, transport and parks, Oakleigh State School and Kelvin Grove College catchment.<br/><br/>If you are interested in viewing this property, please register your interest to be notified of upcoming open homes.','acreage/semi-rural','Ashgrove',-27.43965700,152.99568479,4060,'Qld','32 Yardley Ave','Ashgrove',2,4,4,'Better Homes And Gardens Real Estate - Connect','Carport: 2, Garage: 2'),(2990,'2 BEDROOM GRANNY FLAT',600,'This modern and private two‑bedroom granny flat provides low‑maintenance, single‑level living with a fenced grassed yard. Ideally positioned within easy reach of Asquith Train Station, local shops, quality schools, and Hornsby Westfield.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- Two carpeted bedrooms with built‑in wardrobes<br/>- Modern kitchen with gas cooking and dishwasher<br/>- Tiled open-plan living<br/>- Combined bathroom and laundry<br/>- Split‑system air conditioning<br/>- Private, fully fenced grassy backyard<br/>- Single undercover parking space<br/><br/>In the interest of protecting our tenants against leaking of any personal data, please only pay your holding deposit to our agency upon receiving approval from DiJones Real Estate. You will then receive a remittance, in the form of a trust account receipt, from DiJones to confirm receipt of your deposit.','house','Hornsby',-33.69524293,151.10751950,2077,'NSW','77A Sherbrook Road','Hornsby',1,2,1,'DiJones Upper North Shore','Carport: 1, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes'),(2991,'Breezy Bayside Beauty in the Manly State School Catchment',720,'This highset home in the heart of Manly is situated in an elevated position to capture refreshing breezes and abundance of natural light. Located within the Manly State School catchment and walking distance to Manly train station, bring your family and enjoy the lifestyle you have been dreaming of on the beautiful bayside. With 3 bedrooms plus a sunroom and open plan living area, there is plenty of space to relax at the end of your busy day.<br/><br/>Property features:<br/>- 3 Bedrooms with ceiling fans (master has AIR CON and a standalone robe)<br/>- Main bathroom with separate toilet<br/>- Open plan, air conditioned living area<br/>- Updated kitchen with plenty of storage<br/>- Sunroom <br/>- Laundry space downstairs<br/>- Garage underneath for small car plus carport <br/>- Fully fenced with motorised gate<br/>- Large backyard<br/>- Manly State School catchment <br/><br/>Manly is approximately 26km from the Brisbane CBD and is a family-friendly community with an array of amenities on offer – some just a stone\'s throw away including public transport, schools, shops and parks. Located near the beautiful waterfront of Wynnum-Manly where you can enjoy weekend picnics, markets and strolls - your weekend entertainment is sorted! Secure the lifestyle you have been waiting for on the beautiful bayside.<br/><br/>Contact the agent