ter <br/>- Split system in second living area<br/>- Carport and access via side gate to the backyard <br/>- Garden shed<br/>- Covered entertaining area with enclosed yard<br/>- Walk to Kennington Village and lake','house','Strathdale',-36.77408754,144.31215980,3550,'Vic','4 Plante Court','Strathdale',1,3,1,'Bendigo Ballarat Real Estate - BENDIGO','Carport: 1, Fully Fenced, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Gas Heating, Living Areas: 2, Split-system Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1, Pets Allowed'),(3057,'Spacious, Secure & Stylish First-Floor Apartment',675,'This beautifully presented half-floor apartment combines space, light and style. Set quietly at the rear of a well-maintained and secure boutique block of just six, this first-floor retreat is bathed in natural light from the North, East and West, and has a secure undercover car space on title.<br/> <br/>Featuring polished timber floorboards throughout the living areas, new plush carpet in both bedrooms, and freshly painted throughout, the generous open-plan living and dining area is serviced by split-system air conditioning, which flows seamlessly onto a sunlit north-facing balcony with a leafy outlook - perfect for relaxing or entertaining.<br/> <br/>The contemporary kitchen offers a large pantry, abundant storage, and quality stainless-steel Bosch appliances, including a dishwasher. <br/> <br/>Both bedrooms are queen-sized with large built-in wardrobes, blackout blinds and ceiling fans. These are complemented by a sparkling central bathroom with a shower-over-bath, laundry facilities and floor-to-ceiling tiles, plus a separate powder room for added convenience. <br/> <br/>Ideally positioned just a short stroll from Fawkner Park, Prahran Market, South Yarra Station, the Royal Botanic Gardens, and vibrant Chapel Street, this home offers the ultimate South Yarra lifestyle. <br/> <br/>Additional highlights include walking distance to public transport in all directions, secure indoor bicycle storage space and inter