r dining setting with umbrella, cushioned daybed and a ready-made low maintenance potted garden and storage shed, its an entertainers haven with room to truly spread out. Enjoy breathtaking sunsets every evening in your own expansive private oasis.<br/><br/>One bedroom features private terrace access via its own door, creating a beautiful indoor-outdoor connection and further enhancing the homes spacious design. Comfort is assured year-round with ceiling fans and a split system, while the bathroom adds flair with stunning wallpaper, a heated towel rail, and thoughtful finishes.<br/><br/>Despite being moments from the CBD, evenings here are wonderfully dark and quiet, and the tree line surrounds, rare inner-city luxuries.<br/><br/>On site gym<br/><br/>IGA supermarket next door and Chemist Warehouse directly across the road<br/><br/>#1 tram at your doorstep to South Melbourne Beach or the CBD<br/><br/>5 minute walk to the Malthouse, Recital Centre, and Melbourne Theatre Company<br/><br/>10 minute walk to the NGV, Hamer Hall, State Theatre, and the newly opened Anzac train station<br/><br/>15 minute walk to Flinders Street Station, Sidney Myer Music Bowl, and Rod Laver Arena<br/><br/>Close by to the Botanic Gardens, Yarra River, Shrine of Remembrance and parklands<br/>               <br/>This is more than an apartment its a spacious, freshly revitalised lifestyle sanctuary in the heart of Southbank. <br/><br/>Dont miss out, inspect today!','apartment','Southbank',-37.82810492,144.96627330,3006,'Vic','2/161-173 Sturt Street','Southbank',1,2,1,'MICM - Melbourne CBD & Southbank','Garage: 1'),(3098,'\"LIGHT, BRIGHT, MODERN IN A CONVENIENT LOCATION AND A POOL IN THE BLOCK!\"',700,'This one bedroom security apartment has been renovated throughout in a fresh contemporary style. <br/><br/>It boasts spacious open-plan interiors, sleek finishes and an exceptional setting, perfect for enjoying the local lifestyle. <br/><br/>Highly central, it stands just a moments stroll fro