ed with built-in wardrobes, <br/>- Separate study/office sunroom/make what you wish for it. <br/>- Generous family/lounge room with a fully equipped wet bar overlooking Shipwrights Bay.<br/>- Huge kitchen/ separate dining with gas cooking appliances, Caesar stone bench top with ample cupboard/pantry space.<br/>- 2 bathrooms with floor-to-ceiling travertine tiles and his and hers shower and vanity basins. <br/>- Sun-drenched balcony with water views, pool and immaculate garden view, perfect for relaxing and entertaining. <br/>- Easy Garden area, no pool access, making it pet-friendly. <br/>- Travertine tiles throughout blend with designer Timber floorboards within bedrooms, providing easy cleaning and maintenance. <br/>- Air conditioning unit and Intercom.<br/><br/>\"AVAILABLE 3rd MARCH- INSPECT BY APPOINTMENT\"<br/><br/>To enquire via phone, call 1300 815 051 and enter code 2429','house','Blakehurst',-33.99548033,151.11299096,2221,'NSW','1/44a TOWNSON STREET','Blakehurst',2,2,1,'Property Now - BRISBANE CITY','Balcony, Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards, Intercom, Living Areas: 2, Study, Pets Allowed'),(3101,'SPACIOUS GARDEN APARTMENT!',925,'Situated close to the Yarra with all its charms and leafy views, is this amazing renovated three bedroom apartment with gorgeous wooden floors, two separate living areas and a study. <br/><br/>Offering an entry hall, separate dining room, spacious kitchen with gas cooking, a Bosch dishwasher and a breakfast bar opening to a light, bright living room that leads to the courtyard. <br/>Main bedroom with robes and an ensuite, second bedroom with built in robes, central bathroom with a separate wash closet. Second living area or 3rd bedroom. <br/><br/>Features include heating/cooling, tandem remote garage, separate laundry and lots of storage. <br/><br/>Brilliantly positioned close to shops, motorway and only moments to Toorak Village, Richmond and elite schools.<br/><br/>**PLEASE REGISTER YOUR INTEREST VIA EMAIL AND YOU WILL BE CONTACTED REGARDING VIEWING ARRANGEMENTS.**','apartment','Toorak',-37.83399200,145.01822000,3142,'Vic','1/4 Yarradale Road','Toorak',2,3,2,'Beck & Small Property - BRIGHTON','Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1'),(3102,'PENTHOUSE WITH PANORAMIC VIEWS',1850,'OPEN FOR INSPECTION AT 10:35AM - 10:55AM ON SATURDAY 28/02/2026<br/><br/>Rising above Chatswood from a commanding 28th-floor level, this luxury three bedroom residence in the acclaimed Regency building is available for lease now.<br/><br/>293sqm interior filled with natural light and defined by house-like proportions.<br/>Two living areas and three luxuriously appointed bedrooms, two with ensuites. Fully ducted air conditioning. Central kitchen fitted with top end appliances and a plumbed in fridge. Wrap around terrace with outdoor BBQ and dual entertaining decks.<br/><br/>Swimming pool, 24hr concierge service, secure entry and two carspaces.<br/><br/>Positioned within Chatswood\'s vibrant retail, dining and transport precinct, this residence pairs luxury with effortless convenience.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>- 24hr concierge attendance<br/>- Huge floor plan<br/>- Top end appliances<br/>- Three bedrooms and three bathrooms<br/>- Two separate lounge/dining rooms<br/>- Award winning balcony entertaining areas<br/>- Two swipe card access carspaces <br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>','apartment','Chatswood',-33.79532398,151.18189188,2067,'NSW','2803/2A Help Street','Chatswood',3,3,2,'Shead Property - Chatswood','Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Intercom, Pets Allowed'),(3103,'3 Bedroom Spacious Home!',580,'TO APPLY: please click \"Get in touch\" or \"Enquire\" & a link will be sent to you. Please also register for each inspection to be kept up to date with changes.<br/><br/>Safety First:<br/><br/>The safety of our tenants is our top priority. In accordance with the Residential Tenancies Act, this property has undergone