es. It is compulsory for all our renters to conduct a National Tenancy Data (NTD) base Check. Please register for each inspection for priority access & to inform our agents of your attendance. This will ensure you are kept up to date with any information regarding the property & any changes or cancellations of inspection times. To be kept informed of future inspections, please click \"Contact Agent\".<br/><br/>Photo ID is required for entry.<br/><br/>Covid safe policy applies.','house','Epping',-37.64378600,145.05616600,3076,'Vic','14 Pommel Crescent','Epping',1,3,2,'Harcourts Rata & Co','Courtyard, Open Spaces: 2, Built-in Wardrobes'),(3105,'Spacious 3 Bedroom Home in Mill Park',600,'TO APPLY: please click \"Get in touch\" or \"Enquire\" & a link will be sent to you. Please also register for each inspection to be kept up to date with changes.<br/><br/>Safety First:<br/><br/>The safety of our tenants is our top priority. In accordance with the Residential Tenancies Act, this property has undergone Gas, Electrical, and Smoke Alarm safety checks and was deemed compliant as of the listing date. Copies of the compliance reports will be made available to successful applicants upon request, as per the Residential Tenancies Act. <br/><br/>This well-presented home at 6 Karen Court, Mill Park offers comfortable family living in a quiet and convenient location. Designed with space and functionality in mind, the property is ideal for those seeking a practical layout with multiple living areas.<br/><br/>The home features an updated kitchen with an adjoining meals area, providing a welcoming space for everyday dining. A separate, generously sized lounge offers additional room to relax or entertain. Accommodation includes three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the master serviced by an ensuite and the remaining bedrooms conveniently located near the central bathroom.<br/><br/>Ducted heating and cooling ensure year-round comfort throughout the home, while solar panels helps reduce