erred northern rear aspect allowing an abundance of natural light all on a spacious 370sqm (approx.) allotment. <br/> <br/>Step inside into a flowing floor plan with high ornate ceilings, the home is complimented by superb extra wide limed floorboards leading through arched doorways to a large living room, downstairs bedroom, bathroom, fitted study and laundry. Upstairs has a further three double bedrooms with built-in robes; main bedroom with an ensuite, plus a family sized central bathroom. A full-width north-facing family dining area with a wall of glass blends indoor and outdoor living with a sleek architecturally designed kitchen with curved 2 Pack and wood veneer cupboards, Brazilian quartzite benchtops and Miele appliances. The sliding doors open through to a heritage inspired outdoor terrace and large backyard which includes an external multi-function room that can be used as a studio or future pool house. <br/> <br/>This property also includes newly upgraded 7-star energy features such external double glazed windows throughout, insulated floors and perimeter dense wall linings to ensure maximum comfort throughout the winter and summer months. Additional features include integrated alarm system, video intercom entry, security cameras, wireless surround sound, automatic gates to off-street parking gently shaded by a night-lit mature tree. <br/> <br/>This inner-city oasis is perfectly situated within a short stroll of the Yarra River precinct at the end of Crown Street, Melbourne renowned Maker Coffee Roasters, Victoria Gardens Shopping Centre as well as Mountain Goat Brewery and Brogans Gin Distillery. Moments from Swan Street and Bridge Road cafes with easy access to the Kew private school precinct, Melbourne Girls College and Yarra Primary School. Bridge Road trams provide for quick access to the MCG and Melbourne’s CBD. All adding to the desired inner city lifestyle benefits of a sought after Richmond address. <br/><br/>**To Inspect**<br/><br/>To book an inspection, click either the ‘Request Online Inspection Link’ or ‘Get in Touch’ then select ‘Request an Inspection’ to enter your details. An inspection invitation will then be sent to you via our application platform. If there are no available inspection times, or you cannot attend the listed time, please send an enquiry or contact the leasing agent for further assistance. Please note ‘add to plan’ is not booking into the inspection.<br/><br/>**Please Note** <br/><br/>Open for Inspection times and property availability is subject to change without notice. We highly recommend registering for an inspection you are going to attend to avoid disappointment for cancellations. If you are registered for an inspection, you will be notified by SMS if the inspection is cancelled. <br/><br/>**Caution** <br/><br/>Marshall White has exclusive leasing rights to this property. We do not advertise on Gumtree, Facebook Marketplace or any other social media platforms. Please beware of scammers and apply only via the official advertising link using the Snug platform.','house','Richmond',-37.81682400,145.01068200,3121,'Vic','41 Crown Street','Richmond',3,4,3,'Marshall White - Boroondara','Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Open Spaces: 3, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Floorboards, Intercom, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Rumpus Room, Study'),(3107,'A stunning family home that combines comfort and style.',790,'Welcome Home This spacious house features three generously sized bedrooms, each designed for relaxation and privacy.<br/><br/>With three modern bathrooms, including an ensuite in the master bedroom, you\'ll enjoy convenience and comfort for the whole family. The open-plan living area is perfect for entertaining, flowing seamlessly into the well-appointed kitchen.<br/><br/>The property also boasts a double garage, providing ample space for vehicles and additional storage. <br/><br/>Located in a quiet cul-de-sac, this home offer