iaco’s popular café strip, boutique shopping and public transport, including the train, with Perth CBD only minutes away.<br/><br/>Linen not provided<br/>Minimum Lease - 6 months <br/>','apartment','Subiaco',-31.94774893,115.82988010,6008,'WA','410/19 Olive Street','Subiaco',2,2,2,'Leasing Elite Pty Ltd','Balcony, Garage: 2, Gym, Furnished'),(3426,'Renovated Five-Bedroom Home in Prime Lyneham Location!',1200,'Recently renovated, this expansive five-bedroom, three-bathroom residence at 23 Owen Crescent offers contemporary design, premium finishes and versatile living in one of Lyneham’s most sought-after streets.<br/><br/>Behind its modest façade lies a striking transformation. The home showcases warm timber tones, textured feature walls, custom joinery and high-end finishes throughout, creating a cohesive and sophisticated aesthetic.<br/><br/>The heart of the home is the designer kitchen, featuring extensive cabinetry, quality appliances, generous bench space and a statement island ideal for entertaining. The open-plan living and dining areas are framed by large windows and sliding doors, seamlessly connecting indoors to the expansive covered deck with views over Lyneham wetland. <br/>Perfect for year-round entertaining.<br/><br/>Accommodation is both generous and flexible, with five well-proportioned bedrooms positioned across a thoughtful layout. The master suite is privately set and complemented by a beautifully finished ensuite. Two additional bathrooms are finished in contemporary tones with quality fixtures and fittings.<br/><br/>Multiple living zones provide excellent separation for families, shared households, or those working from home.<br/><br/>Outdoors, the property continues to impress with: <br/>- Large covered entertaining deck.<br/>- Secure backyard with lawn space.<br/>- Additional lower-level storage/workshop area.<br/>- Under cover off-street parking.<br/><br/>Additional features include: <br/>- Newly renovated throughout with excellent natural light.<br/>- Premium timber flooring.<br/>- Designer bathrooms with custom vanities.<br/>- Statement lighting and architectural detailing.<br/>- Fully insulated including double glazed windows.<br/>- Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning and ceiling fans.<br/>- Low utility bills with large solar system and rainwater tanks.<br/>- Dedicated laundry space.<br/><br/>Positioned in a quiet, tree-lined crescent, this home is within easy reach of local schools, parks, Lyneham shops, transport links and the City. A rear gate provides direct access to the Sullivans Creek bike path and Lyneham wetland.<br/><br/>Offering scale, style, and substance, this is a rare opportunity to secure a fully renovated family home in a tightly held Inner North location.<br/><br/>Please Note:<br/><br/>All prospective tenants must rely on their own enquiries as the owner or their respective agents, do not make any warranty as to the accuracy of the information provided above and do not or will not accept any liability for any errors, misstatements or discrepancies in that information.<br/><br/>We have diligently and conscientiously undertaken to ensure it is as current and as accurate as possible.<br/><br/>The tenant requires written consent from the lessor to keep a pet at the property.<br/>The tenant requires written consent from the lessor to make modifications to the property.<br/><br/>EER: 7.2<br/>This property does comply with the Minimum Ceiling Insulation standards.','house','Lyneham',-35.25642770,149.13041619,2602,'ACT','23 Owen Crescent','Lyneham',3,5,2,'PURNELL','Garage: 2'),(3427,'FABULOUS APARTMENT LIVING!',695,'To arrange a viewing please follow these instructions...<br/>1. Click on the \'EMAIL AGENT\' or BOOK AN INSPECTION TIME\" button<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection/viewing time or propose your own time<br/>3. If no viewing times are currently available, your registration will enable us to contact you when a new time is arranged<br/>PLEASE NOTE: If you do not registe