h easy access to Tonkin Highway for a smooth commute. You\'re just a short drive to Armadale Shopping Centre, as well as local primary and secondary schools, childcare centres and public transport options.<br/><br/>If you\'re seeking a pristine, never-lived-in home that offers space, functionality and modern comfort in a thriving community, this property is ready to welcome you.','house','Hilbert',-32.16484931,115.98863972,6112,'WA','8 Mulgrave Street','Hilbert',2,4,2,'The Property Project - PERTH','Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning, Study'),(3430,'Amazing Coastal Location Close to Shops & Schools!',550,'Available: 6th March 2026<br/><br/>Click \'Book an Inspection Time\' (at the bottom) to see currently scheduled open inspection times. <br/>Please register for any open inspections you will be attending or register your interest so that we can advise of new times/ unexpected changes*<br/><br/>Conveniently located on a quiet street within a short walk to local shops, medical services, public transport, schools and the beach.<br/>This three bedroom home offers some great features with a well equipped kitchen with loads of storage and views to the large rear yard, making it easy to keep an eye on the kids or family pet. <br/>The lounge room is to the front of the home, with lovely big windows and brand new split system for all year round comfort. The dining area has sliding door access to the outdoor paved entertaining area. All three bedrooms are generous in size, with robes fitted to two of them. <br/>The main bathroom is clean and tidy with bath and separate toilet, plus the laundry has great built in robe for storage and access to the rear yard. Outside offers a double length carport with drive through capability to the back yard. <br/>The rear yard is a great size for kids to play or for pets, it has a garage in the back corner and a small garden shed. <br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE<br/>> No smoking inside the property<br/>> If you are successful in your application to ente