nly and is based on details supplied to us by the Owner. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, no warranty or representation is given. Prospective tenants should not rely solely on this information and are encouraged to make their own independent enquiries regarding the property, including measurements, inclusions, and suitability, prior to submitting an application or entering into a lease.','house','Sinagra',-31.74393435,115.79976283,6065,'WA','26 Lillypilly Loop','Sinagra',2,4,2,'Redmond Realty','Garage: 2, Toilets: 2'),(3438,'Neat Villa Home - Furnished or unfurnished, your choice!',690,'This villa is in the middle of a small collection of like-styled accommodation and features three bedrooms and two bathrooms and easy access to all the amenities Carlisle has to offer.<br/><br/>The home has a separate front theatre room, open plan kitchen/living/dining room area with rear access to the undercover patio area for easy summer indoor/outdoor entertaining. The bedroom zone at the back of the home houses three decent sized rooms, all with BIRs and reverse cycle air conditioning - the main bedroom is more than generous in size and has it\'s own neat, quaint ensuite bathroom.<br/><br/>The toilet is separate off the laundry which also features sliding door outdoor access to a secluded courtyard area with storage room and clothesline.<br/><br/>Archer Street turns into Mint Street, giving you direct access to all the culinary delights that the Albany Highway restaurant and cafe strip has to offer.<br/><br/>FEATURES:<br/>- Villa complex<br/>- 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms <br/>- Separate theatre room<br/>- Open plan living<br/>- Wood look flooring<br/>- Ensuite<br/>- BIRs<br/>- Generously proportioned bedrooms<br/>- Reverse cycle air conditioning <br/>- Carport + extra car bay<br/>- Alfresco entertaining<br/>- Storage room<br/>- Courtyard<br/><br/>LOCATION:<br/>- Fletcher Park<br/>- Peet Park (approx 4 mins)<br/>- Tomato Lake (approx 5 mins)<br/>- Perth CBD (approx 11 mins)<br/>- Perth airport (approx 10 mins)<br/>- Carlisle Primary School (approx 4 mins)<br/>- Ursula Frayne High School (approx 4 mins)<br/>- Australian Islamic College (approx 5 mins)<br/>- Albany Highway restaurant and cafe strip (approx 6 mins)<br/><br/>** Property can be leased with all furniture and inventory items present at the time of viewing or property can be leased without these items upon request. Please note that the exception is the wall mounted television which will remain at the property. <br/><br/>*Important* Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, Ray White Urban Springs will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All information is considered correct at the time of printing. Please note the property must be viewed by either the applicant or a person acting on their behalf prior to submitting an application form.<br/><br/>*** ARE YOU A STRATA LANDLORD? If you are looking for property management services with a difference, we would love to hear from you! Leasing strata requires skill, knowledge, attention to detail, and multiple disclosures, don\'t take the risk. Contact us for specialist strata assistance for your rental Deborah on [REDACTED PHONE] or [REDACTED EMAIL] for a no-obligation and confidential conversation. ***','house','Carlisle',-31.97327770,115.91736042,6101,'WA','3/36 Archer Street','Carlisle',2,3,2,'Ray White Urban Springs - RIVERVALE','Garage: 2'),(3439,'Inner City Living at Its Best – Stylish Cento Apartment!',590,'Don\'t miss the opportunity to have this beautifully designed one bedroom apartment in Cento, offering a refined Inner City lifestyle. Flooded with natural light, the apartment boasts a generous layout and is perfectly positioned for those seeking convenience and comfort.<br/><br/>Located just a short stroll from the heart of Braddon and only a short distance away from the City Centre, you will have restaurants, cafés, bars, public transport