ctricity, supplied via an embedded network.<br/><br/>This apartment offers secure, low-maintenance living in an unbeatable location.<br/><br/>This one won\'t last long!','house','Adelaide',-34.93246298,138.59883272,5000,'SA','404/15 Frew','Adelaide',1,1,1,'Julianne Price Real Estate - Adelaide (RLA 262864)','Garage: 1, Toilets: 1'),(3492,'Well Presented Dianella Unit',650,'This rear unit in a small group of four is privately positioned with your allocated undercover parking space located at the front of the complex (with four visitor Bays available).<br/><br/>This charming unit offers a perfect blend of comfort and convenience. Features include <br/><br/>* 2 double bedrooms with robes<br/>* Spacious sunken living room that leads to the enclosed light filled courtyard<br/>* The fully fenced outdoor courtyard offers a private space for entertaining or simply enjoying the fresh air<br/>* Split system air-conditioning in the main living area<br/>* Good sized storeroom under the main roof<br/>* The open-plan living area is enhanced by floorboards.<br/><br/>Located in a desirable area, this property is close to Dianella Plaza, Inglewood Recreation Centre, Galleria and The City. Bus routes are close by in Grand Promenade and Alexander Drive. <br/><br/>NO NEED TO REGISTER TO ATTEND THE ADVERTISED HOME OPEN.<br/>NO VIRTUAL OR ONLINE INSPECTIONS. THE PROPERTY MUST BE VIEWED - APPLICATION FORMS WILL BE MADE AVAILABLE AT THE VIEWING.<br/>WE DO NOT ACCEPT ONLINE APPLICATIONS.<br/><br/>*** PLEASE SEE IMPORTANT NOTICE AND DISCLAIMER BELOW ***<br/>IMPORTANT NOTICE: The Tenants must make all relevant investigations regarding the phone, internet, and NBN connection type and availability as Ray White Whiteman & Associates cannot guarantee or control telecommunication services. Ray White Whiteman & Associates advises all Tenants to speak to their provider before making an application to lease (if required).<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: Whilst every care is taken in preparing the information in