t<br/>• Multiple living zones - formal lounge/dining plus open plan family living<br/>• Private master retreat with walk-in robe, large ensuite, A/C & ceiling fan<br/>• Oversized activity/guest room with direct garden access<br/>• Separate study (or optional 6th bedroom) for ultimate flexibility<br/>• Cosy gas fireplace & built-in bar for entertaining<br/>• Spacious kitchen with gas cooktop, oven, double sink & ample storage overlooking the pool<br/>• Huge undercover alfresco area<br/>• Sparkling below-ground pool<br/>• 6 solar panels (3kW system) for energy efficiency<br/>• Powered shed<br/>• Garage plus additional driveway & verge parking<br/><br/>TERMS: <br/>• $1300 per week<br/>• 12 month lease<br/>• Move in ASAP<br/>• Pets considered on application <br/><br/>While we have taken utmost care to provide accurate information, Loop Leasing does not warrant or guarantee its accuracy and disclaims responsibility for any inaccuracies. Therefore, all interested parties are advised to conduct their own inquiries for verification.','house','Ocean Reef',-31.76396000,115.74873000,6027,'WA','40 Binnacle Road','Ocean Reef',2,6,3,'Loop Leasing','Garage: 2, Open Spaces: 1, Pets Allowed'),(3494,'Welcome to WOVA',650,'Situated in the recently built Wova development, is this 2-bedroom residence perched on the 8th floor providing spectacular views throughout the apartment. With stunning complex amenities and a highly convenient location, this residence is the ideal investment or future live-in opportunity.<br/><br/>Expanses of floor-to-ceiling windows and sliding doors invite a warm and welcoming atmosphere while stunning fixtures and design ensure that the apartment is both sophisticated and highly liveable.<br/><br/>The stylish kitchen features a stone island bench, ample storage space along with quality stainless steel Smeg appliances, including an induction cooktop. The sun-drenched living area seamlessly flows out to the balcony.<br/><br/>Both bedrooms offer floor-to-ceiling double glazed windows and mirrored built-in wardrobes. The interior designed ensuite and main bathroom feature an elegant colour palette with full-height tiling, medicine cabinets with feature shelving, stone topped vanities and plenty of under sink storage.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>- Located on the 8th floor of the Wova development<br/>- Double glazed windows and doors<br/>- Smeg appliances including induction cooktop<br/>- Stone bench and countertops<br/>- Full height bathroom tiling<br/>- Medicine cabinets<br/>- Reverse cycle heating and cooling<br/>- European laundry<br/>- Basement car parking with storage enclosure<br/>- Lift access<br/>- Residents indoor pool, sauna and fitness studio<br/>- Development cinema<br/>- Co-working spaces<br/>- Rooftop terrace<br/>- Communal kitchen and dining space<br/><br/>Wova is part of a vibrant urban precinct, where residents have access to a beautiful indoor lap pool and sauna, a private cinema, co-working spaces, rooftop terrace, fitness studio, residents lounge and a communal kitchen/dining space. Adding further convenience, the development is only minutes to Westfield Woden and an easy walk to bus stops and the future light rail.<br/><br/>A 12-month lease is the standard lease term – anything longer or shorter will be advertised or considered upon application.<br/>Availability: 6th March 2026<br/>Pets: Tenants must seek approval for pets via application form<br/>EER: 6.0<br/><br/>This property is part of an embedded network.<br/>The property is exempt from meeting the minimum ceiling insulation standards.<br/><br/>Bond and Rent:<br/>A bond equal to four weeks rent will be required before the commencement of the lease. We accept rent fortnightly or calendar monthly.<br/><br/>*Please note all care has been taken in providing the marketing information, Independent Property Management South will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information, and you should rely on your own investigation for accuracy.<br/><br/>It is o