. Local shopping, public transport, schools, parks, playgrounds, and dining options are all within close proximity-ensuring effortless day-to-day living.<br/><br/>Keys features:<br/>2 good sized bedrooms. One with built-in.<br/>Formal lounge room with air-conditioning<br/>Kitchen/dining area<br/>Seperate laundry/bathroom/toilet<br/>Tandem garage for 2 small cars<br/><br/>Exclude items:<br/>Split system in back bedroom (not operational)<br/>Gas heater in lounge room (not operational)<br/>Ducted system (not operational)<br/><br/>Pet is negotiable<br/><br/>Please email this office to inspect.<br/><br/>**Please re-confirm the open inspection time/s as they are subject to change without prior notice.**','house','Parafield Gardens',-34.77002811,138.60740183,5107,'SA','26B Browning Crescent','Parafield Gardens',1,2,1,'Rentabode- RLA 248024 - MITCHAM SHOPPING CENTRE','Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards, Pets Allowed'),(3498,'3 BEDROOM HOME',420,'Neat and well presented 3 bedroom stone home. The home features polished floorboards throughout, open plan living with split system air conditioning and slow combustion heater, and an updated kitchen with breakfast bar, electric appliances and dishwasher.<br/>All three bedrooms include ceiling fans, main with built-in robes. Tiled bathroom with large walk-in shower and separate toilet. Updated laundry with excellent storage. Rainwater (approx. 10,000L) plumbed to the home.','house','Naracoorte',-36.96672619,140.75112625,5271,'SA','6 Pine Grove','Naracoorte',1,3,2,'Elders Real Estate - Naracoorte (RLA62833)','Open Spaces: 2'),(3499,'3 bedroom 3 bathroom townhouse in CBD',780,'Available | 10 March 2026<br/><br/>Fox Real Estate is proud to present this contemporary 3 bedroom townhouse in a prime CBD location. <br/><br/>Features:<br/>• Bedroom 1 with built-in robe and ensuite<br/>• Bedroom 2 with built-in robes <br/>• Bedroom 3 with ensuite on ground floor<br/>• Large open plan living and dining area<br/>• Modern kitchen with stainless steel appliances including dishwasher. <br/>• Separate laundry area<br/>• Balcony<br/>• Single lock up garage with internal access to property<br/>• Ducted reverse cycle air-conditioning throughout<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned in a small group close to Central Markets, Universities, great restaurants/shops and all forms of public transport.<br/><br/>Bond | $3,120<br/>Pets | In accordance with Strata by-laws<br/>Lease term | 12 months<br/>Water Charges | Tenant to pay all water usage and all supply charges<br/>Unfurnished<br/><br/>All information has been obtained and understood to be accurate, however we accept no liability for any errors or omissions. We encourage you to prepare your application via www.2apply.com.au, however applications received prior to viewing the home will not be processed. It is a policy of Fox Real Estate that all homes are viewed either by yourself or an appointed nominee before proceeding to an application.<br/>We endeavor to list open inspections on all available properties each week, and you will need to register to access the viewing time. If no inspection is available, the property may be pending applications and you will be advised if an open time becomes available.','unit','Adelaide',-34.93510966,138.59465284,5000,'SA','5/3 Park Lane','Adelaide',3,3,1,'Fox Real Estate - Adelaide (RLA 226868)','Garage: 1'),(3500,'SPACIOUS FAMILY HOME LOCATED OPPOSITE PARK',590,'To register for an open inspection, simply click \'Enquire\' or \'Request an Inspection\'.<br/><br/>We\'ll then send you an email to register your attendance for viewing and provide further details about the property and application process. Registration will ensure you are advised on any new or updated inspection times.<br/><br/>ABOUT THE PROPERTY<br/><br/>Welcome to 13 Hugh Crescent, Morphett Vale.<br/><br/>This three-bedroom home offers comfort, space, and updates, making it an ideal choice for families or professionals alike.<br/><br/>Featuring three generously sized bedrooms, the main bedroom includes a built-in robe for convenient storage. The updated kitchen is both stylish and functional, complete with an island bench and dishwasher, perfect for everyday living and entertaining.<br/><br/>Enjoy dining room overlooking kitchen with direct access to the rear pergola, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor flow. The large lounge room provides a comfortable living space and is equipped with split-system air conditioning for year-round comfort.<br/><br/>The bathroom includes a separate bath, while the added convenience of a second toilet located off the spacious laundry enhances practicality. The large laundry also offers direct access to the rear yard.<br/><br/>Additional features include a single carport with extra off-street parking available. Polished timber floorboards run throughout the living areas and bedrooms, adding warmth and character to the home.<br/><br/>A fantastic opportunity to secure a comfortable and low-maintenance home.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- 3 bedrooms, main with built in robes<br/>- Large lounge area<br/>- Updated kitchen with island bench and dishwasher<br/>- Split system reverse cycle air conditioning<br/>- Rear pergola area<br/><br/>LEASE TERM: 12 months<br/>AVAILABLE FROM: Available now<br/>WATER CHARGES: Tenant to pay supply and water use<br/>PET POLICY: 1 x small outdoor pet up to 15 kg\'s negotiable<br/>EXCLUSIONS: Driveway to right hand side of property<br/> Rear yard as per subdivision markings (fence to be installed)<br/>INSPECTION: Register to view<br/><br/>APPLYING FOR THIS PROPERTY<br/><br/>Please note applications will not be processed until:<br/><br/>> The property has been viewed in person or someone has viewed it on your behalf<br/>> All occupants over 18 years have completed the application form<br/>> Photo ID has been provided<br/>> Proof of Income (Pay slip/Bank balance/Centrelink) has been provided<br/><br/>TO INSPECT THIS HOME<br/><br/>Click the \'Enquire\' or \'Request an Inspection\' button to register for our upcoming open inspections. We manage our enquiries through Tenant Options and recommend registering your interest to stay updated throughout every step of the leasing process.<br/><br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition) Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal advice.<br/><br/>RLA 277721<br/>','house','Morphett Vale',-35.13334793,138.50684860,5162,'SA','13 Hugh Crescent','Morphett Vale',1,3,2,'LJ Hooker - Glenelg | Brighton','Carport: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Toilets: 2'),(3501,'Beautiful Spacious Courtyard Homestead',550,'*** VIEWING TUESDAY 03/03/26 BETWEEN 5:30PM - 5:45PM ***<br/><br/>AdProp is proud to present to the open rental market, this charming stone-fronted homestead on a courtyard block, with all the character and elegance of yesteryear while having the modern interior for creature comforts of today, on a low-maintenance block. Featuring exposed-beam high ceilings and spacious natural light filled open-plan family/dining area, timber kitchen with extensive cupboards & bench space that makes cooking for the family a breeze. The huge master bedroom has double timber doors that lead out to patio area. Gorgeous ensuite with extra-large shower, stone feature wall and additional corner bath. All other bedrooms include built-in wardrobes. The covered entertaining pergola area is perfect for entertaining guests no matter the season. Roller shutters on all windows for security and thermal benefits, and even a solar power system providing the tenant a discount off their power usage. Plenty of off-street parking on the gravel driveway to the side of the residence to fit two or more cars. This magnificent home is positioned in the popular Goolwa South area near the golf course, beach and barrage, and certainly should be on your viewing list!<br/><br/>FEATURES:-<br/>- Four bedrooms, main with walk-in wardrobe & ensuite, all other bedrooms with built-in wardrobes<br/>- Ensuite including large second corner bath <br/>- Hygienic flooring slate in main living and tiled/floorboards in bedrooms<br/>- Split system air conditioning & ceiling fans for year round comfort<br/>- Roller shutters on all windows<br/>- Solar system for power cost savings<br/><br/>Solar: A solar panel system is installed for the benefit of the tenant, with cost savings on power bills.<br/><br/>Sales Activity: The landlord does not currently have any known plans to sell the property. <br/><br/>Inclusions/Exclusions: The secondary dwelling, known as \"2A Sweetman Road\" on the laneway side is clearly fenced off and not part of the main residence. This dwelling is is reserved for landlord’s personal use, it will remain locked & is excluded from this lease.<br/><br/>Pets: Even your pets are welcome, subject to mutual negotiation. <br/><br/>Prescribed Charges: Quarterly WATER supply & usage charges through SAWATER will be required to be paid by the tenant. <br/><br/>Tenancy Term Duration: Initial fixed 12 month lease offered, with renewals offered by mutual agreement. <br/><br/>You must view the property to apply. Unless inspection by appointment, please refer to first line above for the next available viewing time. Due to the high volume of enquiries, it is unlikely we can arrange an alternative viewing time when there is already a time set. Please note: Only CBS or AdProp applications will be accepted. AdProp applications can be obtained at the viewing or by emailing [REDACTED EMAIL]','house','Goolwa South',-35.51236706,138.78016511,5214,'SA','2 Sweetman Road','Goolwa South',2,4,2,'AdProp - North Adelaide RLA199528','Ensuite: 1'),(3502,'Perfectly positioned for lifestyle and convenience',540,'*** All applications to be sent via this advert, shortlisted candidates will be contacted and invited to attend a private inspection. We will NOT be holding a general inspection. Please ensure that all details are correctly completed on your application, and that all relevant documents are provided, if multiple applicants are applying ensure they also submit their details too, this will ensure that your application is processed efficiently and in a timely manner. **<br/><br/>Your Property Agency is delighted to offer for lease this perfectly positioned property offering lifestyle and convenience, this well-located family home is just moments from Paralowie Village Shopping Centre, providing easy access to supermarkets, cafés and everyday essentials.<br/><br/>Families will appreciate the close proximity to quality schools including Riverdale Primary School, Settlers Farm Primary School, Bethany Christian School, Paralowie High School and Temple Christian College.<br/><br/>Commuting is effortless with excellent public transport connections to Salisbury and Mawson Lakes Interchange, while the nearby Northern Expressway provides a convenient 25-minute drive to the Adelaide CBD — ideal for professionals and families alike.<br/>________________________________________<br/>THE RESIDENCE<br/>Set on a generous allotment, this well-maintained home offers comfortable living with plenty of outdoor space, secure fencing and off-street parking.<br/>________________________________________<br/>FEATURES INCLUDE:<br/>• Three well-sized bedrooms<br/>• Built in robes to main bedroom and bedroom 2<br/>• Ceiling fans to bedrooms<br/>• Updated bathroom<br/>• Large entertaining area<br/>• Fully fenced yard – perfect for families<br/>• Secure off-street parking<br/>• Large allotment (approx. 664sqm)<br/>• Convenient and family-friendly location<br/>________________________________________<br/>This is a fantastic opportunity to secure a home in the sought-after suburb of Paralowie, close to shops, schools and transport.<br/><br/>Don’t miss out — register your interest today!<br/><br/>Rent: $540 per week<br/>Bond: $2160 (plus 2 weeks rent in advance)<br/>Lease: 12 months<br/><br/>','house','Paralowie',-34.74575545,138.61378851,5108,'SA','300 Waterloo Corner Road','Paralowie',1,3,4,'Your Property Agency','Carport: 1, Fully Fenced, Open Spaces: 3, Shed, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards, Gas Heating, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Toilets: 1'),(3503,'Two bedroom Unit!',390,'In a complex of 21 units, this ground floor unit is now available! Boasting a fabulous location within close proximity to the Queanbeyan Central Business District, the local showground, public transport and neighbourhood parks - this property will not be available for long! <br/><br/>Features include: <br/>Spacious bedrooms<br/>both with built-in robes <br/>Good size living area <br/>Ample sized kitchen with electric cooking <br/>Combined bathroom and laundry <br/><br/>Property Available: Now<br/><br/>Pets:<br/>At any stage throughout this tenancy, the tenant will be required to seek the landlords consent in writing to keep a pet at the premises.<br/><br/>Viewing policy:<br/>1. Click on the \"BOOK INSPECTION\" button.<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection.<br/>3. If no time offered, please register so we can contact you once a time is arranged.<br/>If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations, or further inspection times.<br/>4. Inspections must be in the presence of an agent either at a private viewing or at an arranged open home, please do not contact the occupants directly or knock on the door.<br/><br/>Rental Requirements:<br/>Rent is due on a fortnightly basis in advance. Bond equivalent to four weeks rent is payable when signing the tenancy agreement.<br/><br/>All prospective tenants must rely on their own enquiries as the owner or their respective agents, do not make any warranty as to the accuracy of the information provided above and do not or will not accept any liability for any errors, misstatements, or discrepancies in that information. We have diligently and conscientiously undertaken to ensure it is as current and as accurate as possible.','unit','Queanbeyan',-35.35778402,149.22739242,2620,'NSW','2/7 Brook Street','Queanbeyan',1,2,1,'Ian McNamee & Partners - Queanbeyan','Open Spaces: 1'),(3504,'Brand New Coastal Living - 3.5km to the Beach!',700,'Welcome to your brand-new home in the heart of Two Rocks, perfectly positioned just 3.5km from the stunning coastline at Two Rocks South Beach. Set on a generous 468sqm block, this beautifully finished home offers space, style, and comfort - ready for you to move straight in.<br/><br/>Step inside and be greeted by a warm, inviting colour palette that instantly feels like home. To your right, the spacious master suite features a walk-in robe and a sleek ensuite complete with a separate toilet, creating a private retreat away from the rest of the home. Further down the hallway, you\'ll find a separate theatre room - perfect for cosy movie nights or a quiet second living space.<br/><br/>The heart of the home opens up into a bright and expansive open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area. Featuring recessed ceilings and flooded with natural light, this space feels airy and welcoming. The modern white kitchen with marble-look benchtops offers:<br/>• Breakfast island with ample prep space<br/>• Gas cooktop and oven<br/>• Fridge and dishwasher recesses<br/>• Large walk-in pantry<br/><br/>To the rear of the home, you\'ll find three well-sized minor bedrooms with built-in robes, serviced by a family bathroom with a separate toilet. A dedicated laundry with linen cupboard adds extra practicality.<br/><br/>Outside is where this home truly shines! Step through to the large undercover alfresco area - the perfect space for entertaining family and friends all year round. Overlooking a super-sized backyard, there is plenty of r