xternal features include:<br/>- Carport<br/>- Additional car parking space<br/>- Easy-to-care-for, low maintenance gardens with and array of plants and shrubs<br/>- Veggie patch<br/>- Electric hot water system<br/>- Garden shed<br/>- Clothesline<br/>- Fully fenced<br/>- Peaceful and private rural outlook<br/><br/>Pets: Upon Application<br/>Water Charges: Tenant to pay supply & usage<br/>Unfurnished','house','Littlehampton',-35.03340404,138.91200883,5250,'SA','54 North Tce','Littlehampton',2,3,1,'Harris Real Estate -  Adelaide Hills RLA 343103','Carport: 1, Living Areas: 1'),(3537,'NEWLY BUILT MODERN ELEGANCE IN AN ULTRA-CONVENIENT LOCATION!',840,'From the moment you step through the front door, you will be captivated by the thoughtful design and stylish finishes of this beautifully presented residence. Offering comfort, functionality, and contemporary appeal, this impressive home delivers light-filled living spaces complemented by neutral, high-quality finishes throughout.<br/><br/>Boasting 3 spacious bedrooms, 2 modern bathrooms, plus a bonus enclosed study, this home is perfectly suited to professionals, small families, or those working from home.<br/><br/>Ideally positioned just a short 300m stroll to Belmont Forum, you will enjoy easy access to fashion, dining, and entertainment options right at your doorstep. Public transport is conveniently located only a few hundred metres away, the Perth CBD is approximately 15 minutes by car and Perth Airports can be reached in under 10 minutes - an exceptional location for city commuters and frequent travellers alike!<br/><br/>Surrounded by beautiful green open spaces including Arlunya Park, Miles Park, Forster Park, and Faulkner Park, this location offers the perfect balance of lifestyle and convenience.<br/><br/>FEATURES INCLUDE:<br/>* Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area designed for modern living<br/>* Stylish kitchen featuring quality appliances, stone benchtops, ample cabinetry and contemporary finishes