ant storage. Overlooking the open-plan living and dining area, this welcoming space flows seamlessly out to a beautifully presented alfresco entertaining area - ideal for hosting family and friends or enjoying relaxed evenings outdoors.<br/><br/>The large central bathroom features a separate bath, shower and vanity, complemented by a practical separate laundry for added convenience.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>• Three generous, well-carpeted bedrooms<br/>• Built-in robes to all bedrooms<br/>• Main bedroom with ensuite and ceiling fan<br/>• Spacious open-plan living and dining<br/>• Well-equipped kitchen with gas cooktop, dishwasher & ample storage<br/>• Large main bathroom with bath and separate shower<br/>• Ducted air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>• Ceiling fans in bedrooms<br/>• Separate laundry<br/>• Generous courtyard, perfect for entertaining<br/>• Garage with additional off-street parking<br/><br/>Enjoy the lifestyle benefits of being just minutes from public transport, close to quality local schools and only a short drive to Westfield West Lakes for shopping and dining. You\'ll also love the easy access to some of Adelaide\'s finest beaches, making weekend relaxation effortless.<br/><br/>Your local schools are Seaton Park Primary School and Seaton High School.<br/>Other nearby schools include Hendon Primary School, Grange Primary School, Woodville Primary School, Fulham Gardens Primary School, Findon High School, Woodville High School, Henley High School, and Underdale High School.<br/><br/>This is a fantastic opportunity to secure a spacious and well-located home in a sought-after coastal suburb. Enquire today to arrange your inspection.<br/><br/>Bond - 4 weeks rent equivalent<br/>Lease Term - 12+ months<br/>Water Charges - All water usage and water supply<br/>Furniture - Unfurnished<br/><br/><br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition, inclusions, exclusion, omission) Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal advice. As well as all parties must view the property in person to make sure it reflects the list of inclusions listed in this ad.','house','Seaton',-34.88962746,138.51033657,5023,'SA','3/23 Seaton Terrace','Seaton',2,3,2,'Ray White St Peters - RLA328740','Courtyard, Garage: 2, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(3539,'Foothills charm, Travel Convenience - This unit has it all!',560,'Experience modern comfort in this beautifully updated 1992-built unit. Nestled on a generous 259 m² allotment in the scenic Rostrevor foothills, this home perfectly balances suburban peace with stylish, functional living.<br/><br/>The Home<br/><br/>• Living Room: A beautiful, light-filled, and large living area serves as the heart of the home, featuring elegant French-style windows that continue throughout the residence.<br/>• Kitchen: The open-plan layout flows seamlessly into a stunning, recently renovated kitchen. Chefs will love the expansive countertop space, premium gas stove, dishwasher, and high-quality oven.<br/>• Bedrooms: Two spacious bedrooms, including a master suite with a large built-in cupboard for effortless storage.<br/>• Bathroom: A full-size, versatile bathroom equipped with both a relaxing bathtub and a separate shower.<br/>• Backyard: A private, fully fenced backyard offers a secure space for outdoor enjoyment, complete with a traditional clothesline and room for a small garden.<br/>• Parking: Includes one dedicated off-street car space. <br/><br/>Key Features & Location<br/><br/>• Comfort: Air-conditioned throughout with elegant French-style windows providing a relaxing touch.<br/>• Parking: Secure property with one dedicated off-street parking space.<br/>• Lifestyle: Stop by the newly upgraded Newton Village or the Target Magill precinct for all your essentials, gym options, and quick eats on the way home.<br/>• Commute: Just 11 km from the Adelaide CBD.<br/><br/>Other Information<br/><br/>• Land Size: 259 m²<br/>• Parking: 1 Dedicated Space<br/><br/>Don\'t miss out on this well-maintained gem in a tightly held Rostrevor location. Contact us today to arrange an inspection or obtain further information.<br/><br/>*DISCLAIMER: PHOTOS ARE FOR ILLUSTRAION ONLY. AXIOM REALTY STRIVES ON PROVIDING INFORMATION THAT IS BOTH TRUE AND ACCURATE, AND WE ENSURE THE PHOTOS SHOWN ARE AS CLOSE AS POSSIBLE TO THE ACTUAL CONDITION OF THE PROEPRTY. HOWEVER, AXIOM REALTY ACCEPTS NO RESPONSIBILITY AND DISCLAIM ALL LIABILITY IN RESPECT TO ANY ERRORS, OMISSIONS, INACCURACIES OR MISSTATEMENTS CONTAINED WITHIN THE TEXT ABOVE AND THE ACCOMPANYING IMAGES. Prospective renters and/or purchasers should make their own enquiries and assessments to verify the information provided within this document.<br/>Axiom Realty - RLA 296242','house','Rostrevor',-34.89486482,138.67644116,5073,'SA','1/12 Koonga Avenue','Rostrevor',1,2,1,'Axiom Realty - ST PETERS','Open Spaces: 1'),(3540,'Discover your Dream Home in Jindalee, WA.',800,'Welcome to your dream home in the vibrant and welcoming suburb of Jindalee in Western Australia. This modern built stylish house with sleek design offers generous and comfortable living space, easy care and low maintenance.<br/>When you enter the property you are welcomed by a spacious and inviting tiled open plan living dining and kitchen area, bathed in natural light due to the large windows that look out over the backyard with paved alfresco area under the same roof and artificial lawn. The kitchen is modern and fresh, with a sculery and plenty of cupboard and bench space, and is equipped with all the appliances you need to cook up a storm.<br/>The three bedrooms are well-sized, carpeted and equiped with built-in wardrobes, while the