ress. Failing to provide this information for security and safety reasons may result in being refused entry.','house','Jindalee',-31.63241341,115.67902363,6036,'WA','13 Barnea Road','Jindalee',2,4,2,'@realty - National Head Office Australia','Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Ensuite: 1'),(3541,'A haven of style and comfort nestled in the heart of Baldivis',800,'Welcome to 8 Giverny Way Baldivis.<br/><br/>Discover the epitome of contemporary family living in this impeccable, brand new, four-bedroom residence, a haven of style and comfort nestled in the heart of Baldivis. Designed with family life in mind, this home presents a seamless blend of sophistication and functionality.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>- Master bedroom with walk-in robe and ensuite<br/>- Bedrooms 2, 3 & 4 carpeted.<br/>- Ducted aircon throughout<br/>- Main bathroom with bathtub and separate toilet<br/>- Open plan kitchen, living and dining rooms<br/>- Kitchen with stainless steel oven, gas stovetop and rangehood, dishwasher included!<br/>- Laundry with built-in basin and additional linen storage<br/>- Outdoor alfresco - perfect for entertaining!<br/>- Modest backyard with low maintenance.<br/>- Double garage with remote access<br/><br/>One Week Rent - $800.00<br/>Bond (4 weeks rent) - $3200.00<br/>Total Cost - $4000.00<br/><br/>**Our office staff are unable to answer property specific questions. If you have a query please submit via the \"Get in touch\" button. Please use the \"Request an inspection\" to attend this open. This will allow us to notify you of any changes to inspection times as well as send you an application form**','house','Baldivis',-32.36145177,115.80274564,6171,'WA','8 Giverny Way','Baldivis',2,4,2,'Certainty Property','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(3542,'Large Fully Furnished Unit in a Perfect Location!',550,'Within walking distance to Kensington Park Reserve, and close to local shopping centres, this fully furnished home offers:<br/><b