 to spread out. Freshly painted throughout with brand new flooring, the home feels modern, light and welcoming from the moment you step inside.<br/><br/>The main bedroom features its own private ensuite and built-in cupboards, while the remaining bedrooms are well-sized and fitted with ceiling fans for year-round comfort. The central bathroom includes a separate shower and bath, perfect for families.<br/><br/>At the heart of the home is a spacious lounge room complete with a combustion fireplace, creating a warm and cosy atmosphere during the cooler months. Ducted evaporative cooling keeps the home comfortable through summer. The kitchen offers plenty of cupboard space, a new cooktop, electric oven, and flows through to a separate dining area ideal for family meals. Additional features include a large laundry, hallway storage cupboards, and a new electric hot water system.<br/><br/>Outside, the property truly shines. The large yard provides plenty of space to enjoy, complemented by a beautiful grassed front yard, established fruit trees, and a rainwater tank with pump for garden use. There is an undercover entertainment area as well as a shaded area for added versatility.<br/><br/>For those needing extra storage or workspace, the property includes a single carport and a large powered shed featuring a 15amp plug.<br/>This well-maintained home offers comfort, practicality and space in a peaceful setting.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>-4 bedrooms, main with ensuite and built-ins<br/>-Ceiling fans to bedrooms<br/>-Ducted evaporative cooling<br/>-Combustion fireplace in large lounge<br/>-New flooring and freshly painted throughout<br/>-Kitchen with new cooktop & electric oven<br/>-Separate dining area<br/>-Large laundry & hallway storage<br/>-Powered shed with 15amp plug<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/>-Approx. 15 Minutes to Gawler <br/>-Close to Barossa Valleys best Wineries and restaurants<br/>-5 minutes from Lyndoch Primary School<br/><br/>The safety of our clients, staff and the community is extremely important to us, so we have implemented strict hygiene policies at all of our properties. We welcome your enquiry and look forward to hearing from you.<br/><br/>Please click on the enquire button for any enquiries or submit your application VIA Tenant Options!- https://app.tenantoptions.com.au/<br/><br/>For further information, contact Lee Barnett on [REDACTED PHONE] or Danielle Downie [REDACTED PHONE].<br/><br/>Disclaimer: We have, in preparing this document, used our best endeavours to ensure the information contained is true and accurate but accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability in respect to any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, or misstatements contained. Prospective tenants should make their own inquiries to verify the information contained in this document.<br/><br/>RLA 284373<br/><br/>','house','Altona',-34.59518058,138.91091876,5351,'SA','33 Wilhelm Street','Altona',2,4,1,'Ray White Barossa Valley/ Two Wells','Garage: 1'),(3555,'Luxury Apartment Living at Vantage',790,'Vantage Two-bedroom floorplans represent the perfect opportunity for those seeking a luxury, low-maintenance lifestyle. This 2-bedroom 1 bathroom apartment with a light open-plan living space<br/><br/>• Modern kitchen with Electric Cooktop, Oven, and Dishwasher<br/>• Laundry is a Built cupboard within the Kitchen comes with a dryer. <br/>• Split system in the open living area <br/>• Bedrooms have built in Mirror robe doors . <br/>• One allocated car bay<br/>• Storeroom located behind the Car Bay. <br/>• Ducted Air- Conditioning <br/><br/>Vantage has set a new benchmark in the area with luxurious residents\' amenities that allow you to indulge in the lifestyle you deserve. Your health and wellbeing take top priority in all community spaces. An expansive river-facing infinity-edge pool and sundeck complements additional therapeutic inclusions such as the gymnasium, steam room, spa and sauna. In addition, an architecturally designed rooftop terrace incorporates an open-air cinema, alfresco barbecue and dining area, and yoga deck that all enjoy grand city and river views. Cleverly blurring the lines between a luxurious resort and a private residence, Vantage is your daily retreat. Vantage is unsurpassed in quality and location. In addition to its enviable proximity to the Perth CBD and airports, everything you need is close by - from riverside walks, to sporting, theatre and music events and an overwhelming choice of restaurant and dining options and retail therapy. <br/><br/><br/>*Important* Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, Mouve Asset Management will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All information is considered correct at the time of printing.','house','Rivervale',-31.95461753,115.90472847,6103,'WA','220/60 Riversdale Rd','Rivervale',1,2,1,'Mouve Asset Managements','Open Spaces: 1'),(3556,'2 Bedroom Ground Floor Unit',425,'This ground floor two bedroom unit is located amongst a group of units in a quiet location along popular Prospect Road. It features open plan kitchen/lounge area, 2 bedrooms both with built in robes, a spacious bathroom and separate laundry with one off street parking space.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>• Carpet in Lounge and Main Bedroom <br/>• Built in robes<br/>• Gas cooktop<br/>• No yard<br/>• One off street carpark<br/><br/>Close to supermarket, retail shops, restaurants and cafes. Bus stop located at doorstep and only 10 minutes to CBD.<br/><br/>RLA 147463','house','Prospect',-34.87676491,138.59388198,5082,'SA','9/199 Prospect Road','Prospect',1,2,1,'Select Business & Property Group - Greenacres','Carport: 1, Built-in Wardrobes, Toilets: 1'),(3557,'Feel right at home in this classic 3x1 House!',600,'Features; <br/>* 3 large bedrooms<br/>* Master with floor to ceiling built in robes <br/>* Large lounge with polished floorboards <br/>* Kitchen/Dining <br/> * Private storage shed <br/>* Double remote garage <br/>* Ceiling fans<br/>* Ducted air conditioning<br/> * Large closed in-front garden<br/> <br/>6 month lease only to start.<br/><br/>ARE YOU A LANDLORD? If you are looking for property management services, we would love to hear from you. Contact our office on [REDACTED PHONE] or visit our website at https://cityresperth.ljhooker.com.au','house','Nollamara',-31.87565000,115.84348000,6061,'WA','18 Quadea Way','Nollamara',1,3,2,'LJ Hooker - Property Experience','Garage: 2, Pets Allowed'),(3558,'Loft style living in the City!',595,'This superb 2 level warehouse style apartment is ready for its next lucky resident.<br/><br/>The lower level contains a huge open plan double height living/dining space with a funky galley style kitchen. Upstairs is laid out as 2 bedrooms with a centrally located bathroom incorporating a laundry. The outlook is to the City’s most outstanding atrium/courtyard which incorporates a stunningly beautiful central feature garden.<br/><br/>Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning, timber styled floors, option for roof deck garden, and a secured car park space complete this rare offering.<br/><br/>','apartment','Adelaide',-34.92876034,138.60929680,5000,'SA','41/237 Wakefield Street','Adelaide',1,2,1,'Buchan Lee RLA 280528 - Adelaide','Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Floorboards, Intercom, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1'),(3559,'Sunlit Spaces and Scenic Views',700,'Positioned on the 5th floor of the highly sought-after Mulberry complex, this beautiful apartment blends contemporary design, abundant natural light, and exceptional convenience. With a true northern aspect and uninterrupted views across Dickson to Mount Majura, it offers a lifestyle that feels both connected and serene.<br/><br/>Built by Core Developments, Mulberry has been recognised with multiple HIA awards, including \"Apartment Complex of the Year\" and \"Outdoor Project of the Year\", and the quality is evident throughout.<br/><br/>From the moment you step inside, the home feels instantly inviting. Double-glazed windows flood the open-plan living area with sunlight, highlighting the timber floors and creating a warm, welcoming atmosphere. The living and dining space is designed for connection and effortless entertaining, while the sleek kitchen features gas cooking, quality appliances, and excellent storage, perfect for everything from quick weekday meals to hosting friends.<br/><br/>Through sliding doors, the 19m² balcony extends your living space outdoors, offering the ideal spot for a quiet morning coffee with sunrise views or evening drinks.<br/><br/>Two generous bedrooms provide comfort and privacy, each with built-in robes. The main bedroom includes an ensuite and direct balcony access, so you can start your day with fresh air and a leafy outlook. A stylish main bathroom, European laundry with washer/dryer, and split-system heating and cooling complete the picture of modern convenience.<br/><br/>Mulberry offers more than just a home; it\'s a lifestyle destination. Residents enjoy exclusive access to a rooftop retreat with panoramic views, a heated pool, cabanas, BBQ and dining areas, and a vegetable garden. Tranquil landscaped gardens throughout the complex add a sense of calm, while secure basement parking and a storage cage provide peace of mind.<br/><br/>With its unbeatable location, you\'re perfectly positioned to enjoy the best of the Inner North. Stroll to the Dickson Town Centre for cafés, dining, and daily essentials, or take the Light Rail into Braddon or the City in minutes.<br/><br/>This is more than an apartment, it\'s your opportunity to experience elevated living in one of Canberra\'s most vibrant and connected precincts.<br/><br/>At a glance:<br/>- Level 5 apartment in the award-winning Mulberry complex<br/>- 71m² of internal living + 19m² balcony<br/>- True northern aspect with views across Dickson to Mount Majura<br/>- Open-plan living and dining<br/>- Modern kitchen with gas cooktop and great storage<br/>- Timber flooring through the living area and carpeted bedrooms<br/>- Main bedroom with private ensuite, built-in-robe and balcony access<br/>- Second bedroom with built-in-robe<br/>- Stylish main bathroom<br/>- Double-glazed windows<br/>- Split-system heating and cooling<br/>- European laundry with washer and dryer included<br/>- Basement car space and storage cage<br/>- Within a 4-minute walk to the Light Rail Stop<br/>- Within a 12-minute walk to Dickson Town Centre<br/>- Within a 6-minute drive to Braddon dining district<br/>- Within a 6-minute drive to Ainslie Shops<br/>- Within a 7-minute drive to ANU<br/>- Within a 9-minute drive to City CBD<br/><br/>Availability: Now<br/>Lease Period: 12 months<br/>Applications: Applications will be accepted prior to viewing this property. <br/>Parking: 1 basement car space<br/>Cooking: Electric oven and Gas stovetop<br/>Heating: Split System<br/>NBN: Unknown<br/>EER: Unknown<br/><br/>Adaptable housing and minimum standards: The property is exempt from the minimum ceiling insulation standard. <br/><br/>Embedded networks: The property is awaiting information from the Owners Corporation<br/><br/>PETS: Please be aware that at all stages of tenancy this property requires consent to be sought from the lessor for the keeping of any pets at the premises. Consent must be provided before any pets are at the premises.<br/><br/>RENTING BOOK:<br/>https://www.act.gov.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0006/2608620/The-Renting-Book-September-2025.pdf<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Please note that while all care has been taken regarding general information and marketing information compiled for this rental advertisement, LJ HOOKER DICKSON does not accept responsibility and disclaim all liabilities in regard to any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We encourage prospective tenants to rely on their own investigation and in-person inspections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.<br/><br/>WISH TO INSPECT?<br/>1. Click on the \"BOOK INSPECTION\" button available on our website <br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection<br/>3. If no time offered, please register so we can contact you once time is arranged<br/>4. If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations or further<br/>inspection times.<br/>','apartment','Dickson',-35.25721941,149.13306807,2602,'ACT','501/258 Northbourne Avenue','Dickson',2,2,1,'LJ Hooker - Dickson','Garage: 1'),(3560,'Coastal Living at Its Best, Modern Family Home in Prime Aldinga Beach Location',650,'$650.00<br/>Availability: 11 March 2026<br/><br/>Experience coastal living at its best in this charming and spacious home.<br/><br/>Nestled in the welcoming community of Aldinga Beach, this lovely three-bedroom house provides the perfect blend of comfort and style, offering a superb lifestyle for families or those seeking a serene retreat.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- Generously sized main bedroom with walk-in robe<br/>- Additional bedrooms with built-in robes for convenient storage<br/>- Open-plan living and dining area with floating floors for easy maintenance<br/>- Well-appointed kitchen featuring gas cooktop and dishwasher<br/>- Split-system air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>- Ducted evaporative cooling ideal for hot summer days<br/>- Secure carport with roller door and rear access for added convenience<br/>- Expansive verandah perfect for entertaining in a lush garden setting<br/>- Extra parking space available for visitors<br/><br/>Pets: Upon Application<br/>Water charges: Tenant to pay supply & usage<br/>Furnished: Unfurnished<br/><br/>Would you like to view this property? Please click the button \"contact the agent\", register your interest and we will instantly respond. To avoid disappointment, we encourage you to register your interest so we can keep you informed during all stages of the leasing process.<br/><br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition). Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal advice.','house','Aldinga Beach',-35.27013011,138.46843108,5173,'SA','19 Bluepoint Way','Aldinga Beach',1,3,1,'Harris Real Estate - Wine Coast RLA 335392','Garage: 1, Pets Allowed'),(3561,'Prime Location! 6 Month Lease Only!',700,'Set in one of Dalkeiths most tightly held streets, this spacious home presents a practical short-term living option in an exceptional riverside location. With demolition scheduled later this year, this is a great opportunity for those seeking flexible accommodation without a long-term commitment.<br/><br/>Offering generous indoor spaces, a functional kitchen with gas cooking, timber flooring to the main living areas and ducted air conditioning, the home is comfortable and well-suited to interim living. Outside, the property includes a large concrete swimming pool, secure lockable garage or shed, and ample off-street parking.<br/><br/>Property Highlights: <br/>- Four well sized bedrooms<br/>- Two bathrooms<br/>- Functional kitchen with gas cooktop and ample cupboard space<br/>- Wooden flooring to living areas<br/>- Ducted air conditioning<br/>- Large concrete swimming pool<br/>- Lockable garage or shed<br/>- Ample off-street parking<br/><br/>Conveniently located close to local schools, the University of Western Australia, public transport and nearby shopping and lifestyle amenities, this property offers both comfort and accessibility.<br/>Particulars:<br/>- Please note this property is only available for a 6-month lease. No renewals will be offered.<br/>- Available from 25 February 2026<br/>- Pets considered upon application<br/>- Viewings are by appointment. For the latest available times, please visit our website or email [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/>- Tsokos Property only accepts applications submitted via realestate.com.au. Applications submitted through other platforms will not be accepted.<br/>- The property must be viewed prior to submitting an application, as a unique application code will be provided at the viewing.<br/><br/>For further information and to arrange an inspection, please contact [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/><br/><br/>','house','Dalkeith',-31.99222000,115.80188000,6009,'WA','33 Colin Street','Dalkeith',2,4,2,'Tsokos Property - Subiaco','Garage: 2, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Pets Allowed'),(3562,'STYLISH APARTMENT LIVING IN THE SUBURBS!',530,'PLEASE CLICK \'BOOK INSPECTION\' TO REGISTER & BE NOTIFIED OF UPCOMING INSPECTIONS<br/><br/>This modern 2-bedroom upstairs apartment will be sure to impress! The modern kitchen boasts stone benchtops, a gas cooktop, and a breakfast bar. The tiled floor in the living area will make maintenance a breeze, and the balcony will entice you to spend your free time relaxing in the fresh air. There are built-in robes to both well-sized bedrooms for your convenience and reverse cycle conditioning ensures your comfort in all of Canberra\'s seasons. Car accommodation is provided by a single garage with the ease of internal access. <br/><br/>Located in Harrison, this apartment provides the perfect combination of apartment living in the suburbs. Avoid the hustle and bustle of a busy complex by snapping up the opportunity to reside in this stylish apartment. The property is close to schools and nature parks. Plus it\'s only a five-minute drive to Gungahlin Town Centre, with an array of shops, cafes, restaurants, and services, and only a short drive to the city. <br/><br/>Features of this property include:<br/><br/>2-bedroom apartment<br/>Reverse cycle air conditioning<br/>Modern kitchen with stone benchtops, fridge, gas cooktop & breakfast bar<br/>Tiled living area<br/>Plenty of storage <br/>Built-in robes to both bedrooms<br/>Balcony<br/>Single garage with internal access & remote<br/><br/>Available: 24th March 2026<br/><br/>PETS:<br/>The tenant/s must seek landlord consent to keep pets at this property.<br/><br/>ENERGY EFFICIENCY RATING:<br/>There is no current energy efficiency rating for this property.<br/><br/>MINIMUM STANDARDS:<br/>The property meets the minimum housing standards for insulation.<br/><br/>VITAL INFORMATION:<br/>The property is unfurnished<br/>Please note that we request no videos or photos be taken inside occupied properties<br/>Please note you may be required to remove your shoes prior to inspecting the property<br/><br/>WISH TO INSPECT:<br/>1. Click on \"BOOK INSPECTION\" if this listing does not have the \"BOOK INSPECTION\" button please go to raywhitecanberra.com.au website and register<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection, if no time is offered or if the time does not suit, please register and we will contact you once access is arranged<br/>3. If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations or further inspection times<br/><br/>RENT INFORMATION:<br/>1. Rent is collected fortnightly unless otherwise nominated for a longer period<br/>2. Bond required is equal to 4 weeks rent<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER:<br/>All information regarding this property is from sources we believe to be accurate, however we cannot guarantee its accuracy. Interested persons should make and rely on their own enquiries in relation to inclusions, figures, measurements, dimensions, layout, furniture and descriptions.','apartment','Harrison',-35.18986726,149.15450953,2914,'ACT','44 Haven Street','Harrison',1,2,1,'Ray White - Canberra','Balcony, Garage: 1, Built-in Wardrobes, Toilets: 1'),(3563,'Apartment Lifestyle with Utilities Included - Just Minutes From Henley Beach',630,'Enjoy the privacy of your own entry in this updated first-floor apartment – one of only two in the group (upstairs & downstairs). Located just 3km from Henley Beach and the vibrant Henley Square precinct, this is an ideal option for someone seeking comfortable, low-maintenance living without the upkeep of gardens or being part of a large complex.<br/><br/>Perfect for those who travel frequently for work, the easy-care layout, security roller shutters and close proximity to Adelaide Airport (approx. 10 minutes) make this a practical and appealing choice. With local reserves nearby and the River Torrens Linear Trail within walking distance, there\'s plenty of opportunity to enjoy the outdoors when you\'re home.<br/><br/>One of the biggest bonuses? Electricity, gas and water are all included in the rent – simply connect your NBN and move in.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>• Private entry with internal stairs leading to a light-filled lounge with floating floors & ceiling fan (flooring throughout)<br/>• Modern neutral kitchen overlooking the living area, complete with island bench, gas cooktop and ample cupboard space<br/>• 2 bedrooms, both with wardrobes, ceiling fans and individual split system reverse cycle air-conditioners<br/>• Additional ducted reverse cycle air-conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>• Updated bathroom with large shower, vanity & toilet<br/>• Separate laundry with linen cupboard and additional store room<br/>• Small paved outdoor courtyard with north-easterly aspect – ideal for a morning coffee<br/>• 2 allocated open car parking spaces<br/>• Security roller shutters for added peace of mind<br/><br/>Important Information:<br/>• Garage is excluded from the tenancy<br/>• One bedroom within the property is locked and not included in the lease<br/>','apartment','Fulham Gardens',-34.92397025,138.51717456,5024,'SA','26 Riverway','Fulham Gardens',1,2,2,'Gary J Smith Real Estate (RLA 150557) -','Open Spaces: 2, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 1'),(3564,'Spacious Beachside Home with Flexible Lease Options',900,'$900.00 per week<br/>Available: 27 February 2026<br/>*Six Month Lease*<br/> <br/>To apply for this property, visit Tenant Options<br/> <br/>Positioned in a prime coastal setting just moments from the Esplanade, this spacious three bedroom home offers comfort, flexibility, and relaxed beachside living. A versatile second lounge provides the option of a fourth bedroom, making the layout ideal for families, professionals, or those seeking extra space to work or unwind. Fully furnished and complete with professional gardening included, this property delivers a convenient and low maintenance lifestyle in a highly desirable beachside location.<br/> <br/>Features we love about this property:<br/> <br/>• Three well proportioned bedrooms<br/>• Versatile second lounge room, ideal as a fourth bedroom or additional living space<br/>• Lounge featuring a fireplace for cosy winter evenings<br/>• Split system air conditioning for year round comfort<br/>• Functional kitchen with ample bench space and storage<br/>• Neat and tidy central bathroom<br/>• Fully furnished for immediate move in convenience<br/>• Rear pergola perfect for outdoor entertaining<br/>• Generous backyard with room to enjoy the outdoors<br/>• Secure lock up garage<br/>• Professional gardening included<br/> <br/>Located just a short stroll to the Esplanade and the stunning Aldinga Beach coastline, this home also enjoys easy access to local cafés, shopping, schools, and public transport, delivering an enviable coastal lifestyle with everyday convenience.<br/> <br/>For more information, please contact Taylah at [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/> <br/>Disclaimer: noakesnickolas.com.au | RLA 318522','house','Aldinga Beach',-35.27881210,138.44727271,5173,'SA','27 Aldinga Beach Road','Aldinga Beach',2,4,2,'Noakes Nickolas - RLA 315571','Fully Fenced, Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1');
INSERT INTO `data` VALUES (3565,'Updated Family Home in Ideal Pocket',510,'TO REGISTER AND INSPECT THIS PROPERTY VISIT: https://tenantoptions.com.au/<br/>** Only applicants who have inspected the property will be considered **<br/><br/>LJ Hooker Property Specialists are proud to present this tidy, three-bedroom home in a private street within Munno Para West. The home offers a large, open plan living area, good sized bedrooms and 2-way bathroom. <br/><br/>More features of the property include:<br/>- Three good-sized bedrooms, all with carpet <br/>- Master with WIR and direct access to 2-way bathroom <br/>- New floating floors throughout <br/>- Freshly painted walls <br/>- Open plan kitchen/living area<br/>- Well appointed kitchen with plenty of storage <br/>- Split system A/C to main living space <br/>- Spacious back yard <br/>- Auto roller door carport <br/>- Overall low maintenance <br/><br/>Located in a private, well-kept pocket of Munno Para West, the property is situated close to many convenient and local amenities. Playford Marketplace and Munno Para Shopping Precinct are a short drive away, schooling opportunities of Mark Oliphant College and St Columba College are also close by, as well as many easy-accessible public transport options. <br/><br/>Enquire today and secure this lovely opportunity to make this; your new home to enjoy! <br/><br/>Please contact us during office hours on 8289 6660 (Monday-Friday 9am-5.00pm) if <br/>you have any queries regarding the application process. If your queries relate to an open inspection time, please be advised that all open times are updated every Friday by close of business. If you are unable to attend the open inspection or there are no open times scheduled, please send your enquiry through this website.<br/> RLA 208516','house','Munno Para West',-34.66414979,138.67296430,5115,'SA','16 Isabel Road','Munno Para West',1,3,1,'LJ Hooker - Property Specialists','Carport: 1'),(3566,'Light-Filled & Contemporary Home in Vibrant Riverlea Community',670,'Please apply via Tenantoptions.com.au<br/><br/>Spectacular brand-new residence offering modern comfort, quality finishes and a lifestyle-centric position in one of Riverlea Park\'s newest communities.<br/><br/>Designed for easy, low-maintenance living, the home features a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area that flows seamlessly from the stylish kitchen - perfect for everyday living and entertaining.<br/><br/>Three well-proportioned bedrooms are light-filled and comfortable, with built-in robes providing excellent storage. The master bedroom enjoys its own modern ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms are serviced by a contemporary main bathroom.<br/><br/>Additional features include:<br/>• Spacious open-plan living and dining area<br/>• Modern kitchen with quality finishes and storage<br/>• Three generous bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>• Master bedroom with private ensuite<br/>• Contemporary main bathroom<br/>• Double parking available<br/>• Low-maintenance outdoor space<br/><br/>Located in the highly desirable Riverlea Park community, this home offers easy access to parks, walking trails, local amenities and emerging lifestyle facilities, all within a vibrant and well-planned neighbourhood.<br/><br/>This is a fantastic opportunity to secure a brand-new home in a thriving and family-friendly suburb.<br/><br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate; however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition). Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal advice.<br/><br/>RLA 341434','house','Riverlea Park',-34.65105802,138.53730998,5120,'SA','10  Reedy Road','Riverlea Park',2,3,2,'Belle Property Mawson Lakes','Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(3567,'Easy Living',830,'What you see: <br/>A family entertainer that ticks boxes like no other. Spacious by design indoors and out, this home has incredible flow and is located a level walk to schools, shops and greenbelt space.<br/><br/>What we see: <br/>A home that feels exactly like that.<br/><br/>See more: <br/>Open plan kitchen with ample storage & dishwasher<br/>Master bedroom with ensuite<br/>Three generous sized bedrooms with built in robes<br/>Main bathroom with bath<br/>Many different living spaces<br/>Large backyard<br/>Zoned ducted heating & cooling<br/>Additional kitchenette<br/>Large laundry<br/>Public transport at your doorstep<br/>Ample schooling options nearby<br/>Short distance to local shops where you will find amenities and entertainment<br/>Nearby walking trails, parks and bbq facilities<br/><br/>12-month lease | Available 27th March 2026<br/>EER: Unknown<br/>Embedded Network: No<br/>Disability Access: Unknown<br/>Pets: We request you seek owner\'s approval in writing for pets<br/>- The property complies with the minimum ceiling insulation standard.<br/><br/>INSPECTION – LET\'S TALK<br/>Please book an inspection by clicking the \'BOOK INSPECTION\' button below. If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations, or further inspection times.<br/><br/>WANT TO APPLY?<br/>1. https://2apply.com.au/agency?n=HiveCanberra&form=0<br/><br/>Disclaimer: The material and information contained within this marketing is for general information purposes only. HIVE Property does not accept responsibility and disclaims all liabilities regarding any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. You should not rely upon this material as a basis for making any formal decisions. We recommend all interested parties make further enquiry.<br/><br/>','house','Harrison',-35.18912420,149.15320508,2914,'ACT','50 Osprey Street','Harrison',2,4,2,'HIVE Property','Garage: 2'),(3568,'Classic Charm & Quiet Location',600,'** All applications to be submitted through https://app.snug.com/apply **<br/><br/>Nestled in a peaceful, tree-lined street in the heart of the highly sought-after Surrey Downs, this beautifully maintained original home offers a wonderful blend of comfort, space, and future potential. Set on a generous allotment, it provides an inviting haven for families looking to settle into a quiet yet convenient neighbourhood.<br/><br/>Inside, the home features three spacious bedrooms, all well-proportioned and filled with natural light. The master bedroom is complete with a built-in robe and the added convenience of direct access to the centrally located bathroom, enhancing everyday practicality. The bathroom itself is well-kept and functional, perfectly positioned to service the entire household.<br/><br/>Designed with family living in mind, the home boasts two separate living areas, offering flexibility for relaxing, entertaining, or creating distinct zones for adults and children. Whether it\'s a formal lounge, a casual family room, or a space for movie nights, the options are endless. The central kitchen sits at the heart of the home, connecting seamlessly to the living spaces and making daily living and entertaining effortless.<br/><br/>Step outside and be impressed by the spacious backyard, where a fantastic outdoor entertaining area awaits. Ideal for weekend barbecues, family gatherings, or simply unwinding in a private and tranquil setting, this outdoor space enhances the home\'s appeal and lifestyle offering.<br/><br/><br/>Features you\'ll love: <br/>• Quietly positioned in a tightly held pocket of Surrey Downs<br/>• Well-maintained original residence with timeless appeal<br/>• Three spacious bedrooms, including master with built-in robe<br/>• Direct access from master bedroom to the central bathroom<br/>• Central bathroom in excellent original condition<br/>• Two separate living zones offering versatile family living<br/>• Centrally located kitchen<br/>• Functional layout ideal for everyday living and entertaining<br/>• Expansive backyard with established surrounds<br/>• Covered outdoor entertaining area perfect for hosting<br/>• Peaceful setting with excellent privacy<br/>• Conveniently located near schools, shopping, parks, and public transport<br/><br/>Available - 6/3/26<br/><br/>Pets - negotiable<br/><br/>On behalf of Doman & Co, we strive to do our absolute best in obtaining the correct information for this advertisement. The accuracy of this information cannot be guaranteed, and all interested parties should view the property and seek independent advice.','house','Surrey Downs',-34.79887892,138.71408332,5126,'SA','3 Leyte Drive','Surrey Downs',1,3,1,'Doman & Co.','Carport: 1'),(3569,'Near new apartment in a prime location!',700,'Step into sophisticated living with this stunning near-new 2 bedroom, ensuite apartment, perfectly positioned in the highly sought-after suburb of Turner. Thoughtfully designed with modern lifestyles in mind, this immaculate residence combines stylish interiors, premium finishes, and effortless convenience.<br/> <br/>Enjoy generous open-plan living, a sleek gourmet kitchen, and light-filled spaces that flow seamlessly to a private balcony-perfect for entertaining or relaxing in style. Located just minutes from the vibrant Canberra CBD, ANU, and public transport, this apartment delivers the best of urban living right at your doorstep.<br/> <br/>• 2 bedroom l 2 bathroom l 2 allocated car spaces in the basement<br/>• Near new condition throughout<br/>• Located on level 4<br/>• North facing apartment with views<br/>• Large main bedroom featuring built in wardrobes<br/>• Generous second bedroom with mirror robes <br/>• Designer kitchen with stone benchtops and quality appliances<br/>• High-quality SMEG dishwasher, induction cooktop, and oven<br/>• North facing open plan living area<br/>• Reverse cycling air conditioning and heating throughout<br/>• Double-glazed windows and doors<br/>• LED lighting throughout<br/>• Brand new sheers and electric blinds<br/>• Heated flooring in the bathrooms and heated towel rail in the ensuite<br/>• Vented European laundry with dryer included<br/>• All electric<br/>• Private balcony ideal for outdoor enjoyment with power and water outlets<br/>• Two basement carparks (one standard, one disabled) and cage<br/>• Lift access and intercom to the apartment<br/>• It\'s a 100-meter walk to the light rail station.<br/>• Adjacent to Hotel Mantra<br/>• Coffee shop and GP downstairs<br/>• Minutes to cafes, shops and parks<br/>• Enjoy a short walk to the Haigh Markets every Sunday morning.<br/>• Attractive location in walking distance to the City Center<br/>• Just a short distance from the City CBD, you\'ll find ANU, cafes, restaurants, and popular bars.<br/>• Available soon<br/>• Pets require landlords consent at all stages of the tenancy<br/>• The property has a valid exemption in regard to the ceiling insulation requirements<br/>• EER: 6.0<br/><br/>Open for inspection times may be subject to change, please register or book inspection to receive updated notifications. Follow the link to book an inspection or submit an application.<br/><br/>https://2apply.com.au/agency?n=Bellecanberra<br/><br/>Inspection code for after you have inspected the property and wish to apply: BELLE2604<br/><br/>Please note that Belle Property does not require applicants to complete or pay for the optional 2Apply Premium Identity Verification. Choosing not to complete this verification will not impact how your application is assessed or processed.<br/><br/>Whilst all care has been taken to ensure accuracy in the preparation of the particulars herein, no warranty can be given, and interested parties must rely on their own enquiries. This business is independently owned and operated by Belle Property Canberra. ABN 95 611 730 806 trading as Belle Property Canberra.','apartment','Turner',-35.26060556,149.13132535,2612,'ACT','42/122 Macarthur Avenue','Turner',2,2,2,'Belle Property Canberra - CANBERRA','Open Spaces: 2, Living Areas: 1'),(3570,'Open the Door to Sensational Family Living',740,'Perfectly positioned in a quiet, family‑friendly pocket, this modern and spacious four‑bedroom home opens the door to effortless living. With multiple living zones, low‑maintenance outdoor areas, and everyday convenience at your fingertips, this is the lifestyle upgrade you\'ve been searching for.<br/><br/>Open the Door To:<br/>- A light‑filled family lounge flowing directly to the backyard – the perfect place to unwind<br/>- A generous open‑plan kitchen and dining space designed for connection<br/>- Modern kitchen with dishwasher, gas stove, electric oven and exceptional storage<br/>- Master bedroom sanctuary with walk‑in robe and ensuite<br/>- 3 spacious upstairs bedrooms, all with built‑in robes<br/>- Contemporary three‑way main bathroom<br/>- Split‑system heating & cooling for year‑round comfort<br/>- Double garage under the main roof with secure internal access<br/>- Security alarm system for added peace of mind<br/>- Low‑maintenance gardens so you spend more time enjoying, not maintaining<br/><br/>Close the Door On:<br/>- Long commutes with easy access to transport links<br/>- Weekend chores with easy‑care outdoor areas<br/>- Cramped living with generous internal spaces across two levels<br/>- Storage woes thanks to thoughtfully designed cabinetry and built‑ins<br/><br/>A home that blends modern style with everyday practicality, all while being moments from schools, shops, cafes and transport. If you\'re seeking a lifestyle that\'s easy, connected and family‑focused - this one is for you.<br/><br/>Bond – $2,960<br/>Lease Term – 12 months<br/>Water Charges – Quarterly supply and usage<br/>Unfurnished<br/><br/>WOULD YOU LIKE TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY?<br/>Please submit an enquiry to register your details and be notified of all available inspection times plus receive our online application form.<br/><br/>To view and apply for our other available properties please visit www.ocre.com.au/rent<br/><br/>OUWENS CASSERLY – MAKE IT HAPPEN ™<br/>RLA: 275403/223245<br/><br/>All information or material provided has been obtained from third party sources and, as such, we cannot guarantee that the information or material is accurate. Ouwens Casserly Real Estate Pty Ltd accepts no liability for any errors or omissions (including, but not limited to, a property\'s floor plans and land size, building condition or age). Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own professional advice.','house','Morphett Vale',-35.10785258,138.52758511,5162,'SA','1 The Glenn','Morphett Vale',2,4,2,'OC Real Estate Adelaide - RLA 275403','Open Spaces: 2'),(3571,'Spacious Family Retreat',900,'Nestled within a peaceful, tightly held cul-de-sac, this beautifully appointed residence delivers refined family living with an emphasis on space, comfort and effortless entertaining. The home offers a private sanctuary designed to accommodate modern lifestyles with ease.<br/><br/>From the moment you arrive, the home\'s generous proportions and thoughtful layout are immediately apparent. Multiple living zones provide versatility for both relaxed family living and formal entertaining, while large windows invite natural light throughout, creating a warm and welcoming ambience.<br/><br/>At the heart of the home, the well equipped kitchen offers abundant bench space and storage, seamlessly connecting to the living and dining areas for easy everyday living. Outdoors, the expansive backyard provides a tranquil setting ideal for entertaining guests, children at play, or simply unwinding in complete privacy.<br/><br/>Accommodation comprises four spacious bedrooms, including a well appointed master retreat complete with ensuite. The main bathroom is generously sized and thoughtfully designed to service the remaining bedrooms.<br/>Positioned moments from local schools, parks and shopping amenities, and within easy reach of Queanbeyan and Canb