n Times<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection<br/>3. If there is no time available or if the time does not suit, please register and we will contact you once further access can be arranged<br/>4. Please note that if you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancella-tions or further inspection times<br/><br/>APPLICATIONS<br/>To apply click on the \'APPLY ONLINE\' button and complete the application.<br/><br/>BOND AND RENT<br/>Bond is equivalent to 4 weeks rent <br/>Please note Total Property Management does not accept any cash or cheque payments<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Please note that while all care has been taken regarding general information and marketing information compiled for this rental advertisement, Total Property Management does not ac-cept responsibility and disclaim all liabilities in regard to any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We encourage prospective tenants to rely on their own investigation and in-person in-spections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.','studio','Chifley',-35.35107025,149.07526377,2606,'ACT','4/45 Eggleston Crescent','Chifley',1,1,2,'Total Property Management - MANUKA',NULL),(3592,'Recently renovated fully furnished unit!',380,'TO APPLY FOR THIS PROPERTY<br/>Submit your application via - www.2apply.com.au/login<br/><br/>Ray White Mt Gambier proudly presents 1/17 Davison Street, Mt Gambier for rent.<br/><br/>Step into this effortless style and modern convenience with this renovated one-bedroom unit. Freshly updated with a keen eye for contemporary design, this fully furnished gem offers a lifestyle for those seeking a low maintenance home. The bright and fresh paintwork creates an immediate sense of space and clarity, perfectly anchored by the warmth of new timber vinyl flooring that flows seamlessly throughout the home.<br/><br/>The kitchen is a standout boasts sleek modern cabinetry and a versatile island bench. This central space is bathed in natural light, softened by elegant sheer curtains. To ensure the environment is as comfortable as it is beautiful, a split system provides effortless climate control through every season.<br/><br/>The bedroom is designed with versatility, offering both a double and a single bed to cater to various living arrangements. This room features built-in wardrobes that provide ample storage. Adjacent to the bedroom is the bathroom including a new timber-look vanity, modern shower and toilet.<br/><br/>The laundry area offers a timber-look benchtop and cabinetry, fully equipped with a washing machine and a trough for ultimate convenience. The lifestyle experience extends to the outdoor area, where a dining table set invites you to enjoy alfresco meals. <br/><br/>Additional Information:<br/>Lease Term: 6 Months<br/>Pets: Pets upon application<br/>RLA: 291952','unit','Mount Gambier',-37.82889059,140.79263670,5290,'SA','1/17 Davison Street','Mount Gambier',1,1,1,'Ray White Mt Gambier -  RLA 291953','Garage: 1'),(3593,'\"Your One-Bedroom Retreat in Queanbeyan - Lakeside Living with City Convenience\"',380,'Looking for the perfect mix of peaceful living and city convenience? This charming 1-bedroom unit in the heart of Queanbeyan offers exactly that – and more! Ideal for singles or couples, this top pick is only minutes from the Queanbeyan Shopping Centre, local schools, leafy parks, and just a short 15–20 minute drive to Canberra\'s CBD – making it the perfect choice for commuters or those wanting quick access to city life without the hustle.<br/><br/>Step inside and enjoy a light-filled open-plan living space that flows effortlessly into a well-appointed kitchen. The bedroom is generously sized with built-in storage and plenty of natural light. Whether you\'re relaxing after work or starting your day with a coffee, the picturesque lake views offer a calming backdrop that\'s rare to find in a unit at this price point.<br/><br/>Situated in a quiet, well-maintained complex, this unit provides 