omfort, convenience, and contemporary living.<br/><br/>This light-filled home features an open-plan living and dining area with modern hybrid timber flooring, modern neutral tones, and ducted reverse cycle air conditioning for year-round comfort. <br/>The sleek kitchen includes ample storage, quality appliances including a dishwasher, and a functional layout including internal access to your own secure lock up garage and access to your own private paved courtyard perfect for everyday living.<br/><br/>Upstairs, youll find two spacious bedrooms, both with built-in robes. The master bedroom includes its own private ensuite, while the second bathroom features a full-sized bathtub ideal for relaxing at the end of the day.<br/>Both bedrooms are separated by a second living space, ideal for a home office or second TV space and adding lots of versatility to the home.<br/><br/>Additional features include:<br/>Modern fixtures and fittings throughout<br/>Separate laundry<br/>Third toilet downstairs<br/>Ample storage throughout<br/><br/>Situated in the sought-after suburb of Paradise, this home is conveniently located close to shops, schools, public transport, parks, and the Linear Park walking trails.<br/><br/>Perfect for professionals, couples, or small families seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle in a great location.<br/><br/>To avoid disappointment, we encourage you to register your interest so we can keep you informed during all stages of the leasing process. <br/><br/>We believe the above information to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions. Interested parties should make their own enquiries and you must view the property in person to make sure it reflects the list of inclusions listed in this ad.','unit','Paradise',-34.86911284,138.67981146,5075,'SA','6/2 La Scala Court','Paradise',2,2,1,'Harcourts Sheppard - (RLA 324145)','Garage: 1, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Pets Allowed'),(3595,'A Beautiful Courtyard Hom