y, they can have peace of mind knowing that the unit will be their forever home as it is a permanent investment. <br/><br/>AVAILABLE 16th MARCH $375pw - you won\'t find better at that rent!!<br/><br/>This cosy single bedroom unit is set in peaceful surrounds in a gated complex where mature aged residents are your neighbours giving a friendly and respectful environment. The expansive grounds in the complex are glorious, being carefully maintained at a high level by the Body Corp Management. <br/><br/>THIS UNIT HAS BEEN RECENTLY UPGRADED FROM TOP-TO-TOE WITH: <br/>• Brand new high gloss kitchen with microwave provision, fridge alcove, small induction cooktop and plentiful cupboard & drawer storage<br/>• Brand new rich charcoal carpets add a touch of class<br/>• Professionally painted throughout - so light and fresh<br/>• Lounge with LED light (with remote control dimmer) and on-trend white timber venetian shutters dressing the bay window<br/>• Double size bedroom with ceiling fan, wall of mirrored robes with fitted shelving.<br/>• Ensuite bathroom with laundry provision<br/>• Brand new toilet system<br/>• Glass sliding doors from bedroom out to spacious private rear courtyard ... totally maintenance-free. <br/><br/>It\'s not a huge unit, but it is particularly cute and cosy and ideal for a sole occupant, however couples are certainly welcome to apply. Retired, mature-aged tenants will fit in nicely to the demographic here and enjoy the company of like-minded individuals. <br/><br/>All in all, a safe, secure, peaceful environment you can call your \'Forever Home\'<br/><br/>REGISTER YOUR INTEREST VIA EMAIL TAB TO THE LETTING AGENT. INSPECTIONS ONLY FOR THOSE WHO HAVE REGISTERED.<br/>WE WILL BE BACK IN TOUCH TO EVERYONE WITH INSPECTION DETAILS<br/>','unit','Hackham',-35.14886562,138.52677469,5163,'SA','144 Main South Road (off Service Road)','Hackham',1,1,2,'REAL Estate Agents Group (RLA 187119) - PLYMPTON',NULL),(3609,'FAMILY HOME in RHSZ',720,'18 ERRINBEE STREET, RIVERTON <br/>Spacious family home ideally located in the highly desirable suburb of Riverton, this well-presented 3-bedrooms family home offers comfort, space and convenience within the prized Rossmoyne Senior High School zone. Easy access to shopping and entertainment precincts (Riverton forum shopping centre, Leisureplex, cafes, and restaurants), schools, Curtin University, public transport links, plus quick access to the CBD and Perth AirPort. <br/>','house','Riverton',-32.03448000,115.88700000,6148,'WA','18 Errinbee Street','Riverton',1,3,2,'Property Owner','Carport: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Broadband Internet Available'),(3610,'4x2 Townhouse in fantastic Subiaco location!',1350,'We welcome you to 21/200 Rokeby Road - a modern 4x2 townhouse in central Subiaco location! <br/><br/>You will want for nothing living in this fantastic location on Rokeby Road. Subiaco is full of wonderful restaurants and cafes to enjoy as well as a variety of shopping options! Enjoy the nearby amenities of Rankin Gardens, the Subi Farmers Market, Farmer Jacks and Subiaco Arts Centre. Also located nearby is the lovely Kings Park, where you can enjoy a daily stroll. Located only a short drive from the CBD and with an array of public transport options nearby including the central Subiaco station, you can commute to the city easily. For those with a family, Subiaco Primary School and Bob Hawke College are in close proximity to the property. <br/><br/>This tri-level townhouse will impress you from the moment you walk in. Spacious and bathed in natural light, the ground floor has an open plan living, kitchen and dining area which opens out to a private courtyard area - a lovely spot to spend your evenings entertaining family and friends or enjoy a relaxed morning coffee! The kitchen has a large island bench, high quality appliances and plenty of storage which is perfect for those who love to cook and entertain. The first floor has a large room with a balcony, which can be used in many ways, including as a guest retreat, home office, nursery, or second living area - the options are endless! There is also another bedroom on this level, as well as a modern bathroom that services both rooms. On the upper level, there is two large bedrooms and another modern bathroom which also includes a bathtub.<br/><br/>Complete with all the modern amenities, an unbeatable location, and space for the whole family, this home offers a unique opportunity to be a Subiaco local! Low maintenance, private and secure, this townhouse is the perfect place to call home.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>- two secure underground side by side car bays<br/>- a third outside car bay located adjacent to the back entrance<br/>- storeroom<br/>- secure lift access between the carpark and residential entry courtyard<br/>- private rear access gate to front courtyard<br/>- split-system air-conditioning<br/>- gas bayonet for heating in the main living<br/>- large island stone bench top<br/>- white goods are included (fridge, washing machine and dryer)<br/>- stainless steel high quality appliances including a pull out range hood, gas cooktop, oven and dishwasher<br/>- separate laundry room with plenty of storage, and a skylight<br/>- downstairs has a powder room next to laundry<br/>- feature skylight to the top floor landing<br/>- near new carpets and recently re-painted<br/>- intercom system servicing both the complex entrance and your own courtyard entry door<br/>- security doors<br/>- gas storage hot water system<br/><br/>*Please note, the property is unfurnished (except for the inclusion of fridge, washing machine and dryer). The furnishings pictured are for display purposes only.<br/><br/>**** IMPORTANT PLEASE REGISTER TO INSPECT ****<br/>Please register your details by selecting \'Book Inspection\' and you will be INSTANTLY informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your property appointment. If no one registers for an inspection, then that inspection may not proceed.<br/><br/>Please con