ting friends, enjoying sunset drinks, and creating homemade pizzas in your own elevated outdoor space.<br/><br/>This is more than just a rental - it\'s a lifestyle opportunity in a prime coastal location.<br/><br/>Fully furnished, beautifully maintained, and ready to move in by the end of March.<br/><br/>Homes of this calibre in Doubleview don\'t last long.<br/><br/>Enquire today and make this exceptional property your next home.<br/><br/>WANT TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY? Simply click the BOOK INSPECTION button and you will immediately be able to see and book in any available viewing times (if a date is not currently available you will receive an SMS and email as soon as it\'s available to view).<br/><br/>Please ensure you are registered for all viewings so we can keep you updated on any changes.<br/><br/>Once you have viewed the property, you will be sent an SMS and email with a link to apply.<br/><br/>Own an investment property? If you are looking for property management services, we would love to hear from you. Contact me today for a confidential chat - 6555 7771.<br/><br/><br/><br/>','house','Doubleview',-31.89467740,115.78428826,6018,'WA','239a Holbeck Street','Doubleview',2,4,2,'One Agency - North','Garage: 2, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2, Furnished'),(3612,'Character Home and fully furnished!',1290,'This beautifully presented, fully furnished two-bedroom, one-bathroom home with two off-street car bays is perfectly positioned in the heart of Swanbourne. From the welcoming front entrance to the private courtyard garden, every detail has been thoughtfully maintained to create a warm and inviting home.<br/><br/>The two spacious bedrooms feature polished wooden floors, built-in wardrobes and ceiling fans. A well-appointed bathroom is conveniently located across the hall, complete with a shower and excellent storage.<br/>The centrally located kitchen is filled with natural light from large windows and is equipped with quality appliances, including a gas cooktop, large oven, dishwasher and fridge.<br/><br/> A laundry facility with washing machine and separate powder room is also incorporated into this space. Reverse-cycle split system air conditioning ensures year-round comfort.<br/><br/>The generous living area is light and airy, enhanced by high ceilings, a feature fireplace, and expansive bi-fold doors that open seamlessly onto the private courtyard, perfect for relaxed indoor-outdoor living.<br/><br/>Surrounded by beautiful local parks and just moments from cafés and restaurants, the home is conveniently located near Claremont Quarter, Swanbourne Primary School, and some of Perth’s leading private schools. Public transport is at your doorstep, with buses to the city and the train station just a short walk away.<br/><br/>Enjoy the peace and prestige of this sought-after suburb, only a three-minute drive from the iconic North Cottesloe Beach.<br/><br/>Please note:<br/>• Studio at the rear of the property is not available for tenant use<br/>• Linen is not provided<br/><br/>A charming, low-maintenance home in an exceptional coastal location.<br/><br/>Minimum Lease - 6 months <br/><br/>','house','Swanbourne',-31.98178000,115.76370000,6010,'WA','31 North Street','Swanbourne',1,2,2,'Leasing Elite Pty Ltd','Courtyard, Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Floorboards, Open Fireplace, Toilets: 2, Furnished'),(3613,'Unique 4-Bedroom Fully Furnished & Equipped Home with City Views',1200,'HOME OPENS THIS WEEKEND<br/><br/>Saturday 28th February from 3:00 – 3:30 pm and Sunday 1st March from 12:30-1:00pm<br/><br/>Elevated in a prime pocket of Mount Hawthorn, this beautifully preserved 1957 home captures stunning city and hill views. Just moments from The Mezz and the vibrant Scarborough Beach Road café and retail strip, you’ll enjoy an unbeatable walkable lifestyle with multiple public transport options connecting you to the Perth CBD, Northbridge, Leederville and the coast.<br/><br/>Rich in character, the home features B