rom the city.<br/><br/>There is a secure carport featuring automated roller doors and roller blinds, assisting with securing the property. The dining area opens into the carport and adjoins the back verandah, making entertaining extremely easy!<br/><br/>You have the ability to park up to 4 vehicles on the property. There is a carport as well as a double driveway. The house is positioned on the corner, making the property extremely accessible. <br/><br/>This home will not be vacant for long! Please enquire and look for openings, or we are more than happy to accommodate private openings.<br/>','house','Flinders Park',-34.90958980,138.53770901,5025,'SA','14 Fowler Avenue','Flinders Park',1,3,4,'Crystal Property Group - Somerton Park','Carport: 1, Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Built-in Wardrobes, Toilets: 1'),(3621,'Family Home - Available from 5th March 2026',770,'This lovely character Wanneroo home is located on a corner block with secure side access to a Huge double workshop, perfect for the tradesperson or the shed lovers. <br/><br/>Easy care floating timber flooring throughout the good sized living spaces with both lounge and family rooms and an enclosed patio perfect for a games room. <br/><br/>Ducted air-conditioning is perfect for summer, cooling all areas and the large kitchen is central to the home. <br/><br/>4 good sized bedrooms which are carpeted and a bright bathroom complete the inside. <br/><br/>There is a paved undercover patio area for entertaining off the games room and plenty of space for the kids and fur babies to run and play. <br/><br/>Separate double gates lead to a huge workshop and there is a covered carport under the main roof also. <br/><br/>Located in a great location close to schools, shops and all that Wanneroo has to offer this is a gem. <br/><br/>Pets Neg<br/><br/>Lawn maintenance including fertiliser top up will be tenants responsibility.<br/><br/>*Inf