br/>What to know:<br/>Unfurnished<br/>Available 20th Mar\'26<br/>Pets Considered on Application<br/><br/><br/>To view this property:<br/>1. Please book an inspection from this website<br/>2. You\'ll receive a text or email to a book a viewing, please click the link and follow the prompts<br/>3. You\'ll receive a text or email confirming that you have registered for your viewing<br/><br/>Please ensure you register for any bookings to be notified of any delays, cancellations or changes to the viewing time.','acreage/semi-rural','North Perth',-31.92346000,115.84767000,6006,'WA','A/10 Auckland Street','North Perth',2,3,1,'Realmark Urban - LEEDERVILLE','Garage: 1'),(3626,'Large Character Apartment',750,'This perfectly situated ground floor apartment has a large lounge and dining room, modern kitchen, two large bedrooms, private courtyard and parking for 2 cars. It is conveniently located just East of the beautiful Rose Garden Park land and walking distance to many amenities. This fantastic apartment would suit working professionals wanting easy access to the university precinct, hospitals and the CBD. <br/><br/>- 2 large bedrooms<br/>- Built in Robe to Master Bed<br/>- Polished floorboards<br/>- New oven & gas cook top<br/>- A/C split system <br/>- 1 Garage and room for a second car externally<br/>- Freshly painted <br/>- Situated in a small group of 4 quiet apartments<br/><br/>To arrange a viewing please contact James Heath : [REDACTED EMAIL] : or register for an inspection online. It is recommended to register for an inspection in order to be kept well informed of any changes or amendments to the inspection schedule.','house','Nedlands',-31.97999076,115.80053134,6009,'WA','3/112 Stirling Highway','Nedlands',1,2,2,'Collective Property Group WA - COTTESLOE','Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1'),(3627,'Coastal Beauty - Ready for Exceptional Tenants!',750,'We are thrilled to present this stunning, fully renovated 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom home - an exceptional opportunity for tenants looking for style, space, and comfort in a prime coastal location.<br/><br/>Set on a generous 542sqm block, with a thoughtfully designed 187sqm floor plan, this home has been beautifully updated with contemporary finishes and effortless charm throughout.<br/><br/>From the moment you step inside, you\'ll be welcomed by crisp, fresh interiors, bathed in natural light, with oak-look hybrid flooring, a neutral colour palette, and stylish LED downlights enhancing the bright, airy atmosphere.<br/><br/>The open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area forms the heart of the home - perfect for relaxed living and entertaining. The kitchen is a dream, featuring stone benchtops, sleek white cabinetry, an electric cooktop, wall oven, integrated microwave, and a seamless modern design.<br/><br/>There\'s a separate theatre/media room for cozy movie nights, while all four bedrooms are generously sized, each with mirrored built-in robes and modern blinds. The master suite enjoys split-system air conditioning, a private ensuite, and a front-facing aspect offering extra privacy.<br/><br/>Both bathrooms have been meticulously renovated, complete with frameless glass showers, stylish vanities, and elegant finishes.<br/><br/>This home offers thoughtful accessibility, with no stairs throughout the property. Two areas feature gentle, seamless ramps, providing easy access and making it an ideal option for those who require a wheelchair-friendly or stair-free living environment.<br/><br/>Step outside and you\'ll find a spacious, undercover alfresco area - ideal for year-round entertaining - leading to a beautifully landscaped, low-maintenance backyard with raised garden beds, artificial lawn, paved areas, and a handy garden shed. Fully fenced with side access gates, this backyard is both functional and secure.<br/><br/>Additional features you\'ll love:<br/><br/>• Tandem carport with additional off-street parking<br/><br/>• 2 x Split system air-conditioning<br/><br/>• Exceptional kitchen<br/><br/>• Separate laundry with outdoor access<br/><br/>• Small Shed<br/><br/>• Prime location: 2 minutes to the beach, close to schools, shops, transport, and just 3 minutes to freeway access<br/><br/>This home offers the perfect blend of modern luxury and easy living, all in a sought-after coastal setting.<br/><br/>We are looking for tenants who will appreciate and care for this beautiful home as their own.<br/><br/>Don\'t miss out - homes of this quality and location are rarely available for rent!<br/><br/>Online Applications Only<br/><br/>Please feel free to apply online before viewing the property; however, we will only present applications to the landlord from tenants who have viewed in person or through a representative. For those attending on behalf of a prospective tenant, please be advised it is the representative\'s responsibility to note details seen on the day, including features throughout the property such as air conditioning.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: The above listing information has been provided by sources we deem reliable. We do not accept any responsibility to any person for its accuracy. All interested parties should rely on their own enquiries to determine the accuracy of this information.<br/><br/>','house','Merriwa',-31.67258000,115.71478000,6030,'WA','15 PALERMO CT','Merriwa',2,4,2,'Ray White Northern Coast','Carport: 2, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(3628,'Super City View Apartment',735,'Be quick to secure this 2 bedroom apartment on the 14th floor of the most central city apartment complex (Paragon CBD) with stunning northern views and plenty of light you will feel right at home here.<br/><br/>With all your transport and shopping needs just a short walk away, and close to all the major Oil and mining companies head offices and the new ECU again in walking distance.<br/><br/>The apartment comes full furnished and equipped so just bring your suitcase, this is ideal if your here on a 12 month contract.<br/><br/>No car bay, No Smoking and No pets<br/><br/>Inspections 3rd, 5th and 6th March at 12pm - Call to confirm attendance - David Tuckey [REDACTED PHONE] or Hazel [REDACTED PHONE]','apartment','Perth',-31.95326217,115.85530069,6000,'WA','14i/811  Hay Street','Perth',1,2,2,'Tuckey Property Group','Balcony, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Furnished'),(3629,'Fully renovated with Solar + battery + more',700,'This clean and comfortable 3 bedroom house was fully renovated recently from top to bottom. It has a new kitchen, new bathroom and toilet, new built-in wardrobes in all bedrooms with all windows double-glazed for year-round comfort and efficiency. <br/><br/>Ceiling insulation was replaced and reverse-cycle heating/cooling installed in the two larger bedrooms. A gas heater keeps the living areas of the house cosy in winter. Cleaning is easy with high traffic areas featuring new wooden flooring, and bedrooms having new carpet.<br/><br/>To minimise living expenses, and be kinder to the planet, solar panels and a battery were installed 12 months ago. Rent also includes Internet access.<br/><br/>There is a secure back yard with a mature lemon tree and apple tree plus space for a vege garden if you are keen. There is room in the lock-up garage for a car and bikes etc.<br/><br/>80 Lachlan St is a short walk from Belconnen town centre, even closer to the Jamison shopping centre and the bus to Civic or Belconnen mall goes right past the front door. Macquarie primary school is literally across the road, as is a childcare centre, doctor’s surgery and the local shops.<br/>','house','Macquarie',-35.24838212,149.06146619,2614,'ACT','80 Lachlan Street','Macquarie',1,3,1,'Property Owner','Balcony, Carport: 1, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Pets Allowed'),(3630,'WELLARD 4 X2 LARGE FAMILY HOME FOR LEASE',690,'WELLARD 4x2 FAMILY HOME FOR LEASE - Break Lease <br/><br/>It is our pleasure to proudly present this quality 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom home to the market for rent. This home will not disappoint.<br/><br/>Property features include: <br/><br/>* 4 bedrooms <br/>* Built-in robes in all bedrooms and walk-in robe in the main bedroom<br/>* 2 Bathrooms that will impress <br/>* Ducted air-conditioning <br/>* Theatre room <br/>* Spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen <br/>* Beautiful galley kitchen with modern glass splash back <br/>* Abundance of cupboard space and large walk-in in pantry<br/>* 900mm gas Stainless steel cook top<br/>* 900mm Electric under-bench oven <br/>* Tiled flooring in the living areas, quality carpets in the bedrooms and theatre room <br/>* Roller blinds throughout <br/>* Alfresco area to entertain your friends <br/>* Modern Decor <br/>* Large garage <br/><br/>Ideally located within the Providence Estate and offers easy access to Perth city and surrounds by both road (Kwinana Freeway) and rail (Wellard train station). Located close to schools that provide an array of education choices. Don\'t forget Wellard Square and Kwinana Marketplace to enjoy the shopping and lovely parks in the estate as well, you will not be disappointed with this property. <br/>• • <br/>How to Apply:<br/>Register to View: Please register your interest online to be notified of the next available viewing time.<br/>Attendance at a viewing is required.<br/>Online application links will be provided to all attendees after the property has been inspected.','house','Wellard',-32.26789792,115.84167361,6170,'WA','35 Rockport Ridge','Wellard',2,4,2,'Encore Property Group - KWINANA TOWN CENTRE','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2, Pets Allowed'),(3631,'Modern Townhouse in Small Gated Community',680,'DB Philpott Real Estate are excited to offer this double-storey townhouse in the ever-popular suburb of Prospect. <br/><br/>Offering a large, light filled, open plan living area which is adjoined by the modern kitchen with quality appliances and ample cupboard space.<br/><br/>Upstairs comprises three bedrooms, the main is very generous with a walk-in robe and oversized ensuite plus direct access to your private balcony. The other two bedrooms are a good size and offer B.I.R\'s. The two way main bathroom provides convenient access to both bedrooms two and three.<br/><br/>Outside offers an undercover entertaining area and a bonus fully landscaped yard. Parking is taken care of via a double garage with easy internal access. There is ducted reverse cycle air conditioning, an alarm plus separate laundry with a downstairs W/C.<br/><br/>Exclusions: No<br/>Furnished: No<br/><br/>Bond: If rent is $800 or less, the bond will be equivalent to 4 weeks’ rent. <br/><br/>Water charges: Quarterly supply & usage<br/>Embedded Networks: N/A<br/><br/>Landlords’ intention to sell in next 3 months: No<br/><br/>*Strictly NO still or video footage permitted at any of DB Philpott Real Estates viewings*<br/><br/>Pets may be considered on application; however, pets may not be permissible where Body Corporate rules and regulations apply. <br/><br/>Please note that DB Philpott Real Estate has exclusive agency over this property, and it will not be advertised by any third parties. If you see the property listed elsewhere, it is not our listing and is most likely a scam. Any such instances should be reported to the agency and flagged on the relevant website.<br/><br/>Do you want to view the property or find out more information? Please register your interest below for updates on inspection times. You must be registered for the inspection to attend. If no inspection times are currently available, please submit your details and you will be informed instantly when a new time is available.<br/><br/>We encourage all attendees to follow Government COVID-19 advice and avoid attending inspections in person if you are displaying any flu-like symptoms or have tested positive to COVID-19.<br/><br/>All information has been obtained and understood to be accurate, however we accept no liability for any errors or omissions. We encourage all interested parties to make their own enquiries, particularly regarding NBN/internet availability at the property.<br/><br/>DB Philpott Real Estate Sales and Rentals – Where you’re part of the family! RLA 46442','house','Prospect',-34.87225484,138.59244329,5082,'SA','5/298-300 Prospect Road','Prospect',2,3,2,'D B Philpott Real Estate RLA 46442 - Prospect','Garage: 2, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes'),(3632,'Generous family home with stylish finishes!',660,'Welcome to 13 Fairbrother Circuit, Nuriootpa - a beautifully presented home offering space, comfort and modern family living in the heart of the Barossa.<br/><br/>Positioned in a quiet, family-friendly circuit, this well-designed residence delivers the perfect balance of practicality and lifestyle. From the moment you arrive, you\'ll appreciate the neat street presence and welcoming façade that sets the tone for what\'s inside.<br/><br/>Step through the front door and you\'re greeted by a light-filled interior with a private living room located at the front of the home. Thoughtfully designed with both everyday living and entertaining in mind. The generous open-plan living and dining area forms the heart of the home, seamlessly connecting to the kitchen - complete with quality appliances, ample bench space, huge walk in pantry and excellent storage. It\'s a space where family life naturally comes together.<br/><br/>The home offers well-proportioned bedrooms, including a comfortable master suite positioned for privacy, creating the perfect retreat at the end of the day. Additional bedrooms two and three feature built in robes and are ideal for children, guests, or even a home office setup, depending on your needs.<br/><br/>Outside, the backyard provides plenty of room to enjoy - whether it\'s weekend barbecues, space for kids and pets to play, or simply relaxing in your own private outdoor setting.<br/>The double garage offers secure lockable storage as well as a office/workshop space perfect for extra storage or tinkering. <br/><br/>Located just moments from local schools, shops, parks and the renowned Barossa wineries, this home offers convenience without compromising on lifestyle.<br/><br/>Whether you\'re a growing family or just looking to relax, 13 Fairbrother Circuit presents an outstanding opportunity to secure a quality home in one of Nuriootpa\'s most desirable pockets.<br/><br/>Things we love; <br/>- 3 bedroom home <br/>- Main bedroom with ensuite and walk in robe <br/>- Spacious bedrooms 2 & 3 with built in robes <br/>- Two separate living areas<br/>- Modern kitchen with stainless steel appliances, dishwasher and huge walk in pantry <br/>- Stylish interior with modern finishes<br/>- Three way bathroom with full size shower and bath <br/>- Ducted heating and cooling for comfort all year round <br/>- Tiled floor coverings for easy cleaning <br/>- Undercover patio for entertaining <br/>- Low maintenance gardens and turf grass<br/>- Double lockable garage with space for a workshop <br/><br/>Please contact our agent for more information. <br/>Chloe Goers - [REDACTED PHONE] <br/><br/>Lease Term - 12 months<br/>Available - 27/03/2026 <br/>Amount - $660.00 per week<br/>Bond - 4 weeks rent = $2,640.00<br/>Intention to sell - NO<br/>Exclusions - NO <br/><br/><br/>Disclaimer: While every endeavour has been made to ensure the accuracy of the information supplied, neither the landlord nor our company accept any responsibility or liability for any omissions and/or errors. We advise that if you are intending to lease this property, that you make every necessary independent enquiry, inspection and property searches. This brochure and floorplan, if supplied, are to be used as a guide only. RLA 263081.','house','Nuriootpa',-34.46548910,139.00922811,5355,'SA','13 Fairbrother Circuit','Nuriootpa',2,3,2,'SA Homes & Acreage Property Specialist - WILLIAMSTOWN/NURIOOTPA','Garage: 2'),(3633,'Foreshore living done right',640,'When people talk about lifestyle at Kingston Foreshore, this is what they mean.<br/><br/>Set in the \"Prince of Kingston\" complex, this first-floor furnished one-bedroom apartment delivers modern, low-maintenance living with a relaxed edge. Elevated for privacy and security, it also offers easy access from the secure basement parking.<br/><br/>Architecturally designed with interiors by Hecker Guthrie, the building has a polished, considered feel. Landscaped internal gardens by LSA Design add to the calm atmosphere, while the waterfront cafés, restaurants, and walking trails are just moments away.<br/><br/>Inside, the open-plan layout is filled with natural light. The kitchen, living, and meals area flow onto a covered terrace overlooking open space, creating an easy indoor-outdoor connection. Quality stainless steel appliances, including an Ilve cooktop, oven, and dishwasher, are paired with modern finishes throughout. The bathroom features a floating vanity and subway tiling, and the bedroom includes built-in robes and soft carpet.<br/><br/>Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning keeps things comfortable year-round, and the apartment is offered furnished, making it a genuine move-in-ready opportunity.<br/><br/>The Benefits<br/>• Furnished and move-in ready<br/>• First-floor position with secure access<br/>• Covered terrace overlooking open space<br/>• Quality Ilve kitchen appliances<br/>• Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning<br/>• Secure parking (storage cage not included) <br/><br/>What\'s Near Your addy.<br/>• Cafés and restaurants along the Kingston Foreshore boardwalk<br/>• Walk to Green Square and Kingston shops<br/>• Close to Norgrove Park and lakeside walking trails<br/>• Easy access to Jerrabomberra Wetlands<br/>• Short drive to Manuka and the City<br/><br/>If you\'re chasing lifestyle, walkability, and a furnished apartment in one of Canberra\'s most popular precincts, this one makes it very easy.<br/><br/><br/>Ceiling Insulation: This property meets the minimum standard for ceiling insulation.<br/><br/>Pets: Prior consent from both property owners and the body corporate is required for tenants wishing to keep pets on the premises.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: While we have taken utmost care in the advertising and marketing of these properties, occasionally, building marketing materials/photographs are utilised. Therefore, we do not assume responsibility for any errors or inaccuracies. It is recommended you view the property physically.<br/><br/>Car parking and Storage: During open house viewings, it may not always be possible to view the location and access of car parking or storage cages (if applicable). Should details about these specific inclusions be crucial to you, please request a private viewing if you become the successful applicant.','apartment','Kingston',-35.31404761,149.14877064,2604,'ACT','134/85 Eyre Street','Kingston',1,1,1,'addy.','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Floorboards, Intercom, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Furnished'),(3634,'Modern 3 bedroom home',640,'Welcome to 49 Stanbury Crescent in the beautiful suburb of Ellenbrook. This modern 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom house is now available for lease. <br/><br/>Situated across the road from serene bushland this well maintained home features a spacious kitchen with modern appliances, a comfortable living area, and a good sized outdoor space, this property is perfect for a family or a couple looking for a new home. The property also includes a carport with space for 2 vehicles.<br/><br/>Located in a quiet and friendly neighborhood, this property is close to schools, parks, and shopping centers, making it a convenient and desirable place to live.<br/><br/>Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to lease this wonderful property!<br/><br/>HOW TO INSPECT THIS PROPERTY<br/>Arranging inspections is easy. Simply click on the button above \'Book an inspection\' or alternatively go to our website and book the inspection on this site by entering your details and choose an appointment time that suits you.<br/><br/>You will be INSTANTLY informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your appointment.<br/><br/>If no one registers for an appointment time - then that appointment WILL not proceed. So DON\'T MISS OUT book for an appointment today.<br/><br/>To apply for this property, please use the \'APPLY FOR PROPERTY\' button on our website at rmaproperty.com.au<br/><br/>*Important* Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, Rental Management Australia will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All information is considered correct at the time of printing.','house','Ellenbrook',-31.75351912,115.99021880,6069,'WA','49 Stanbury Crescent','Ellenbrook',2,3,2,'Rental Management Australia - OSBORNE PARK','Carport: 2'),(3635,'Beautifully presented 3 bedroom home',630,'Welcome to 1 The Mews, Seaford! This beautiful 3 bedroom home is available now!<br/><br/>Rent: $630 per week<br/>Available: 18th March<br/>Pets: Negotiable<br/>Bond: 4 weeks rent equivalent<br/>Water Charges: Tenant to pay supply and usage charges<br/><br/>Features you will love:<br/>- Highly desirable Torrens Title courtyard home<br/>- Superb position close to Seaford Shopping Centre, train station, beaches and wineries<br/>- Three bedrooms - master with walk-through robe, ensuite<br/>- Delightful kitchen with stainless steel appliances, Fisher & Paykel dishwasher<br/>- Ducted reverse cycle heating and cooling throughout<br/>- 264m2 block includes beautiful rear garden, decked all-weather entertaining<br/>- Lockup garage with handy internal access <br/><br/>For more information, please contact Amy-Lee Macrow at [REDACTED EMAIL]','house','Seaford',-35.18772552,138.48944198,5169,'SA','1 The Mews','Seaford',2,3,1,'Ray White - Woodcroft','Garage: 1'),(3636,'Laidback Living on Laffer Avenue!',630,'Set in a quiet and secluded court, this beautifully presented 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home at 12 Laffer Avenue, Nuriootpa is a true gem. The open-plan design effortlessly unites the kitchen, dining, and living areas into a stylish, light-filled space, thanks to expansive windows that frame views of the entire backyard. This thoughtfully designed layout encourages seamless indoor-outdoor living, with an easy flow to the outdoor entertaining area.<br/><br/>Located in the heart of South Australia\'s world-renowned Barossa Valley, Nuriootpa is a highly sought-after destination for homebuyers seeking a perfect blend of country charm and modern convenience. As the largest town in the region, Nuriootpa offers a thriving community atmosphere with excellent local amenities, making it an ideal place to call home.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>• As you approach via the double driveway, you\'ll be impressed by the neat street appeal of this well-maintained home, featuring a double lock-up garage and the added convenience of side access to the backyard<br/>• Positioned just off the entryway, the spacious master bedroom boasts a large walk-in robe and a private ensuite, combining comfort with practicality<br/>• As you make your way down the hallway, you\'ll discover to the left a separate lounge room, a perfect retreat for relaxing with a book or enjoying a movie night<br/>• As you continue down the hallway to the right you\'ll find the remaining two bedrooms that are both generously sized<br/>• The main bathroom is well located, has a functional layout with a linen cupboard for added storage and a separate toilet<br/>• The open-plan design brings together the kitchen, dining, and living areas into a stylish, unified space, filled with natural light from expansive windows that overlook the entire backyard. It flows effortlessly to the outdoors, offering the perfect setting for seamless indoor-outdoor living<br/>• At the heart of the home lies the kitchen, an entertainer\'s delight