uiries regarding school availability, distances, and property features.','house','East Victoria Park',-31.99467000,115.90597000,6101,'WA','373 Berwick St','East Victoria Park',1,3,1,'Ray White - Canning River','Open Spaces: 1, Toilets: 1'),(3638,'A Low Maintenance, European Inspired Designed Property',620,'Welcome to this tri-level home in Tonsley Village. This design combines efficient, luxury living with one of Adelaide\'s most convenient suburbs. Spread out over three levels, this home offers an abundance of natural light and modern finishes with all city conveniences right at your doorstep. <br/><br/>This quality home offers: <br/>- 2.7m ceilings throughout. <br/>- Access to renewable energy through CleanPeak Tonsley for reduced electricity, recycled water and natural gas rates. Gas and Power are embedded network, new tenants must contact provider Win Connect to set up.<br/>- Modern kitchen with stainless steel appliances, dishwasher and gas cooking.<br/>- Combined living and dining room with timber floating floors opening to a large balcony with hills views. <br/>- The living room offers a ceiling height of up to 6 metres optimising light and space. <br/>- Loft style main bedroom with large mirrored built-in wardrobes and ensuite. <br/>- Bedroom two with a built-in wardrobe and under stair storage. <br/>- Separate private courtyard from the second bedroom. <br/>- Separate bathroom with modern finishes. <br/>- Split system air conditioner in main bedroom and living room. <br/>- Concealed laundry with storage. <br/>- Single garage with an automatic panel lift door. <br/>- Block out roller blinds.<br/>- Instant gas hot water system. <br/>- Storage shed. <br/><br/>A true standout feature of this home is the location being less than a 5-minute walk to Flinders Rail Link connecting you from Tonsley Station to Adelaide Railway Station in 20 minutes. You are minutes away from bus stops, shopping precincts and all facilities Tonsley Village has to offer. You\'ve conveni