ok Inspection\" button and follow the prompts<br/><br/>For all other websites: Please send an enquiry and we will automatically respond with the open inspection times and how to book<br/><br/>Note: If there are no inspections available yet please send an enquiry and you will be notified as soon as we upload an inspection time.<br/><br/>--------------------<br/><br/>Delivering space, flexibility, and modern comfort, this beautifully presented 4-bedroom home offers the perfect balance of lifestyle and location. Ideal for families, professionals, or those needing extra room to move, this property provides versatile living with quality features throughout.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>• Attractive street appeal with additional off-street parking<br/>• Four generous bedrooms<br/>• Flexible second lounge / potential 5th bedroom or home office<br/>• Light-filled open-plan living and dining area<br/>• Well-appointed kitchen with modern appliances and ample storage overlooking the open plan living area<br/>• Main bathroom with separate bath and shower<br/>• Separate Toilet<br/>• Laundry with external access<br/>• Tiled flooring through main traffic areas<br/>• Roller shutters for privacy and security<br/>• Ducted evaporative cooling & ducted gas heating<br/>• Outdoor entertaining area<br/>• Low maintenance gardens and small lawned area<br/>• 13.2kW Solar System with 48 panels for energy efficiency<br/>• Top-notch security camera system<br/><br/>Conveniently located near shopping centres, Playford Lakes Golf Club, and a variety of popular schools, this property is perfectly situated with easy access to Main North Road and the Northern Expressway, offering quick routes to the Adelaide CBD. Public transport options, including nearby train and bus services, make commuting to the city and beyond a breeze.<br/><br/>Your local school is Mark Oliphant College (B-12).<br/>Other nearby schools include John Hartley School B-6, Riverbanks College B-12, Munno Para Primary School, Angle Vale Primary School, Craigmore High School, Gawler and District College B-12, and Playford International College.<br/><br/>This is a fantastic opportunity to secure a spacious, energy-efficient home in a highly convenient location. Enquire today to arrange your inspection.<br/><br/>Bond - 4 weeks rent equivalent<br/>Lease Term - 12+ months<br/>Water Charges - All water usage and water supply<br/>Furniture - Unfurnished<br/><br/><br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition, inclusions, exclusion, omission) Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal advice. As well as all parties must view the property in person to make sure it reflects the list of inclusions listed in this ad.','house','Munno Para West',-34.65417977,138.67264650,5115,'SA','1 Monterey Drive','Munno Para West',2,4,2,'Ray White St Peters - RLA328740','Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Shed, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(3646,'Contemporary & Convenient',580,'There is so much to love about this nearly brand new apartment, especially the location, as you have so much at your fingertips. Conveniently positioned in the new \"Boulevard\" development you can stroll across the road to the supermarket and fuel station, easily access public transport to CBD and you can even shop \'til you drop at Westfield West Lakes which is just down the road.<br/><br/>This modern well-appointed apartment is located on Level 2 and has a spacious open plan living area, with views over the central park and direct access to your very own great sized balcony which will be the perfect place to sit and relax after a hard day at work or study.<br/><br/>The kitchen has beautiful s