ain bathroom in original condition and separate toilet<br/>- Ceiling fans to bedroom 2 and 3<br/>- Fully renovated kitchen with 900mm gas cooktop, dishwasher overlooking the dining and living area<br/>- Spacious casual lounge + dining zone with ambient LED downlights<br/>- Ducted evaporative cooling to the main house and large r/c split system to the living area<br/>- Fully renovated detached granny flat or home office with ensuite bathroom, wet bar (no oven/stove) and r/c split system<br/>- Large powered storage shed in rear yard<br/>- Single garage with auto door<br/><br/><br/>Situated about 9-12 km northwest of the Adelaide CBD, Royal Park offers excellent access to both the city and the coast - roughly a 20–25-minute drive to the CBD and only minutes from popular beachside precincts like Semaphore and Tennyson Beach.<br/>Well-connected via major roads, including Port Road and Tapley’s Hill Road, with frequent bus services making commuting into the city or around the western suburbs easy and convenient. Close to rail links via nearby suburbs, enhancing access across greater Adelaide.<br/>A short drive to Westfield West Lakes Shopping Centre and the Port Mall for retail, dining and entertainment options.<br/>Close to a range of quality school options including Hendon Primary School, Seaton High School, Mount Carmel College, Portside Christian College and Alberton Primary<br/><br/>LEASE TERM: 12 Months<br/>AVAILABLE FROM: now<br/>WATER CHARGES: Tenant to pay water supply & water usage.<br/>REGISTER & APPLY: www.tenantoptions.com.au<br/><br/>As a part of our service to you, any successful applicant will be contacted by our partners at MyConnect who provide Free No Obligation utility connection services. For more information, visit www.myconnect.com.au<br/><br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate; however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we cannot accept liability for any errors or omissions (including