s and are well-serviced by a large main bathroom featuring a bathtub, separate shower, vanity, and toilet.<br/><br/>At the heart of the home is the well-appointed kitchen, designed for both functionality and style. Featuring stainless steel appliances, abundant storage, an island bench, and a dedicated fridge alcove, it flows seamlessly into the expansive open-plan living and dining area. Large windows and sliding doors flood the space with natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere ideal for entertaining family and friends.<br/><br/>Step outside to discover a fantastic undercover outdoor entertaining area, complete with its own sink and storage - perfect for weekend barbecues or relaxed evenings at home. Positioned on a corner block, the property offers added privacy and space, making it ideal for families and children to enjoy.<br/><br/>Additional features include roller shutters for privacy and security, ducted air conditioning for year-round comfort, a secure double garage, a practical laundry with storage and external access, and an eco-friendly rainwater tank supporting sustainable living.<br/><br/>Features you\'ll love:<br/>• Four spacious bedrooms, master with walk-in robe and ensuite<br/>• Built-in robes in the other bedroom<br/>• Stunning kitchen with island bench, stainless steel appliances, and ample storage<br/>• Expansive light-filled open-plan living and dining<br/>• Large main bathroom with separate bath, shower, and vanity<br/>• Outdoor entertaining area with its own sink and storage<br/>• Roller shutters for added privacy<br/>• Ducted air conditioning<br/>• Timber floors and 3m high ceilings<br/>• Secure double garage<br/>• Rainwater tank<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned for families, this home is just a short walk to Black Forest Primary School, local shopping centres, and popular cafés. Multiple public transport options are nearby, providing easy access to the Adelaide CBD and surrounding areas.<br/><br/>Your local schools are Black Forest Primary School, Adelaide High School, and Adelaide Botanic High School.<br/>Other nearby schools include Goodwood Primary School, Edwardstown Primary School, Westbourne Park Primary School, Plympton Primary School, Plympton International College, Mitcham Girls High School, and Hamilton Secondary College.<br/><br/>Don\'t miss the chance to secure this stunning family home in one of Black Forest\'s most desirable streets. Enquire today to arrange your inspection!<br/><br/><br/>Bond - 6 weeks rent equivalent<br/>Lease Term - 12+ months<br/>Water Charges - All water usage and water supply<br/>Furniture - Unfurnished<br/><br/><br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition, inclusions, exclusion, omission) Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal advice. As well as all parties must view the property in person to make sure it reflects the list of inclusions listed in this ad.','house','Black Forest',-34.96435607,138.57631961,5035,'SA','27 Gordon Road','Black Forest',2,4,2,'Ray White St Peters - RLA328740','Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(3667,'Fully Renovated Home with large rear deck - Available 9th March',820,'A spacious family residence located in this popular suburb is now offered with vacant possession and a long term lease is available. The generous accommodation includes formal lounge room, dining room, gourmet kitchen and also offers 3 large bedrooms upstairs with a studio, ensuite and studio that could be utilized as a 4th bedroom/rumpus downstairs.<br/><br/>Meticulously renovated throughout several years ago, it boasts a gourmet kitchen with quality appliances, stylish bathroom, timber f