 easy care gardens<br/><br/><br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>We take the utmost care in providing information regarding properties advertised for rent, however we accept no responsibility and disclaim all liabilities in regards to any errors or inaccuracies contained in advertising material. All parties should rely on their own investigation to authenticate information.<br/><br/><br/>Important information -<br/>*Tenant must seek Landlord\'s consent for a pet.<br/>*There is no current Energy Efficiency Rating (EER) recorded for this property.<br/>*This property does comply with the current minimum insulation standards.','house','Isaacs',-35.36248127,149.10971533,2607,'ACT','21 Adkinson Close','Isaacs',4,6,5,'Mick Barlow Property - AINSLIE','Balcony, Garage: 3, Open Spaces: 2, Alarm System, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Indoor Spa, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Rumpus Room'),(3670,'Spacious & Well-Located Home',720,'Welcome to this well positioned home in the heart of Bertram.<br/>Perfect for families or professionals seeking space and accessibility, this property provides a practical layout with generous living areas and a functional design.<br/><br/>Key Features:<br/><br/>Spacious living and dining area<br/>Practical kitchen layout<br/>Comfortable bedrooms<br/>Suitable for families or professionals<br/>Convenient location with good accessibility<br/><br/>Situated in a highly convenient location, the property is close to local schools, shopping centres, parks, and public transport. Key nearby amenities include Bertram Primary School, Kwinana Marketplace, local childcare centres, medical facilities, and easy access to Kwinana Freeway.<br/><br/>Enquire today for more details or to arrange a viewing.','house','Bertram',-32.24169182,115.84572196,6167,'WA','66 Millbrook Avenue','Bertram',2,4,2,'HouseSmart Real Estate Pty Ltd - CLOVERDALE','Garage: 2'),(3671,'Canning Vale 4 bedrooms house',850,'This beautifully 4 bedroom, 2 bathroom home offers ideal modern family living. It offer double garage with shopper\'s entry and additional street parkings. Located within a well-maintained compound that includes access to a swimming pool, residents can enjoy both comfort and lifestyle.<br/><br/>The home features:-<br/>- air conditioning to whole house,<br/>- L shaped kitchen complete with stone benchtops, <br/>- ample storage, a pantry, gas cooktop, and rangehood,<br/>- adjoining dining and living areas,<br/>- the living area equipped with its own Split-system air conditioner, <br/>- master suite includes a Split-system air conditioner, <br/>- a private ensuite with both bath and shower,<br/>- adjoining bedroom next to the master offers versatility,<br/>- all common bedrooms comes with wardrobes,<br/>- separate bathroom with both bathtub and shower,<br/>- an extra three-door storage room, <br/>- a double garage complete the interior,<br/>- sliding doors open to a cozy paved alfresco area,<br/>- a small garden space ideal for growing herbs or veggies,<br/><br/>Property Code: 853<br/>','house','Canning Vale',-32.09238050,115.92248329,6155,'WA','4 Glendalough Loop','Canning Vale',2,4,2,'Limmybuild Realty - PERTH','Garage: 2'),(3672,'LARGE 4 X2 IN SOUGHT AFTER AREA',700,'Great designed 4x2 with four good size bedrooms all with robes and a separate study / activity to the back between the minor bedrooms<br/>With wonderful living with a good size lounge to the front and a spacious meals, family and games areas off the kitchen <br/>Nice functional kitchen, bathrooms and laundry <br/>With a full length patio, and plenty of yard space – all reticulated by a bore so the lawns will improve here <br/>In a fantastic location surrounded by quality homes <br/>Pets considered - Available 6 March 2026<br/>','house','Port Kennedy',-32.36318200,115.74800900,6172,'WA','31 Antonio Circuit','Port Kennedy',2,4,2,'Cutten & Co - PORT KENNEDY',NULL),(3673,'Spacious Family Living in Great Location',650,'Welcome to this 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom in 21 Hartfield road