aintain.<br/><br/>Bright Spaces: LED lighting and high ceilings enhance the open, airy feel.<br/><br/>Comfort: Reverse-cycle air conditioning for year-round comfort.<br/><br/>Modern Kitchen: Open-plan design with stone benchtops, induction stove, oven, and plenty of storage.<br/><br/>Master Bedroom: Spacious bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.<br/><br/>Spacious Bedrooms: Minor bedrooms with built-in robes, providing ample storage.<br/><br/>Bathrooms: Separate toilet and a modern bathroom with a laundry-bathroom combo, including a shower, vanity, and laundry facilities [front loader only] in the same room.<br/><br/>Outdoor Living: Low-maintenance, fully paved alfresco area, perfect for easy outdoor living.<br/><br/>Ready to move in and enjoy a modern, hassle-free lifestyle—don’t miss out on this beautifully designed home!<br/><br/>To arrange a viewing please click on the CONTACT THE AGENT BUTTON or the BOOK INSPECTION BUTTON. You will be sent an instant reply to Register for the Next Available Inspection.<br/><br/>Home Open Times are Subject to Change and Cancellation without Notice. <br/><br/>Please be on time so you have sufficient time to view the property and that it meets your requirements. Viewing times cannot be extended.<br/><br/>Virtual inspections are not available for this property. We recommend all prospective tenants attend the scheduled home open or arrange for a representative to inspect on their behalf. This ensures you have an accurate understanding of the property, as it will be leased as advertised and as viewed at the inspection. <br/><br/>Facetiming, videoing, or taking photos during a home open is not permitted without prior approval from the attending Property Manager. This policy is in place to respect the privacy and security of the property, its occupants, and any personal belongings that may be present. If you wish to conduct a video call, take photos, or record any part of the inspection, please seek permission from the Property Manager beforehand to ensure all activity complies with privacy and agency guidelines. <br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: NO APPLICATIONS WILL BE ACCEPTED UNLESS YOU HAVE VIEWED THE PROPERTY.<br/>','unit','Maddington',-32.05028436,115.99150914,6109,'WA','12/35 Morley Street','Maddington',2,3,2,'LJ Hooker  - Harrisdale','Garage: 2'),(3675,'Newly Built Home in Baldivis',680,'This newly built home offers comfortable and modern living with a spacious open-plan layout and low-maintenance design. Featuring a bright living area and a contemporary kitchen with island bench, this property is ideal for easy everyday living.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- 4 bedrooms with built-in mirrored wardrobes<br/>- 2 modern bathrooms (one with bathtub)<br/>- Spacious open-plan living area<br/>- Modern kitchen with island bench and dishwasher<br/>- Gas cooktop, oven and rangehood<br/>- Separate laundry area<br/>- Large fully fenced backyard<br/>- Outdoor shed area and clothesline<br/>- Double car space<br/>- Low-maintenance home<br/><br/>Conveniently located close to local schools, shops and amenities.<br/><br/>To arrange a viewing, please contact Jaye on [REDACTED PHONE].<br/><br/>APPLY USING 2APPLY ONLY<br/>(We do not accept applications submitted via realestate.com.au)','house','Baldivis',-32.29908439,115.80609252,6171,'WA','6 Imilla St','Baldivis',2,4,2,'Westcoast Property Sales','Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Shed, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Pets Allowed'),(3676,'Easy-Care, Hard to Beat!',1450,'Few homes achieve a striking aesthetic that\'s matched equally by functionality. But this exceptional executive residence does just that - it\'s perfect for the busy modern family who love to entertain, or downsizers wanting that desirable \'lock up and leave\' lifestyle without compromising on space.<br/><br/>Enviably low maintenance, the property has a small section of lawn but no fussy gardens tying you down. Lock and leave at a moment\'s notice, and return a month later to a property that looks just as perfect as when you left.<br/><br/>In a whisper quiet position at the end of a long driveway, this residence makes a commanding first impression. A stacked stone feature wall rises two storeys and a handsome wood-panelled double garage introduces the home\'s distinctively warm contemporary style.<br/><br/>The interior is stylish and uncompromising, with a thoughtfully designed layout that harnesses natural light and provides excellent separation between areas. Double entrance doors welcome you to a large reception area. From there, you flow through another set of doors to the main living hub - or take the magnificent timber staircase to the second storey.<br/><br/>There\'s endless space to spread out, including multiple living areas and a purpose-built theatre. The main living hub opens on two sides, spilling out to the private alfresco entertaining area.<br/><br/>One of the highlights of the home is the kitchen, which has pride of place at the centre of the enormous open plan living / meals / kitchen zone. The large island and breakfast bar provides a social layout, while the glossy woodgrain cabinetry, stacked stone inlay, and high-end appliances continue the unmistakable feeling of quality, which is evident throughout the home.<br/><br/>The huge bedrooms all offer significant built-in storage, and the master also has a stunning ensuite with large bath. Downstairs, a junior suite has a semi-ensuite bathroom. Additional quality features include towering high bulkhead ceilings, glass-paned French doors, plush carpets, timber floor boards, ducted air-conditioning, and an alarm system.<br/><br/>This is a location where you will feel like you live in the heart of it all - you can stroll to the Oxford Street or Angove Street precincts; power walk into Northbridge or the CBD; get onto the freeway quickly; and drive to City Beach in less than 15 minutes. Schools, parks, festivals, events, sports clubs, and amenities surround you!<b