nd correct. The particulars are supplied for information only and shall not be taken as a representation of the lessor or its agent as to the accuracy of any details mentioned herein which may be subject to change at any time without notice. No warranty or representation is made as to its accuracy and interested parties should place no reliance on it and should make their own independent enquiries.<br/><br/>','house','Brabham',-31.82400167,115.97767706,6055,'WA','42 Carmine Chase','Brabham',2,4,2,'HKY Real Estate - Head Office','Garage: 2'),(3693,'WHEN QUALITY MEETS SIMPLICITY!!!',1400,'What we love<br/>This stunning 4 bedroom 3 three-bathroom two-storey residence is privately positioned off the street and defines modern low-maintenance “lock-up-and-leave” living of the highest order. A wonderful close-to-everything location only adds to the appeal. Prepare to be impressed by flexible internal living options and privacy and security regarding outdoor entertaining, here!<br/><br/>What to know<br/><br/>AT A GLANCE:<br/><br/>4 bedrooms<br/>3 bathrooms<br/>Tiled open-plan family, dining, and kitchen area downstairs<br/>Well-appointed kitchen with stone bench tops, double sinks and glass splashbacks<br/>Separate tiled upper-level “second” living/lounge room<br/>Massive upstairs master suite with a walk-in wardrobe<br/>Sumptuous fully-tiled master ensuite bathroom with a walk-in rain shower<br/>Large 4th or “guest” bedroom with its own walk-in robe<br/>Fully tiled main and third/guest bathrooms<br/>Fantastic timber-lined alfresco-entertaining area with an outdoor range hood & kitchenette<br/>Covered and Juliet front balconies off the upstairs living room, both with double doors<br/>Easy-care gardens and artificial backyard turf<br/>Double lock-up garage<br/><br/>FEATURES:<br/><br/>Double-door entrance<br/>High ceilings<br/>Double-door kitchen storage pantry<br/>Quality stainless-steel kitchen range-hood, gas cooktop, oven, and dishwasher appliances<br/>Carpeted bedrooms<b