oom, plus multiple outdoor zones to enjoy year-round. It’s the kind of home that feels welcoming the moment you step inside timeless, low-maintenance and ready to move straight into.<br/><br/>Whether you love character homes, entertaining outdoors, or simply being close to everything - this one just feels right.<br/><br/>WHAT LOOP LOVES:<br/>• Polished timber floors that add warmth and personality<br/>• Renovated kitchen with stone benchtops, island breakfast bar & sleek black fixtures complete with a dishwasher <br/>• Modern bathroom with walk in shower & designer basin<br/>• Light and bright interiors throughout<br/>• Split system air conditioning<br/>• Two generous bedrooms with natural light<br/>• Large covered timber deck – perfect for entertaining<br/>• Separate laundry space<br/>• Private side yard with secure fencing <br/>• Classic red brick charm with modern updates<br/>• Easy care block with paved areas and outdoor gazebo space<br/><br/>THE LIFESTYLE<br/>Moments from Morley Galleria, local cafés, parklands and public transport, you’ll enjoy unbeatable convenience without sacrificing the comfort of home.<br/><br/>Quick access to Tonkin Highway, close to schools and just a short drive to the CBD - this is low maintenance living in a location that makes everyday life easy.<br/><br/>TERMS:<br/>• $750 per week<br/>• Available now<br/>• Pets considered on application<br/>• Long term tenant preferred <br/><br/>INTERESTED?<br/>• Enquire for more details<br/>• You will get an email to complete a 2apply application (please do not use Ignite).<br/>• Encourage using cover letters for a personal touch<br/>• Stay tuned for inspection arrangements!<br/> <br/>While we have taken utmost care to provide accurate information, Loop Leasing does not warrant or guarantee its accuracy and disclaims responsibility for any inaccuracies. Therefore, all interested parties are advised to conduct their own inquiries for verification.','house','Morley',-31.88599000,115.89247000,6062,'W