ge with wall-mounted controller plus remote control access.<br/>* Located within the Harrisdale Primary School and Harrisdale Senior High School intake zones and a short drive to them.<br/>* Close to Bunnings, grocery stores, local shops/shopping centres, cafes and restaurants.<br/>* Surrounded by parks and green spaces.<br/>* Convenient access to public transport and roads.<br/><br/>This home delivers a secure, light-filled and low-maintenance lifestyle with modern comforts and thoughtful design throughout. A fantastic opportunity in a highly desirable Harrisdale location.<br/><br/>HOW TO APPLY:<br/>Via listing’s ad on realestate.com.au , Hit \"Apply\" button.<br/>*Please be aware that you must first view the property with one of our representatives prior to your application being considered and processed*','house','Harrisdale',-32.11923132,115.94026703,6112,'WA','14 ROCKVALE CRESCENT','Harrisdale',2,3,2,'SellingKey Canning Vale - CANNING VALE','Garage: 2'),(3769,'Space. Style. Location.',450,'This ground floor unit sits in a well-maintained private complex with plenty of green space. This low-maintenance unit features large windows and spacious rooms. Both bedrooms include built in robes and share a well-appointed bathroom and laundry. The living area has a split system air conditioner and modern gas heater and adjoins a lovely eat-in kitchen with plenty of storage.<br/><br/>Located in the convenient suburb of Plympton, this unit is within an easy stroll to the shops, schools, public transport, and The Highway. It is less than 10 minutes to popular Glenelg and the city, adding to the broad appeal of the property.<br/><br/>KEY FEATURES:<br/>- Ground floor unit<br/>- Privately fenced group<br/>- Common green spaces<br/>- Renovated interior<br/>- Split system air conditioning<br/>- Large bedrooms<br/>- Plenty of storage<br/>- Walk to schools, shops and public transport<br/><br/>Subject to strata conditions for Pets <br/><br/>12 month lease available.<br/><br/>RLA 236