ite<br/>Double car spaces for secure parking<br/>Ideal for kids, pets, and entertaining<br/>Multiple living areas to suit a growing family<br/>Open-plan kitchen with modern appliances and ample storage<br/>Fully tiled living & dining areas for low-maintenance elegance<br/>Ducted evaporative cooling for year-round comfort<br/>Built-in robes for convenient storage<br/>Two toilets for everyday practicality<br/>Wide frontage with strong street presence<br/>Spacious patio perfect for outdoor gatherings<br/>Fully fenced yard for privacy and security<br/>Solar panels, security alarm, and security shutters included<br/><br/>***Photos are for illustration purposes only and the property is available unfurnished***<br/><br/>This home truly ticks all the boxes for families seeking space, comfort, and peace of mind. Enquire today to secure this stunning property! To arrange your viewing, book online at www.socorealty.com.au','house','Maddington',-32.05111706,116.01443845,6109,'WA','1 Ellamere Retreat','Maddington',2,4,2,'Soco Realty - South Perth','Garage: 2'),(3791,'Beachside Comfort Meets Modern Convenience',950,'Discover relaxed coastal living in this contemporary 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom apartment located in the highly sought after North Coogee community. Perfect for renters seeking a modern, low maintenance lifestyle just moments from the beach.<br/><br/>Property Features<br/>• Bright, open plan living and dining area with stylish finishes<br/>• Modern kitchen with quality appliances, sleek cabinetry, and generous bench space<br/>• Private balcony ideal for morning coffee or evening unwinding<br/>• Two spacious bedrooms with built in wardrobes and large windows<br/>• Master bedroom with private ensuite<br/>• Two beautifully finished bathrooms with modern fixtures<br/>• Hardwood flooring and contemporary décor throughout<br/>• Secure apartment building with easy access to walkways and coastal paths<br/><br/>Lifestyle & Location<br/>Enjoy the best of coastal living with North Co