in robes for ample storage space. The master bedroom boasts an oversized ensuite, and the apartment includes two full bathrooms, offering added convenience and privacy.<br/><br/>Step into a bright and airy combined lounge, dining, and kitchen area, designed for modern living. The spacious stone kitchen features quality appliances, ample cupboard space, and a dishwasher, making meal preparation a breeze.<br/><br/>Never worry about parking with one secure basement car space included, along with a convenient storage cage for your belongings.<br/><br/>Features:<br/><br/>Fully furnished two-bedroom apartment with full kitchen supplies<br/><br/>Two full bathrooms<br/><br/>Two bedrooms, both with built-in robes<br/><br/>Large master bedroom with ensuite<br/><br/>Second bedroom currently set up as a home office (perfect for remote work)<br/><br/>Option to provide a king single bed in the second bedroom if required – rent will be $30 extra per week with this addition<br/><br/>Secure basement parking for one car plus storage cage<br/><br/>Spacious stone kitchen with ample storage and dishwasher<br/><br/>Reverse cycle heating and cooling for year-round comfort<br/><br/>Conveniently located close to Canberra Centre, university, pubs, restaurants, and cafes<br/> <br/>Bond and Rent:<br/>A bond equal to four weeks rent will be required before the commencement of the lease. Here at Archer Canberra, we accept rent weekly, fortnightly or monthly and our preferred payment method is direct debit.<br/><br/>When can I see the property?<br/>Saturday exhibition times will be advertised by close of business each Wednesday. Should the open time not suit, please register to view the property and you will be first to be advised once an open is booked. Alternatively, please call our dedicated leasing department to arrange a personal inspection. Please note – if the property isn’t advertised as ‘available now’ this usually means that the property is currently tenanted, making Saturday viewings all that we will have available until after this date.<br/><br/>Interested in applying for this property?<br/>After you register or view the property, you’ll receive a link and code from our leasing system<br/>https://www.2apply.com.au/Agency/Archer<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Whilst care has been taken in gathering details for properties for lease, we accept no responsibility for any inaccuracies herein. All applicants should rely on their own research to confirm any information provided.<br/><br/>Useful Information<br/>• A 12 month lease is the standard lease term – anything longer or shorter will be advertised or considered upon application.<br/>• It is our company policy to either view the property, or have someone view the property on your behalf before your application can be accepted.<br/>• This property is exempt from minimum standards (ceiling construction)','apartment','Turner',-35.26201595,149.13150115,2612,'ACT','182/217 Northbourne Ave','Turner',2,2,1,'Archer Canberra','Balcony, Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Intercom, Furnished'),(3847,'Fully Furnished 3-Bedroom Retreat in Quiet, Prime Location!',725,'Available: Now<br/>Lease Term: Until December 2026<br/>Bond: 4 Weeks Rent Equivalent<br/><br/>Nestled near tranquil creeks and just minutes from the scenic walking trails of Morialta Conservation Park, this fully furnished 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home is a haven of peace and privacy. Surrounded by natural beauty, the property offers a lifestyle that’s both relaxed and convenient. Perfect for those who love the outdoors but still want access to modern comforts and quality schooling, this spacious home offers the best of both worlds. Experience the perfect blend of country charm and modern living in this solid family home.<br/><br/>Features you will love:<br/><br/>– 3 generously sized Bedrooms<br/>– Spacious master bedroom with walk-in robe & ensuite<br/>– Well appointed open plan kitchen, with quality appliances and ample storag