/><br/>Please submit an application via the Kemp Real Estate website. Viewings are by application only.','house','Louth Bay',-34.54301070,135.93084092,5607,'SA','5 Central Street','Louth Bay',1,2,1,'Kemp Real Estate Pty Ltd - Port Lincoln','Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Toilets: 1'),(3851,'Neat Maisonette',270,'** APPLICATIONS TO BE SUBMITTED PRIOR TO VIEWING **<br/><br/>* 3 bedrooms * Polished floors throughout *Wall unit air conditioner in living room * Spacious kitchen * Tiled bathroom with shower over the bath *Tool shed in back yard * Close to shops<br/><br/>To apply please visit our website www.blights.com.au or click on apply now on this advert through Ignite.<br/><br/>RLA110<br/><br/>Beware of rental property scams. Our properties are only listed on blights.com.au, realestate.com.au and view.com.au. If in doubt, please contact one of our offices.','duplex/semi-detached','Whyalla Stuart',-33.03320950,137.52006901,5608,'SA','5 Millowick Street','Whyalla Stuart',1,3,2,'Blights Real Estate RLA110 - PORT PIRIE','Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 1'),(3852,'Prime Position, Premium Lifestyle - Eastern Suburbs Gem',775,'Set well back from the road, this family home enjoys a prime position in the heart of Kensington Gardens, capturing the true charm of Adelaide\'s eastern suburbs. Just a short stroll away, you\'ll find the vibrant shopping and dining precincts of The Parade and Magill Road.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Three generously sized bedrooms, including a master suite with walk-in robe<br/>- Dedicated study or home office, easily adaptable as a fourth bedroom<br/>- Light-filled open plan living and dining zone<br/>- Well-appointed kitchen featuring an electric cooktop and ample storage<br/>- Central bathroom with separate bath and shower<br/>- Second bathroom combined with laundry facilities<br/>- Rear garden with established beds and an undercover pergola, ideal for outdoor entertaining<br/>- Secure garage with additional storage space<b