-from-home convenience<br/>• Double auto door garage with internal access<br/>• Additional single garage and driveway for extra parking<br/>• Recently landscaped gardens, maintained by full-time gardener<br/>• Water Usage is included <br/>• Exclusive Inner South street, close to Parliament House, leafy parks, quality schools, and boutique shops<br/>• Quiet, secure, and premium residential neighbourhood offering a sanctuary away from the city buzz<br/>________________________________________<br/>This home is ideal for professionals or families seeking a combination of prestige, comfort, and effortless living in one of Canberra\'s most sought-after suburbs. Move in and enjoy a lifestyle that balances privacy, convenience, and sophistication - all in a beautifully maintained home ready for immediate occupancy.<br/><br/>? Arrange your private inspection with McIntyre Property today.<br/><br/>? Available Now - $1600 per week<br/><br/><br/>EER: Last Known EER is Unknown<br/><br/>Ceiling insulation compliance: The property doesn\'t comply with the minimum ceiling insulation standards.<br/><br/>Pet Policy:<br/>The tenant will be required to seek consent to keep a pet.<br/><br/>Viewing policy:<br/>1. Click on the \"BOOK INSPECTION\" button.<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection.<br/>3. If no time offered, please register so we can contact you once a time is arranged.<br/>If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations or further inspection times.<br/>4. Inspections must be in the presence of an agent either at a private viewing or at an arranged open home, please do not contact the occupants directly or knock on the door.<br/><br/>Rental Requirements:<br/>Rent is due on a fortnightly basis in advance. Bond equivalent to four weeks rent is payable when signing the tenancy agreement.<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Whilst we take all due care in gathering details regarding our properties either for sale or lease, we accept no responsibility fo