-obligation and confidential conversation.','apartment','Joondanna',-31.90633472,115.84328308,6060,'WA','10/35 Orchid Street','Joondanna',1,2,1,'Platinum Property Co','Balcony, Carport: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Toilets: 1, Furnished'),(3902,'Home Sweet Home',750,'Available from 26 Mar 2026<br/><br/>This 4 beds 2 bath and 2 garage bays property is practical and situated at a convenient location with amenities in the vicinity:<br/><br/>Within 1 km radius there are:<br/>- Local IGA for your daily grocery needs <br/>- Local Café and eatery shops<br/>- Pharmacy<br/>- Atwell Primary School<br/>- Atwell College<br/>- Local parks<br/><br/>There are more ... where within 3.5 km radius are:<br/>- Cockburn Gateway Shopping Centre<br/>- Cockburn Train Station<br/>- Local and international cuisines<br/>- Gym<br/>- Clinics and Pharmacies<br/>(Distance is approximate)<br/><br/>The Property<br/><br/>Well positioned on a corner block and a quite location. It is bright, spacious and fully fenced up. The open plan dining-kitchen concept plus a second living area provide the space that fulfil your family needs.<br/>The kitchen is simple but has sufficient storage cabinet, 4 burner gas cooking and upgraded with stainless steel range hood and oven.<br/><br/>The Backyard<br/><br/>There are plenty of space to enjoy and entertain family and friends. It is partly sheltered and paved, adjoining the garage and accessible via the dining area. If you love to grow your own vegetables or create your fauna and flora garden, there is ample space to express your creativity.<br/><br/>Other features include:<br/>- En-suite master bedroom with walk in wardrobe and equipped with reverse cycle AC<br/>- The other 3 bedrooms are of good size including one with reverse cycle AC<br/>- Timber look flooring for all bedrooms<br/>- Gas hot water system<br/>- Ample storage cabinet<br/>- Separate laundry and toilet<br/>- Automated double garage<br/>- Security screen doors