 the laundry and bathroom so easily accessible from here. It simply doesn\'t get any more \"lock-up-and-leave\" than this!<br/><br/>PROPERTY FEATURES;<br/><br/>- 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom<br/>- Ground-floor position - lending itself to almost everybody<br/>- Easy-care timber-look flooring<br/>- Open-plan living, dining and kitchen area with floating media cabinetry, split-system air-conditioning and a breakfast bar for casual meals<br/>- Double kitchen sinks<br/>- Concept range hood, an electric cooktop and an under-bench oven in the kitchen<br/>- Massive pitched front patio-entertaining deck with café blinds - accessible via the property\'s access gate from a lush reticulated complex lawn area<br/>- Full-width entertaining patio and second deck at the rear<br/>- Huge master bedroom with full-height built-in wardrobes and security-door access out to the front deck<br/>- 2nd bedroom with direct security-door access out to the rear deck and patio<br/>- Separate laundry with a double linen press, security-door access out to the back deck and entry into a practical bathroom with a shower, toilet, vanity and skylight<br/>- Freshly painted<br/>- Feature down lighting<br/>- Electric hot-water system<br/>- Refurbished roof<br/>- Single lock-up garage - PLUS a single carport preceding it<br/>- Nearby visitor-parking space<br/>- Reticulated complex gardens<br/><br/>Hop, skip or jump around the corner to the lovely Peet Fyfe Reserve, with cafes, restaurants, bars, entertainment and the outdoor Scarborough Pool along the beachfront all just walking distance away in their own right. <br/><br/>The sprawling Abbett Park reserve and community sporting facilities are within arm\'s reach too, as are picturesque bushland walking trails. Everything else is no more than a stone\'s throw away - top schools, major shopping centres (including the revamped Karrinyup complex) and public transport.<br/><br/>To ensure a smooth viewing and application process, please note the following;<br/><br/>1