ens green, and even a powered shed for storage or a workshop, this home offers unbeatable value.<br/><br/>Other features you will love include -<br/><br/>- 2 generous bedrooms plus 2 smaller rooms ideal for kids room all with built-in wardrobes.<br/><br/>- 2 bathrooms, 1 in the master bedroom.<br/><br/>- Open-plan living & dining with plenty of natural light<br/><br/>- Well-appointed kitchen with ample storage and bench space<br/><br/>- Roller shutters for privacy, security, and energy efficiency<br/><br/>- 6.6kW solar system - save on electricity bills<br/><br/>- Bore reticulation - keep gardens lush without high water costs<br/><br/>- 9 sqm. powered shed - perfect for storage & hobbies.<br/><br/>- Evaporative cooler system.<br/><br/>- Ceiling fans to 3 bedrooms<br/><br/>- Double carport with extra driveway space<br/><br/><br/>Prime Location:<br/><br/>- Only 8 minutes walk to Forest Crescent Primary School - perfect for families.<br/><br/>- 5 Minutes to Forest Lakes Shopping Centre<br/><br/>- Close to parks and public transport<br/><br/>- Easy access to Roe Highway and major routes<br/><br/>To enquire on the property please contact [REDACTED EMAIL] <br/><br/><br/>','house','Thornlie',-32.07887000,115.95463000,6108,'WA','11 Bluegum Road','Thornlie',2,4,2,'Professionals Property Plus Canning Vale / Thornlie - THORNLIE','Carport: 2, Fully Fenced, Shed, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Evaporative Cooling, Floorboards, Gas Heating, Toilets: 2'),(3906,'Apply now- Spacious Family Home with Stunning Coastal Views in Seaview Downs',750,'Kindly submit an enquiry to register your details. We will keep you informed of available inspection times and provide you with the online application link.<br/>-------------------------------------------<br/>Lease term: 12 months<br/>Unfurnished<br/>Available date: NOW<br/><br/>This spacious four-bedroom family home enjoys stunning coastal views and a thoughtfully designed layout that balances comfort and practicality. Loc