ions.','apartment','Kingston',-35.31080655,149.14769405,2604,'ACT','16/12 Trevillian Quay','Kingston',1,2,1,'Ray White - Canberra','Balcony, Carport: 1, Dishwasher, Toilets: 1'),(3913,'Stunning low maintenance house in Campbelltown',680,'This residence provides a secure, easy care lifestyle opportunity. The well designed home, fresh in appearance boasts a light filled open plan living, an external entertaining area and a rear garden suitable for children and pets. Pets are negotiable.<br/>Tenant will be responsible for maintaining the garden and will also pay the supply charge and water usage. <br/><br/>The residence is fully fenced with access via an automated sliding gate and valuable double width garaging providing undercover parking for two vehicles and a further two more securely parked off-street.<br/><br/>The location is extremely convenient. The Newton Central Shopping Centre, numerous cafes, popular restaurants and specialty stores are located nearby, as are schools and public transport. Additionally, the CBD is less than 8 kms providing quick travel times by vehicle or a 30 minute bus trip via the Paradise Interchange O-Bahn busway.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>• 3 bedroom design<br/>• Light filled open plan living<br/>• Gas kitchen with walk-in pantry and dishwasher<br/>• Main bedroom with ensuite & walk-in robe<br/>• Built-in robes to bedrooms 2 & 3<br/>• 2.7 metre ceilings throughout<br/>• Abundance of storage throughout the home<br/>• Ducted reverse cycle air-conditioning<br/>• Security system<br/>• Video intercom<br/>• Front and rear security doors<br/>• Undercover outdoor entertaining area<br/>• Rear garden suitable for children and pets<br/>• Rain water tank<br/>• Secure double garaging with automatic panel lift door and drive-thru access<br/>• Fully fenced with remote control automatic sliding gate providing secure parking for an additional 2 more vehicles. (2 undercover + 2 off street)<br/><br/>Water Charges: All water use & Supply Charge<br/>Lease Term