t blend of comfort, convenience and easy living. The home feels bright, welcoming and effortless. Everything has been thoughtfully prepared so you can move in and enjoy. Perfectly suited for those seeking a well-located, low-maintenance home in a peaceful, tight-knit community.<br/><br/>Inside, the layout is both generous and functional, with a separate living room providing a quiet retreat away from the dining and kitchen zone. The modern kitchen is well-equipped with gas cooking and ample storage, flowing comfortably into the dining area for easy everyday living, with three well-proportioned bedrooms (wait until you see how big the master bedroom is!), including built-in robes to the master and second bedroom. A spacious bathroom and separate laundry add further practicality.<br/><br/>Step outside to a large covered entertaining area, ideal for relaxed evenings, complemented by easy-care gardens designed for low-maintenance living. As a freestanding home with no adjoining walls, it offers an added sense of privacy and peace. Reverse cycle air conditioning services the living room and two of the bedrooms, and solar panels (2.5kW system) help keep energy costs down.<br/><br/>Positioned just moments from the vibrant café and restaurant strip of Mount Hawthorn, close to local parks and everyday conveniences, and only a short drive to Perth CBD, this home delivers lifestyle and location in equal measure.<br/><br/>A rare leasing opportunity in tightly held Mount Hawthorn. Please be sure to ask today to secure your place in this wonderful community.','house','Mount Hawthorn',-31.92100000,115.84427000,6016,'WA','28b Dunedin Street','Mount Hawthorn',1,3,2,'The Property Project - PERTH','Carport: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning'),(3992,'\"BARGOTI\'\' presents - Outstanding, Display Home Style 3x2x2 Family Home in Bennett Springs, Close to Parks, Child Care & Shopping Centre.',900,'RASHMI CHAUDHARY! FROM \'\'BARGOTI REAL ESTATE\" PROUDLY BRINGS 62 DORADO DRIVE BENNETT SPRINGS \'\'FOR LEASE\".<br/><br/>Offering the perfect blend of modern style, comfort, and unbeatable convenience, this stunning 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom Villa-inspired central courtyard Hamptons style retreat with a modern touch home is designed for an easy living. The spacious open-plan layout flows effortlessly from the kitchen to the light-filled living and dining spaces, and further into the inviting undercover entertaining area where you\'ll love hosting BBQs or unwinding in your private oasis watching sporting events through the custom bi- fold windows of the stylish theatre which comes with a fantastic 100 inch tv already installed.<br/><br/>The kitchen is a true showstopper, featuring brand new fridge installed, elegant stone benchtops, quality stainless steel appliances, and plenty of overhead and under bench storage, all overlooking the heart of the home.<br/><br/>Huge living and dining provide the sense of spaciousness. Living is equipped with an 87-inch TV. Each bedroom is generously sized with built-in robes, while the master suite impresses with its walk-in robe and stylish ensuite with double sink vanity, separate toilet and tiling to the roof.<br/><br/>This home is perfectly positioned just moments from three local parks (Dazzle Park, Pegasus Park and Luminous Park), Hindu temple, Sikh temple and Bloom early learning centre while a quick drive to Drumpellier Drive (connecting to Brabham and Ellenbrook), Reid Highway and Tonkin Highway.<br/><br/>Some fantastic features include:<br/>- Spacious open-plan living and dining.<br/>- Living areas with plantation shutters and an 87-inch TV.<br/>- Modern and huge chef style kitchen with quality benchtops, built in pantry, stainless steel appliances, brand new refrigerator and ample storage.<br/>- Master bedroom with king bed, walk in robe and an ensuite with double shower and double sink vanity.<br/>-Two other minor bedrooms with built in robes.<br/>- A separate activity room/office/study.<br/>- Family bathroom wi