rt notice. We appreciate your understanding and cooperation in helping us provide a smooth and efficient inspection process.','apartment','Whyalla Stuart',-33.02730664,137.54771963,5608,'SA','5/32 Ryan Avenue','Whyalla Stuart',1,2,2,'Ray White - Port Augusta/Whyalla RLA231511',NULL),(4020,'Modern Living and Strata security meets central Midland lifestyle!',650,'Step into 2/20 The Crescent, Midland - a recently refreshed, modern two-bedroom, two-bathroom strata apartment designed for comfort, security, and convenience. With spacious bedrooms and a European-style laundry with a store room, this home is perfect for professionals, couples, or small families seeking a move-in ready lifestyle. The master bedroom features a well-sized layout with a private bathroom, while the second bedroom is ideal for guests, a home office, or study space.<br/><br/>The living area is bright and open, complete with air-conditioning, making it a welcoming space to relax or entertain. One bathroom boasts a double vanity for added convenience. Located just minutes from Midland Gate Shopping Centre, Midland Station, cafes, and restaurants, this property offers excellent walkability and connectivity. With the security of a strata complex, a dedicated car park, and low-maintenance living, you can enjoy peace of mind while taking advantage of everything Midland has to offer - from the Swan River walks to the vibrant local community events.<br/><br/>Key Features:<br/>- 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, spacious living areas<br/>- Air-conditioning in living room<br/>- European-style laundry with store room<br/>- One bathroom with double vanity<br/>- Secure strata complex with dedicated car park<br/>- Minutes from Midland Gate Shopping Centre, Midland Station, cafes, and restaurants<br/>- Low-maintenance modern apartment, ideal for professionals or small families<br/><br/>WHAT NEXT<br/>To book an inspection, simply click the email agent or ‘book inspection’ time button.<br/>IF A TIME APPEARS – Please regist