e<br/><br/>Private ensuite and ample space for additional cabinetry<br/><br/>Formal home theatre room – perfect for movie nights or entertaining guests<br/><br/>Light-filled open plan kitchen, dining and living area<br/><br/>Well-appointed kitchen with plenty of bench space and storage<br/><br/>3 generous guest bedrooms, all with built-in robes<br/><br/>Modern second bathroom with separate shower and bathtub<br/><br/>Functional laundry with external access<br/><br/>❄ Comfort All Year Round:<br/><br/>Ducted air-conditioning throughout<br/><br/>Additional split system to boost heating and cooling efficiency<br/><br/>? Outdoor Living:<br/><br/>Low-maintenance paved patio area<br/><br/>Perfect space for BBQs and family gatherings<br/><br/>Easy-care backyard ideal for busy families<br/><br/>? Parking & Location:<br/><br/>Double lock-up garage with internal access<br/><br/>Walking distance to local schools<br/><br/>Close to shopping centres, parks and public transport<br/><br/>Easy access to main roads for commuting<br/><br/>This home combines space, practicality and location — making it the perfect rental opportunity for families seeking long-term comfort.<br/><br/>To make an enquiry for the property, simply click on the \"Get in Touch or Contact \" button and you will receive updates for viewing times and home opens. Alternatively feel free to call the office on 9490 1576 for further information.<br/><br/>***HOME OPEN TIMES ARE SUBJECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT NOTICE.*** Please be on time so you have sufficient time to fully view the property and ensure that it meets your requirements as viewing times cannot be extended, so as not to cause delays for the next home open. See You There. ***<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: Whilst every care has been taken with the preparation of the particulars contained in the information supplied, neither the Agent nor the client, guarantee their accuracy. Interested persons are advised to make their own enquiries and satisfy themselves in all respects. T