, refreshed with new paintwork and complemented by multiple indoor and outdoor living zones.<br/><br/> <br/>Designed for flexible living, the ground floor is equipped with ducted reverse cycle air-conditioning and features two generous bedrooms both with ensuites, plus a separate study/fifth bedroom. A formal lounge and adjoining dining room sit toward the front, with the rear opening to the open plan living, dining and kitchen. The kitchen offers generous prep space and storage, a dishwasher, and a scullery/laundry.<br/> <br/><br/>Upstairs features a spacious landing, ideal as an additional sitting area and two double bedrooms with built-in robes, split system air-conditioning and ceiling fans, serviced by a central bathroom.<br/><br/>Outdoor spaces include an elevated front lawn with area views across Claremont, a Juliette balcony, a large rear yard with a covered alfresco and newly installed artificial turf, and a beautifully maintained enclosed side garden with established fruit trees.<br/><br/>Additional features include excellent internal storage throughout, a lower level utility room with a separate wine cabinet, a large rear storage shed, a double garage with shopper’s entry, and a solar system to help reduce household running costs.<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned just metres from the Swan River and moments from Cottesloe Beach, this location offers easy access to Claremont Quarter and Napoleon Street for shopping, cafés and everyday needs. Surrounded by Perth’s top private schools including PLC, Scotch, MLC, Christchurch and St Hilda’s, with excellent transport links to the CBD and surrounding areas.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>* Flexible multi-level layout offering multiple indoor and outdoor living zones<br/>* Freshly painted throughout<br/>* Modern plantation shutters<br/>* Carpeted lounge on entry that flows through to the formal dining <br/>* Expansive open plan living and dining to the rear with easy care terracotta tiles<br/>* Large entertainers kitchen with excellent bench space and storage, island bench, and a dishwasher<br/>* Combined scullery/laundry adjoining the kitchen, with direct access to a dedicated drying area with a clothesline<br/>* Ducted reverse cycle air-conditioning throughout the ground floor, and split system air-conditioning and ceiling fans to all bedrooms<br/>* Two generous ground floor bedrooms with their own ensuites, the front bedroom featuring a walk-in robe and Juliet balcony, and the second with built-in robes<br/>* Dedicated study to the front of the home with built-in cabinetry, with flexibility to be used as a fifth bedroom<br/>* Upstairs features a generous landing ideal as a study or kids zone, plus two large double bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>* Central bathroom servicing the upper level bedrooms<br/>* Excellent storage throughout, including multiple internal cupboards, a lower level utility room with built in cabinetry, a separate wine cabinet, and a large rear storage shed<br/>* Double garage with shopper’s entry to the utility room, plus additional driveway parking<br/>* Elevated front veranda and lawn enjoying area views across Claremont<br/>* Spacious rear yard with a covered alfresco and easy care artificial lawn, wrapping around to an enclosed side garden with established fruit trees<br/>* Solar panels to help reduce household running costs<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: The property listing may contain images which show furniture in the property which may or may not be digitally staged. Prospective tenants must be aware that the property is being leased unfurnished.<br/><br/>12+ month lease preferred<br/><br/>AVAILABLE 6 MARCH 2026<br/><br/>Send your enquiry through today to arrange an appointment to view. Please ensure you are registered for any viewings to allow us to keep you updated of any changes.','house','Claremont',-31.99065891,115.77071330,6010,'WA','28A Anstey Street','Claremont',3,4,2,'Pure Leasing Central - SUBIACO','Garage: 2'),(4051,'Available for 7 months- Short term lease',695,'Set in one of O\'Connor\'s most desirable tree-lined pockets and positioned directly adjacent to peaceful reserve land. With parkland, local shops, cafés, excellent schools, and light-rail connections all close by, the address offers exceptional convenience and lifestyle appeal.<br/><br/>The home itself is neat, well-maintained, and immediately comfortable, featuring generous formal and casual living spaces, polished floorboards, and a functional kitchen with gas cooktop, dishwasher, and practical storage. <br/><br/>Accommodation includes three well-sized bedrooms, with the main bedroom offering built-in robes, direct backyard access, and a private deck. A family bathroom, separate WC, and internal laundry complete the liveable floorplan. Additional features include a freestanding garage with mechanic\'s pit, solar array, and ample off-street parking. <br/><br/>• 3 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, and single lock-up garage plus additional off-street parking on a generous block adjacent to reserve<br/>• Versatile living spaces including open-plan living and dining, a separate meals area, and a central kitchen overlooking the rear gardens<br/>• Functional kitchen with good storage, gas cooktop, servery window, and easy access to meals and outdoor spaces<br/>• Three well-proportioned bedrooms, all positioned for privacy and supported by a main bathroom and separate WC<br/>• Large internal laundry with direct outdoor access<br/>• Expansive backyard with established trees, garden shed, and ample room<br/>• Moments from local shops, schools, and transport<br/>• Single freestanding garage plus additional driveway parking<br/>• Block Size: 780sqm<br/>• Living Size: 121sqm<br/>• EER: 2.5<br/>• Ceiling insulation rating R4<br/>• Pets require landlords consent at all stages of the tenancy <br/>• The property is available for 7 months (short term rental)<br/><br/>Open for inspection times may be subject to change, please register or book inspection to receive updated notifications. Follow the link to book an inspection or submit an application.<br/><br/>https://2apply.com.au/agency?n=Bellecanberra<br/><br/>Inspection code for after you have inspected the property and wish to apply: BELLE2604<br/><br/>Please note that Belle Property does not require applicants to complete or pay for the optional 2Apply Premium Identity Verification. Choosing not to complete this verification will not impact how your application is assessed or processed.<br/><br/>Whilst all care has been taken to ensure accuracy in the preparation of the particulars herein, no warranty can be given, and interested parties must rely on their own enquiries. This business is independently owned and operated by Belle Property Canberra. ABN 95 611 730 806 trading as Belle Property Canberra.','house','O\'Connor',-35.25221308,149.11887632,2602,'ACT','30 Clianthus Street','O\'Connor',1,3,2,'Belle Property Canberra - CANBERRA','Garage: 2, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(4052,'Modern & Low-Maintenance 3x2 Home with Double Garage – Ready to Move In!',750,'To make an enquiry for the property, simply click on the \"Get in Touch or Contact \" button and you will receive updates for viewing times and home opens. ** Applications welcome prior to the home opens ** using the apply now feature , please all ensure all information is provided for prompt responses<br/><br/>This well-presented 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom home offers comfort, practicality and low-maintenance living — perfect for families, couples or professionals seeking a quality rental in a convenient location.<br/><br/>Designed with functionality in mind, the home features a spacious open-plan layout that creates a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere from the moment you walk in.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>• Generous open-plan kitchen, dining and living area – ideal for everyday living and entertaining<br/>• Modern kitchen with ample bench space and storage<br/>• Master bedroom complete with private ensuite and built-in robe<br/>• Two well-sized guest bedrooms, both with built-in robes<br/>• Central second bathroom servicing the minor bedrooms<br/>• Air-conditioning in the main living area for year-round comfort<br/>• Secure and easy-care front yard – perfect for low maintenance living<br/>• Double lock-up garage providing secure parking and additional storage<br/>• Practical layout with good natural light throughout<br/><br/>This home offers the perfect balance between space and easy upkeep, making it ideal for busy households who want comfort without the maintenance burden.<br/><br/>Conveniently located close to local amenities, schools, parks and public transport, everything you need is within easy reach.<br/><br/>To make an enquiry for the property, simply click on the \"Get in Touch or Contact \" button and you will receive updates for viewing times and home opens. Alternatively feel free to call the office on 9490 1576 for further information.<br/><br/>***HOME OPEN TIMES ARE SUBJECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT NOTICE.*** Please be on time so you have sufficient time to fully view the property and ensure that it meets your requirements as viewing times cannot be extended, so as not to cause delays for the next home open. See You There. ***<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: Whilst every care has been taken with the preparation of the particulars contained in the information supplied, neither the Agent nor the client, guarantee their accuracy. Interested persons are advised to make their own enquiries and satisfy themselves in all respects. The particulars contained are not intended to form part of any contract.','house','Landsdale',-31.79468141,115.85774497,6065,'WA','28/23 Bakana Loop','Landsdale',2,3,2,'HERITAGE REALTY - GOSNELLS','Garage: 2'),(4053,'HUGE BACK YARD!',490,'** WE ARE PLEASED TO ACCEPT APPLICATIONS PRIOR TO THE INSPECTION ONLINE VIA WWW.RESIDENTIALLETTING.COM.AU **<br/><br/>** ALL ATTENDEES MUST REGISTER TO ATTEND THE OPEN. CLICK ON ‘BOOK INSPECTION’ TO REGISTER**<br/><br/>Be sure to inspect this fantastic property!<br/><br/>Located in Christies Beach this great home is superbly positioned with convenient access to schools, shops, transport, facilities and just a short walk to the beach!<br/><br/>The home offers a generous tiled open plan living area overlooking the modern kitchen with stainless steel appliances, gas cooking and dishwasher, and leads to a separate laundry and handy second separate toilet.<br/><br/>You will find two generous bedrooms, one with built in robe, and the other bedroom could also be utilized as another living area.<br/><br/>The functional bathroom provides bath, shower and toilet.<br/><br/>Outside you will find a huge rear garden with loads of room for the kids and pets to play, plus undercover areas perfect for entertaining.<br/><br/>There is heating and cooling, lock up garage and pets are negotiable.<br/><br/>The home features;<br/><br/>- Two bedrooms<br/>- Main bedroom with built in robes<br/>- Second bedroom suitable to be used as a second living area<br/>- Open plan tiled living<br/>- Modern kitchen with gas cooking<br/>- Dishwasher<br/>- Functional bathroom with shower, bath and toilet<br/>- Separate laundry<br/>- Handy second toilet<br/>- Heating / Cooling<br/>- Lock garage with auto roller door<br/>- Huge rear lawn and garden<br/>- Undercover areas for entertaining<br/>- Lawn mowing included in the rent<br/>- Pets negotiable<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>All information contained in this advertisement has been gathered from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee or give any warranty about the information provided and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions. Interested parties should seek independent advice before making any leasing decisions. RLA168235','house','Christies Beach',-35.13030170,138.47493563,5165,'SA','4a Oceanview Rd','Christies Beach',1,2,1,'Residential Letting & Management Experts - MORPHETT VALE RLA168235','Garage: 1'),(4054,'Modern 3-Bedroom Home in Oaklands Park - Close to Everything!',730,'First National Lewis Prior takes pride in presenting this property to the market.<br/><br/>Welcome to 4C Bowden Grove, Oaklands Park SA 5046 - a tidy and low-maintenance home perfect for families, professionals or those looking for a comfortable lifestyle in a highly convenient location.<br/>Located in the heart of Oaklands Park, this property is just moments from Westfield Marion Shopping Centre, public transport including the Oaklands Park Train Station, local parks, schools, cafes and dining options - all within easy reach of your new front door.<br/> <br/>Features:<br/> <br/>The spacious bedrooms, bedrooms two and three with built in robe <br/>Master bedroom located on the lower level with walk in robe and ensuite<br/>Spacious open plan living and dining areas designed for relaxed living<br/>Well-appointed kitchen featuring generous bench space and storage, complete with stainless steel appliances including a gas cooktop.<br/>Centrally located full main bathroom located on the upper level<br/>Third toilet with basin located on the lower level<br/>Laundry with convenient external access<br/>Ducted reverse cycle heating and cooling throughout for year-round comfort<br/>Secure rear yard perfect for entertaining, pets or kids<br/>Carport with automatic roller door and internal access<br/>Driveway allowing additional off street parking<br/>Low maintenance living with quality finishes throughout<br/> <br/>This lovely home is ideally positioned for easy access to public transport, Marion\'s major retail and entertainment precinct, Flinders Medical Centre & University, and scenic coastal areas at Glenelg & Brighton - all just a short drive or train trip away.<br/> <br/><br/>Available 6th March, 2026. Pets Negotiable. <br/>Photos sourced from RPdata.','house','Oaklands Park',-35.00610048,138.54697180,5046,'SA','4C Bowden Grove','Oaklands Park',2,3,1,'First National Real Estate Lewis Prior - WARRADALE (RLA 160031)','Garage: 1, Air Conditioning, Pets Allowed'),(4055,'Refurbished & Ready - Stylish Living in the Heart of Mile End',720,'First National Lewis Prior takes pride in presenting this property to the market.<br/><br/>This beautifully refurbished home offers fresh, modern living in one of Adelaide\'s most convenient city-fringe locations. Updated throughout, the property combines contemporary finishes with low-maintenance comfort, making it ideal for professionals, couples or small families seeking space and lifestyle.<br/><br/>Light-filled interiors create an inviting atmosphere, with a functional layout designed for easy everyday living. The updated kitchen and living areas provide a practical yet stylish setting, while refreshed finishes throughout ensure a move-in-ready experience.<br/><br/>Ideally positioned in sought-after Mile End, just minutes from the Adelaide CBD and within easy reach of public transport, local cafés, shopping precincts and parklands. Enjoy proximity to Henley Beach Road dining, Adelaide Airport and quality local schools.<br/><br/><br/>Featuring:<br/><br/>- Refurbished throughout<br/>- Three well-proportioned bedrooms, bedroom 2 with robe<br/>- Light-filled living area<br/>- Dedicated dining space<br/>- Renovated kitchen offering generous storage and a dishwasher for added convenience.<br/>- Centrally located bathroom featuring floor-to-ceiling tiles, with a separate shower and bathtub.<br/>- Separate toilet<br/>- Separate laundry with direct rear access<br/>- Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning throughout<br/>- Low-maintenance rear yard<br/>- Rear veranda<br/>- Single carport<br/>- Driveway allowing additional off street parking<br/>- Secure and private setting<br/><br/>Enjoy the best of city-fringe living, moments from the CBD, beaches, shopping, transport and local lifestyle amenities.<br/><br/>Available Now.','house','Mile End',-34.93075330,138.57395263,5031,'SA','1A Daringa Street','Mile End',1,3,1,'First National Real Estate Lewis Prior - WARRADALE (RLA 160031)','Carport: 1, Air Conditioning, Dishwasher'),(4056,'Welcome to your new home at 1004/2 Furzer Street, Phillip.',520,'This stunning one-bedroom apartment offers a perfect blend of comfort and modern living, ideal for professionals or couples seeking a vibrant urban lifestyle.<br/><br/>Step inside to discover a spacious living area featuring ducted heating and air conditioning, ensuring year-round comfort. The well-appointed kitchen comes equipped with a dishwasher, making meal prep and clean-up a breeze. The bedroom boasts built-in robes, providing ample storage space for your belongings.<br/><br/>Enjoy your private balcony, perfect for relaxing after a long day. The apartment is located in a secure building with intercom access and includes a remote garage space for your convenience.<br/><br/>As a resident, you\'ll have access to fantastic amenities, including a gym and an inviting inground pool, perfect for unwinding on warm days. <br/><br/>Located in the heart of Phillip, you\'ll be just moments away from shopping, dining, and public transport, making it easy to explore everything the city has to offer.<br/><br/>Don\'t miss out on this opportunity to live in a stylish and convenient apartment. <br/><br/>This property is exempt from minimum ceiling insulation requirements<br/>EER NA<br/><br/>PETS: please be aware that at all stages of tenancy this property requires consent to be sought in writing for the keeping of any pets at the premises. Consent must be provided in writing before any pets are at the premises<br/>RENTING BOOK:<br/>https://www.act.gov.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0006/2608620/The-Renting-Book-January-2025.pdf<br/>TO ARRANGE AN INSPECTION PLEASE:<br/>1. Click on book inspection button<br/>2. Complete your details<br/>3. Answer pre-qualifying questions<br/>4. Register for a time<br/><br/>NOTE: IF you do not register you will not be notified of cancellations or changes to the inspection. If no-one has registered for the inspection, the inspection will not go ahead. Alternatively call the office on 6241 1922 to book an appointment<br/>Disclaimer:<br/>While all care has been taken in compiling information regarding properties marketed for rent, LJ HOOKER KALEEN accepts no responsibility and disclaim all liabilities in regard to any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. All parties should rely on their own investigation to validate information provided<br/><br/>','apartment','Phillip',-35.34089090,149.08394826,2606,'ACT','1004/2 Furzer Street','Phillip',1,1,1,'LJ Hooker - Kippax - Holt','Balcony, Garage: 1, Remote Garage, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Gym, Intercom'),(4057,'An expansive parcel in prestigious Deakin',1100,'What you see: <br/>Timeless charm in the heart of Deakin.<br/><br/>What we see:<br/>A space to call home. <br/><br/>See more:<br/>Securely fenced and privately gated residence<br/><br/>Expansive 1,472sqm (approx.) blue-chip landholding<br/>In-ground swimming pool framed by generous garden surrounds (Unfenced)<br/>Double lock-up garage with additional storage<br/>Additional driveway parking within secure grounds<br/>Established, private landscaping creating a true sanctuary<br/>Peacefully positioned in a quiet, tree-lined street<br/>Enchanting wisteria-draped entrance setting a romantic first impression<br/>Light-filled interiors enhanced by high ceilings and timeless period detail<br/>Cedar-framed windows adding warmth and character<br/>Elegant formal lounge with fireplace<br/>Ducted gas heating on lower level<br/>Wall heating on upper level<br/>Ceiling fans in two up stairs locations<br/>Separate family living and meals areas for flexible everyday living<br/>Well-appointed kitchen with gas cooktop, electric oven, dishwasher and walk-in pantry<br/>Guest bedroom or home office with garden access on the lower level<br/>Main bathroom servicing the ground floor<br/>Three spacious bedrooms + guest room<br/>Private ensuite plus additional family bathroom<br/>Picture windows capturing leafy garden and streetscape views<br/>Walking distance to Parliament House<br/>Close to Canberra Girls Grammar<br/>Zoned for Forrest Primary School<br/>Moments to Deakin Shops<br/><br/>6 - 12 month lease | Available 03/03/2026<br/>Pets: We request you seek the owner\'s approval in writing for pets.<br/>EER: Unknown.<br/>Embedded Network: No<br/>Disability Access: No<br/>-This property complies with the minimum ceiling insulation standards<br/><br/><br/>INSPECTION – LET\'S TALK<br/>Please book an inspection by clicking the \'BOOK INSPECTION\' button below. If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations, or further inspection times.<br/><br/>WANT TO APPLY?<br/>1. https://2apply.com.au/agency?n=HiveCanberra&form=0<br/><br/>Disclaimer: The material and information contained within this marketing is for general information purposes only. HIVE Property does not accept responsibility and disclaim all liabilities regarding any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. You should not rely upon this material as a basis for making any formal decisions. We recommend all interested parties to make further enquiries. By submitting an enquiry you are agreeing to opt in to further communication from HIVE Property PTY LTD in line with our Privacy Policy. A copy of our Privacy Policy can be found on our website.','house','Deakin',-35.31912948,149.09984397,2600,'ACT','4 Normanby Street','Deakin',2,4,2,'HIVE Property','Garage: 2'),(4058,'Low Maintenance Living in a Super Convenient Location!',480,'Set at the front of a small group of only 4, this neat and tidy unit offers super low maintenance living just 4km from the beach and 7km to the CBD. With a tram stop approximately a 15-minute walk away and bus stops just minutes from your door, commuting is made easy.<br/>Enjoy the convenience of local takeaway shops on the corner, Plympton Park Oval and playground at the end of the street, plus Castle Plaza Shopping Centre only a 5-minute drive away.<br/><br/>Property Features Include:<br/><br/>Two (2) bedrooms – main with full wall built-in robe and ceiling fans to both bedrooms<br/><br/>Open plan living area with floating floors and reverse cycle air-conditioning<br/><br/>Updated modern kitchen with electric cooking and overhead cupboards<br/><br/>Neat and functional bathroom with shower, toilet and laundry facilities<br/><br/>External roller shutters to main windows for added privacy and to help keep out the summer heat<br/><br/>Secure paved rear courtyard<br/><br/>Undercover parking for one (1) vehicle<br/><br/>12 month lease<br/>Tenant pays water use & supply<br/>APPLICATIONS via www.tenantoptions.com.au<br/>','unit','Plympton Park',-34.97973007,138.54907671,5038,'SA','1/45 Ferry Avenue','Plympton Park',1,2,1,'Gary J Smith Real Estate (RLA 150557) -','Carport: 1, Air Conditioning, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 1');
INSERT INTO `data` VALUES (4059,'Elegance Defined',1150,'Step into luxury living with this exquisite residence. Beyond the welcoming private front courtyard, you\'ll find a home adorned with captivating features. The heart of the house is a stunning granite gourmet kitchen, fully equipped with top-tier stainless steel appliances. The open-plan design effortlessly blends the kitchen, meals area, and family room, fashioning a generous and inviting living space. This is the epitome of refined living.<br/><br/>THE PROPERTY<br/>*Three bedrooms<br/>*Three bathrooms<br/>*Chef\'s kitchen with stainless steel appliances<br/>*Spacious living and meals area<br/>*Theatre room/additional bedroom<br/>*Laundry with rear access<br/>*Private front and rear courtyards<br/>*Balcony off main bedroom <br/>*Double lockup garage with shopper\'s entrance<br/><br/>THE FEATURES<br/>*Walk in robe to main bedroom<br/>*Built in robes <br/>*Gas cooktop<br/>*Dishwasher included<br/>*His and hers basins to ensuite <br/>*French doors on mezzanine floor that open to balcony <br/>*Ducted airconditioning and heating<br/>*Ample storage throughout <br/>*Easy clean tile flooring to living areas<br/>*Low maintenence gardens<br/><br/>THE AREA<br/>*Situated within the highly desirable enclave of Mount Pleasant<br/>*Within Applecross Senior High School and Rossmoyne Senior High School catchment <br/>*Less than 1km from Brentwood Primary School<br/>*Opposing local shops and cafes<br/>*Steps from local parks and Blue Gum Tennis Club <br/>*Moments from the scenic Swan River <br/>*Easy access to Perth CBD via. Kwinana Freeway<br/><br/>IMPORTANT INFORMATION<br/>Please be aware that we encourage online applications however, the applicant must have completed a registered viewing of the property with a Vivid Property Perth representative prior to making any such application.<br/><br/>If the property contains images which contain furniture the prospective Tenant must not consider the property as furnished unless expressly stated as furnished in the advertisement and if so, must also understand that the furniture and furnishings may differ from that contained in the images.<br/><br/>','house','Mount Pleasant',-32.04054974,115.84999499,6153,'WA','65 Parkside Avenue','Mount Pleasant',3,3,2,'Vivid Property Perth Pty Ltd','Balcony, Courtyard, Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1, Living Areas: 3, Toilets: 3, Pets Allowed'),(4060,'Modern Seaside Living in Brighton!',700,'Located at 15 Seaview Terrace, this much loved 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom house offers the ultimate coastal lifestyle in the heart of Brighton, SA. With a spacious design, this property is perfect for families looking for comfort and style by the beach.<br/><br/>Boasting a contemporary kitchen, multiple living areas, and a generous backyard, this home is ideal for entertaining guests or simply relaxing in a tranquil setting. Enjoy the convenience of two open car spaces, making parking a breeze for you and your visitors.<br/><br/>Don\'t miss this opportunity to experience the best of seaside living in this beautiful house in Brighton.<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/><br/>- Large rear yard<br/>- Pets Negotiable<br/>- Split System Airconditioning<br/>- Spacious Main Living area<br/>- Undercover parking<br/><br/>To apply: please visit tenantoptions.com.au<br/><br/>Disclaimer: it is a policy of Oh! Property Management that all properties are viewed either by yourself, or an appointed nominee before proceeding to an application. Applications received prior to viewing the property will not be processed. All information has been obtained from sources deemed as accurate, however, it cannot be guaranteed and neither the agent, agency or landlord accepts any liability for errors, omissions or oversights. Oh! Property Management has exclusive management of this property, and it is not advertised by any other third parties or on other third-party websites, if you see this property advertised elsewhere please get in contact with the agency immediately. RLA 305890.','house','Brighton',-35.02231110,138.51809501,5048,'SA','15 Seaview Terrace','Brighton',1,3,2,'Oh! Property Management - WOODCROFT','Fully Fenced, Open Spaces: 2, Secure Parking, Shed, Broadband Internet Available, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Pets Allowed'),(4061,'Modern & Convenient Living in the Heart of Harrison',680,'To Apply, please click the link below:<br/>https://app.2apply.com.au/Agency/prdcanberracbd<br/><br/>Available 26 March 2026<br/><br/>Welcome to 22 Adventure Street, Harrison ACT 2914, a well-maintained home offering comfortable, low-maintenance living in a highly sought-after location.<br/><br/>The home is located within the Unincorporated ACT council area, with no bushfire, flood, or heritage overlays detected, providing added peace of mind. <br/>Families will appreciate that the property is within the priority enrollment area for Harrison School and Gungahlin College, plus one additional local school.<br/>Enjoy reliable connectivity with NBN Fibre to the Premises and strong 5G mobile coverage.<br/>Conveniently situated close to local shops, parks, schools, and public transport, this home offers an excellent lifestyle opportunity in one of Harrison\'s popular residential pockets.<br/><br/>Positioned on a 250m² block, this property features:<br/><br/>- 3 spacious bedrooms<br/>- 1 well-appointed bathroom<br/>- 1 dedicated car space<br/>- Functional floorplan with light-filled living areas<br/>- If no Energy Rating is displayed for this property, EER is unknown<br/>- The property complies with the insulation requirement.<br/><br/>Pets<br/>In accordance with the Residential Tenancies Act Clause 71AE Process for tenant seeking consent - the tenant must apply, in writing, to the lessor, for the lessors\' consent to keep pet/s at this property.<br/><br/>The lessor may impose conditions on consent, including but not limited to, the number and type of animals being kept, and any cost involved for rectification required as a result of the animal.<br/><br/>note: All care has been taken in compiling this information, PRD Canberra CBD will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All applicants /parties should rely on their own inspection & investigations to validate any information provided.<br/>Photos provided by landlord<br/><br/><br/>','house','Harrison',-35.20838926,149.15522958,2914,'ACT','22 Adventure','Harrison',1,3,1,'PRD Canberra CBD - PAGE','Garage: 1'),(4062,'Private 3x1 Granny Flat | Modern Renovation | Secure',750,'**Please note: The main residence is not included. Only the granny flat is available for lease.** pool not included.<br/><br/>Positioned in the sought-after suburb of Henley Brook, this beautifully presented 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom granny flat offers privacy, comfort, and modern finishes - ideal for a couple, small family, or professional tenants seeking low-maintenance living in a peaceful setting.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>Three well-sized bedrooms<br/><br/>One modern bathroom<br/><br/>Beautifully renovated kitchen with modern appliances<br/><br/>Neutral colour palette throughout<br/><br/>Open and functional living layout<br/><br/>Private entrance to the granny flat<br/><br/>Secure side gate access for added privacy<br/><br/>Parking space for two vehicles<br/><br/>Covered patio area - perfect for relaxing and unwinding after a long day<br/><br/>The kitchen is the heart of this home, thoughtfully renovated with contemporary finishes and quality appliances, offering both style and practicality. The neutral tones create a fresh, light-filled environment ready for you to make your own.<br/><br/>With its separate access and private outdoor space, this property provides independence and comfort while still being located in a well-established and convenient area.<br/><br/>Enjoy the lifestyle Henley Brook has to offer, with parks, wineries, local shops, and major amenities all within easy reach.<br/><br/>For further information or to arrange a private inspection, please contact us today.<br/><br/>When Only The Best Will Do.','house','Henley Brook',-31.80301000,115.97361000,6055,'WA','42 Horseshoe Circuit','Henley Brook',1,3,2,'New Dawn Realty - AVELEY','Open Spaces: 2, Toilets: 1'),(4063,'Smart, Solar-Powered Living in Harrison',860,'To Apply, please click the link below:<br/>https://app.2apply.com.au/Agency/prdcanberracbd<br/><br/>Available 7th March 2026<br/><br/>A modern single level and spacious home designed for comfort, efficiency, and contemporary living.<br/>This impressive residence is equipped with outstanding energy and smart-home features, making it ideal for tenants seeking long-term savings and everyday convenience.<br/><br/>The home offers a well-designed layout with comfortable living areas and quality finishes throughout, perfect for modern families or professionals.<br/>Conveniently located close to local shops, schools, parks, and public transport, this property delivers an exceptional lifestyle in one of Harrison\'s most desirable pockets. <br/><br/>Property Features<br/>- NBN Fibre to the Premises (FTTP)<br/>- Ethernet cabling to the study and living area TV space<br/>- 1.5kW solar unit generating 45.9c/kW (fixed for 4 years)<br/>- 13kW solar system with 11kW battery (under warranty until September 2032)<br/>- Electric vehicle (EV) car charger<br/>- Reverse cycle air conditioning with five separate zones<br/>- Under-tile electric heating to the living area<br/>- Digital keyless entry to the main door and garage/hallway entrance<br/>- Bosch oven with 5-burner gas cooktop<br/>- Samsung dishwasher<br/>- If no Energy Rating is displayed for this property, EER is unknown<br/>- The property complies with the insulation requirement.<br/><br/>Pets<br/>In accordance with the Residential Tenancies Act Clause 71AE Process for tenant seeking consent - the tenant must apply, in writing, to the lessor, for the lessors\' consent to keep pet/s at this property.<br/><br/>The lessor may impose conditions on consent, including but not limited to, the number and type of animals being kept, and any cost involved for rectification required as a result of the animal.<br/><br/>note: All care has been taken in compiling this information, PRD Canberra CBD will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All applicants /parties should rely on their own inspection & investigations to validate any information provided.<br/>Photos provided by landlord','house','Harrison',-35.19766893,149.15986643,2914,'ACT','48 Cultivation Street','Harrison',2,4,2,'PRD Canberra CBD - PAGE','Garage: 2'),(4064,'Amazing 4x2 Modern Family Home',850,'HouseSmart Real Estate Pty Ltd is thrilled to present this sublime single-level strata property strategically is located in modern lifestyle complex offering a neat and low maintenance 4 bedroom 2 bathroom home. Perfect for any family.<br/><br/>As soon as you walk through the property, you will be impressed by this modern property. The kitchen is equipped with lots of bench space and plenty of cabinetry. The living and dining area are complete with quality timber flooring, evaporative air conditioner and sliding glass door that lead out to the beautiful courtyard, making the perfect spot for friends and families gathering.<br/><br/>FEATURES INCLUDE:<br/>Master room with private bathroom & walk in robe.<br/>2nd, 3rd & 4th bedrooms with built-in robes and the sliding doors.<br/>Kitchen with BOSCH gas stainless steel hot plate cooking, oven, rangehood, pantry and dishwasher.<br/>Large linen board with sliding doors in the passage.<br/>Outdoor access from the laundry.<br/>BOSCH Gas instantaneous hot water system<br/>Ducted Evaporative airconditioning throughout the property.<br/>Equipped with Hills home security alarm.<br/>Outdoor courtyard with low maintenance.<br/>Double garage with remote control access and internal shopper\'s entry.<b