ep inside and be greeted by an open-plan living and dining area, bathed in natural light thanks to the large windows that frame the stunning views of the surrounding area. The well-appointed kitchen features sleek cabinetry, quality appliances, and ample storage space, making meal preparation a breeze.<br/><br/>Both bedrooms are generously sized and include built-in wardrobes, providing plenty of storage for all your belongings. The stylish bathroom is modern and functional, with a large shower and a vanity with ample counter space. <br/><br/>Don\'t miss out on this fantastic opportunity to secure a modern and convenient lifestyle in the heart of Bruce. Contact us today to arrange a private inspection and start envisioning your new home.','apartment','Bruce',-35.24030669,149.10265663,2617,'ACT','204/39 Braybrooke Street','Bruce',1,2,1,'Uplus Realestate - DICKSON','Balcony, Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Intercom, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Furnished'),(4092,'BEAUTIFULLY PRESENTED INSIDE & OUT!',740,'This modern 4 bedroom, 2 bathroom home is beautifully presented and located in the St Anthony\'s Estate in Secret Harbour. Situated close to beautiful beaches, local primary and high schools, Secret Harbour shops and Golf Course.<br/><br/>Perfect for families, the property offers plenty of living space inside, including an open plan meals and family room, theatre and kids activity room. The modern style kitchen features stone bench tops, a scullery and double insert sink, dishwasher and gas hot plates.<br/><br/>Outside features a paved alfresco and a low maintenance rear yard with artificial turf.<br/><br/>Just some of the many features include:<br/>- Attractive street frontage<br/>- Open plan Family and Meals room<br/>- Modern Kitchen with Scullery, Double Sink & Stone benches<br/>- Dishwasher<br/>- Gas Hot Plates<br/>- LED lights<br/>- Theatre Room<br/>- Spacious Bedrooms with Built in robes<br/>- Activity Room<br/>- D