unny living area with adjoining \'Winter Garden\'<br/>• Lovely top floor corner position<br/>• Modern kitchen with stone benchtop and quality ILVE appliances <br/>• Spacious bedroom <br/>• Two-way ensuite style bathroom with quality finishes <br/>• Internal laundry with washer/dryer <br/>• Double-glazing <br/>• Split-system air-conditioning <br/>• Remote control window blinds in the Winter Garden <br/>• Allocated basement car parking space <br/>• Storage locker <br/>• Pleasant outlook to the leafy streetscape<br/>• Convenient location within a unique village community<br/>• On-site shops, salons and local businesses<br/>• Close to restaurants and cafes of the Kingston Foreshore, Lake Burley Griffin and Fyshwick Markets<br/><br/>This lovely apartment is available now! <br/><br/>A current EER Report is not available for this property.<br/><br/>This property does not yet comply with the minimum ceiling insulation standard. <br/><br/>Please register your interest or book an inspection via the Book Inspection tab/Request a time for an Inspection link.<br/><br/>Applications are via 2apply.com however, please note that it is our company policy that an application will not be processed until an inspection has been attended.<br/><br/>PETS: please be aware that at all stages of tenancy this property requires consent to be sought in writing from the lessor for the keeping of any pets at the premises. Consent must be provided in writing before any pets are at the premises.','apartment','Kingston',-35.31732287,149.14980218,2604,'ACT','404/1 The Causeway','Kingston',1,1,1,'Luxe Residential Canberra - KINGSTON','Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Intercom, Pay TV Access, Split-system Air Conditioning'),(4094,'Newly Renovated Delightful Four Bedroom Home',795,'This beautifully maintained home offers a comfortable and convenient lifestyle in the heart of Fulham Gardens.<br/><br/>Key Features:<br/><br/>• Freshly painted throughout