oorstep, complemented by resort-style amenities for the ultimate inner-city lifestyle.<br/><br/>Just a short stroll to St Georges Terrace, Elizabeth Quay, Kings Park and the Swan River, you\'ll enjoy unparalleled access to the CBD, dining, entertainment and public transport – all within minutes of your front door.<br/><br/>Step outside your apartment and into a lifestyle of convenience and leisure. Take a refreshing dip in one of the sparkling swimming pools, enjoy a workout in the fully equipped gym, or unwind with a game on the tennis court – all without leaving home.<br/><br/>Apartment Features:<br/>Fully furnished and equipped – move straight in<br/>Spacious kitchen with ample storage<br/>Two generous bedrooms<br/>Two bathrooms<br/>Two air conditioning units for year-round comfort<br/>One secure parking bay<br/>Secure storeroom<br/>Resort-Style Complex Amenities:<br/>Two swimming pools<br/>Tennis court<br/>Fully equipped gymnasium<br/><br/>Secure, well-maintained complex<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/>Walking distance to Perth CBD & St Georges Terrace<br/>Moments from Elizabeth Quay precinct<br/>Easy access to Kings Park walking trails<br/>Swan River foreshore at your doorstep<br/>Public transport right outside the complex<br/>Close to cafes, restaurants & bars<br/>Quick access to freeway entries north and south<br/><br/>PLEASE DRIVE BY THE PROPERTY TO ASSESS ITS SUITABILITY.<br/><br/>WANTING TO VIEW THIS HOME?<br/>To view this property please register for an inspection time via the Driven Property Group website https://www.drivengroup.com.au<br/><br/>Click on \"Book Inspection\" and follow the prompts. If there are no available or suitable times, use the contact agent\' submission form to request an inspection, you will then be notified of the next scheduled viewing. <br/><br/>Applications are submitted through 2 apply and the link will be sent once the property has been viewed.','house','Perth',-31.95580053,115.84758524,6000,'WA','16/124 Mounts Bay Road','P