amily lifestyle. A substantial two-storey home offering four bedrooms, two bathrooms and three toilets, this property combines generous proportions with multiple living zones and exceptional outdoor entertaining.<br/><br/>Designed with families in mind, the home offers a seamless blend of open plan living and private retreats. The central living, dining and kitchen area forms the heart of the home, while a separate study and activity room situated on the ground floor, plus an upstairs lounge with compact kitchenette space provides versatility for growing families or multi-generational living.<br/><br/>Upstairs, the master suite is a true sanctuary – complete with its own front balcony, a nursery / dressing room-style space, and a beautifully appointed ensuite. Whether you\'re starting the day with ocean breezes or winding down in comfort, this space delivers both luxury and practicality.<br/><br/>Property features include:<br/>• Spacious master retreat with private front balcony + a versatile nursery / dressing room-style space off the bedroom, sizeable purpose-built walk-in robe and luxurious ensuite <br/>• Three additional generously sized bedrooms, two featuring BIR\'s<br/>• Expansive kitchen featuring generous bench space, ample storage and quality stainless steel appliances, including induction + gas cooktop, electric oven, dishwasher and 2x fridge / freezers included with the property - perfect for those who love to cook<br/>• Three separate living areas - one upstairs with compact kitchenette bench + two downstairs, offering flexibility and convenience for the whole family <br/>• Dedicated home office with built-in cabinetry and desk <br/>• Ducted reverse cycle air-conditioning, ceiling fans to three bedrooms, plus floor heating throughout – providing year-round comfort<br/>• Abundant storage throughout the home<br/>• Two undercover rear alfresco areas, one with built-in gas BBQ<br/>• Rear balcony overlooking the backyard <br/>• Astro turf to front and rear g