ing barbecues or simply enjoying the sunshine, with a low-maintenance yard that requires minimal upkeep. <br/><br/>Property Features: <br/>• Master bedroom has walk through robe to the ensuite. 3 other spacious bedrooms with built-in robes, 1 bathroom, corner bathtub with shower cubicle, and extra-long vanity top offering extra cupboards and draws, and 2nd toilet <br/>• Large sunken front formal lounge with laminate flooring and raked ceilings <br/>• Dining/open study area with easy-care laminate flooring <br/>• Kitchen with double sink, splashback, gas hot plate cooking, underbench oven, corner pantry, loads of cupboards, breakfast bar, and dishwasher <br/>• Tiled meals/family area adjacent to kitchen with sliding door access to rear yard <br/>• Laundry with direct access to outside, with overhead cupboards, 2 x double linen cupboards in hallway <br/>• New Ducted evaporative air conditioning throughout <br/>• Large brick paved patio entertaining area <br/><br/>This property offers convenient access to a range of amenities. <br/><br/>Within close proximity, you will find shopping centers, schools, parks, and public transport options, ensuring that everything you need is just a short distance away.<br/><br/><br/><br/>*** ARE YOU A LANDLORD? If you are looking for property management services, we would love to hear from you. Contact our Business Development Manager Ervina on [REDACTED PHONE] or [REDACTED EMAIL] for a no-obligation and confidential conversation.','house','Bull Creek',-32.05815000,115.85955000,6149,'WA','12 Hardy Street','Bull Creek',2,4,2,'Harcourts Property Specialists','Carport: 2, Fully Fenced, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Ensuite: 1, Evaporative Cooling, Pets Allowed'),(4276,'CHARMING & UPDATED 2 BEDROOM ROW COTTAGE',750,'$750.00 per week<br/>Available Now<br/><br/>Williams Property Management are proud to offer this two-bedroom residence for rent in an idyllic, tree lined street. <br/>The property is ideally situated within walking distance of Melbo