NG: One off-street parking place<br/><br/><br/>To view this property and select your preferred inspection time, click on the button \"EMAIL AGENT\" and enter your details and we will instantly respond. Important Note: If you are not registered, you will not be advised should any home opens be cancelled.','unit','South Perth',-31.98031000,115.86341000,6151,'WA','2/23 Albert St','South Perth',1,1,1,'Momentum Wealth Residential Property','Open Spaces: 1'),(4280,'Relaxed, Low-Maintenance Living You’ll Love',550,'Perfectly positioned in Glenelg East, this beautifully presented two-bedroom home delivers a relaxed, low-maintenance lifestyle in a location you’ll love. Ideal for professionals, couples or downsizers, it’s thoughtfully designed for comfort, simplicity and everyday ease.<br/>You will love:<br/>• A bright, welcoming living area filled with natural light, perfect for unwinding after work, enjoying quiet mornings, or entertaining with ease<br/>• A neat and practical kitchen is equipped with upright electric cook top and oven. The open-plan design allows for easy movement and connection, making daily cooking and casual meals effortless.<br/>• A spacious master bedroom featuring a built-in robe, providing comfort, storage and a peaceful retreat<br/>• A well-sized second bedroom ideal for guests, a home office or a flexible second living space<br/>• A freshly renovated modern bathroom, combining modern finishes with easy-care functionality for stress-free living.<br/>This inviting home blends comfort, convenience and style — an excellent opportunity to enjoy effortless living in a well-connected neighborhood.<br/><br/>AVAILABLE on 6th March<br/><br/>Tenant to pay water usage and supply. <br/>4 weeks bond rent equivalent <br/><br/>Please email/SMS to register prior to inspection <br/><br/>Disclaimer<br/>RLA 322064 - This advert contains information and imagery that is believed to be accurate based on Ernest Real Estate sources and inspections of the property.<br/>Pros