fect for gatherings in all seasons. There is a secure garage plus additional off-street parking, and the fenced front yard enhances privacy and security.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>Spacious living area with separate dining<br/><br/>Polished timber flooring<br/><br/>Split-system air conditioning<br/><br/>U-shaped kitchen with ample storage<br/><br/>Built-in wardrobes<br/><br/>Separate shower<br/><br/>Large backyard<br/><br/>Covered outdoor entertaining area<br/><br/>Secure garage plus extra parking<br/><br/>Fenced front yard<br/><br/>A practical layout with generous outdoor space rarely found in similar properties. Ideal for families seeking space, privacy, and comfort.<br/><br/>Come take a look in person and submit your application before someone else does.<br/><br/>Rent - $600 per week<br/><br/>Bond - $2400 (4 weeks rent equivalent)<br/><br/>Deposit - $1200 (2 weeks rent equivalent)<br/><br/>LEASE TERM: 12 months+<br/><br/>AVAILABLE FROM: Now!!!<br/><br/>WATER CHARGES: Tenant to pay all water usage and supply charge<br/><br/>INSPECTION: Booking now<br/><br/>APPLICATION: www.2apply.com.au/Agency/HOSORE<br/><br/>BOOK YOUR INSPECTION ONLINE:<br/><br/>If you are interested in viewing this property, please go to our website https://www.2apply.com.au/Agency/HOSORE and press the BOOK INSPECTION button to register for a currently open inspection time. Open inspection times will be uploaded mid-week on our Facebook for weekend viewings.<br/><br/>Please note we do not do private inspections unless a property manager has arranged otherwise.<br/><br/>To avoid disappointment, we encourage you to register your interest so we can keep you informed during all stages of the leasing process. *Please note that these may contain generic automated responses*<br/><br/>TO APPLY ONLINE:<br/><br/>To apply for this property online please go to our website https://www.2apply.com.au/Agency/HOSORE and press the APPLY NOW button to submit an application. Each applying tenant will need to create an account to apply for the property.<br/><br/>Applications will be processed in the following week due to the increase in demand for rentals, please be aware that we will contact you if we need additional information, ID or if your application is successful.<br/><br/>Disclaimer<br/><br/>At HOSO Real Estate, we try our absolute best to obtain the correct information for this advertisement. The accuracy of this information cannot be guaranteed and all interested parties should view the property and seek independent advice if they wish to proceed.<br/><br/>1800 314 775','house','Elizabeth',-34.72630371,138.66994629,5112,'SA','22 Harvey Road','Elizabeth',1,3,3,'HOSO Real Estate - RLA 322535','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Shed, Built-in Wardrobes, Evaporative Cooling, Floorboards, Living Areas: 1, Open Fireplace, Split-system Heating'),(4284,'Spacious 4-bedroom home in prime warnbro location.',650,'Welcome to 6 Coronata-a beautifully presented, move-in ready home offering space, comfort, and modern living. Perfect for families or anyone seeking a relaxed coastal lifestyle, this property combines functional design with convenient location. Close to parks, schools, and childcare facilities, this home is just minutes from Warnbro Fair Shopping Centre and offers easy access to Warnbro Train Station and public transport. It\'s also only a short drive to Warnbro Beach, local coastal attractions, and the Aqua Jetty Aquatic Centre, making it perfectly positioned for both convenience and lifestyle.<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>• Four spacious bedrooms with neutral, modern tones.<br/>• Master bedroom filled with natural light and split-system air conditioning.<br/>• Freshly painted interiors for a bright, welcoming atmosphere.<br/>• Front lounge providing a separate, relaxed living space.<br/>• Dedicated study nook-ideal for working from home.<br/>• Open-plan living and dining area with tiled flooring.<br/>• Wrap-around patio, perfect for entertaining or relaxing outdoors.<br/>• Solar panels to help reduce electricity costs.<br/>• Security cameras installed for peace of mind.<br/><br/>Submit your application through the 2APPLY app.<br/><br/>HOW TO VIEW THE PROPERTY: No private inspections, please register for the allocated timeslot by clicking on Register For Inspection and enter your details. If no times are allocated to view this property, we recommend that you register your interest below to be notified of viewing and times as soon as they become available.<br/><br/>** PLEASE NOTE: All viewings are booked online. If there are no registered attendees for the viewing, the viewing will be cancelled, and the leasing agent will not be attending. **','house','Warnbro',-32.34155000,115.76405000,6169,'WA','6 Coronata Drive','Warnbro',2,4,1,'Acton | Belle Property Rockingham & Baldivis','Carport: 1'),(4285,'LOCATION LOCATION LOCATION!!!!',800,'2 BED, 2 BATH, 2 CARBAYS & HUGE BALCONY<br/><br/>With a huge 97 SQM balcony, right in the heart of the West Perth cafe strip, this luxury style living will not disappoint!<br/><br/>The 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom, unfurnished apartment is located at one of West Perth\'s finest developments, Eleven78. Situated in the café/shopping strip of West Perth, it\'s an easy walk to the stunning views from Kings Park, or go for a run through kilometres of botanic gardens. For the gym junkies, nearby is \"Next Generation\", Perth\'s most prestigious health and fitness centre. Or use the private gym in the complex.<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>- Modern kitchen with stainless steel appliances, stone benchtop, plenty of storage space and dishwasher<br/>- Large open plan living and dining area with access to your own large courtyard with privacy screens<br/>- Master bedroom with mirrored robe, ensuite, split system, reverse cycle air conditioning and access to the balcony<br/>- Second bedroom with mirrored robe<br/>- Ensuite with large double shower, plenty of vanity and storage space and toilet<br/>- Second bathroom with laundry facilities including a wall mounted dryer<br/>- Large courtyard<br/>- 2 car bays (stacker) in secure parking<br/>- Own storage room<br/> <br/>Don\'t miss out on this impressive opportunity. <br/><br/>*Note: Please select the \'Book Inspection Time\' button and register your details to ensure you receive updates on any unforeseen changes or cancellations of viewing times.<br/><br/>Please ensure that you are at the property before the start of the viewing to ensure you are able to inspect the property. Late attendance may result in the property not being able to be viewed.<br/><br/>Photos are indicative and are only for advertising purposes, furnishings/items depicted are not necessarily included in any property.<br/><br/>Blackburne Property Management are the highest-rated property management company in Perth, delivering exceptional Perth Property Management Services across Perth and metropolitan areas.','apartment','West Perth',-31.94874948,115.84382906,6005,'WA','14/1178 Hay Street','West Perth',2,2,2,'Blackburne   - Subiaco','Balcony, Garage: 2, Air Conditioning, Intercom'),(4286,'Low Maintenance Home with Spa, Solar, Large Family Room & Games Room - Exceptional Parking & Prime Convenience',750,'Harcourts Rockingham is pleased to present this spacious and easy care home positioned in a quiet cul de sac. Offering multiple living zones, generous outdoor space, and excellent parking for boats, caravans or extra vehicles, this property provides comfort, practicality, and convenience in one of Rockingham\'s most accessible locations.<br/> <br/>Property Features<br/>• 3 well sized bedrooms<br/>• PLUS a large family room<br/>• PLUS a separate games room / second living area<br/>• Solar panels to help reduce electricity costs<br/>• Jacuzzi/spa for relaxation<br/>• Low maintenance gardens<br/>• Large parking capacity suitable for boat, caravan, trailer or multiple vehicles<br/>• Light fi