re perfect for everyday enjoyment.<br/>- Modern Bathroom: A spacious, updated bathroom with a rain/hose shower, separate bathtub, stone powder vanity, and a toilet provides comfort and convenience for the whole family.<br/>Master Suite Retreat: The larger master bedroom is a standout, with a ceiling fan, split-system air conditioning, and full-height built-in wardrobes.<br/>- Outdoor Entertaining: Step outside to a private, paved courtyard, accessible from both the master suite and dining area. Enjoy the soothing sea breezes and peaceful atmosphere, perfect for relaxing or entertaining.<br/>- Additional Features: Timber-look floors, carpeted 2nd and 3rd bedrooms with built-in robes, a separate second toilet off the laundry, ducted-evaporative air-conditioning, downlights, feature skirting boards, and a security-door entrance.<br/>- Parking and Storage: Single carport with space for a second vehicle in tandem. Plus, there\'s a separate external rear storeroom for extra convenience.<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/>- Just minutes away from Scarborough Beach, offering surf, sand, cafes, restaurants, bars, and a public outdoor pool.<br/>- Close to Abbett Park’s community sporting facilities and excellent schools (St Mary\'s, St John\'s, and Churchlands).<br/>- Nearby shopping hubs, including Westfield Innaloo, the newly renovated Karrinyup, and the Doubleview IGA supermarket.<br/>- Easy access to public transport and the freeway.<br/><br/>This villa offers the perfect “lock-up-and-leave” lifestyle in a prime location. With all the conveniences of modern living and the serenity of coastal breezes, this property is ready for you to call home.<br/><br/>AVAILABLE: Now<br/>LEASE TERM: Minimum of 12 months<br/>Special condition: <br/>Split system in master not working<br/><br/>TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY:<br/>To schedule a viewing, click on the \"Contact Agent\" or \"Get in Touch\" button, enter your details, and we will respond instantly.<br/>Important Note: If you are not regist