ceful lifestyle while still close to the city, transport and amenities. <br/><br/>This unit has been renovated from top to bottom with no expense spared. It offers its new occupants a spacious open plan living, dining and kitchen area which overlooks the small courtyard and its leafy outlook. <br/><br/>Features of this apartment include: <br/>* 2 Bedrooms<br/>* 1 Bathroom and Laundry<br/>* Ceiling Fans to both bedrooms <br/>* Reverse Cycle Air conditioning to the living room <br/>* 2 Parking Bays (located off the courtyard)<br/>* Dishwasher<br/>* Storage galore to the kitchen<br/>* Laminate flooring throughout <br/>* Security door to be installed to the courtyard <br/><br/>Tucked away in a wonderfully convenient location, this unit delivers effortless access to everyday essentials while still offering a peaceful, community minded atmosphere. Local shopping centres, cafés and key services are only minutes away, and public transport options are close by for easy commuting. With parks and leafy open spaces just around the corner, you\'ll have plenty of inviting spots for walking, exercising or simply unwinding outdoors.<br/><br/>For more information or to book a viewing please contact Justine on one of the options below:<br/>1. Email: [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/>2. Office: [REDACTED PHONE]<br/>3. Mob: [REDACTED PHONE] (SMS If you prefer)<br/><br/>Please note that online applications wont be processed until you have attended a viewing and received the application information.<br/><br/>Thank you for viewing this property FOR LEASE.<br/><br/>*** TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY IS EASY***<br/>Enter your details in the email agent section below.<br/><br/>***TO MAKE AN APPLICATION EASY***<br/>Application forms will be on hand at the inspections.<br/>Disclaimer: This description has been prepared for advertising and marketing purposes only. You must make your own independent investigations and rely on your own personal judgment about the information included in this advertisement as we provid