rdens and, with care, will grow to two metres within eighteen months.<br/><br/>The chef-designed kitchen showcases expanses of white granite benchtops, feature pendant and benchtop lighting, a stainless steel Ilve six gas burner freestanding cooker with large electric oven, commercial quality in-roof exhaust, Samsung dishwasher, Blanco black granite sink, large pantry and wine fridge. A Tallowwood bi-fold servery window conveniently opens to the deck area. The laundry, with granite benchtop and built-in cupboards is positioned adjacent to the kitchen and family room.<br/><br/>There is a luxuriously proportioned master bedroom featuring large corner windows overlooking the Maple tree in the rear garden and a walk-in wardrobe. The ensuite includes double sinks, Caesarstone vanity top, double shower heads and heated towel rail. There are three additional large bedrooms, two with built-in wardrobes.<br/><br/>The beautifully appointed main bathroom features stylish Italian wall tiles, Caesarstone vanity top, double shower heads, freestanding bathtub, pebble shower floor, underfloor heating and two heated towel rails. The powder room is decorated with matching feature tiles.<br/><br/>Year round comfort is ensured with ducted gas heating and evaporative cooling and car accommodation includes a substantial double carport and single brick garage with automated door. (two smaller cars would fit behind each other)<br/><br/>Located within walking distance to the Grammar School, St. Bede\'s and Red Hill Primary School and the French Australian Pre School. The property is in close proximity to Narrabundah, St. Clare\'s and St. Edmund\'s Colleges, Red Hill and Manuka shopping precincts and the enjoyment of walking and mountain bike trails on Red Hill Reserve is just metres away!<br/><br/>• 4 bedrooms l 2 bathrooms l single garage l double carport <br/>• Single level home <br/>• Ensuite to master bedroom<br/>• Ducted gas heating and evaporative cooling<br/>• Double carport<br/>• Si