/><br/><br/>NOTE ABOUT THE OPEN INSPECTIONS: Interested persons MUST register their details to attend any of the scheduled viewing dates and times allocated. The agent will not attend the listed viewing date and time if you do not register and confirm your attendance. It is for this reason we highly recommend you register to attend to ensure the agent\'s attendance and to avoid disappointment. <br/><br/>Disclaimer: All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions. We encourage all interested parties to make their own enquiries, particularly regarding NBN/internet availability at the property.','house','Grange',-34.89626250,138.49409872,5022,'SA','28A Fort Street','Grange',2,3,2,'LJ Hooker - Adelaide Metro','Garage: 2, Alarm System, Ensuite: 1, Living Areas: 1, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning'),(4437,'1 bedroom, 1 bathroom. Eligibility criteria applies. Start date subject to maintenance being completed.',150,'PLEASE NOTE: in order to be eligible for this property you must meet the following criteria: <br/><br/>You must be in receipt of an Aged Pension (or similar) from Centrelink <br/><br/>If you do not meet the income criteria, you will not be eligible for this property <br/><br/> <br/><br/>HOW TO APPLY:<br/>Access via Computer: Please use the \"Get In Touch\" button to send through your enquiry and you will be given more information about how to apply for this property. <br/> <br/>Access via your Mobile Phone: If you are on your mobile - please scroll to the bottom and use the “Send an Enquiry” button to receive more information about how to apply for this property<br/><br/>A hard copy application form can be requested, please send an enquiry <br/><br/> <br/><br/>Features to this property include: <br/><br/>* Bedroom with split system air conditioner <br/><br/>* Open plan kitchen/living area with split system air conditioning and electric oven. <br/><br/>* Main bathroom with shower only <br/><br/>* Separate laundry <br/><br/>* Single garage','unit','Peterborough',-32.97209317,138.83320453,5422,'SA','4 Chinner Street','Peterborough',1,1,1,'Unity Housing - Adelaide RLA 246371','Garage: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning'),(4438,'PEACEFUL, PRIVATE AND PERFECT',1050,'WHAT TO LOVE<br/>Nestled right at the end of a whisper-quiet cul-de-sac setting, this stylish rear 3 bedroom 2 bathroom single-level residence blends modern design with low-maintenance comfort in the most effortless way. A striking façade gives way to wide open spaces, inviting indoor-outdoor flow and a sense of calm that instantly makes you feel at home. It’s a hidden retreat for those who value peace, privacy and a touch of contemporary quality — all without compromising on convenience.<br/><br/>A spacious front master suite is the pick of the bedrooms with its walk-in wardrobe and intimate ensuite bathroom – shower, twin “his and hers” vanities, under-bench storage, toilet and all.<br/><br/>A central study area is a fantastic highlight of the floor plan, with a walk-in linen press, separate second toilet and a separate laundry (with under-bench storage and external/side access to the corner drying courtyard) servicing the minor sleeping quarters well, alongside a practical main family bathroom – with a shower, separate bathtub, powder vanity and under-bench cupboards – and two spare bedrooms with built-in robes.<br/><br/>The open-plan family, dining and kitchen area is a huge functional hub of the layout, playing host to split-system air-conditioning, a gas bayonet for heating, tiled splashbacks, over-head display cabinetry and a breakfast bar for quick bites.<br/><br/>The kitchen itself is well-equipped with everything a resident chef needs, inclusive of a full-height double-door storage pantry, double sinks, Robam range-hood and gas-cooktop appliances, a stainless-steel Technika under-bench oven and a stainless-steel Samsung dishwasher.<br/><br/>A separate lounge – or theatre – room only inches away doubles personal living options, whilst the family room extends outside to a tiled alfresco-entertaining area with a gas bayonet for a barbecue, amidst an easy-care backyard dominated by artificial turf.<br/><br/>AT A GLANCE:<br/> • 3 bedrooms<br/> • 2 bathrooms<br/> • Study area<br/> • Generous open-plan family/dining/kitchen space<br/> • Separate lounge/theatre room<br/> • Outdoor alfresco entertaining<br/> • Double lock-up garage<br/><br/>WHERE IT\'S AT:<br/>A short walk around the corner gets you to Caratti Park in one direction and the stunning Stirling Civic Gardens parklands in the other, with Stirling Train Station around the corner and several bike paths also just strolling distance away. Picturesque Princeton Private Estate lakes and parklands, top schools, Roselea Shopping Centre, public transport, the freeway, the vibrant Main Street café and restaurant strip, the city, the coast, Westfield Innaloo and the exceptional Karrinyup Shopping Centre precinct are all in close proximity too, for good measure. <br/><br/>HOW TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY<br/><br/>Arranging an inspection is easy!<br/><br/>Simply click the \'Make an enquiry\' or \'email agent\' button for that rental property. You then enter your details and choose an inspection time that suits you. An instant registration email and/or text message will be sent to you. Confirm your attendance by selecting \'register\'.<br/><br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: If you do not register to attend we can\'t notify you of any changes or cancellations to open. An open will be cancelled if no one has registered to attend.','house','Stirling',-31.89174930,115.81236166,6021,'WA','35A Whittle Place','Stirling',2,3,2,'Haiven Property','Garage: 2'),(4439,'GREAT FAMILY HOME',480,'** APPLICATIONS MUST BE SUBMITTED PRIOR TO VIEWING **<br/><br/>* Colonial home situated in a great location * All rooms are of a large size * Large open kitchen with stainless stee