ERTY IS UNFURNISHED<br/><br/>A well-preserved home with stylish additions throughout and a flexible floor plan, you won’t want to miss out on this rare gem in Flinders Park.<br/>Comprising three spacious bedrooms, all of which feature polished timber floorboards. There is an additional studio/study which is located off the main bedroom. <br/><br/>Property features include:<br/><br/>- 3 Bedrooms<br/>- Separate studio<br/>- 1 Bathroom plus a 2nd WC<br/>- Separate living area<br/>- Combination of timber floorboards and tiled flooring<br/>- Gas stove top<br/>- Dishwasher<br/>- Fully paved backyard<br/>- Driveway parking for multiple cars<br/>- Separate Laundry room<br/>- Ducted air conditioning <br/>- 7km to Adelaide CBD<br/>- Close to schools<br/>- Easy access to public transport<br/>- 5min drive to Adelaide Airport <br/><br/>EXCLUSIONS: Old air conditioner (formal dining room) and heater (in living room)<br/><br/>**Tenant responsible for water usage and supply charges.','house','Flinders Park',-34.90645320,138.55089351,5025,'SA','15 Holbrooks Road','Flinders Park',1,3,2,'Turner Real Estate - Adelaide (RLA 62639)','Carport: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling'),(4481,'Roystonvale in Griffith',460,'PLEASE CLICK \'BOOK INSPECTION\' TO REGISTER & BE NOTIFIED OF UPCOMING INSPECTIONS<br/><br/>PLEASE CLICK \'BOOK INSPECTION\' TO REGISTER & BE NOTIFIED OF UPCOMING INSPECTIONS<br/><br/>Located in the \'Roystonvale\' complex in the prestigious inner North suburb of Griffith, this lovely 1-bedroom apartment boasts a generous north-facing open plan living area that opens out to the balcony - perfect for entertaining. The king-sized bedroom is complete with a built-in robe for streamlined storage, as well as balcony access to enjoy the peaceful surroundings. A spacious combined bathroom & laundry features a dryer for added convenience, and a single allocated undercroft parking space provides car accommodation.<br/><br/>A complex pool surrounded by leafy complex gardens w