ings.<br/><br/>Please note we do not do private inspections unless a property manager has arranged otherwise.<br/><br/>To avoid disappointment, we encourage you to register your interest so we can keep you informed during all stages of the leasing process. *Please note that these may contain generic automated responses*<br/><br/>TO APPLY ONLINE:<br/><br/>To apply for this property online please go to our website baileypropertysa.com.au/rent and press the APPLY NOW button to submit an application. Each applying tenant will need to create an account to apply for the property.<br/><br/>Applications will be processed in the following week due to the increase in demand for rentals, please be aware that we will contact you if we need additional information, ID or if your application is successful.<br/>Please refrain from contacting us in regards to your application status, however if you are submitting any additional information to your application please email [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s features e.g type of Air conditioning, Solar Electricity.','house','Redwood Park',-34.80802800,138.71732626,5097,'SA','286 Hancock Road','Redwood Park',1,4,5,'Bailey Property - Greenwith / Tea Tree Gully','Carport: 1, Open Spaces: 4, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Ducted Heating, Floorboards, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 1, Pets Allowed'),(4484,'Sensationally located modern 3 bedroom home',970,'To view this property - Please click GET IN TOUCH to register your interest in attending a scheduled open inspection or to contact the agent for more information. Open times are subject to change at short notice so only those registering will be notified of changes.<br/><br/>To apply for this property – Please click APPLY after you have inspected the property. Please do not apply prior to viewing. <br/><br/>Situated in the heart of the highly sought-after suburb of Hyde Park, this immaculate home promises convenience and easy-living, without sacrificing on space. 3 spacious bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a double garage, make this home a great choice for a variety of different lifestyles and circumstances.<br/><br/>Other features of this light and bright home to love include:<br/><br/>- Generously proportioned formal and informal living spaces<br/>- Spacious master bedroom with built-in robes and private courtyard access<br/>- Ensuite bathroom to master<br/>- Two additional well-sized bedrooms, one with built-in robe<br/>- Generous kitchen with gas cooking, dishwasher and ample pantry and bench space<br/>- Family bathroom with tub<br/>- Separate laundry<br/>- Generous but low maintenance courtyard with shade sails<br/>- Double garage with automatic doors and internal access<br/>- Ducted R/C air conditioning<br/><br/>Within walking distance to all the great cafes, restaurants, and boutiques of King William Road, and positioned perfectly for easy access to the CBD and public transport.<br/><br/>- 12 month minimum lease<br/>- Unfurnished<br/>- Water use and supply charges are applicable<br/>- Bond is equal to 4 weeks rent<br/><br/>Disclaimer: The accuracy of this information cannot be guaranteed, and all interested parties should seek independent advice.','house','Hyde Park',-34.95461580,138.59813351,5061,'SA','12 Royal Avenue','Hyde Park',2,3,2,'Alexander Real Estate - (RLA 308922)','Courtyard, Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1, Living Areas: 2, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Toilets: 2'),(4485,'Flexible Family 3 bedroom home with huge entertaining area located close to schools, shopping centres and parks.',620,'A spacious property on an easy care allotment with ample parking available.<br/><br/>This property offers:-<br/>3 bedrooms all with built-in robes<br/>Updated sparking white bathroom with bathtub and separate toilet.<br/>Open plan living from lounge through to spacious kitchen with island bench and gas cooktop<br/>Second living/dining area adjacent to kitchen or ideal teenage retreat<br/>Large covered entertaining area<br/>4 car carport<br/><br/>Additional features include hard flooring to most of the home, security screens to windows and external doors, ducted evaporative cooling, split system a/c, ceiling fans and fully fenced yard.<br/><br/>For more information contact Christine Marotti on [REDACTED PHONE]<br/>','house','Salisbury Plain',-34.76842548,138.65459775,5109,'SA','44 Warringa Street','Salisbury Plain',1,3,4,'Marotti Real Estate - Highbury','Carport: 4, Fully Fenced, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Built-in Wardrobes, Evaporative Cooling, Split-system Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1'),(4486,'Premium Low Maintenance Living!',540,'TO APPLY FOR THIS PROPERTY<br/>Submit your application via - www.2apply.com.au/login<br/><br/>Ray White Mount Gambier proudly presents 4 Degaris Street, Mt Gambier for Lease. <br/><br/>Positioned in the highly sought-after \"Lakes Area\" of Mount Gambier, this property offers a superb blend of location and lifestyle. This solid 3-bedroom brick residence sits on a 643m² allotment. Located close by to Tenison Woods College and Reidy Park Primary school. The home is also close to the CBD of Mt Gambier and The Blue Lake. <br/><br/>Step into a home where neatness and style go hand-in-hand. This beautifully updated residence offers a fresh, modern aesthetic throughout, making it the perfect \"turn-key\" opportunity for those who value both comfort and convenience. The heart of the home is the inviting lounge room, bathed in natural light through large windows equipped with versatile day-and-night blinds. Whether you\'re curling up by the gas log heater on a chilly evening or enjoying a sun-drenched afternoon, this space sets a sophisticated tone for the rest of the property.<br/><br/>The thoughtful layout flows seamlessly from the lounge into a separate dining room, tucked just around the corner from the kitchen to keep your dinner parties intimate yet connected. The kitchen itself is a masterclass in practicality and space; designed in a generous L-shape, it boasts extensive storage and high-end appliances. Home chefs will fall in love with the gas cooktop and oversized oven, while the inclusion of a dishwasher ensures that cleaning up is never a chore.<br/><br/>Flexibility is a key feature of this floor plan, offering three well-proportioned bedrooms-one featuring convenient built-in wardrobes. At the end of the hallway, you\'ll discover a versatile bonus room: perfect as a dedicated home office, a quiet study, or even a fourth bedroom. Equipped with its own split system for year-round climate control, it\'s a quiet sanctuary tailored to your needs.<br/><br/>The lifestyle upgrades continue outdoors with a fully secured rear yard, ideal for pets or play. Entertaining is a breeze on the timber deck, which is cleverly sheltered from the elements to allow for year-round alfresco dining. Complete with a single-car garage and a low-maintenance yard, this property is meticulously prepared and waiting for you to simply move in and enjoy.<br/><br/>Additional Information:<br/>Lease Term: 12 Months<br/>Pets: Pets upon application<br/>RLA: 291952','house','Mount Gambier',-37.83074346,140.76346585,5290,'SA','4 Degaris Street','Mount Gambier',1,3,1,'Ray White Mt Gambier -  RLA 291953','Garage: 1'),(4487,'Fully Furnished, Uncompromised Lifestyle at The Griffin',750,'Indulge in luxurious living at The Griffin with this stunning sixth-floor, fully furnished, 1-bedroom apartment, offering a spacious and lush retreat in the heart of the city. Wake up to breath-taking views of the serene lake and iconic Parliament House and revel in the magic of fireworks right from your private balcony.<br/><br/>The living area is thoughtfully designed to effortlessly accommodate both dining and lounge settings, offering a versatile space for relaxation and entertaining. <br/><br/>The kitchen is a masterpiece, featuring a stone benchtop and a convenient breakfast bar, along with top-of-the-line Miele cooking appliances, an integrated dishwasher, glass feature cabinetry, and a sleek ducted range hood. Every culinary desire is met in this well-appointed space. Additionally, a separate laundry, complete with its own washer/dryer and sink, adds an extra layer of practicality to your daily routines.<br/><br/>The bedroom, generously adorned with built-in storage, provides a harmonious blend of elegance and functionality. A separate bathroom ensures privacy and convenience, while plentiful linen space caters to your storage needs seamlessly.<br/><br/>The Griffin offers outstanding amenities onsite including a health and wellness centre with 25m indoor lap pool, steam and sauna rooms, separate weights and cardio gyms, large outdoor gardens and a true highlight is the direct pedestrian access to the lake and park which expands your backyard in just moments.<br/><br/>Immerse yourself in the sophistication and comfort of this remarkable apartment at The Griffin, where every detail has been meticulously crafted to elevate your living experience and enjoy elegance, comfort, and panoramic views, defining sophisticated urban living.<br/><br/>- Open plan living, kitchen and dining<br/>- Located on the 6th floor<br/>- 2.7m high ceilings, double glazed windows and timber flooring throughout<br/>- 1 bedroom & 1 bathroom<br/>- Full height glass sliding doors opening from living area to balcony with extensive views<br/>- Kitchen fitted with stone benchtop and breakfast bar, Miele cooking appliances, integrated dishwasher, glass feature cabinetry and ducted range hood<br/>- Main bedroom with built-in-robes for storage<br/>- Separate bathroom with underfloor heating<br/>- Ducted heating & cooling throughout<br/>- LED down lights throughout<br/>- Separate laundry<br/>- Access to The Griffins communal areas including the outdoor gardens, 25m indoor pool, steam & sauna rooms, weights & cardio gym<br/>- Direct pedestrian & bicycle access to Lake Burley Griffin & Commonwealth Park<br/>- Basement secured one car space with storage cage<br/>- NBN fibre to the premises<br/>- EER: 6.0<br/>- Internal living: 58m2 <br/>- Balcony: 16m2<br/><br/>The property complies with the minimum ceiling insulation standard.<br/><br/>PETS: Please be aware that at all stages of tenancy this property requires consent to be sought from the lessor for the keeping of any pets at the premises. Consent must be provided before any pets are at the premises.<br/><br/>Whilst all care has been taken to ensure accuracy, the material and information contained are approximate only and no warranty can be given. Bastion Property Group does not accept responsibility and disclaim all liabilities regarding any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. You should not rely upon this material as a basis for making any formal decisions. We recommend all interested parties to make further enquiries.','apartment','Parkes',-35.28788097,149.13807240,2600,'ACT','59/44 Constitution Avenue','Parkes',1,1,1,'Bastion Property Group - Canberra','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Furnished'),(4488,'Unique and luxurious, this special family home offers the complete package',690,'*** How to apply: If you wish to apply for this property, Please apply through realestate.com.au using the APPLY button<br/><br/>Bond - 4 weeks rent equivalent<br/>Lease term - 12 months<br/>Water charges - Tenant to pay all water usage and water supply charges<br/><br/>This much-loved family home has been carefully curated to house everything that today\'s modern family could ever want, need or desire.<br/><br/>Features<br/>- 3 good-sized bedrooms<br/>- Master bedroom with ensuite<br/>- Large and wide kitchen for use<br/>- Mas