ained estate.<br/><br/>The heart of the home is a triumph of light and texture, where rich wooden flooring flows seamlessly from the wide hallway into a sprawling open-plan living domain. Framed by elegant windows that invite the garden indoors, this space is designed for both quiet reflection and grand-scale hosting. The atmosphere is kept perfectly temperate year-round by a high-performance ducted air conditioning system, ensuring every corner of this grand residence remains a sanctuary of comfort.<br/><br/>Culinary enthusiasts will gravitate toward the gourmet kitchen, a masterpiece of functional design featuring pristine white cabinetry and an expansive central island bench that serves as the social hub of the home. Equipped with a large professional-grade gas cooktop and a double stainless-steel sink, the kitchen balances aesthetic brilliance with practical utility, all while maintaining a visual connection to the dining and living areas. The dedicated dining space is perfectly proportioned for sophisticated dinner parties, illuminated by natural light reflecting off the polished timber floors.<br/><br/>The private wing houses four generous bedrooms, each transformed into a plush retreat with carpets underfoot. Every bedroom is thoughtfully appointed with custom built-in robes and individual air conditioning access, ensuring personalized comfort for every family member. <br/><br/>The bathrooms embody contemporary luxury, offering spacious layouts and designer finishes; the primary bathroom features a deep soaking tub, perfect for unwinding after a long day in an environment that rivals a high-end day spa.<br/><br/>The rear of the property transitions into an outdoor entertaining precinct. <br/><br/>Two magnificent floating decks provide elevated platforms for alfresco dining and lounging, overlooking the crown jewel of the estate: a shimmering swimming pool. <br/><br/>Surrounded by lush greenery and private garden walls, this exterior space offers a tranquil es