ainless steel appliances, gas cooking and stone benchtops. Cook up a feast with your friends, while you enjoy a glass of wine and stare out on to the Swan River, Langley Park and the lights of South Perth foreshore. This apartment is inner-city living at its best. <br/><br/>Lay in the master bedroom all weekend and enjoy the view of the river from the comfort of your own sheets. With access to the balcony, as well as your own private bathroom with north city views and built in robe, you will feel like you’re staying at the crown every night of the week. The second bedroom also features floor to ceiling windows with a north facing aspect and a built in robe.<br/><br/>Reflections West Tower offers resort style facilities including a pool with sundeck and spa, tennis court, fully equipped gymnasium, sauna, outdoor BBQ area, residents lounge, as well as boardroom. Directly opposite Langley Park, and within walking distance to Elizabeth Quay and the City or catch one of the many free buses along St George Terrace.<br/><br/>• Reverse cycle air conditioning <br/>• Fully furnished and equipped (couch setting on balcony not included)<br/>• Double car bay in secure parking<br/>• Storage room<br/>• Bin shoot from 17th floor lobby<br/>• Washing facilities in second bathroom<br/><br/>Contact ACTIVE Property Services today to arrange a viewing. <br/><br/>All applications are online through our website www.activepropertyservices.com.au','apartment','East Perth',-31.96003187,115.86849109,6004,'WA','56/100 Terrace Road','East Perth',2,2,2,'ACTIVE Property Services','Balcony, Garage: 2, Outside Spa, Secure Parking, Swimming Pool - Inground, Tennis Court, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Gym, Intercom, Living Areas: 1, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Toilets: 2, Furnished'),(4509,'Modern Four Bedroom Home in Spearwood!',1050,'Welcome to 30 Ukich Crescent, Spearwood, a modern home that offers a light-filled open-plan living and dining area flowing seamlessly to a low-mainten