 Apply:<br/>Enquire and register your interest online and \'Request an inspection\' or \'Book an inspection\' to book attend a property viewing. Following registration, you’ll receive a link with instructions and all information on how to apply with IRE 2apply (please check your junk mail folder). We look forward to assisting you with your application! Please ensure all emails are spelt correctly on your application for reference checks.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: The information provided is for general advertising purposes only and is based on details supplied to us by the Owner. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, no warranty or representation is given. Prospective tenants should not rely solely on this information and are encouraged to make their own independent enquiries regarding the property, including measurements, inclusions, and suitability, prior to submitting an application or entering into a lease.','house','Landsdale',-31.81450921,115.87537396,6065,'WA','18 Mela Way','Landsdale',2,4,2,'Redmond Realty','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1'),(4517,'PRIME COTTESLOE LOCATION!',850,'Watch the waves roll in on a summers\' day, and the storms roll in on a winters\' night from this cosy beach-lover\'s unit. Perfectly located right on the beach, this unit has beautiful views and is in the highly sought-after suburb of Cottesloe. <br/><br/>Grab your surfboard or paddle board and literally walk across the road to leap into the water. <br/><br/>This light and airy compact renovated kitchen, is tiled throughout except for the second bedroom, and has a lot of large windows to take advantage of the views, and a large balcony to spend long lazy balmy summer evenings on. <br/><br/>Features Include: <br/>- Beautiful ocean views <br/>- Two bedrooms <br/>- Spacious kitchen with fridge + Microwave<br/>- Gas cook top and oven <br/>- Separate laundry with washing machine <br/>- Balcony to enjoy the ocean views <br/><br/>In close proximity to heart of Cottesloe, beaches, cafes, local transport <br/><br/>\"Enjoy sitting on your balcony watching magnificent sunsets!\" <br/><br/>TERMS OF AGREEMENT:<br/><br/>Available : NOW<br/>Lease Term : Negotiable <br/><br/>Viewing : Please \"Request An Inspection\" if you would like to view<br/>To apply : Please follow the link - https://www.2apply.com.au/agency/rwdc<br/><br/>*PLEASE NOTE THAT THIS PROPERTY IS UNFURNISHED*<br/><br/>**** PLEASE NOTE THAT WE ARE UNABLE TO OFFER ANY ALTERNATIVE VIEWING TIMES BEYOND THE ONES ALREADY SCHEDULED ****<br/><br/>IMPORTANT INFORMATION TO READ:<br/><br/>** HOW TO INSPECT THIS PROPERTY **<br/><br/>If you are on https://raywhitedalkeithclaremont.com.au/ simply click Book an Inspection\' and enter your details.<br/><br/>If you are using either www.realestate.com.au, www.reiwa.com or www.domain.com.au, simply select Contact/Email Agent\' and enter your details.<br/><br/>By registering your details using either method above, you will be instantly informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your property appointment.<br/><br/>Should the time not suit you, please register for another time but no guarantees can be made that a further inspection will be booked. Please be aware if no one registers for an inspection time, then that inspection may not proceed.<br/><br/>** HOW TO APPLY FOR A PROPERTY **<br/><br/>RayWhite Dalkeith | Claremont accepts applications prior to viewing. You will need to sign a sight unseen clause or attend the viewing.<br/><br/>Please see link for online application process:<br/>https://www.2apply.com.au/agency/rwdc<br/><br/>** IMPORTANT INFORMATION **<br/><br/>It is the Tenant\'s responsibly to make all relevant investigations regarding phone, internet, and NBN connection type and availability as RWDC cannot guarantee or control telecommunication services. RWDC advises all Tenants to speak to their provider before making an application to lease (if required).<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information in the marketing, RWDC will not be held liable for any errors in the typing of the information. Tenants are required to make their own investigations. We do not accept any responsibility to any person for its accuracy. All interested parties should rely upon their own enquiries in order to determine the accuracy of this information.','apartment','Cottesloe',-31.98275280,115.75410591,6011,'WA','2/232 Marine Parade','Cottesloe',1,2,1,'Ray White - Dalkeith | Claremont','Balcony, Open Spaces: 1, Toilets: 1'),(4518,'FURNISHED & EQUIPPED WITH VIEWS',850,'Immaculate upper floor 2 bed 2 bath apartment with tandem car bay overlooking the tree tops of Boas Gardens.<br/><br/>The apartment is fully furnished and equipped (pots, crockery, kettle, toaster etc) with secure under cover parking for two cars (tandem).<br/><br/>Split system air con in main living room and main bedroom. Ceiling fan in second bedroom.<br/><br/>Ideally located next to Boas Gardens, within 100m of City West Train Station and CatBus, easy walk to the city, Water Town Shopping, Northbridge and Kings Park.<br/><br/>The complex offers security access, a pool, fully equipped gym, sauna, spa and BBQ area,<br/><br/>Available from 29th February, sorry strictly no pets, owner requires 12 month lease.<br/><br/>Please note: No linen included.<br/><br/>Email Agent for viewings details.','apartment','West Perth',-31.94653822,115.84587478,6005,'WA','68/9 Delhi Street','West Perth',2,2,2,'Hallmark Realty - WEST LEEDERVILLE','Balcony, Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outside Spa, Secure Parking, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Gym, Intercom, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Toilets: 2, Furnished'),(4519,'Elegant 4-Bedroom Home in Aveley',800,'Discover the perfect blend of modern comfort and sty