 Heart of Guildford',700,'ELECTRIC GATE ENTRANCE<br/><br/>Nestled in the heart of historic Guildford, this beautifully preserved 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom home seamlessly blends period charm with modern comfort. From the moment you step through the classic brick feature fence, you\'ll be transported to a time of elegance and craftsmanship, while still enjoying the convenience of contemporary updates.<br/><br/>Character & Charm Meet Modern Living<br/><br/>• Period Features: Ornate ceilings, decorative cornices, polished timber floors, and traditional sash windows highlight the home\'s historic charm.<br/><br/>• Spacious Bedrooms: Three great sized bedrooms provide warmth and character, ideal for families, professionals, or those who appreciate timeless beauty.<br/><br/>• Modern Updates: A thoughtfully designed kitchen with modern appliances blends seamlessly with the home\'s heritage style, offering functionality without compromising charm.<br/><br/>• Cozy Living Spaces: A welcoming lounge and dining area i the kitchen, bathed in light filled spaces create the perfect ambiance for relaxation and entertaining.<br/><br/>• Modern Style Bathroom: A well-maintained bathroom featuring modern comforts.<br/><br/>Prime Guildford Location<br/><br/>• Situated in one of Perth\'s most historically rich and sought-after neighbourhoods, this home is just moments from:<br/><br/>Guildford\'s iconic cafés, antique shops, and boutique stores<br/>Renowned restaurants and local wineries in the Swan Valley<br/>Beautiful parklands and walking trails along the Swan River<br/>Excellent transport links - easy access to Guildford Train Station and major roads<br/>Highly regarded schools and community amenities<br/>Whether you\'re a lover of history, or looking to secure a new place for your family, this is a truly unique property, this home is a rare find in a location rich with character.<br/><br/>TO VIEW:<br/>You must register to view online with home open times scheduled by visiting our website: https://5starrealty.com.au<br/><br/>TO APPLY:<br/>You can apply for this property using 2apply.<br/>Applications will be processed only once you have attended the open.<br/><br/>[REDACTED EMAIL]<br/>','house','Guildford',-31.89897000,115.97870000,6055,'WA','32 James Street','Guildford',1,3,2,'5 Star Realty Professionals - MIDLAND','Open Spaces: 2, Toilets: 1'),(4538,'Lifestyle Living',695,'IMPORTANT INFORMATION<br/>Send an enquiry using the \"Email enquiry\" or \"Ask a question\" button and we will instantly respond with details on how to apply for the property. Inspections will be by registered inspection. Applications are welcome prior to inspection. <br/><br/>Huhme is proud to present 35 Ward Street, North Adelaide for lease.<br/><br/><br/>This stunning architectural design townhome is perfectly located in the heart of North Adelaide with the vast selection of North Adelaide dining and shopping options on your doorstep. With just a short stroll across stunning parklands to all that Adelaide has to offer, this private and secure home will be the desire of many. <br/><br/>ACCOMODATION<br/>- 2 bedrooms<br/>- 1 bathroom plus powder room<br/><br/>PARKING<br/>- secure reserved undercover parking <br/><br/>Also offering:<br/>- Stunning master with private north facing balcony<br/>- Upstairs second bedroom/ retreat/ home office/ studio<br/>- Open plan kitchen and living<br/>- Two private courtyards<br/>- Feature fireplace<br/>- Reverse cycle air conditioning<br/>- Ceiling fans<br/>- Plenty of storage<br/><br/>TERMS<br/>Available: Late Feb<br/>Lease Length: 12 months<br/>Water Charges: Tenant to pay supply & usage<br/>Inspection: By appointment <br/>Apply: Online - 2apply.com.au<br/><br/>ARE YOU A PROPERTY OWNER LOOKING TO LEASE? If you are looking for property management services, we would love to discuss with you how we can assist you? Please contact Kirsty Ciampa on 8213 5900 to find out how we can maximise the return on your investment.<br/><br/>On behalf of Huhme, we try our absolute best to obtain the correct information for this advertisement. The accuracy of this information cannot be guaranteed, and all interested parties should view the property and seek independent advice.<br/>RLA250254','house','North Adelaide',-34.90814171,138.59997930,5006,'SA','35 Ward Street','North Adelaide',1,2,1,'Huhme   (RLA250254) - ADELAIDE','Garage: 1'),(4539,'Lovely 4 x 2 Family Home in Byford',690,'Welcome to 6 Gunsynd Lane, Byford. This 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom house is now available for lease. This property offers a comfortable living environment and ample storage options for you and your family. <br/><br/>Property features Include: <br/><br/>• Master suite with large WIR & ensuite shower room with WC<br/>• 3 minor bedrooms , with built in robes<br/>• Open plan kitchen/living/dining<br/>• Kitchen with stone benchtops and stainless steel appliances<br/>• Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning throughout<br/>• Covered alfresco<br/>• Low maintenance reticulated gardens<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE <br/><br/>Applications are accepted and encouraged prior to viewing the property. The application form link will be sent to you as soon as you enquire about this property.<br/><br/>IMPORTANT - if you do not register online, we cannot notify you of any upcoming inspections, time changes or cancellations to inspections.<br/><br/>Please note, we do not accept 1form applications.','house','Byford',-32.21605682,116.00212553,6122,'WA','6 Gunsynd Lane','Byford',2,4,2,'Douglas Corby - Ray White Rockingham Baldivis','Garage: 2, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(4540,'A Unique, Fully Furnished Mount Lawley Retreat with Loft',690,'12 month lease preferred.<br/><br/>Step into charm, comfort and convenience in this beautifully furnished one-bedroom apartment, nestled in the heart of vibrant Mount Lawley. With soaring ceilings, vintage character, and clever use of space including a versatile loft, this residence is the perfect blend of style and functionality - ideal for professionals or couples seeking a move-in-ready inner-city home.<br/><br/>Key Features:<br/>• Fully furnished throughout with tasteful, retro-inspired pieces and modern comforts<br/>• Loft-style mezzanine offering bonus space - ideal for a guest bed, office or retreat<br/>• Impressive floor-to-ceiling bookshelves with sliding ladder<br/>• Renovated galley kitchen with gas cooking, ample storage and quality appliances<br/>• Leafy, private balcony with a tranquil outlook, perfect for morning coffee or evening wine<br/><br/>Located just steps from the lively café and dining scene of Beaufort Street and with easy access to public transport, this unique character apartment is a rare find. Whether you\'re drawn to its eclectic style, functional layout or unbeatable location, 8/596 William Street delivers comfort and charm in equal measure.','apartment','Mount Lawley',-31.93112000,115.86709000,6050,'WA','8/596 William Street','Mount Lawley',1,1,1,'Acton | Belle Property Mount Lawley','Balcony, Carport: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards, Split-system Heating'),(4541,'Two Bedroom Fully Furnished Apartment in the Heart of CBD East End! AVALIABLE NOW!!',680,'Bent Street Apartments are prime located just off of Rundle Street in the East end of City! Available Now!<br/><br/>$680/week for a half year lease ending 1st July 2026<br/>or<br/>$700/week for a full year lease ending 1st February 2027<br/><br/>- NON STUDENTS MAY APPLY!!!<br/>- 2 Bedrooms <br/>-1 Bathroom<br/>- Open Kitchen, Dining & Lounge room<br/>- Balcony<br/>- Washing machine & dryer included in apartment<br/>- Gas & Water included in rental price<br/>- Great Safe location<br/>- Swipe card access (Very Secure)<br/><br/>Enquire now for more information & to book an inspection.<br/><br/>**You will be required to supply your own kitchen items and linen in most of our properties, and packs can be purchased from our website: https://shop.unilodge.com.au/ All other large furniture items are provided. Please note that the advertising photos used may not accurately reflect the apartment given, and are to be used as a guide only. We request that everybody views an apartment before booking, where possible, and you will be sent a picture of the exact room you are getting once an application has been received.**<br/>','apartment','Adelaide',-34.92316816,138.60741927,5000,'SA','455/45 York Street','Adelaide',1,2,2,'UniLodge Australia','Balcony, Built-in Wardrobes, Intercom, Split-system Air Conditioning, Furnished'),(4542,'Take a Permanent Vacation with Breathtaking Beachfront Views',680,'To register for an open inspection, simply click \'Enquire\' or \'Request an Inspection\'.<br/><br/>We\'ll then send you an email to register your attendance for viewing and provide further details about the property and application process. Registration will ensure you are advised on any new or updated inspection times.<br/><br/>ABOUT THE PROPERTY<br/><br/>Welcome to 195 Esplanade PORT NOARLUNGA SOUTH.<br/><br/>This two storey home is ready for new tenants to enjoy the seaside lifestyle. <br/><br/>Situated on the esplanade opposite Jack Holder Reserve (U Turn Carpark) with lovely ocean views and ramp access to the beach and boardwalk from the doorstep. There is plenty of room for all the family, with a flexible floor plan to suit a large or extended family. <br/><br/>The lower level consists of a formal lounge and dining area adjacent the spacious kitchen including a walk in pantry and lovely outlook to the rear yard. There is a large family room with lovely bay window and outlook to the ocean. The laundry is located at the rear of the home with external access. There is also a second toilet and shower, and under stair storage. <br/><br/>Upstairs consists of three spacious bedrooms, two with ocean views and direct access to the front balcony. All the bedrooms have built in robes. The main bathroom with bath and separate toilet is also located upstairs. There is a third living area with kitchenette and ocean views which can be utilised as a fourth bedroom. <br/><br/>The rear private deck is accessed from this room, leading down to the large rear yard with undercover entertaining. There are numerous garage storage options with drive through garage with remote control door to one side of the property and a triple length carport to the other. At the rear of the property there is another double garage and garden shed. <br/><br/>This home has so many wonderful features. Inspection is a must to appreciate all the options this home offers. <br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- Flexible floor plan with option for 4 bedrooms<br/>- 2 bathrooms<br/>- Seaview\'s from your own balcony<br/>- Double carport plus double length carport with roller doors<br/>- Outdoor entertainment area<br/>- Formal lounge plus rumpus room<br/><br/>Lease Term: 12 months<br/>Available From: 27 March 2026<br/>Water Charges: Tenants to pay usage and supply<br/>Pet Policy: 1 x small outdoor pet negotiable<br/>Exclusions: 3 x wall heater units in the lounge and downstairs rumpus room - not operational<br/>Inspection: Register to view<br/><br/>APPLYING FOR THIS PROPERTY<br/><br/>Please note applications will not be processed until:<br/><br/>> The property has been viewed in person or someone has viewed it on your behalf<br/>> All occupants over 18 years have completed the application form<br/>> Photo ID has been provided<br/>> Proof of Income (Pay slip/Bank balance/Centrelink) has been provided<br/><br/>TO INSPECT THIS HOME<br/><br/>Click the \'Enquire\' or \'Request an Inspection\' button to register for our upcoming open inspections. We manage our enquiries through Tenant Options and recommend registering your interest to stay updated throughout every step of the leasing process.<br/><br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition) Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal advice.<br/><br/>RLA 277721','house','Port Noarlunga South',-35.17392415,138.46705546,5167,'SA','195 Esplanade','Port Noarlunga South',2,4,6,'LJ Hooker - Glenelg | Brighton','Balcony, Carport: 4, Deck, Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Shed, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Rumpus Room, Split-system Heating, Toilets: 2, Pets Allowed'),(4543,'2-Bedroom 2-Bathroom Apartment in Kewdale',680,'Welcome to 3/96 Cohn Street! This 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom apartment in the heart of Kewdale is ideally located placing you close to everyday essentials, local parks, shopping options and easy public transport links.<br/><br/>Key Property Features:<br/>Split system air conditioner<br/>Kitchen featuring a gas stove cook top, range hood, double sink, refrigerator recess and ample cupboard space <br/>Bedrooms feature mirrored WIR\'s <br/>Security alarm<br/>Storage room<br/>Private courtyard<br/>One designated car bay<br/><br/>Key Location Highlights:<br/>1.6km to Tomato Lake <br/>2.1 km to Carlisle Station <br/>3.2km to Belmont Forum <br/>5.1km to Perth Airport<br/>9.2km to Perth CBD<br/><br/>Please note: You MUST register to attend this inspection, if the inspection is at full capacity, then we may not be able to guide you through the property. Please DO NOT bring anyone to this inspection that is not registered, they must too register or property access will be denied.<br/><br/>*Important* Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in this marketing, Peak Central will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All information is considered correct at the time of printing.<br/><br/>','apartment','Kewdale',-31.97798200,115.93099100,6105,'WA','3/96 Cohn Street','Kewdale',2,2,1,'Peak Central Property Group','Carport: 1, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Built-in Wardrobes, Toilets: 2'),(4544,'Gorgeous family home!',670,'Ray White - The Ialacci Group is proud to present this large family home for lease. Located close to schools, shops and Rockingham foreshore you couldn\'t ask for much more! Located across from a beautiful grassed reserve you will have plenty of room for the kids to enjoy the outside space. <br/><br/>Property features <br/>- 3 bedrooms <br/>- 2 bathrooms<br/>- Newly renovated ensuite<br/>- Multiple split system air con units throughout the home <br/>- Multiple fans throughout the home <br/>- Abundance of backyard for the kids with a closed off front yard <br/>- Solar <br/><br/>Rent $670 per week <br/>Bond $2680','house','Rockingham',-32.28361000,115.72949000,6168,'WA','17 Christison Way','Rockingham',2,3,2,'Ray White - The Ialacci Group','Garage: 2, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(4545,'Great home!',670,'This home is situated in a prime location within easy walking distance to the local train station and shops and boasts the following attributes: <br/>Family living area with ceiling fan, stylish kitchen with island bench, ample cupboard and bench top space, gas hotplate, range hood, breakfast bar. <br/>Bedroom 1 offers his & her walk in robes, ceiling fan, ensuite. <br/>Bedroom 2 has mirrored robes and ceiling fan, bedroom 3 has a built-in robe. <br/>Rear garden is paved for easy care and steps down into double enclosed carport at rear.<br/><br/>WANT TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY? Simply click the BOOK INSPECTION button and you will immediately be able to see and book into any available viewing times. (if a date isn\'t currently available you will receive an SMS and Email as soon as it\'s available to view)<br/><br/>To ensure a smooth viewing and application process, please note the following:<br/>1- Please ensure you register to view (note; all attending parties MUST be registered)<br/>2- If a viewing is not available then please be patient, we will notify you as soon as a time becomes available.<br/>3- Upon viewing, you will be sent a tenant options link where applications are to be submitted electronically<br/>4- Our application processing team will keep you updated on the progress and outcome of your application - please keep in mind that it can take 24-48 working hours to process when many applications are received. We suggest giving your references a heads up that we may be in touch - this will help expedite the process!<br/><br/><br/>','house','Butler',-31.64062516,115.70401965,6036,'WA','18 Uppingham Way','Butler',2,3,2,'Harcourts Alliance - JOONDALUP','Garage: 2'),(4546,'Tidy Home Available 6 Month Lease only !!',660,'Wow!! <br/><br/>Be quick to snap up this family home equipped with 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom. Separate lounge room. <br/><br/>Please attend the viewing before applying for the property. <br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>','house','Ballajura',-31.84813000,115.91117000,6066,'WA','47 Hamelin Drive','Ballajura',1,3,1,'Harcourts Initiative - MALAGA','Carport: 1, Pets Allowed'),(4547,'FIRST FLOOR APARTMENT LIVING !',650,'Cleverly designed to showcase its modern and stylish elements, this modern 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom apartment creates an effortless lifestyle and ensures low-maintenance living.<br/><br/>Located in a quiet complex with electric gates and beautiful landscaped gardens, this home is just a short drive to the Swan Valley with it\'s array of wineries and minutes from Midland Town Centre and train station.<br/><br/>Additional features include:<br/><br/>• Split system air-conditioner<br/>• Intercom security <br/>• Open plan living / dining area<br/>• Modern kitchen with stone bench tops, pantry & dishwasher<br/>• Built-in robes to both bedrooms<br/>• Internal European laundry <br/>• Covered balcony<br/>• Undercover car bay behind security gates<br/>• Bike racks<br/><br/>Located in the rapidly re - developed suburb of Midland with it\'s array of shops, restaurants and cafes and just 16km from Perth\'s CBD! What more could you want!<br/><br/>Please click on the \"BOOK/REQUEST INSPECTION\" button to book a viewing time or register for future viewings.<br/><br/>Online applications now accepted through 2apply.com.au, however, they will not be processed until the property has been viewed<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: This advertisement has been written to the best of our ability based upon the Lessor\'s information provided to us and may be subject to change. Whilst we use our best endeavours to ensure all information is correct, no warranty or representation is made as to its accuracy, prospective tenants should make their own enquiries and investigations to determine all aspects are true and correct.<br/><br/><br/>','apartment','Midland',-31.87857141,116.00969743,6056,'WA','24/114 Great Northern Highway','Midland',2,2,1,'Professionals Wellstead Team - Bassendean','Balcony, Carport: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Toilets: 2'),(4548,'Secure and Modern Family Home',650,'This modern and spacious 4 bedroom, 2 bathroom family home is located in a quiet spot away from the road, & only a short stroll to the local shops, schools, parks and public transport.<br/><br/>Sporting high ceilings and quality fittings throughout, including LED down lights to hall and living room, ducted a/c, stone bench tops and artificial turf, shows that this house has not been built to a budget, unlike many others on the market.<br/><br/>The property features a large tiled, open plan, dining and living room area, separate home theatre / play room and big double size alfresco dining area. It is paved all the way around for low maintenance, all the bedrooms has a/c and large double built in and fitted robes to the minor bedrooms, and even bigger fitted robes to the master. Along with a full size laundry, large linen closet and storage area this home is sure to impress.<br/><br/>If you are after a long term family home then this would be ideal.<br/><br/>To book your inspection head to www.armadalerentals.com.au and SELECT the property you are after, then CLICK the book an inspection\' button. You can then enter your details and choose an inspection time that suits you. You must register to view, if you do not register online we cannot notify you of any time changes or cancellations to inspections.<br/><br/>Professionals Armadale Real Estate does accept Realestate.com.au online applications & paper applications are available at the viewings.<br/>Realestate.com.au applications will not be considered unless you have viewed the property. PLEASE DO NOT APPLY UNTIL YOU HAVE VIEWED THE PROPERTY AS YOUR APPLICATION WILL BE REJECTED. ONCE VIEWED, PLEASE APPLY ONLINE..','house','Armadale',-32.15375023,116.00397058,6112,'WA','135a Seventh Road','Armadale',2,4,2,'Armadale Real Estate -','Garage: 2, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Toilets: 2'),(4549,'Modern and Light-Filled Family Home',650,'Step into comfort and style with this beautifully presented 4 bedroom, 2 bathroom family home, perfectly positioned in the heart of Parmelia. Designed with modern living in mind, this light-filled residence offers space, functionality and a welcoming atmosphere for the whole family.<br/><br/>From the moment you enter, you\'ll appreciate the fresh, contemporary feel and well-considered layout. The spacious open plan living and dining area forms the heart of the home, complemented by a modern kitchen featuring quality appliances, ample bench space and generous storage - ideal for busy family life and entertaining alike.<br/><br/>The master bedroom is privately positioned and complete with a well-appointed ensuite and built-in storage. The remaining three bedrooms are all well-sized, serviced by a modern family bathroom with separate bath and shower.<br/><br/>Additional features include:<br/>Light and bright open plan living<br/>Modern kitchen with ample cupboard and bench space<br/>Spacious master suite with ensuite<br/>Built-in robes to minor bedrooms<br/>Split system air conditioning<br/>Low-maintenance gardens<br/>Double garage with secure internal access<br/><br/>Conveniently located close to local schools, parks, shops and public transport, this home offers both lifestyle and practicality in a family-friendly neighbourhood.<br/><br/>Be quick - modern homes of this calibre in Parmelia don\'t last long!','house','Parmelia',-32.23657181,115.83759762,6167,'WA','34 Pickering Avenue','Parmelia',2,4,2,'Harcourts Property Specialists','Garage: 2, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(4550,'Do not miss this one!',650,'Located in a quiet and friendly neighborhood this property is perfect for a family looking for a new home. The house is located in a convenient location, close to schools, shops, and public transportation.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>* Fire place <br/>* Spacious kitchen<br/>* Study area <br/>* Reverse cycle split systems <br/>* Powered workshop <br/>* Open plan dining, living and kitchen <br/>* Security screens throughout <br/><br/>HOW TO INSPECT THIS PROPERTY<br/>Arranging inspections is easy. Simply click on the button above \'Book an inspection\' or<br/>alternatively go to our website and book the inspection on this site by entering your<br/>details and choose an appointment time that suits you.<br/>You will be INSTANTLY informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your<br/>appointment.<br/>If no one registers for an appointment time - then that appointment WILL not proceed.<br/>So DON\'T MISS OUT book for an appointment today.<br/>To apply for this property, please use the \'APPLY FOR PROPERTY\' button on our<br/>website at rmaproperty.com.au<br/>*Important* Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the information contained in<br/>this marketing, Rental Management Australia will not be held liable for any errors in<br/>typing or information. All information is considered correct at the time of printing.','house','Port Kennedy',-32.35250000,115.75791000,6172,'WA','31 Chelmsford Avenue','Port Kennedy',2,4,2,'Rental Management Australia - PORT KENNEDY','Open Spaces: 2'),(4551,'Coastal Life Style with views',650,'30 Vennachar Drive Hallett Cove, SA, 5158<br/><br/>Speed up the application process and pre-apply now. <br/><br/>- Call on [REDACTED PHONE] to discuss rental applications<br/>- Email [REDACTED EMAIL] to obtain the application forms<br/>- Obtain an application form at our open inspection<br/><br/>SA water: Tenant to pay supply and water use<br/><br/>Available: ready to move in<br/>Furnished: Unfurnished<br/>Lease term: 12 months plus renewal<br/><br/>Stunning three-bedroom home, enjoy low maintenance living within moments from walking trails, central shopping districts, schools and public transport.<br/><br/>Features we love about this home: <br/>- Building area approximately 120 sqm<br/>- Great position to capture sea glimpses and area views! <br/>- Open plan kitchen with two separate living areas and one area can be used as a home office<br/>- Powerful rangehood, plenty of storage and gas cook stove & oven<br/>- Three great size bedrooms, two with built-in robes<br/>- West-facing windows have doubled blind treatments<br/>- Separate shower and toilet rooms<br/>- Easy care floating floors and carpeted bedrooms <br/>- Convenient two-way bathroom with direct access to master bedroom <br/>- Ducted evaporative air conditioning and gas wall heater in the main living area <br/>- Ceiling fans in all bedrooms and living areas<br/>- Paved and covered outdoor areas for all-season entertainment<br/>- Paved driveway to serve as extra parking spot<br/>- Large landscaped rear yard with sea glimpses and lovely area views, the well maintained lawn provides perfect playground for your pets and family<br/>- Double gated garage plus a side gate allow direct access to the backyard<br/>- A tool shed to keep your tools secured and dry<br/>- Rainwater tank available<br/><br/>Convenience for life: Local shops and outdoor spaces<br/><br/>- 250 m walk to Tigree Drive Reserve<br/>- 1.5 km to Coorabie Crescent Reserve<br/>- 1.8 km to Hallett Cove Shopping Centre<br/>- 2.6 meters to Hallett Cove Station<br/>- 3.9 km to Hallett Cover Conservation Park<br/>- 5 km to Hallett Cove Beach<br/><br/>Time saving for education <br/><br/>- 450 m walk to 47A Barramundi Drive, direct bus 681 to Flinders University<br/>- 600 m to Hallett Cove East Primary School<br/>- 1.9 km to Hallett Cove School R-12<br/><br/>Disclaimer: All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition). Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal and financial advice.','house','Hallett Cove',-35.07076560,138.52347313,5158,'SA','30 Vennachar Drive','Hallett Cove',1,3,3,'First National Real Estate Evergrand','Carport: 2, Deck, Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Shed, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Evaporative Cooling, Floorboards, Gas Heating, Toilets: 1, Pets Allowed');
INSERT INTO `data` VALUES (4552,'Malabar Apartment amidst the Dickson Buzz',650,'PLEASE CLICK \'BOOK INSPECTION\' TO REGISTER & BE NOTIFIED OF UPCOMING INSPECTIONS<br/><br/>This immaculate two-bedroom apartment situated in the Malabar complex is set amidst the energetic buzz of the revitalised Dickson shopping and dining precinct. Surrounded by restaurants, cafes, bars, boutiques, a gym, a supermarket, state-of-the-art office spaces, a major transport hub, the light rail station, and more. Malabar takes inner-city living in Canberra to a whole new level.<br/><br/>With a meticulously designed floor plan, the apartment offers a light and bright open-plan living area with sliding door access to the covered balcony, perfect for taking in the views across Dickson. The ultra-modern kitchen offers sleek simplicity with crisp white soft-close cabinetry & is well equipped with Bosch appliances, including a dishwasher & electric cooktop. Both the chic ensuite and main bathroom offer a designer look with creamy marble look tiles & floating vanities. Ducted reverse air conditioning throughout ensures your year-round comfort, with double glazing for additional comfort and energy efficiency.<br/><br/>The Malabar complex offers its residents an indoor gymnasium and heated pool as well as a communal sky roof entertaining area with views towards the City and beyond. Another resident perk is a communal cinema where you can stream Netflix or watch sports or movies on the big screen. This executive-style apartment offers an amazing lifestyle & enviable location, all wrapped up in an elegant package<br/><br/>Offering the perfect inner-north location, just a few kilometres from the centre of Canberra and a short distance to the new light-rail line. Located in the sought after \"Malabar\" development with residents\' only access to covered pool, gym, bbq area and even cinema.<br/><br/>- Beautifully appointed with plenty of natural light<br/>- Double glazing for improved energy efficiency and sound<br/>- Soft-close kitchen cabinetry and quality Bosch kitchen appliances<br/>- Ducted reverse cycle and ceiling fans throughout<br/>- Secure lift access, video intercom system<br/>- Sleek ensuite and main bathroom with floor-to-ceiling tiling<br/>- Instantaneous hot water system, NBN connected and Provision for Pay TV<br/>- Book in to watch your favourite tv show or movie in the cinema<br/>- Gym, heated pool, and an outdoor entertaining/recreational area<br/><br/><br/>Available; 23rd March 2026<br/><br/>PETS:<br/>The tenant/s must seek landlord consent to keep pets at this property.<br/><br/>ENERGY EFFICIENCY RATING:<br/>The EER Rating of this property is 8.5 <br/><br/>MINIMUM STANDARDS:<br/>The property is exempt from the minimum housing standards for insulation.<br/><br/>VITAL INFORMATION:<br/>The property is unfurnished<br/>Please note that we request no videos or photos be taken inside occupied properties<br/>Please note you may be required to remove your shoes prior to inspecting the property<br/><br/>WISH TO INSPECT:<br/>1. Click on \"BOOK INSPECTION\" if this listing does not have the \"BOOK INSPECTION\" button please go to raywhitecanberra.com.au website and register<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection, if no time is offered or if the time does not suit, please register and we will contact you once access is arranged<br/>3. If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations or further inspection times<br/><br/>RENT INFORMATION:<br/>1. Rent is collected fortnightly unless otherwise nominated for a longer period<br/>2. Bond required is equal to 4 weeks rent<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER:<br/>All information regarding this property is from sources we believe to be accurate, however we cannot guarantee its accuracy. Interested persons should make and rely on their own enquiries in relation to inclusions, figures, measurements, dimensions, layout, furniture and descriptions.','apartment','Dickson',-35.25153520,149.13742494,2