ll contact you once access is arranged<br/>3. If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations or further inspection times<br/><br/>RENT INFORMATION:<br/>1. Rent is collected fortnightly unless otherwise nominated for a longer period<br/>2. Bond required is equal to 4 weeks rent<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER:<br/>All information regarding this property is from sources we believe to be accurate, however we cannot guarantee its accuracy. Interested persons should make and rely on their own enquiries in relation to inclusions, figures, measurements, dimensions, layout, furniture and descriptions.','apartment','Forrest',-35.31519325,149.13159829,2603,'ACT','66/8-10 Dominion Circuit','Forrest',2,2,2,'Ray White - Canberra','Balcony, Carport: 2, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Toilets: 2'),(4556,'Updated Cook Family Home',640,'PLEASE CLICK \'BOOK INSPECTION\' TO REGISTER & BE NOTIFIED OF UPCOMING INSPECTIONS<br/><br/>This classic 3-bedroom ensuite Cook home has been revitalised with modern renovations to create a wonderful family home. The heart of the home is the sun-soaked living space, where raked extra-high ceilings bring a sense of space and openness to the split-level living area. A few stairs take you up to the dining space and adjoining kitchen. Here, sleek cabinetry complements a tiled splashback, bright tiled floor & is well equipped with a large gas cooktop, dishwasher and lots of storage and prep space. <br/><br/>All three bedrooms are well-sized with leafy garden outlooks, with a renovated ensuite to the main bedroom. The family bathroom has adeep bath for long soaks and a separate shower. Outdoors, the large rear yard is a private haven, with mature hedging framing the space, raised garden beds for your home veggie crop & a lawned area shaded in summer by a large deciduous tree. A pergola-covered entertaining area runs the length of the home, providing a perfect spot for alfresco dining.<br/><br/>Features of the home include;<br/><br/>Three bedrooms with built in robes & master with renovated ensuite<br/>Renovated kitchen with quality appliances including a dishwasher<br/>Split level updated dining and lounge room<br/>Ducted gas heating and evaporative cooling throughout, with R/C in living<br/>Updated laundry<br/>Lots of internal cupboards<br/>Easy care gardens with watering system<br/>1 carport with storage and additional parking spaces<br/>Large rear entertainment patio and lawn sections for family fun<br/>Raised veggie beds<br/>North-facing aspect<br/><br/>Available; 7th April 2026<br/><br/> PETS:<br/>The tenant/s must seek landlord consent to keep pets at this property.<br/><br/>ENERGY EFFICIENCY RATING:<br/>There is no current energy efficiency rating for this property.<br/><br/>MINIMUM STANDARDS:<br/>The property meets the minimum housing standards for insulation.<br/><br/>VITAL INFORMATION:<br/>The property is unfurnished<br/>Please note that we request no videos or photos be taken inside occupied properties<br/>Please note you may be required to remove your shoes prior to inspecting the property<br/><br/>WISH TO INSPECT:<br/>1. Click on \"BOOK INSPECTION\" if this listing does not have the \"BOOK INSPECTION\" button please go to raywhitecanberra.com.au website and register<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection, if no time is offered or if the time does not suit, please register and we will contact you once access is arranged<br/>3. If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations or further inspection times<br/><br/>RENT INFORMATION:<br/>1. Rent is collected fortnightly unless otherwise nominated for a longer period<br/>2. Bond required is equal to 4 weeks rent<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER:<br/>All information regarding this property is from sources we believe to be accurate, however we cannot guarantee its accuracy. Interested persons should make and rely on their own enquiries in relation to inclusions, figures, measurements, dimensions, layout, furniture and descriptions.','house','Cook',-35.25462365,149.07215609,2614,'ACT','1 Teague Street','Cook',2,3,1,'Ray White - Canberra','Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes'),(4557,'ATTRACTIVE COURTYARD HOME',620,'**Please send an enquiry via your preferred app and you will be invited to the next open inspection**<br/><br/>Conveniently located for easy access to shops and transport.<br/><br/>OFFERING:<br/><br/>~3 bedrooms (master with ensuite and walk-in robe)<br/>~Large formal lounge room<br/>~Spacious open plan living, dining and kitchen<br/>~Gas stove (new)<br/>~Main bathroom with separate full length bath<br/>~Ducted and zoned reverse cycle heating and cooling<br/>~Secure, fully fenced yard<br/>~Lock up garage.<br/><br/>Close to shops, schools and public transport.<br/><br/>Available from 11 March 2026.','house','Oakden',-34.85550033,138.64238370,5086,'SA','32 Attingham Crescent','Oakden',2,3,1,'Stanley Samuels Pty Ltd - Parkside (RLA 2199)','Garage: 1, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating'),(4558,'3x2 Home - Great Location!',620,'This home is ideally located in the Chimes Estate in Baldivis and is close to local shopping, schools, transport routes and parks. <br/><br/>Features Include;<br/>• Ducted evaporative A/C<br/>• Double lock up garage with a double driveway for additional parking<br/>• Shoppers entry<br/>• Main bathroom with separate shower / bath<br/>• Laundry with double slider storage<br/>• Master bedroom with WIR <br/>• Ensuite with bench & cupboard space<br/>• Both minor bedrooms have BIR<br/>• Open plan kitchen / meals / family area<br/>• Stainless steel cooking appliances<br/>• Breakfast bar / island bench<br/>• Sliding doors off living & kitchen lead to the under roof alfresco area ideal for entertaining <br/>• Enclosed back yard <br/>• Plus much more!<br/><br/>For viewing / enquiries please email us via web advert or you can call the office on (08) 9419 7933 | Rachael Francis [REDACTED PHONE] or Amanda Griffin [REDACTED PHONE].<br/><br/>Gem Property Sales & Management accept online applications where available through web advertisements.<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: The details of this property listing have been prepared for advertising & marketing purposes only. Gem Property Sales & Management have made every effort to ensure that at the time of preparing this advertisement the information is believed to be reliable & accurate. However, clients must carry out their own independent due diligence to satisfy that the information provided herein is correct and meets their expectations.','house','Baldivis',-32.30632497,115.81173662,6171,'WA','11 Firebrand Grove','Baldivis',2,3,4,'Gem Property Sales & Management - WELLARD','Garage: 2, Open Spaces: 2, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(4559,'Charming 2-Bedroom Maisonette in Prime Torrensville Location',620,'Positioned in convenient and tree lined Torrensville, this well-presented 2-bedroom maisonette offers comfortable living with excellent convenience to the city, beach, and walking distance to the Torrens Linear Trail.<br/><br/>Featuring two generous bedrooms and a central bathroom, the home is ideal for couples, small families or professionals seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle. The property includes secure car parking, air conditioning and a private backyard perfect for relaxing or entertaining.<br/><br/>Best of all, pets are welcome, making this an ideal home for those looking for a bit of backyard space.<br/><br/>The location is hard to beat – enjoy easy access to nearby schools, the vibrant Henley Beach Road café and shopping precinct, and Brickworks Shopping Centre. You’re also just minutes from the Adelaide CBD and only a short drive, or bike ride, to Henley Beach, offering the perfect balance of work and lifestyle.<br/><br/>Property features include:<br/>* 2 spacious bedrooms<br/>* 1 bathroom <br/>* 2+ off-street car parks<br/>* Air conditioning<br/>* Private backyard<br/>* Pet friendly<br/>* Well-maintained maisonette<br/>* Character home features<br/>* Renovated kitchen and bathroom<br/><br/>Rent: $620 per week<br/>Lease: Initial 12-month lease with intention for long-term tenancy<br/>Availability: 28 February','house','Torrensville',-34.91822570,138.55802188,5031,'SA','86B Ashley Street','Torrensville',1,2,3,'Property Owner','Carport: 3, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Alarm System, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Pets Allowed'),(4560,'Great Value!',600,'ROSS REALTY proudly present this spacious three bedroom home positioned on a large block with a powered workshop at the rear! Boasting multiple living zones this home will supply you with the space you\'re after and you can expand the entertaining outdoors with a great sized patio overlooking the large rear yard. Register your interest today, this one will not last !!<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Ducted evaporative a/c<br/>- Front lounge and formal dining<br/>- Spacious master with walk in robe<br/>- Functional kitchen with ample storage and stainless steel appliances<br/>- Second living area <br/>- Two minor bedrooms<br/>- Main bathroom with shower-bath<br/>- Great sized patio overlooking huge backyard<br/>- Rear powered workshop<br/>- Single carport with extra secure parking<br/><br/>**Please do not apply prior to inspecting the property**','house','Beechboro',-31.87367000,115.94920000,6063,'WA','29 Brockmill Avenue','Beechboro',1,3,3,'ROSS REALTY - MORLEY','Carport: 1, Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Ducted Cooling, Evaporative Cooling, Workshop, Pets Allowed'),(4561,'Spacious one bedroom apartment close to shops',580,'Situated in a well maintained quiet complex of just 12, this spacious one bedroom/bathroom apartment has an abundance of natural light. Conveniently located with cafes, restaurants, delicatessen, chemist and more at your doorstep, the apartment offers a large living and dining area, separate kitchen, large bedroom with ensuite bathroom, high ceilings, timber floorboards, reverse aircon, dishwasher, washing machine, plus a laundry room in the complex, large built in robes in bedroom, one parking bay and city views.','apartment','Floreat',-31.94114000,115.80077000,6014,'WA','9/449 Cambridge Street','Floreat',1,1,1,'Property Owner','Carport: 1, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(4562,'Low Maintenance Living At It\'s Finest.',580,'This well presented four bedroom home is set in popular Munno Para West, close to schools, transport and reserves. With only a few minutes drive to shopping centres, this well presented home provides the ultimate in low maintenance, functional living.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>* Master bedroom with walk in robe and ensuite plus split-system AC and ceiling fan. <br/>* Two additional bedrooms with built-in robes and carpet flooring.<br/>* Additional 4th bedroom / Study / Living<br/>* Main bathroom complete with separate bath and large shower + separate toilet.<br/>* Well appointed kitchen with stainless steel appliances including dishwasher and gas cooking facilities. <br/>* Ample storage and usable bench space and breakfast bar.<br/>* Light-filled open-plan living and dining areas with a direct access to outside.<br/>* Laundry with direct external access.<br/><br/>Additional Features Include: <br/>* Alfresco entertaining area with artificial grass and shade sails for year- round family entertaining. <br/>* Reverse cycle air conditioning to main living and dining area. <br/>* Carpet in bedrooms<br/>* Laminated timber flooring throughout living space. <br/><br/>Facts: <br/>* Available 27/02/2026<br/>* $580 per week<br/>* Lease term 12 months<br/>* Water Charges: Tenants to pay all water supply charges & all water <br/> usage<br/><br/><br/>Application\'s are now open - click APPLY on this listing.<br/><br/>Please note: the property must be inspected for your application to be processed.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: All photos and text are for illustration purposes only and are not intended to be part of any contract. In preparing the information we used our best endeavours to ensure that the information contained herein is true and accurate, but accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability in respect of any errors, omissions, inaccuracies or misstatements that may occur.<br/>','house','Munno Para West',-34.65356009,138.66990856,5115,'SA','11  Jarrah Drive','Munno Para West',2,4,2,'National Property Buyers SA','Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Split-system Air Conditioning, Toilets: 2, Pets Allowed'),(4563,'A Nice Place to Call Home!',550,'A rare opportunity to rent this lovingly cared for family home set on a large 826sqm block.<br/><br/>This home is perfect to move in straight away and enjoy.<br/><br/>Featuring fantastic street appeal and with many great amenities close by, this home is sure to impress families and couple wanting a nice place to call home.<br/><br/>Features that make this home special:<br/>- Large master bedroom with built-in robe<br/>- Good sized bedrooms all with built in robes<br/>- Large, light filled lounge room area<br/>- Updated kitchen with dishwasher<br/>- Dining area adjacent kitchen<br/>- Renovated main bathroom with bath and shower and separate toilet<br/>- Ducted gas heating and evaporative air-conditioning throughout<br/>- Large Veranda\'s, ideal for all season entertaining<br/>- Fully fenced, manicured rear yard<br/>- Large double garage 5.3m x 7.1m2 servicing 2 cars<br/>- Large additional shed 8mx3.3m2 she perfect for caravan, bikes or a man cave<br/>- NBN connected<br/>- partial reticulated grounds watering system<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned in the sought after suburb of Ingle Farm and close to a variety of schools, Modbury Hospital, Tafe SA Gilles Plains and the O\'Bahn for easy access to Adelaide CBD. Public transport options just a short walk away. Only minutes\' drive to all the shopping and entertainment that Ingle Farm and Tea Tree Plaza has to offer. All this and less than 13kms (approximate) to the Adelaide CBD..','house','Ingle Farm',-34.83506000,138.64644300,5098,'SA','2 Baradine Drive','Ingle Farm',1,3,6,'Real Simple Real Estate (RLA268543) - PAYNEHAM','Fully Fenced, Garage: 4, Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Shed, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Toilets: 1'),(4564,'Modern Comfort in a Relaxed Community Setting',520,'Positioned in a quiet residential setting, 29A Bright Street, Willaston presents a practical and easy-care rental opportunity ideal for tenants seeking comfortable living without the upkeep. Perfectly suited to couples, small families or professionals, this home offers functional open-plan living and a simple, low-maintenance outdoor space.<br/><br/>Willaston is a well-regarded suburb on the doorstep of Gawler, known for its relaxed pace, community atmosphere and everyday convenience. With shopping, cafés, schools and medical facilities just minutes away, residents enjoy the charm of a semi-rural setting while still having easy access to essential amenities. The nearby Northern Expressway also makes commuting towards Adelaide straightforward.<br/><br/>Whether you\'re a young family, a professional couple, or looking to downsize, this home offers a relaxed lifestyle with everything you need nearby.<br/><br/>This property features:<br/>• Three bedrooms, all fitted with mirrored built-in robes<br/>• Central bathroom with practical layout<br/>• Light-filled open-plan living area designed for comfortable everyday living<br/>• Functional kitchen overlooking the living space<br/>• Compact, low-maintenance backyard - ideal for tenants wanting minimal upkeep<br/>• Simple outdoor setting with no established gardens, keeping maintenance requirements to a minimum<br/>• Set back from the road for added privacy<br/>• Split system air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/><br/>• A short drive to Gawler\'s cafés, shopping, restaurants, and local services<br/>• Convenient access to public transport and the Northern Expressway for an easy commute to Adelaide<br/>• Close to quality schools, parks, and sporting facilities<br/>• Only a short trip to the Barossa Valley for weekend getaways and world-class wineries<br/>• Part of a quiet, family-friendly neighbourhood with a strong sense of community<br/><br/>About the Lease:<br/>Length: 12-month lease<br/>Water: Tenants pay for all water usage and supply. <br/>Property is Unfurnished<br/><br/>***To be considered for this property, an application must be submitted, and you must have viewed the property***<br/><br/>***HOW TO APPLY FOR THIS PROPERTY***<br/><br/>Step 1:<br/>To apply, please click on the Enquire or Get in Touch button, click one of the enquiry boxes, type in your details, and then press Send/submit.<br/>You will receive 2 automatic emails. 1. to inform you of any open inspections that you can register for, and 2. A confirmation email with a direct link to 2Apply to submit your application.<br/><br/>Step 2:<br/>Complete and Submit your 2Apply application; please ensure all details are correct and current on your profile before sending. If you are applying with someone else, make sure that they have received the invitation to apply in their email. Your application will not be submitted until all parties have completed the application.<br/><br/>Step 3:<br/>Notify all of your references to complete the reference email that has been sent to them.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Every care has been taken to verify the correctness of all details used in this advertisement. However, no warranty or representation is given or made regarding the correctness of the information supplied, and neither the owners nor their agents can accept responsibility for errors or omissions.','house','Willaston',-34.59082101,138.74093013,5118,'SA','29A Bright St','Willaston',1,3,3,'Ray White - Mawson Lakes RLA222434','Carport