st long. For further information, please contact Rachel Lawrie [REDACTED PHONE]<br/>RLA 283760','house','Salisbury North',-34.74916428,138.63031682,5108,'SA','69 Kelsey Road','Salisbury North',1,3,2,'Stadium Real Estate','Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1'),(4577,'Harrisdale Primary School and Harrisdale Senior High School Catchment',800,'Located in the desirable suburb of Harrisdale, 304 Wright Road offers 4 bedrooms, a theatre and 2 bathrooms, the perfect blend of tranquillity and accessibility.<br/><br/>* 4 generously sized bedrooms <br/>* 2 additional bedrooms offer ample space and a built-in robe for effortless organization<br/>* 4th bedroom / study room complete with double doors <br/>* Separate home theatre room <br/>* Open-plan living and dining areas<br/>* Kitchen with modern stainless steel appliances plus ample storage flow seamlessly into the dining and living areas<br/>* Split system air conditioning unit to main living area <br/>* Double lock up garage <br/>* Low-maintenance paved outdoor entertaining area <br/><br/>Location, Location, Location Situated in the sought-after suburb of Harrisdale, this home offers easy access to schools, parks, shops, and public transport. <br/>Experience the best of both worlds: a peaceful neighbourhood with all the conveniences at your doorstep.<br/><br/>To arrange a private viewing of this property contact Bailey Devine Real Estate today on [REDACTED PHONE]<br/> <br/>*** Applications will be provided after inspection of the property. The applicants acknowledge that in applying for the property they are accepting the property in the condition in which they viewed.','house','Harrisdale',-32.12236169,115.92535245,6112,'WA','304 Wright Road','Harrisdale',2,4,2,'Bailey Devine Real Estate','Garage: 2'),(4578,'Grandeur in Griffith',700,'Positioned within one of Griffith’s most desirable and tightly held developments, this beautifully presented two-bedroom apartment offers the perfect combination of lifestyle, comfort, and convenience. With generous proportions, quality finishes, and amenities, this home is ideal for professionals, couples, or anyone seeking executive living in a premium Inner South location.<br/><br/>From the moment you enter, you’ll appreciate the light-filled open plan design, seamless indoor-outdoor flow, and peaceful leafy outlook. The modern kitchen is well-appointed with stone benchtops, quality appliances, and ample storage, overlooking the spacious living and dining areas.<br/><br/>Both bedrooms are generously sized, with the master featuring its own private ensuite and balcony access, while the second bedroom is serviced by a well-designed two-way bathroom, offering flexibility and privacy for guests or shared living.<br/><br/>The private balcony provides the perfect space to relax and unwind while enjoying the tranquil surroundings.<br/><br/>Residents also enjoy access to excellent on-site facilities including a fully equipped gym, secure parking, and beautifully maintained common areas.<br/><br/>Property Features<br/><br/>• Two spacious bedrooms with built-in wardrobes<br/>• Master bedroom with private ensuite and balcony access<br/>• Second two-way bathroom offering added convenience and privacy<br/>• Light-filled open plan living and dining area<br/>• Modern kitchen with stone benchtops and quality appliances<br/>• Private balcony with leafy outlook<br/>• Two secure underground car spaces<br/>• Dedicated storage cage<br/>• Reverse cycle heating and cooling<br/>• Secure building access with lift<br/>• Access to fully equipped residents’ gym<br/><br/>Location Highlights<br/><br/>Ideally located in the heart of Griffith, you are just moments from:<br/><br/>• Manuka Village cafes, restaurants, and boutique shopping<br/>• Kingston Foreshore lifestyle precinct<br/>• Canberra CBD and Parliamentary Triangle<br/>• Public transport and major arterial roads<br/>• Parks, walking trails, and recreational facilities<br/><br/>This is Inner South living at its finest — offering lifestyle, convenience, and comfort in one exceptional package.<br/><br/>- Applicants to seek permission to keep pets<br/>- EER unavailable<br/>- Available 27th March 2026<br/>- Property Complies with the Insulation legislation<br/><br/>Inspection Guidelines:<br/>(For www.allhomes.com.au only)<br/>1. To schedule an inspection, simply click the \"BOOK INSPECTION\" button.<br/>2. Register to attend an existing inspection.<br/>3. If there\'s no scheduled time available, register anyway to ensure we can notify you once a time is arranged.<br/>4. Failure to register means we won\'t be able to inform you of any changes, cancellations, or additional inspection times. Remember, inspections may be cancelled if no registrations are received, so please ensure you register.<br/><br/>Pet Policy:<br/>Per the Residential Tenancies Act Clause 71AE, tenants must submit a written request to the lessor for consent to keep pet(s) on the property. The lessor may impose conditions on this consent, such as specifying the number and type of animals permitted and any associated rectification costs.<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>While we strive to provide accurate marketing information, Canberra Property Partners disclaims liability for any errors or inaccuracies within this listing. Interested parties are encouraged to conduct their own research to verify the provided information.','apartment','Griffith',-35.32218418,149.14713706,2603,'ACT','19/115 Canberra Avenue','Griffith',2,2,2,'Completely Property - MONCRIEFF','Garage: 2, Dishwasher'),(4579,'Lovely Home with Entertaining Area',580,'This lovely home is located in popular Andrews Farm that now has so many amenities close by. The home offers:<br/>- 3 bedrooms<br/>- master with walk in robe, door through to 2-way bathroom, bay window, carpet<br/>- bedroom 2 has a built in robe and has carpet<br/>- bedroom 3 has a built in robe and overlooks the back yard and has carpet<br/>- open plan living/meals/kitchen, this area is quiet spacious with lots of windows to let light in, timber laminate flooring throughout this area, walk through sliding door to veranda<br/>- kitchen features include gas cooktop, under bench oven and range hood, plenty of bench space and cupboards and a very generous walk in pantry and a dishwasher<br/>- the bathroom is 2-way with loads of storage in the vanity area, separate shower cubicle and bath, separate toilet<br/>- reverse cycle ducted keeps you cool and warm all year round<br/>- there is a lovely gable roof veranda area which is ideal for entertaining<br/>- side area accessed by 2 x small front gates could be utilised for small trailer or motor bike<br/>- rear yard is mostly grass with garden beds to borders, the grass has underground watering<br/>- rain water tank<br/>- double garage with one remote door and one manual door<br/>- plenty of parking on the front part of the home<br/>- the home is tucked away in the corner of the court<br/>- Available long term<br/><br/>- Lease Term: 12 Months Preferred<br/>- Furnished: Unfurnished<br/>- Water: Tenant(s) will be responsible for water usage and supply <br/>- Internet: Tenant(s) responsibility to complete own investigations and enquiries<br/>- Pets: Pets may be negotiable subject to property suitability and any applicable council or body corporate by-laws/restrictions<br/><br/>Tenant Selection Criteria apply in order for your application to be considered for this property. Full criteria will be available to view when making your application. <br/><br/>Once all applications which meet our tenant selection criteria have been sent to the Landlord, no further applications received will be processed unless a second round of applications is required. <br/><br/>Every care has been taken to verify the correctness of all details used in this advertisement. However no warranty or representative is given or made as to the correctness of information supplied and neither the owners nor their agent accept responsibility for error o