, efficiency and long-term liveability rarely found in the local rental market.<br/><br/>From the moment you enter, the quality is evident. Brand-new double-glazed windows with integrated pull-down flyscreens, smart garage door, security camera and R6-rated roof insulation create outstanding thermal and acoustic performance, maintaining a calm, climate-controlled interior year-round.<br/><br/>At the centre of the home is a beautifully appointed chef-grade kitchen featuring stone benchtops, custom storage solutions and premium Bosch appliances, including a high-performance 6-burner induction cooktop, oven and integrated dishwasher. A unique architectural detail sees the stone benchtop extend seamlessly through a custom awning window into the alfresco zone, enhancing the connection between indoor and outdoor entertaining.<br/><br/>The master suite offers a refined private retreat with a luxury ensuite and high-spec bidet toilet. Both bathrooms have been renovated to a boutique hotel standard. Ducted cooling, an additional split system and DC-powered ceiling fans in every room ensure comfort in all seasons.<br/><br/>Outdoor living is exceptional. The expansive ~80sqm exposed aggregate alfresco area functions as a genuine second living space, complete with 6m wide electric blind for privacy, ceiling fan and dedicated outdoor heater for year-round use.<br/><br/>Designed as a fully electric, gas-free home, sustainability is central to its design. A large solar system, electric heat pump hot water system and secure double garage with rare 3-phase EV charging infrastructure position the property well ahead of typical suburban offerings.<br/><br/>Positioned in a quiet, tightly held pocket of Willetton, the location further enhances its appeal. A large local park sits just 50 metres away, with the Willetton Community Garden approximately 300 metres from the doorstep. Rostrata Primary School is an easy 500-metre walk, and the home sits within the Willetton Senior High School catchment. Multiple bus routes are within walking distance, with Southlands Shopping Centre and Riverton Forum just minutes away by car.<br/><br/>Homes of this specification, efficiency and technological integration are seldom offered for lease in Willetton.<br/><br/>Please register to arrange an inspection.','house','Willetton',-32.04900812,115.89540142,6155,'WA','1/16 Glenmoy Ave','Willetton',2,3,4,'RentBetter','Balcony, Deck, Fully Fenced, Garage: 4, Secure Parking, Shed, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Split-system Heating, Pets Allowed'),(4583,'HUGE 4x2 - A Cut Above The Rest!!',850,'Discover a remarkable opportunity to rent a spacious family home on Surfers Street in the vibrant suburb of Alkimos. This four-bedroom house offers an ideal blend of comfort and convenience, perfect for families looking to settle in a growing community that love the finer things in life with quality fixtures and fittings throughout. With two well-appointed bathrooms and a double garage, this property ensures plenty of room for everyone, while the ducted reverse cycle air conditioning and ceiling fans to all bedrooms keep the home comfortable year-round.<br/><br/>Alkimos is a thriving coastal suburb known for its beautiful beaches and family-friendly atmosphere. Enjoy being just a short drive away from local shopping centers, parks, and recreational facilities that cater to all ages. Families will appreciate the proximity to reputable schools, ensuring quality education options for children of all ages. The nearby train station and Freeway access also provides easy access to Perth CBD, making commuting a breeze.<br/><br/>The home has a chef inspired Kitchen with masses of stone benches, storage, scullery and massive walk in pantry! Make this home yours and be the envy of your friends! <br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>* Ducted Reverse Cycle Air Conditioning<br/>* Oversized feature front door leading into large entrance hall<br/>* Huge master bedroom with ceiling fan a