entials.<br/>• Side driveway access with parking space suitable for a trailer.<br/>• Multiple verandahs - front, rear, and right-side - creating seamless indoor-outdoor flow and relaxed spaces in every season.<br/>• Great size garage with concrete floor perfect for tools, bikes, or workshop use.<br/>• Ample off-street parking with room for up to three cars plus the garage.<br/><br/>Close the Door On:<br/>• Long commutes and disconnected living, with easy access to Victor Harbor, Port Elliot, and surrounding coastal townships, keeping work, leisure, and lifestyle perfectly balanced.<br/>• Weekend stress, thanks to nearby beaches, walking trails, and open coastal spaces that encourage fresh air and outdoor living.<br/>• School drop-off chaos, with local primary and secondary schools conveniently close for growing families.<br/>• Endless errands, with shopping centres, supermarkets, cafés, medical facilities, and public transport all within easy reach.<br/>• Compromising on space or flexibility - this home offers room to live, work, relax, and entertain without feeling crowded.<br/><br/>This is a home that supports a relaxed, well-connected lifestyle by the coast. Space, comfort, and location come together at 5 Hicks Court, creating a rental opportunity that truly feels like home.<br/><br/>Bond – $2,200<br/>Lease Term – 12 months<br/>Water Charges – Quarterly supply and usage<br/>Unfurnished<br/><br/>WOULD YOU LIKE TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY?<br/>Please submit an enquiry to register your details and be notified of all available inspection times plus receive our online application form.<br/>To view and apply for our other available properties please visit www.ocre.com.au/rent<br/><br/>OUWENS CASSERLY – MAKE IT HAPPEN ™<br/>RLA: 275403/223245<br/><br/>All information or material provided has been obtained from third party sources and, as such, we cannot guarantee that the information or material is accurate. Ouwens Casserly Real Estate Pty Ltd accepts no liability for any err