ghtful layout ensures plenty of room for relaxation and entertainment, making it an ideal setting for creating cherished family memories.<br/><br/>Property features include:<br/><br/>? 5 bedrooms plus study – ideal for families or shared living<br/><br/>? 2 bathrooms, including a private ensuite to the master bedroom<br/><br/>? 2 toilets for added convenience<br/><br/>? Double car garage with secure parking<br/><br/>? Generously sized living areas offering flexible spaces for relaxing and entertaining<br/><br/>? Large backyard – perfect for kids, pets, or outdoor gatherings<br/><br/>? Covered veranda – enjoy alfresco dining or unwind outdoors year-round<br/><br/>❄️ Ducted Air-conditioning<br/><br/>? Prime Location:<br/>Situated in a quiet, family-friendly neighbourhood close to schools, parks, shopping centres, and public transport, with easy access to major roads.<br/><br/>This rental opportunity won\'t last long, as homes like this in such a sought-after location are rare. Don\'t miss your chance to secure a fantastic family home in one of Thornlie\'s most desirable areas. Contact us today to learn more about making this wonderful property your next home!<br/><br/>TO VIEW PLEASE ENSURE YOU REGISTER TO HOME OPEN by clicking book an inspection time.<br/>By registering, you will be kept informed of any changes, updates or cancellations. If there are no registered attendees for a home open, then that particular home open time may be cancelled. Please be on time so you have sufficient time to fully view the property and ensure that it meets your requirements as viewing times cannot be extended, so as not to cause delays for the next home open. See you there!<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Whilst every care is taken, Agency 168 will not be held liable for any misprints of this advertisement and the applicant/s acknowledge that in applying for the property they are accepting the premises in the condition in which they viewed the home','house','Thornlie',-32.06791665,115.94421419,6108,'WA','13 Heath Place','Thornlie',2,5,2,'Agency 168','Garage: 2, Living Areas: 2, Toilets: 2'),(4625,'** Luxury Designer Living Residence in Exclusive East Perth **',1400,'This is a residence that must be experienced to be fully appreciated. Privately positioned within one of East Perth’s most tightly held and prestigious pockets, this striking tri-level home delivers a rare combination of scale, architectural presence and refined luxury finishes. Surrounded by quality homes and tranquil streetscapes, the setting is peaceful, discreet and highly sought after.<br/><br/>Spanning approximately 305sqm, the home offers exceptional space across three beautifully designed levels, comprising 3.5 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, multiple living zones, private courtyards and balconies, along with secure undercover parking for two vehicles and excellent storage throughout. The ground floor welcomes you through an elegant foyer into a designer kitchen with stone benchtops and premium stainless steel appliances, flowing into expansive open plan living and dining zones finished with rich hardwood mahogany floors. Both front and rear courtyards extend the living spaces outdoors, creating a seamless environment for entertaining or relaxed everyday living.<br/><br/>The first floor provides a second living retreat framed by floor-to-ceiling glass and fitted with electronic shutters for privacy and comfort. Two generous bedrooms with built-in robes are serviced by a contemporary bathroom and linen storage, while a private balcony offers a quiet escape. The entire upper level is dedicated to an indulgent master suite of impressive proportions, complete with Juliet balcony, walk-in robe and a beautifully appointed ensuite with deep soaking bath. A versatile adjoining room offers the flexibility of a home office, nursery or private sitting room.<br/><br/>Positioned moments from the Swan River foreshore, parklands and walking trails, this exclusive address offers the lifestyle advantages of inner-city living without compromise. Cafés, dining and everyday amenities are close by, with the Perth CBD, Crown, Optus Stadium and key transport routes all within easy reach. The location delivers a rare blend of privacy, prestige and connectivity.<br/><br/>Impeccably presented and architecturally distinctive, this exceptional residence offers a level of quality and scale seldom found in the rental market. A refined inner-city lifestyle awaits those seeking space, privacy and uncompromising luxury.<br/><br/>FEATURES:<br/>* Approx. 305sqm of internal and outdoor living<br/>* 3.5 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms<br/>* Multiple living zones across three levels<br/>* Designer kitchen with stone benchtops and stainless steel appliances<br/>* Hardwood mahogany flooring<br/>* Master retreat with Juliet balcony, walk-in robe and luxury ensuite<br/>* Private front and rear courtyards plus balcony<br/>* Electronic shutters to upper living zone<br/>* Secure undercover parking for two vehicles<br/>* Excellent storage throughout<br/>* Ducted air conditioning<br/><br/>LOCATION:<br/>* Prestigious, tightly held pocket of North East Perth<br/>* Walking distance to Swan River foreshore and parklands<br/>* Close to cafés, dining and lifestyle amenities<br/>* Minutes to Perth CBD<br/>* Easy access to Crown and Optus Stadium<br/>* Convenient access to major transport routes<br/><br/>For further information or to arrange a private inspection, please register/apply and advise on your prefer time and dates for a viewing.','house','East Perth',-31.94863350,115.87965612,6004,'WA','43 Tully Road','East Perth',2,3,2,'SFR Property Professionals - East Perth','Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Swimming Pool - Above Ground, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Gym, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Study'),(4626,'Sparkling One Bedroom Unit in Security Block',500,'Fresh and Clean this one bedroom unit is ready for you to move into.<br/><br/>Well run security block with allocated parking behind the security gates.<br/><br/>This unit does have a reverse cycle air con in the open plan living/kitchen area.<br/><br/>There is a communal laundry downstairs for all residents use.<br/><br/>One bedroom with a built in robe, modern kitchen with plenty of cupboard space and a good sized north facing balcony.<br/><br/>Easy to view and will be snapped up!','unit','Victoria Park',-31.97771533,115.89219566,6100,'WA','43/53 Leonard Street','Victoria Park',1,1,1,'Steven Davis Real Estate - Kensington','Balcony, Carport: 1, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Toilets: 1'),(4627,'Comfortable Living in a Great Location - 6 month lease',680,'To view this property - Please click GET IN TOUCH to register your interest in attending a scheduled open inspection or to contact the agent for more information. Open times are subject to change at short notice so only those registering will be notified of changes.<br/><br/>To apply for this property – Please click APPLY after you have inspected the property. Please do not apply prior to viewing. <br/><br/>Set in the peaceful, tree-lined streets of Westbourne Park, this solid brick home offers a practical and comfortable lifestyle in a location that\'s hard to beat. With some recent upgrades, and plenty of space both inside and out, it\'s ideal for those wanting a well-kept home with everything you need close by.<br/><br/>This home has a welcoming feel, with a light-filled front lounge and a separate meals area. The kitchen has been updated with quality appliances, and the backyard is neat and spacious - great for relaxing outdoors or letting the kids run around.<br/><br/>Enjoy the convenience of being just minutes from local schools, shopping, public transport, and some great local cafes. Whether you\'re heading into the city or staying local, everything is within easy reach.<br/><br/>Other features of this lovely home include:<br/><br/>- Updated kitchen with Smeg oven, gas cooktop, Westinghouse rangehood, dishwasher and ample cupboard space<br/>- Light-filled lounge room and separate meals area<br/>- Three good-sized bedrooms, master with built-in robe and ceiling fan<br/>- Zoned ducted reverse cycle air-conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>- Central bathroom with shower, separate bath and vanity<br/>- Separate laundry with direct access to the backyard<br/>- Spacious, fully fenced backyard<br/>- Enclosed carport with drive-through access and space for multiple vehicles<br/>- Automatic garden irrigation system<br/><br/>Why you\'ll love living here:<br/><br/>- Friendly neighbourhood with a relaxed feel<br/>- Easy walk to local cafés<br/>- Zoned for sought-after schools including Mitcham Primary and Unley High<br/>- Close to shopping centres including Cumberland Park Shopping Centre, Mitcham Shopping Centre & Castle Plaza<br/>- Just under 6km to the city with great public transport links<br/><br/>- 6 month lease initially with possible periodic extension<br/>- Unfurnished<br/>- Water use and supply charges are applicable<br/>- Bond is equal to 4 weeks rent<br/><br/>Disclaimer: The accuracy of this information cannot be guaranteed, and all interested parties should seek independent advice.','house','Westbourne Park',-34.97188460,138.59171413,5041,'SA','1 Monmouth Road','Westbourne Park',1,3,3,'Alexander Real Estate - (RLA 308922)','Garage: 3'),(4628,'Newly Renovated 4x2 Family Home',750,'Submit an enquiry now and get your booking and application link sent to you<br/><br/>Newly Renovated 4x2 Family Home <br/><br/>Be the first to enjoy this beautifully renovated 4 bedroom, 2 bathroom family home, ideally positioned in the heart of Banksia Grove. Perfectly suited for families, this property offers space, comfort and convenience all in one.<br/><br/>Located in a highly central position, youll be just moments from local shops, schools, parks and public transport.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/> Freshly renovated <br/> Four generously sized bedrooms<br/> Two well-appointed bathrooms<br/> Large open-plan dining and lounge area<br/> Functional laundry to the rear <br/> Spacious enclosed backyard<br/> Swimming pool with undercover entertaining area perfect for summer<br/> Double garage<br/><br/>With a fully enclosed rear garden and multiple living areas, this home offers both comfort and practicality for modern family living.<br/><br/>Book your look today!<br/><br/>WANT TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY? Simply click the BOOK INSPECTION button and you will immediately be able to see and book in any available viewing times (if a date isn\'t currently available you will receive an SMS and email as soon as its available to view). Please note you will only be notified of inspection times through Peard Real Estate and our staff members.<br/>Please be careful if someone claiming to be the owner of a property contacts you directly to arrange a viewing, as there are a number of scams going on at the moment and we would hate for you to become a victim.<br/>Please ensure to bring a tape measure to properties if you need to measure any specific areas as seconds viewings are not always available.','house','Banksia Grove',-31.69896000,115.80745000,6031,'WA','43 Celadon Loop','Banksia Grove',2,4,2,'Peard Property Management','Garage: 2, Swimming Pool - Inground, Pets Allowed'),(4629,'Well-Located Family Home Close to Shops, Schools & Transport',665,'Jimmy Hoang and Chi Mai Do welcome you to this spacious family home located in a quiet, secure, and highly convenient neighbourhood, making it ideal for families, professionals, or students seeking comfortable long-term living in a vibrant area.<br/><br/>✨ Key Features:<br/><br/>Flexible layout offering 2 bedrooms plus a study at the front, with 2 additional bedrooms at the rear<br/>All bedrooms are generously sized, well-ventilated, and filled with natural light<br/>Practical and comfortable living spaces, ideal for everyday family living<br/>Low-maintenance garden, easy to care for year-round<br/>Positio