ay by the landscaped gardens that set the tone for the rest of this meticulously kept home.<br/><br/>Inside, you\'ll be greeted by a sense of quality and style that\'s hard to beat. No expense was spared in selecting high-end features and fittings. With four spacious bedrooms (including a master with a walk-in robe), a fully renovated master ensuite, and a swanky gourmet kitchen custom-built by Joyce Kitchens, this place has it all.<br/><br/>And if you love to entertain, you\'re in luck! The backyard is an absolute haven, boasting an oversized triple dome alfresco with over 50sqm of paved undercover space. Perfect for hosting barbies with your mates or just chilling out with the family. Plus, there\'s an enclosed below-ground pool to keep you cool on those hot Aussie days.<br/><br/>Located in a quiet street just a stone\'s throw away from Westfield Booragoon, parks, schools, and public transport, this property ticks all the boxes.<br/><br/>Features include; <br/>- Flexible fully furnished or partly furnished options <br/>- Air-conditioned & gas bayonets<br/>- CCTV cameras installed around the perimeter of the property <br/>- Multiple living areas including open plan kitchen & meals, lounge room and theatre room. <br/>- Master suite with walk in robes, minor bedrooms with build in robes <br/>- Large entertaining/alfresco area<br/>- Below ground pool <br/>- Double carport with additional off street parking in the driveway <br/><br/>So, what are you waiting for? <br/><br/>To attend a viewing, please register your details via the inspection time(s) below. If no viewing times are available please email [REDACTED EMAIL] and [REDACTED EMAIL] from Caporn Young Property Management PTY LTD.<br/><br/>We are happy to arrange a virtual inspection, if you\'re unable to attend an open for inspection. Please send a text message via WhatsApp to the agent, and they will provide a video tour, subsequent to availability, as soon as possible.<br/><br/>These details are provided for info