alf. This ensures you have an accurate understanding of the property, as it will be leased as advertised and as viewed at the inspection. <br/><br/>Facetiming, videoing, or taking photos during a home open is not permitted without prior approval from the attending Property Manager. This policy is in place to respect the privacy and security of the property, its occupants, and any personal belongings that may be present. If you wish to conduct a video call, take photos, or record any part of the inspection, please seek permission from the Property Manager beforehand to ensure all activity complies with privacy and agency guidelines. <br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: NO APPLICATIONS WILL BE ACCEPTED UNLESS YOU HAVE VIEWED THE PROPERTY.','house','Harrisdale',-32.12260447,115.93664696,6112,'WA','145 Gracefield Boulevard','Harrisdale',2,4,2,'LJ Hooker  - Harrisdale','Garage: 2'),(4647,'TOP-NOTCH TOWNHOUSE',800,'Discover this private and well maintained townhouse freshly painted offering generous proportions, quality finishes, and a low-maintenance lifestyle in a convenient Cannington location ideal for professionals, couples, or small families seeking comfort and space.<br/><br/>LIVING AND ENTERTAINING<br/>Step inside to an enormous tiled living area designed for effortless everyday living and entertaining. The open plan layout flows seamlessly out to a large enclosed patio, creating a versatile indoor outdoor space perfect for year round enjoyment while maintaining privacy and security.<br/><br/>KITCHEN<br/>The feature packed kitchen is equipped with gas cooking and an abundance of storage, making meal preparation both practical and enjoyable. With extra cabinetry and ample bench space, this kitchen caters perfectly to those who appreciate functionality without compromising on space.<br/><br/>BEDROOMS AND BATHROOMS<br/>The main bedroom suite is privately positioned on the top floor, providing a peaceful retreat complete with its own ensuite. The thoughtful layout enhances separati