ern shared areas to relax, cook, work, create & connect with other residents<br/>- After-hours Resident Adviser<br/><br/>If you want to live with a strong community feeling at home, on the doorstep of Scarborough Beach and the recently completed $100 million Scarborough Foreshore redevelopment, The Tide is for you.<br/><br/>For more information or to book a viewing time call 6144 0700 or visit www.thetide.com.au.<br/><br/>LIVE. PLAY. WORK. CONNECT @ The Tide.<br/><br/>*Images used are for display only and contain extra items of furniture and accessories that are not included in the standard room charge. Room size, layout & balcony view may also vary dependent on room availability.<br/>','apartment','Scarborough',-31.89287598,115.75798594,6019,'WA','101/200 West Coast Highway','Scarborough',1,1,1,'Celsius Property','Carport: 1, Secure Parking, Swimming Pool - Inground, Air Conditioning, Furnished'),(4668,'Smart, Stylish & Perfectly Located',800,'Welcome to this beautifully presented, tech-savvy home in the highly sought-after suburb of Aubin Grove. Designed for comfort, convenience and modern living, this impressive property offers smart-home features, spacious interiors and easy-care outdoor living - perfect for families or professionals seeking quality and lifestyle.<br/><br/>Property Features;<br/>• Secure pin code keyless entry to the front door.<br/>• Smart WiFi-enabled garage door - control your garage from anywhere via app.<br/>• Smart Google LED lighting. <br/>• Reverse cycle ducted air conditioning for year-round comfort.<br/>• Hybrid flooring to main living areas.<br/>• Carpeted bedrooms and dedicated study.<br/>• Welcoming entrance with separate lounge room.<br/>• Light-filled hallway featuring a stunning courtyard.<br/>• Dedicated study/games room with built-in desk and wall-mounted TV.<br/>• Spacious master bedroom with walk-in \"his & hers\" walk in robes.<br/>• Modern ensuite with rain showerhead set and vanity.<br/>• Two minor bedrooms, both with buil