 an inspection time then that inspection may not proceed **<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: Whilst every care has been taken with the preparation of the particulars contained in the information supplied, believed to be correct, neither the Agent nor the client nor servants of both, guarantee their accuracy. Interested persons are advised to make their own enquiries and satisfy themselves in all respects. The particulars contained are not intended to form part of any contract.<br/><br/>Semple Property Group will NEVER send you our BSB and Account details in the body of an email. We will confirm all requests for initial bond and rental payments via SMS. Please be aware of scams and if ever you are in doubt please phone our office on (08) 9494 2606 for confirmation.<br/>','house','Aubin Grove',-32.16090054,115.85790583,6164,'WA','57 Sorbonne Turn','Aubin Grove',2,3,2,'Semple Property Group - Residential',NULL),(4669,'Modern, Low-Maintenance Living in the Heart of Camillo',595,'Nestled in a quiet and convenient pocket of Camillo, this modern two-bedroom, one-bathroom home offers stylish, low-maintenance living ideal for professionals, couples, or small families.<br/><br/>Thoughtfully designed with comfort and functionality in mind, the home features bright, modern interiors and quality finishes throughout. The contemporary kitchen includes white cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, and ample storage, making it perfect for everyday living.<br/><br/>Sliding doors open to a secure, easy-care yard with Astroturf, providing a private outdoor space without the maintenance. Both bedrooms are generously sized and include built-in robes and ceiling fans, while the modern bathroom features sleek tiling, a quality vanity, and a separate toilet.<br/><br/>Strategically placed windows allow natural light to flow through the home, creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>Modern two-bedroom, one-bathroom home<br/>Modern kitchen with ample storage and stai