rooms and a large covered outdoor entertaining space - ideal for families seeking comfort and convenience.<br/><br/>Inside features light-filled living zones with a practical floorplan separating living and sleeping areas. The kitchen offers ample bench space, good storage and electric cooking, overlooking the outdoor patio.<br/><br/>All four bedrooms are well-sized with built-in mirrored robes, serviced by a neat central bathroom with large vanity and full-sized shower.<br/><br/>Outdoors, enjoy a substantial covered patio and easy-care backyard, all conveniently located close to schools, parks, shops and public transport.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>• 4 well-sized bedrooms with built-in mirrored robes<br/>• Multiple spacious living areas<br/>• Light-filled interiors<br/>• Functional kitchen with ample storage<br/>• Electric cooktop and oven<br/>• Neat bathroom with large vanity and shower<br/>• Generous paved outdoor entertaining space<br/>• Undercover parking<br/>• Quiet cul-de-sac location','house','Morley',-31.88340000,115.91603000,6062,'WA','4 Esher Place','Morley',1,4,1,'ROSS REALTY - MORLEY','Garage: 1'),(4766,'1 Bedroom Unit - Available Now',390,'Due to a break lease - available now<br/><br/>Located just a stone\'s throw from the CBD, this unit is perfect for those looking for easy access to city amenities while enjoying a quiet, comfortable home. This charming 1-bedroom unit offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience, ideal for a young couple or student seeking a cozy, low-maintenance lifestyle. <br/><br/>Apply online at www.2Apply.com.au<br/><br/>Key Features:<br/>• 1 Bedroom: Easily accommodates a queen-sized bed, with plenty of space for storage.<br/>• Ensuite Bathroom: Private and convenient, perfect for everyday living.<br/>• Car Parking: Includes 1 on-site parking space for your vehicle.<br/>• Kitchenette: Fully equipped for simple meal preparation, with everything you need.<br/>• Family Room: A cozy living space that\'s great for re