t-in robes & easy access to the ultra-stylish bathroom complete with LED strip lighting. <br/> <br/>Residents at Linq can enjoy the superbly maintained grounds, including communal vegetable gardens, along with a well-equipped gym and beautiful outdoor pool. <br/><br/>The perks: <br/><br/>• Open plan living <br/>• Modern colour scheme <br/>• Video intercom access <br/>• Bosch stainless steel kitchen appliances including a dishwasher <br/>• Built-in wardrobes <br/>• Dryer to the laundry <br/>• Reverse-cycle air conditioning <br/>• Balcony area <br/>• NBN installed <br/>• 1 restricted access car spaces with storage area <br/><br/>The numbers:<br/><br/>• Approx. 5-minute walk to Westfield Belconnen (over 200 shops and restaurants)<br/>• Approx. 5-minute drive to Calvary Hospital<br/>• Approx. 2-minute walk to CISAC<br/>• Approx. 4-minute walk to Belconnen Bus Interchange<br/>• Approx. 8-minute walk to the University of Canberra<br/><br/>Availability: March 09, 2026<br/><br/>Please note: the property complies with the minimum ceiling insulation standard.<br/><br/>Pets: Prospective tenants must obtain prior consent from their owners and body corporate to keep pets on the premises.<br/><br/>Please note: It\'s not always possible to view the location and access of the carparking or storage cage (if applicable) at the open home. If information relating to these specific inclusions are important to you, please request a private viewing of these spaces in the event you are the successful applicant.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: While all care has been taken in the advertising and marketing of these properties, we do not accept responsibility for any errors or inaccuracies.','apartment','Belconnen',-35.24225857,149.07276070,2617,'ACT','115/8 Veryard Lane','Belconnen',1,1,1,'The Property Collective - CANBERRA','Open Spaces: 1, Pets Allowed'),(4768,'Furnished Double-Storey Home - Spacious, Modern & Perfectly Located',850,'Furnished: Spacious Double-Storey Home - Modern Living in a Prime Location<br/><br/>Move straight in and enjoy comfort, style, and convenience in this beautifully presented furnished double-storey, three-bedroom, two-bathroom home. Ideally positioned close to shops, parklands, and public transport, it offers an effortless lifestyle suited to families and professionals alike.<br/><br/>Welcoming you with a wide and inviting entrance, the attractive front elevation sets the tone for what\'s inside. The home opens to a light-filled and generously sized open-plan living and dining area, complete with split-system air conditioning for year-round comfort, seamlessly flowing into a modern kitchen designed with both functionality and style in mind.<br/><br/>With everyday amenities just moments away, you\'ll enjoy easy access to shopping, green spaces, and transport links. Whether commuting to work or spending quality time with family on the weekend, this location delivers outstanding convenience and lifestyle appeal.<br/><br/>Main Features:<br/>· Modern Kitchen - Seamlessly connected to the living area and featuring ample cupboard and bench space, dishwasher, Fridge, pantry, elegant downlights, and plenty of storage throughout.<br/>· Powder Room (Downstairs) - Conveniently located for guests.<br/>· Spacious Laundry & Large Linen Closet - Practical design with excellent storage solutions.<br/>· King-Sized Main Bedroom (Upstairs) - Exceptionally spacious ( no bed provided), Split-system air conditioning, plush carpet flooring, highlight windows for natural light, downlights, and a generous walk-in wardrobe.<br/>· Extra-Large Ensuite - Featuring a double vanity and separate toilet, immaculately presented.<br/>· Bedrooms 2 & 3 - Well-positioned with full-length built-in wardrobes and highlight windows allowing plenty of natural light.<br/>· Modern Family Bathroom - Spacious layout including a bathtub and an additional toilet for added comfort.<br/>· Double-Car Garage - Secure parking with access to a wide driveway offering additional parking space.<br/>· Solar Panels Installed - Helping reduce electricity costs and improving energy efficiency.<br/>· Paved Alfresco Area - Perfect for entertaining guests or enjoying relaxed family evenings outdoors.<br/>· Artificial turf at the front and back yards for easy maintenance.<br/><br/><br/><br/>*** ARE YOU A LANDLORD? If you are looking for property management services, we would love to hear from you. Contact our Business Development Manager Ervina on [REDACTED PHONE] or [REDACTED EMAIL] for a no-obligation and confidential conversation.','house','Hammond Park',-32.16019489,115.84821782,6164,'WA','15/18 Deanmore Bend','Hammond Park',2,3,2,'Harcourts Property Specialists','Garage: 2, Air Conditioning, Dishwasher, Toilets: 2, Furnished'),(4769,'Beautifully renovated 3 bedroom',750,'Wake up to birdsong and unwind in peaceful bushland surrounds — this charming home opposite Lake Goollelal Reserve offers relaxed living in a quiet, well-maintained complex. <br/>Perfectly positioned just a stroll to the bus stop on Whitfords Avenue, convenience meets serenity in this delightful 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom residence.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>• 3 Bedrooms, 1 Bathroom<br/>• Recently renovated <br/>• Patio / Courtyard for outdoor enjoyment<br/>• Single Garage plus Visitor Parking<br/>• Spacious, light-filled lounge at the front of the home, the perfect place to relax<br/>• Main bedroom positioned at the front featuring four built-in robes<br/>• Two minor bedrooms (one with built-in robe)<br/>• Good-sized bathroom with separate toilet<br/>• Separate laundry conveniently located near the washing line<br/><br/>With stunning bushland as your neighbour and every daily convenience within easy reach, this home delivers comfort, calm and lifestyle in one inviting package.','house','Kingsley',-31.80439390,115.80699284,6026,'WA','7/169 Goollelal Drive','Kingsley',1,3,1,'The Agency - WA','Garage: 1, Pets Allowed'),(4770,'MODERN COASTAL LIVING',720,'Providing comfort, privacy and modern coastal living this well presented and spacious home is ideally located in the heart of Secret Harbour, just meters from Mandalay Reserve. Close to stunning beaches, local schools, shopping centres, parks and the Secret Harbour Golf Course, this property is perfectly suited to families and professionals.<br/><br/>The home boasts:-<br/>4 BEDROOMS - ALL WITH ROBES<br/>MASTER WITH ENSUITE & WALK-IN ROBE<br/>2 BATHROOMS - MAIN WITH BATH<br/>SEPARATE THEATRE/ACTIVITY ROOM<br/>LIGHT FILLED OPEN-PLAN LIVING<br/>DUCTED REVERSE CYCLE AIR CONDITIONING<br/>SUPERB CHEF\'S KITCHEN WITH AMPLE STORAGE AND BENCH SPACE<br/>DISHWASHER & 900MM HOT PLATE AND OVEN<br/>SEPARATE LAUNDRY WITH PLENTY OF STORAGE<br/>DECKED ALFRESCO FOR ALL YEAR ROUND ENTERTAINING<br/>RAISED GARDEN BED<br/>BORE RETICULATION TO LAWN & GARDENS AT FRONT<br/>DOUBLE GARAGE <br/>GARDEN SHED<br/>5kW SOLAR PANELS<br/><br/>To view or regster your interest please go to www.rentwest.com.au and or call our office [REDACTED PHONE]','house','Secret Harbour',-32.40189001,115.76189661,6173,'WA','12 Cathedral Approach','Secret Harbour',2,4,2,'Rentwest Solutions - Applecross','Garage: 2'),(4771,'FULLY FURNISHED APARTMENT',580,'Set on the fourth floor of a well located apartment complex, this fully furnished home offers low maintenance inner city living with views and resort style facilities in one of Perth’s most connected lifestyle locations.<br/><br/>DINING AND LIVING<br/>Featuring a light filled open plan living and dining area, thoughtfully furnished with a couch, dining table and television. The space flows seamlessly to the private balcony, creating an ideal setting to relax or entertain while enjoying glimpses of the Perth city skyline. The kitchen comes fully equipped with appliances, cookware and utensils, offering a true move in ready opportunity.<br/><br/>BEDROOMS AND BATHROOMS<br/>The generously sized bedroom includes furniture and direct access to a large ensuite bathroom through a walk in robe. The bedroom allows natural light and views towards the river enjoyed from the comfort of your room.<br/><br/>FACILITIES<br/>Residents enjoy access to a range of premium, resort-style facilities, including: Swimming pool, Fully equipped gym and Tennis Court with secure underground parking and store room. <br/><br/>LOCATION<br/>Perfectly positioned near Kings Park, the Perth CBD and the Swan River foreshore, with easy freeway access and public transport close by. This location offers exceptional convenience for professionals seeking city living with lifestyle appeal and a requirement for furniture. <br/><br/>FEATURES<br/>- Fully Furnished <br/>- Bedroom with Ensuite<br/>- Balcony with City View Glimpses<br/>- Open Plan Living & Dining<br/>- Fully Equipped Kitchen<br/>- Secure car bay<br/>- Gym, Pool and Tennis Court<br/>- Close to Kings Park, CBD and Freeway<br/><br/>Please email [REDACTED EMAIL] with your preferred viewing dates and times, and we will be in touch to arrange an inspection.<br/><br/>','apartment','Perth',-31.95591286,115.84688973,6000,'WA','411/126-128 Mounts Bay Road','Perth',1,1,1,'OEIJ Property - Perth','Balcony, Garage: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Swimming Pool - Inground, Tennis Court, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Gym, Intercom, Living Areas: 1, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating, Toilets: 1, Furnished'),(4772,'Easy to maintain family home!!',650,'This home has all the finest features to give your family a luxurious lifestyle close to all amenities including Yanchep Shopping Centre, a gym, fast food and the beach! Few places can give you all of the city\'s luxuries while still keeping that small country town feeling with a close community full of after school activities and events to keep you entertained all year round!<br/><br/> Features include: <br/><br/>• 4 bedrooms (master with triple sliding robe and 2 x minors have sliding robes)<br/>• 2 bathrooms<br/>• Open plan kitchen, meals, lounge<br/>• Paved rear yard with good sized grass area<br/>• Double lock up garage with shoppers entrance<br/>• Security cameras<br/><br/><br/><br/>VIEWING & APPLICATION INFORMATION<br/>• Does this property tick the boxes? Yes - Click the \'BOOK AN INSPECTION\' button. If there isn\'t a time available, send through the enquiry so you can be contacted when one is booked and/or emailed updates. Registrations are MANDATORY, no registration, no updates. Please be aware, if there isn\'t a time available, there may have already been an inspection and applications pending.<br/>• The property MUST be viewed by yourself or someone on your behalf before you can apply. We will not carry out virtual inspections.<br/>• Applications will NOT be accepted prior to viewing<br/>• We use the 2Apply platform so you are welcome to prepare your profile - after the viewing, you will be sent the code to submit your application<br/>• Something else you need to know? Please EMAIL your enquiry as we are often on the road, in appointments or with clients and do not have the information at hand.<br/>• SCAM BE AWARE - we will only ever accept an applicant via phone before following up with an email confirmation. We do not advertise on Facebook Marketplace. If in doubt, call to confirm the legitimacy before transferring any funds.<br/>','house','Yanchep',-31.55141721,115.65191317,6035,'WA','44 Bundjalung Rise','Yanchep',2,4,2,'Professionals Northern Coast Real Estate','Garage: 2'),(4773,'Charming 3-Bedroom Home',730,'This 3-bedroom house is ideal for families or those seeking extra space.<br/><br/>Key Features:<br/>3 spacious bedrooms, including a master bedroom with a walk-in robe.<br/>2 modern bathrooms, each equipped with heat-light-fan combos.<br/>Formal lounge and a main living area comprising family, meals, and kitchen spaces.<br/>Ducted evaporative system for cooling.<br/>Double Garage <br/><br/>**HOW TO ARRANGE A VIEWING**<br/><br/>Please click the “Book an Inspection Time” button and select your preferred inspection time. If no times are available or suit you, please click on “Request an Inspection” and register your details and you will be notified of the next scheduled viewing time. By registering your details, you will be instantly informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your property appointment. Please ensure that you arrive on time so you have sufficient time to view the property as viewing times cannot be extended.<br/>Disclaimer: This advertisement has been prepared with our best endeavours to ensure the information contained in this document is true and correct. We accept no responsibility and disclaim all liability in respect to any errors, omissions, inaccuracies or exclusions in this document. Prospective tenants must make their own enquiries to verify the information contained in this material is true and correct. The particulars are supplied for information only and shall not be taken as a representation of the lessor or its agent as to the accuracy of any details mentioned herein which may be subject to change at any time without notice. No warranty or representation is made as to its accuracy and interested parties should place no reliance on it and should make their own independent enquiries.','house','Atwell',-32.13763000,115.86784000,6164,'WA','3 Wilmot Close','Atwell',2,3,2,'The Agency - WA','Garage: 2, Ducted Cooling, Pets Allowed'),(4774,'Gorgeous Unit With Balcony!',520,'This two bedroom unit is quality throughout. <br/><br/>Ideally located a few minutes walk to the Midland Train station and the CBD of the old Midland town it will not be available long! <br/><br/>Features include:<br/><br/>* 2 bedrooms with carpet and built in robes <br/>* Open plan living and kitchen area <br/>* Electric cooking and hot water system <br/>* Bathroom with shower and toilet<br/>* Separate toilet for guests <br/>* Laundry <br/>* Reverse cycle air conditioning <br/>* Private balcony off the main living <br/>Contact us today to arrange a viewing.','apartment','Midland',-31.88880651,116.00052139,6056,'WA','13/8 William Street','Midland',1,2,1,'The Agency - WA','Carport: 1'),(4775,'Stylish and Contemporary Design',600,'These apartments have everything you need, but space is number one! Located in the desirable suburb of Coombs, this stunning example of modern, stylish living. With its clever design, and ideal positioning to make the most of its breathtaking views across the Molonglo Valley, this home offers the perfect blend of privacy, convenience, and comfort.<br/><br/>Meticulously designed with the intention to maximise floor space, airflow, natural light, and the stunning views of the picturesque Molonglo Valley.<br/><br/>Situated in a fabulous, convenient location, this apartment is just moments from nearby walking trails and key routes to Canberra City. The close proximity to amenities makes this an ideal place to call home.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- Bosch appliances<br/>- Washer and dryer <br/>- Caroma tapware<br/>- Waterfall stone benchtops<br/>- Double glazing<br/>- Reverse cycle air conditioning<br/>- Good size storage cages<br/>- Multiple living areas<br/>No current EER<br/><br/>This property has a valid exemption and is not required to comply with the minimum ceiling insulation standard.<br/><br/>This property is awaiting an insulation information from the Owners Corporation.<br/><br/>There is no embedded network. <br/><br/>Suburb Snapshot<br/>Coombs is a suburb currently under development in the Molonglo Valley district of Canberra, located within the Australian Capital Territory, Australia. It is named in honour of Herbert Cole \"Nugget\" Coombs, a prominent public servant, economist, and the first Governor of the Reserve Bank of Australia.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: <br/>Please note that while all care has been taken regarding general information and marketing information compiled for this rental advertisement, LJ HOOKER CANBERRA CITY does not accept responsibility and disclaim all liabilities in regard to any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We encourage prospective tenants to rely on their own investigation and in-person inspections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.<br/><br/>PETS: <br/>Please be aware that at all stages of tenancy this property requires consent to be sought from the lessor for the keeping of any pets at the premises. Consent must be provided before any pets are at the premises.<br/><br/>RENTING BOOK:<br/>https://www.justice.act.gov.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0008/2443472/Renting-Book-May-2024.pdf','apartment','Coombs',-35.31068599,149.03207158,2611,'ACT','205/220 John Gorton Drive','Coombs',2,2,2,'LJ Hooker - Canberra City','Balcony, Garage: 2, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating, Intercom'),(4776,'Prime Plympton Location & Low Maintenance Living',600,'To register for an open inspection, simply click \'Enquire\' or \'Request an Inspection\'.<br/><br/>We\'ll then send you an email to register your attendance for viewing and provide further details about the property and application process. Registration will ensure you are advised on any new or updated inspection times.<br/><br/>ABOUT THE PROPERTY<br/><br/>Welcome to 44a Keith Avenue Plympton. <br/><br/>This beautifully presented three-bedroom courtyard home, perfectly positioned in the highly sought-after suburb of Plympton. Offering comfort, space, and convenience, this home is ideal for families or professionals seeking easy access to both city and beach living. The home has low maintenance floating timber flooring throughout. <br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>Three (3) generous bedrooms<br/>- Main bedroom featuring a near-new split-system air-conditioner, stunning bay window, and direct access to the three-way bathroom.<br/>- Second bedroom complete with a large built-in wardrobe.<br/>- All bedrooms have floating timber floorboards<br/><br/>Well-appointed three-way bathroom<br/>- Full-size bath<br/>- Large shower<br/>- Spacious vanity with ample storage<br/>- Separate toilet for added convenience<br/><br/>Two living areas<br/>- Large formal lounge room at the front of the home.<br/>- Informal living area at the rear, overlooked by the kitchen.<br/>- Air-conditioners installed in both living spaces for year-round comfort (total of 3 A/C\'s in the home)<br/><br/>Functional kitchen<br/>- Ample cupboard space for storage and the home chef.<br/>- Breakfast bar for casual dining.<br/>- Gas cooktop.<br/>- Puratap.<br/>- Easy-care tiled flooring.<br/><br/>Outdoor living<br/>- Covered pergola entertaining area overlooking the garden.<br/>- Spacious yard with room for a pet to enjoy.<br/>- Garden shed for additional storage.<br/><br/>Additional features<br/>- Gas instantaneous hot water.<br/>- Separate laundry with built-in storage cupboards and external access.<br/>- Parking for three vehicles, including two under a carport.<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/>- Situated in Plympton, this home offers the best of both worlds - just a 10-minute drive to the Adelaide CBD and only 10 minutes to the beach. Convenient shopping is close by at Kurralta Park Shopping Centre, along with public transport options, schools, and local amenities.<br/>- Enjoy low-maintenance living in a location that keeps you connected to everything Adelaide has to offer.<br/>- Enquire today to arrange an inspection - this one won\'t last long!<br/><br/>LEASING INFORMATION<br/><br/>LEASE TERM: 12 Months<br/>AVAILABLE FROM: 26 February 2026<br/>WATER CHARGES: Tenant to pay supply and water use<br/>PET POLICY: Pet friendly <br/>FURNISHED: This property is offered UNFURNISHED.<br/>INSPECTION: Register to view<br/><br/>APPLYING FOR THIS PROPERTY<br/><br/>Please note applications will not be processed until:<br/><br/>> The property has been viewed in person or someone has viewed it on your behalf<br/>> All occupants over 18 years have completed the application form<br/>> Photo ID has been provided<br/>> Proof of Income (Pay slip/Bank balance/Centrelink) has been provided<br/><br/>TO INSPECT THIS HOME<br/><br/>Click the \'Enquire\' or \'Request an Inspection\' button to register for our upcoming open inspections. We manage our enquiries through Tenant Options and recommend registering your interest to stay updated throughout every step of the leasing process.<br/><br/>All information provided has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee the information is accurate and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions (including but not limited to a property\'s land size, floor plans and size, building age and condition) Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain their own legal advice.<br/><br/>RLA 277721','house','Plympton',-34.95218692,138.55919490,5038,'SA','44a Keith Avenue','Plympton',1,3,2,'LJ Hooker - Glenelg | Brighton','Carport: 2'),(4777,'Available Now',1150,'Stylish Inner City Family Living!<br/><br/>This impeccably-presented 4 bedroom 2 bathroom two-storey residence offers inner-city living close to everything you could ever want or need, but without the hustle and bustle.<br/><br/>Beyond a securely-gated courtyard entrance, a beautifully-tiled open-plan living, kitchen and dining area is where most of your casual time will be spent and plays host to double sinks, glass splashbacks, a walk-in pantry and quality modern stainless-steel range-hood, gas-cooktop and oven appliances. There is also a double fridge/freezer recess and sparkling stone bench tops in this part of the house, for good measure.<br/><br/>Upstairs, there are leafy views across to the lovely Norwood Park from the balcony, off a tiled retreat that doubles personal living options and has its own built-in kitchenette with a range hood, circular sink and an electric hotplate. The pick of the bedrooms is a sublime master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and a fully-tiled ensuite bathroom – shower, stylish stone vanity, toilet and all.<br/><br/>At the rear, you will find a spacious paved courtyard that encourages easy-care outdoor entertaining. Completing this terrific package is a double lock-up garage.<br/><br/>Far enough removed from all of the traffic that accompanies a city lifestyle yet still only walking distance away from the likes of East Perth Train Station, our picturesque Swan River, sporting events and concerts at HBF Park, East Perth\'s vibrant Royal Street café and restaurants strip and our world-class Optus Stadium at Burswood, this impressive home is right in the thick of where the action is – and you wouldn\'t even know it. It\'s a “lock-up-and-leave” gem in the most perfect of positions!<br/>PROPERTY FEATURES:<br/>• 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms<br/>• Gated courtyard entrance<br/>• Two living areas – each with their own kitchen<br/>• Carpeted bedrooms – including a large master suite with a walk-in robe<br/>• Mirrored BIR\'s<br/>• Fully-tiled ensuite and main bathrooms – both with showers and stone vanities<br/>• Separate toilet, off the laundry<br/>• Upstairs balcony with park views<br/>• Private rear entertaining courtyard<br/>• Stone bench tops<br/>• Ceiling fans<br/>• White plantation shutters<br/>• Feature ceiling cornices<br/>• Security roller shutter to the front downstairs window<br/>• Double lock-up garage<br/><br/>LOCATION FEATURES:<br/>• 1.9km (approx.) from Perth CBD<br/>• Footsteps from East Perth Train Station<br/>• Close to the river, medical facilities and HBF Park<br/>• Easy access to cafes, restaurants and shopping<br/>• Minutes away from both Mercedes College and Trinity College<br/>• Walk to Optus Stadium, Burswood and other terrific landmarks','house','Perth',-31.94485876,115.87562365,6000,'WA','5 West Parade','Perth',2,4,2,'The Agency - WA','Garage: 2, Pets Allowed'),(4778,'North Lake House for Lease: 3BR, Pets Allowed, $785/Week from 2026',785,'To apply, submit an enquiry and you\'ll receive the application link via email.<br/><br/>To en