and-families/enrol-school-or-preschool/find-a-school-zone-or-preschool-catchment-area<br/><br/>(We take no responsibility for the information given by the school zone locator and you should always make your own inquiries with the school directly)<br/><br/>12 month lease<br/>Water use and supply charges apply to the tenant<br/><br/>Tayla Mcleod<br/>Property Manager<br/>LJ Hooker Flinders Park<br/>[REDACTED EMAIL]<br/><br/>RLA 215339','apartment','Adelaide',-34.93239538,138.61673358,5000,'SA','16/389 Halifax Street','Adelaide',2,2,2,'LJ Hooker - Flinders Park','Carport: 2, Ensuite: 1, Living Areas: 1, Toilets: 2'),(4805,'OVER 55\'S OPPORTUNITY- RETIREMENT VILLAGE LIVING',390,'A unique opportunity has been presented to the rental market! A \'try before you buy\' in a sense, living opportunity for over 55\'s to be able to experience Retirement Village Living before committing to a long-term arrangement and assistance in easing the burden of everyday living costs and high market rent. <br/><br/>Located in the quiet and peaceful Mirinjani Retirement Village these single level modern, self- sustainable units are available to rent. <br/><br/>The Village offers tenants access to the Community Room and quaint Library, flexibility to enjoy socializing with other residents or to take a stroll around the Village through the beautifully landscaped gardens and pristine, modern unit accommodation. <br/><br/>Car accommodation unfortunately is not guaranteed as there are minimal Garages available within the Village, if garages are available there is an additional $22.58 per week fee. <br/><br/>Mirinjani Retirement Village is in a superb location, opposite Cooleman Court Shopping Centre with a bus stop right outside the Village. <br/><br/>12/24 Month Lease <br/><br/>The property complies with the minimum ceiling insulation standard. <br/><br/>EER Unknown <br/><br/>TO INSPECT THIS PROPERTY <br/>You can Register to join an existing inspection or Register to be notified when inspection times are available. <br/>Click on the BOOK INSPECTION button and choose your inspection time. <br/>If this listing does not have the BOOK INSPECTION button, please go to Belconnen.ljhooker.com.au to Register. <br/>If you do not Register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations, or future inspection times. <br/><br/>PETS: Please be aware that at all stages of your tenancy this property requires consent to be sought from the property owner for the keeping of any pets at the property. Consent must be provided before any pets are on the property. <br/><br/>Disclaimer <br/>Information contained herein is gathered from external sources we consider to be reliable. <br/>Whilst all care has been taken regarding all information compiled for this rental advertisement LJ Hooker Belconnen does not give any guarantee or warranty about the information provided and does not accept responsibility and disclaims all liabilities as to any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We advise prospective tenants to rely on their own investigations and in-person inspections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.','house','Weston',-35.33917128,149.05519312,2611,'ACT','41/11 Namatjira Drive','Weston',1,2,2,'LJ Hooker - Belconnen',NULL),(4806,'Spacious family home with Lounge/Dine PLUS Rumpus room',630,'Spacious three bedroom home that has just received a nice<br/>freshen up with new painting throughout, new carpets, window<br/>treatments and hybrid plank flooring.<br/><br/>Robes in all three bedrooms.<br/>Lounge/Dine with polished timber floors stepping<br/>down to a sep. Rumpus/TV Room.<br/><br/>BRAND NEW Evap Air cond is another bonus!<br/>Winter heating is covered with gas heater in the Lounge.<br/><br/>Kitchen/Meals area with well equipped kitchen and slide<br/>door outside to all weather rear verandah and private rear yard<br/>with toolshed.<br/><br/>outside pet may be considered with references.<br/>Carport UMR.<br/><br/>Close to Shepherds Hill Road transport & easy access<br/>to Adelaide CBD via upgrading at South Road Corridor.<br/><br/>Bellevue Heights Primary and Blackwood High school<br/>conveniently located close by.<br/><br/>Few minutes down Shepherds Hill Road to Flinders University, <br/>Flinders Hospital & Marion Shopping Centre.<br/><br/>FAST FACTS:<br/>* property available immediately - preference 12 month lease<br/>* tenant responsible for supply charge & water consumption<br/>* total of $3780 bond and rent in advance required<br/><br/>VIEWINGS:<br/>OPEN INSPECTION WEDNESDAY 25TH FEBRUARY<br/>4.30pm - 5.00pm.<br/><br/>PRIVATE VIEWINGS - please contact agent and we will<br/>endeavour to make private viewings available if you are<br/>unable to attend OPEN.<br/><br/>if you would like an application form prior to Open<br/>(note: we will not accept completed Applications until you have <br/>viewed the property)<br/>email your details and specific rental requirements/situation<br/><br/>e: [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/><br/>','house','Bellevue Heights',-35.02737510,138.58658801,5050,'SA','4 Silverdale Crescent','Bellevue Heights',1,3,1,'Domain Rental Management - HOVE','Carport: 1, Fully Fenced, Shed, Built-in Wardrobes, Evaporative Cooling, Gas Heating, Rumpus Room, Toilets: 1'),(4807,'Your Own Private Retreat in a Sought-After Riverside Suburb',700,'This beautifully presented ground floor residence offers an exceptional opportunity for couples or small households seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle in one of Perth\'s most desirable riverside suburbs.<br/>Located on the ground level, the home features two generous bedrooms, a modern bathroom and an undercover single car garage space. The functional layout includes a well equipped kitchen with ample storage with dishwasher, and split system air conditioning to both bedrooms.<br/><br/>Outside you\'ll find a fully enclosed grassed courtyard that wraps around the unit - providing a rare outdoor space ideal for entertaining, pets or simply enjoying your own private retreat.<br/><br/>Positioned along Canning Highway, the property offers exceptional convenience with easy access to Perth CBD and Fremantle, along with excellent public transport options at your doorstep. The Swan River foreshore is within walking distance, and Westfield Booragoon, local cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities are all close by. The home is also situated within the catchment of highly regarded schools and a range of quality education options.<br/><br/>This residence presents a fantastic opportunity to secure a lifestyle of comfort, accessibility and convenience in a highly sought after riverside location.<br/><br/>Please register your interest online to arrange a viewing, or contact Lauren at Salt Property for further information.','house','Applecross',-32.02323000,115.82997000,6153,'WA','2/724 Canning Highway','Applecross',1,2,1,'Salt Property Group - Applecross','Garage: 1'),(4808,'Location & Lifestyle',680,'To Apply, please click the link below:<br/>https://app.2apply.com.au/Agency/prdcanberracbd<br/><br/>Available 25 February 2026<br/><br/>This two bedroom apartment is situated in the heart of the City. Within walking distance to everything you need.<br/><br/>Inner-city living at the Highgate apartments located on City Walk. Short walks to many shops, restaurants, cafes, bars, and activities at your doorstep. Within walking distance of the Australian National University, multiple Government Offices, Canberra Centre, and Glebe Park. <br/><br/>Not to mention the amenities within Highgate itself, such as a pool, gym, theatre room, and outdoor entertaining and BBQ area.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>- Master bedroom with BIR and ensuite<br/>- Bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>- Floor to ceiling double glazed windows<br/>- Stone bench tops <br/>- Ceramic electric cooktop<br/>- Dishwasher<br/>- Bathroom with custom joinery<br/>- Ducted reverse cycle air-conditioning<br/>- Basement parking with allocated space and storage cage<br/>- No current EER<br/><br/>Pets<br/>In accordance with the Residential Tenancies Act Clause 71AE Process for tenant seeking consent - the tenant must apply, in writing, to the lessor, for the lessors\' consent to keep pet/s at this property.<br/><br/>The lessor may impose conditions on consent, including but not limited to, the number and type of animals being kept, and any cost involved for rectification required as a result of the animal.<br/><br/>note: All care has been taken in compiling this information, PRD Canberra CBD will not be held liable for any errors in typing or information. All applicants /parties should rely on their own inspection & investigations to validate any information provided.<br/>Photos provided by landlord<br/><br/>','apartment','City',-35.28218623,149.13332713,2601,'ACT','133/264 City Walk','City',2,2,1,'PRD Canberra CBD - PAGE','Garage: 1'),(4809,'2BDR Coastal Home in Henley Beach South – Coastal Lifestyle Awaits',680,'RentBetter Property ID: 415352 (quote when calling)<br/><br/>APPLY: Send through an enquiry and you\'ll receive the link to apply<br/><br/>5 Fletcher Road, Henley Beach South<br/>Relaxed coastal living in one of Adelaide’s most sought-after beachside pockets<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned just a 10 minute walk from the sand and sea, this beautifully presented home offers the ultimate Henley Beach South lifestyle with comfort, style, and convenience.<br/><br/>This two-bedroom home features a newly renovated kitchen, creating a fresh and modern space at the heart of the home. Light-filled living areas and a functional layout provide a warm and welcoming atmosphere, ideal for professionals, couples, or anyone wanting to enjoy a relaxed coastal lifestyle.<br/><br/>To make moving even easier, the property comes fully equipped with a washing machine and fridge, offering added convenience from day one.<br/><br/>Set in a quiet, well-maintained street, you’ll enjoy morning walks along the beach, sunset dinners by the water, and easy access to