olar hot water boost to help keep utility costs manageable.<br/><br/>The layout makes smart use of every square foot, with a well-proportioned eat-in kitchen/dining area and three comfortable bedrooms. The master bedroom and third bedroom include modern built-in robes, while the master also features an additional split system air conditioner. The recently upgraded bathroom is pristine, and the home\'s floating floors are both stylish and durable, complemented by high-quality soft furnishings.<br/><br/>For those who love outdoor living, the rear of the property offers a full-width verandah – an ideal setting for entertaining guests or enjoying a quiet moment. The extra-wide carport enhances the outdoor living space, perfect for gatherings. The property is fully fenced and well-maintained, featuring a 250-litre hot water system installed less than three years ago.<br/><br/>Accessibility is thoughtfully considered with convenient entry and exit points for those with mobility needs. Additionally, the fully lockable side yard provides a secure space for pets or a delightful setting for garden enthusiasts.<br/><br/>Don\'t miss this opportunity to secure a wonderful rental property that promises comfort and convenience in a sought-after location. Contact us today to arrange a viewing and see how this home can meet your lifestyle needs.','house','Elizabeth Vale',-34.75243516,138.65874785,5112,'SA','21 Boronia Crescent','Elizabeth Vale',1,3,1,'Century 21 First Choice in Real Estate - RLA 336572','Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning'),(4813,'New rental property!',450,'Newly renovated three bedroom home now available in Risdon Park South. Large, modern kitchen with electric oven & cooktop, dishwasher & plenty of storage. Modern bathroom with large bath, separate laundry, rear outdoor entertaining area & back yard space, fully fenced.<br/>$450p/w <br/>12 month lease.<br/><br/>Apply online or ask for an application to be printed or emailed. Inspection via private appointment, appro