ort<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned to elevate everyday life, this prized address places you footsteps from lush parks, leafy reserves, and playgrounds, while a strong selection of respected public and private schools sits close at hand. From here, enjoy effortless access to Marden and Firle Plaza for daily essentials, indulge in the trendy cafés, restaurants, and boutiques of The Parade Norwood, and reach Adelaide’s vibrant East End in just an 8-minute zip, delivering a lifestyle where convenience, connection, and leisure converge beautifully.<br/><br/><br/>??????????<br/>Online applications are available by the APPLY button via this listing or pleasse feel free to contact Calvin [REDACTED PHONE] and Tina [REDACTED PHONE]<br/>RLA: 272 867<br/><br/>*Please note that all the information that has been provided for this property has been obtained from sources we believe to be accurate. We cannot guarantee the information is accurate however and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions – including, but not limited to the property\'s land size, floor plans & dimensions, build size, building age, condition, or any other particulars. Interested parties should always make their own inquiries and obtain their own legal advice.','house','Trinity Gardens',-34.91053185,138.64567938,5068,'SA','117B Ashbrook Avenue','Trinity Gardens',2,3,4,'AC Real Estate - ADELAIDE','Garage: 2, Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Floorboards, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Toilets: 3, Pets Allowed'),(4818,'Hilltop Ocean Glimpses in Boutique Scarborough',880,'Sitting high on the hill in a boutique complex of just nine residences, this beautifully designed second-floor apartment captures the best of Scarborough living—modern, coastal and effortlessly low-maintenance. With ocean glimpses and stunning sunsets, you’ll love stepping onto the balcony to unwind at the end of the day.<br/><br/>Inside, the layout is