throom, separate toilet and laundry facilities.<br/>/ Two-car secure lock-up garage (tandem) with plentiful storage including under-stair space and extra storage off the garage.<br/>/ Fully air-conditioned for year-round comfort and convenient, well-considered layout across three levels.<br/><br/>THE LOCATION<br/>A short, approximately 10-minute stroll to Northbridge and just minutes from major transport hubs, HBF Park, Royal Perth Hospital and a wide selection of cafés and restaurants. With easy access to the Perth CBD and nearby schools, this townhouse offers outstanding inner-city convenience in a quiet, well-connected pocket.<br/><br/>THE OPPORTUNITY<br/>A rare tri-level townhouse that blends privacy, space and contemporary finishes - ideal for professionals, families or those seeking a sophisticated inner-city base with excellent storage and secure parking. Register your interest today to arrange a viewing.<br/><br/>IMPORTANT INFORMATION<br/>Initial lease term of 12 months preferred.<br/>Available Now.<br/><br/>If you wish to apply for this property, please submit your application through our website. Please note: applications will only be assessed where the applicant has viewed the property at a scheduled home open or private inspection. Register to inspect via the listing to receive inspection details and notifications.<br/><br/>LANDLORD / INVESTOR ENQUIRIES<br/>Are you a current landlord or a new investor? To learn more about Edison Property\'s property management services, please contact our Business Development Manager, Alma Elliot, at [REDACTED EMAIL] or call [REDACTED PHONE].','house','Perth',-31.94659027,115.87175097,6000,'WA','25 Murchison Terrace','Perth',3,3,2,'Edison Property Residential','Balcony, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Pets Allowed'),(4875,'Large Family Size Home.',900,'Set in the beautiful Ranford Estate, down the road from a park land reserve, is this spacious Summit built family home with features that include: Federation facade set on a large 667sqm. Solid wood front door with feature leadlight window. Ducted evaporative air conditioning with brand new motor. King-sized master suite with large walk-in robe. Light and bright ensuite bathroom. Powder room for guests. Formal front lounge room with recessed walls and quality carpet floor. Massive open-plan main living area with tiled flooring. The kitchen overlooks the main living space to the outside and has a double sink, gas cook-top, electric oven, plenty of cupboard space and 31c ceilings. Family room is spacious with tiled flooring and neutral d cor in keeping with the rest of the home, and also has 31c ceilings. The other three bedrooms are queen-sized (bedroom 2 has built-in robe, and bedrooms 3 and 4 have walk-in robes) with quality carpets and vertical blinds. Main bathroom is large with abundant natural light and quality fittings. 3KW solar panel system. Security alarm. Huge patio entertaining area, all ready to invite in the summer months. Easy-care gardens with bore reticulation. Garden shed. Side access. Close to schools, public transport and park land space. Call Tracey today to arrange a private viewing time.<br/>Available from 7/04/2026<br/><br/>4 WEEKS BOND 2 WEEKS RENT INADVANCE TOTAL INGOING $5400.00','house','Canning Vale',-32.09352000,115.91532000,6155,'WA','122 Goodwood Street','Canning Vale',2,4,2,'Foster\'s Real Estate - OAKFORD','Garage: 2, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(4876,'Spacious Family Living in Prime Canning Vale Location!',900,'Welcome to 256 Boardman Road, Canning Vale - a beautifully presented home offering space, comfort, and convenience in one of the suburb\'s most sought-after pockets.<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned in the heart of Canning Vale, this property delivers the ideal lifestyle for families or professionals seeking room to move without compromising on location.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Generous master bedroom with private ensuite<br/>- Well-s