pections.<br/>• Applications will NOT be accepted prior to viewing<br/>• We use the 2Apply platform so you are welcome to prepare your profile - after the viewing, you will be sent the code to submit your application<br/>• Something else you need to know? Please EMAIL your enquiry as we are often on the road, in appointments or with clients and do not have the information at hand.<br/>• SCAM BE AWARE - we will only ever accept an applicant via phone before following up with an email confirmation. We do not advertise on Gumtree or Facebook Marketplace. If in doubt, call to confirm the legitimacy before transferring any funds.','house','Alkimos',-31.62526856,115.70485746,6038,'WA','17 Howden Parade','Alkimos',2,4,2,'Professionals Northern Coast Real Estate','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Floorboards, Study, Pets Allowed'),(4885,'Elegant Family Living in Prime Location',755,'Certainly! Welcome to 28 Fitchett Street, Garran, a captivating five-bedroom, two-bathroom residence that promises an unmatched blend of comfort, space, and location. As soon as you step through the door, you\'ll find yourself enveloped by the warm ambiance and modern design that this delightful home offers.<br/><br/>One of the standout features of this home is its five generously sized bedrooms. Perfect for large families or those who enjoy the freedom of extra space, each bedroom is well-lit with natural sunlight and comes with built-in wardrobes. Whether it\'s a master suite you\'re after, or a quiet corner room to turn into your personal study or home office, the layout offers flexibility for a variety of living situations.<br/><br/>The living experience is further elevated by two modern bathrooms that are not only functional but also beautifully designed. The master bathroom serves as a private en-suite, adding an extra layer of convenience for the homeowners. High-quality fittings and finishes ensure that your morning and evening routines feel like a luxurious experience every day.<br/><br/>A significant advantage of living in this home is the ample parking space provided by a double garage and an additional single carport. Parking hassles become a thing of the past, and you\'ll also have extra room for storage, or perhaps for setting up a home gym, workshop, or craft space. The options are endless.<br/><br/>The property\'s location in the coveted neighborhood of Garran adds another layer of allure. Here, you\'re close to local schools, shopping centers, medical facilities, and various recreational areas, making it a convenient hub for families and professionals alike.<br/><br/>Don\'t miss your chance to call 28 Fitchett Street, Garran your new home. This is not merely a place to live; it\'s a place where life unfolds beautifully every day. For rent details, availability, and inspection times, please contact us today.','house','Garran',-35.34081000,149.09622424,2605,'ACT','28 Fitchett Street','Garran',2,5,3,'Cercis Property','Carport: 1, Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Evaporative Cooling, Gas Heating, Living Areas: 172'),(4886,'Solid Brick 4/5 Bedroom 2 bathroom family home',750,'This solid brick home offers a great opportunity for the bigger family or someone to share<br/><br/>The home comprises 4 bedrooms, plus a study and a front lounge room with a wall air conditioner.<br/><br/>There is a large eat-in timber kitchen with ample cupboard space plus a double sink and plenty of room to sit down and enjoy evening meals.<br/><br/>The home has been well upgraded and offers 2 bathrooms, floorboards in the lounge and bedrooms, porcelain tiles in the hallway and kitchen plus a generous land allotment of 689m2.<br/><br/>Situated close to transport, Regency Tafe College , Costco shopping center and the City.<br/><br/>Additional feature/s - Close to local Schools.<br/><br/>Lease Term: 12 mo