lity to suit your lifestyle needs.<br/><br/>Dedicated Entertainment Room<br/>Enjoy movie nights, gaming sessions, or entertaining guests in a separate entertainment room that provides privacy without disturbing the rest of the home.<br/><br/>Spacious Laundry<br/>A large, well-designed laundry area with abundant counter space ensures household tasks are convenient and efficient.<br/><br/>Year-Round Comfort<br/>Ducted heating and cooling throughout the home provide perfect temperatures in every season.<br/><br/>Low-Maintenance Backyard<br/>The outdoor area is designed for easy upkeep, allowing you more time to relax and enjoy your surroundings.<br/><br/>This exceptional property truly offers a perfect blend of modern living, comfort, and convenience.<br/><br/>For more information or inspection details, please contact Biju Jose, Property Manager at Rosewood Realtors on [REDACTED PHONE].<br/><br/>RLA 308292<br/>Disclaimer:<br/><br/>All information contained in this advertisement has been gathered from sources we believe to be accurate, however, we cannot guarantee or give any warranty about the information provided and we accept no liability for any errors or omissions. Prospective tenants are advised to conduct their own investigations and make the relevant enquiries required to verify the information contained in this website.','house','Riverlea Park',-34.64805956,138.52657662,5120,'SA','17 Kingfisher Drive','Riverlea Park',2,4,4,'Rosewood Realtors','Courtyard, Garage: 2, Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Floorboards, Living Areas: 280, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Study, Toilets: 2'),(4888,'Single level home in great location',750,'https://www.2apply.com.au/agency?n=HaymanPartners&form=0<br/><br/>Welcome to your new home at this spacious single-level property, boasting a serene outlook onto a nature strip. This inviting residence offers three generously sized bedrooms, each equipped with built-in robes and ceiling fans for your comfort. The master bedroom features a convenient walk-in robe and ensuite, providing a private retreat within your home.<br/><br/>Stay cozy year-round with ducted gas heating and split system air conditioning in the living room. Parking is a breeze with a double carport featuring remote-controlled gate access, as well as an oversized double garage with an automatic door. Outside, the spacious backyard boasts easy-care gardens and a large pergola entertaining area, ideal for enjoying the outdoors.<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>- Single level home<br/>- Outlook to nature strip<br/>- Three spacious bedrooms, all with built-in robes and ceiling fans<br/>- Master bedroom with walk-in robe and ensuite<br/>- Open plan living and dining space<br/>- Updated kitchen with quality appliances and ample cupboard space<br/>- Hybrid flooring throughout<br/>- Main bathroom with separate toilet<br/>- Ducted gas heating<br/>- Gas hot water<br/>- Split system air conditioning in living room<br/>- NBN connected<br/>- Double carport with remote controlled gate access<br/>- Oversized double garage with automatic door<br/>- Spacious backyard with easy care gardens and large pergola entertaining area<br/>- Adjacent to bus stop<br/>- Close to Isaacs shops and a short drive to Southlands shopping centre, The Canberra Hospital & Woden Town Centre<br/>- Proximity to Farrer Primary School, Mawson Primary School, Goodstart Early Learning Centre and Marist College <br/>- Tenants must seek permission to keep pets at the property<br/><br/>- EER: 2<br/>- Ceiling Insulation – Compliant with ACT Government Minimum Energy Efficiency Standards<br/><br/>WISH TO INSPECT?<br/>1. Click on the \"BOOK INSPECTION\" button.<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection.<br/>3. If no time offered, please register so we can contact you once a time is arranged.<br/>4. If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations or further inspection times.',