ndy to transport.<br/><br/>Small pets considered.','house','Seaview Downs',-35.03453430,138.54033913,5049,'SA','6 Gawler Street','Seaview Downs',1,3,4,'Property Owner','Carport: 4, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Alarm System, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Pets Allowed'),(4913,'Spectacular Ocean View Apartment for lease',600,'We are delighted to present this 3-bedroom apartment perfect for coastal living at Safety Bay! This apartment is suitable for a holiday retreat. <br/><br/>Semi furnished property <br/>• Dining table and chairs set<br/>• Sofa<br/>• Washing machine<br/>• Living area table and chairs set<br/>• Brand new Microwave <br/>• Brand new Fridge <br/><br/>Living in this apartment, you will enjoy waking up everyday to the sensational ocean view, enjoy a drink with friends watching the sunset and spend quality time with family in the apartment pool. The apartment is a walking distance to the beach and across from the apartment is the play area with BBQ facilities, visitor parking spaces which is convenient for entertaining guests.<br/><br/>The apartment is situated on the 3rd floor with a balcony that opens up to the ocean breeze. It has a large living area of 100sqm open plan design so you can arrange your furniture freely. The kitchen and dining room are connected facing the floor to ceiling windows. The apartment was refurbished with new carpet and freshly painted walls. All the residents need to enter from the gate with a key at the main entrance which is very safe and secure. The apartment contains 3 generous sized bedrooms with built in robes, bathroom with shower, bath & vanity. There is parking for one car direct access to the apartment. <br/><br/>Don\'t Miss Out!<br/>Contact us today to arrange a viewing and secure this fantastic rental opportunity.<br/><br/>For Inquiries:<br/>Contact Lynn at [REDACTED PHONE] or [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Information provided is deemed reliable but not guaranteed. Prospective te