tops, double shower and a private toilet.<br/><br/>Adjacent to the heart of the home is the home theatre is the perfect place to take in all the latest series, blockbusters and indulge in a passion for live sport on the big screen.<br/><br/>The rear wing is ideal for children or guests and features three generously sized bedrooms, built in robes and quality curtains. A central activity area provides flexibility for study, play or relaxation.<br/><br/>Escape to your own private sanctuary and step outside to discover a haven designed for relaxation. This inviting alfresco area beckons you with its reticulated grass. Imagine entertaining friends and family or simply unwinding after a long day in this tranquil setting.<br/><br/>The estate offers an array of local parklands and enjoys close proximity to the Cockburn Aquatic and Recreation Centre, a junior BMX track, family playgrounds, a dog adventure playground, barbecue facilities, Treeby Primary School, Cockburn Gateway Shopping Centre, Cockburn Central Train Station and the freeway. It truly does not get any better than this.<br/><br/>This immaculately presented home ticks all the boxes and will not last long. To find out more, please contact agent Luke Langford on [REDACTED PHONE] or [REDACTED EMAIL]','house','Treeby',-32.11761914,115.88191502,6164,'WA','26 Sapphire Drive','Treeby',2,4,2,'Ascent Property Co - SUCCESS','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Shed, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Living Areas: 2, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning, Rumpus Room, Toilets: 2'),(5022,'UNDER APPLICATION',620,'A Quiet Osborne Park Oasis<br/><br/>Set in a small popular complex in a great location, this well-presented two-bedroom villa delivers easy-care living and suburban tranquility, only moments from Robinson Reserve, The Western Australian Golf Club, Herdsman Lake Regional Park, quality schooling including Osborne Park Primary, convenient shopping at D