ng Highway offers a surprising amount of space and privacy. This two-story home is much larger than it looks from the outside, with over 260m² of living area.<br/><br/>The ground floor is mostly open-plan, featuring polished floors and a kitchen with stone bench tops and gas cooking. There is a separate theatre room for movies and a fourth bedroom that works well as a home office.<br/><br/>Upstairs, the master bedroom is very generous with a large walk-in robe and a big ensuite. The other bedrooms are well-sized and share a central bathroom.<br/><br/>Property Highlights:<br/><br/>Ducted reverse-cycle air conditioning throughout.<br/><br/>Private, easy-care courtyard with timber ceilings.<br/><br/>Double garage with internal \"shopper\'s entry.\"<br/><br/>Secure gated entry and alarm system.<br/><br/>Walking distance to Penrhos, Como Primary, and local cafes.<br/><br/>A solid, low-maintenance home in a great spot—ideal for anyone looking for a bit more breathing room and a quiet place to call home.','house','Como',-31.99564943,115.86459944,6152,'WA','2/361 Canning Highway','Como',2,4,2,'Bellcourt Property Group - MOUNT LAWLEY','Garage: 2, Toilets: 3'),(5045,'Spacious 4x2 Family Home in Prime Scarborough Location',1200,'Welcome to 147 Duke Street, Scarborough - a beautifully presented 4x2 family home offering two living areas, modern updates, and relaxed coastal living in a highly sought-after location.<br/><br/>Situated in the heart of Scarborough, this spacious residence combines comfort, practicality, and lifestyle convenience just moments from beaches, parks, schools, and local amenities.<br/><br/>What you\'ll love about this gem:<br/>- 4 bedrooms, 2 renovated bathrooms<br/>- Highly polished wooden flooring throughout<br/>- Master bedroom with ensuite and built-in robe <br/>- Two separate living areas for flexible family living<br/>- Open-plan kitchen, dining, and living space<br/>- Large 5-burner Westinghouse stove/oven combo<br/>- Stainless Steel Bosch dishwashe