en designed for comfort and versatility. <br/><br/>The stylish kitchen with a brand-new gas cooktop is perfect for creating culinary delights, while the sunroom with garden views and the expansive alfresco entertaining area offers ideal spaces for relaxing or hosting. <br/><br/>With a large, secure yard, abundant parking, and state-of-the-art security, this home caters effortlessly to both family living and entertaining. <br/><br/>Key Features To Love: <br/>• Stunning character features: ornate fireplaces, polished timber floors, and decorative ceilings <br/>• Grand entrance hallway leading to multiple living areas <br/>• Multiple living areas, including a sunroom with backyard views <br/>• Updated kitchen with brand-new gas cooktop, stainless steel appliances, dishwasher and built-in pantry<br/>• Lounge room with feature fireplace <br/>• 3 generous bedrooms, two with built-in robes & bedroom 2 with feature fireplace <br/>• 2 modern bathrooms, including a stylishly renovated main bathroom <br/>• Large undercover alfresco entertaining area with hardwood panelling and motorised café shade blinds<br/>• Lock-up garage and drive-through carport with parking for up to 5 cars <br/>• Secure yard with manual front gate<br/>• Split system wall systems and ceiling fans <br/><br/>Perfectly positioned between the city and the coast, this home is surrounded by convenience and lifestyle. Enjoy proximity to West Lakes Shopping Centre, pristine beaches, and quality schools, with public transport options at your doorstep. <br/><br/>Whether you\'re relaxing in the alfresco area or exploring the vibrant local community, this home offers an unbeatable combination of charm, functionality, and location.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: <br/>Any prospective purchaser should not rely solely on 3rd party information providers to confirm the details of this property or land and are advised to enquire directly with the agent in order to review the certificate of title and local government details provided