tifully updated home offering modern comfort, space, and convenience in a highly sought-after central location between the city and the sea.<br/><br/>This well-presented residence features light-filled open plan living, complemented by a quality kitchen complete with breakfast bar, dishwasher, and ample storage, making everyday living and entertaining effortless. The stylish, modern bathroom has been tastefully updated, while three generously sized bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, with the master bedroom featuring built-in wardrobes.<br/><br/>Designed for easy living, the home includes reverse cycle air conditioning for year-round comfort, solar system, secure full fencing, and the added peace of mind of an automatic electric gate. There is ample off-street parking for multiple vehicles, plus a fantastic undercover entertaining area overlooking a spacious rear yard - perfect for relaxing, entertaining friends and family, or giving kids room to play.<br/><br/>Ideally positioned in a convenient lifestyle location, you\'ll enjoy being just minutes from major shopping centres, quality schools, public transport options, and key amenities, with quick access to both Adelaide CBD and the coastline.<br/><br/>A modern, move-in ready home offering comfort, security, and location - this is an excellent rental opportunity not to be missed.<br/><br/>AVAILABLE: NOW<br/>LEASE TERM: 12 MONTHS<br/>HOW TO APPLY: REALESTATE.COM.AU (APPLY)<br/>WATER CHARGES: TENANT RESPONSIBLE FOR SUPPLY AND USAGE.<br/>INSPECTION: OPEN INSPECTIONS WILL BE AVAILABLE FOR ALL TO ATTEND<br/>EXCLUSIONS: N/A<br/><br/>Fourth Avenue Real Estate is committed to providing the most accurate information possible for this advertisement. However, we cannot guarantee the complete accuracy of this information. We encourage all interested parties to personally inspect the property and seek independent advice before making any decisions.','house','South Plympton',-34.98101450,138.56095213,5038,'SA','10 John Street','South Plympton',1,3,2,'Fourth Avenue Real Estate','Open Spaces: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(5050,'Refurbished Modern 3x1 Villa in quiet location of Yokine',800,'Nicci McKiever from Professionals Carroll Property Group is pleased to present Villa 2/74 Spence Ave Yokine - a functional Three-bedroom, one-bathroom home located in a quiet street in the sort after suburb of Yokine , close to a range of local amenities.<br/><br/>This home has many features which include: <br/>-Separate front lounge room complete with ducted air conditioning<br/>-Brand new carpets in all bedrooms , and new sunshade and block out blinds Plus Roller shutters to main windows <br/>-Well-appointed open plan kitchen featuring a gas cooktop, generous bench and cupboard space, oven, and dishwasher<br/>-Meals and family room with split system air conditioning heating and cooling <br/>-Three generously sized bedrooms, all filled with natural light and ducted air conditioning <br/>-Fully tiled central bathroom with single vanity, shower and bathtub<br/>-Functional laundry with bench and sink, plus a separate WC<br/>-Linen cupboard providing additional storage<br/>-Enclosed courtyard <br/>-Secured lock up remote controlled garage <br/>-Low maintenance garden with reticulation.<br/>-Solar panels installed <br/>-Freshly painted throughout <br/><br/><br/>Conveniently positioned moments from to Mirrabooka Square and Dianella Shopping Centre , Easy access to Reid Highway, , public transport, and surrounded by parks, and community facilities.<br/><br/>To View The Property:<br/>- For expressions of interest, please send through an enquiry to receive an email to register your attendance for any upcoming home opens.<br/>- Please register to attend inspections. Registering ensures you will be immediately notified of any updates, cancellations, or changes to scheduled times.<br/><br/>How To Apply:<br/>- To apply for this property, simply enquire or attend an inspection, and we will provide you with a link to apply.<br/>- We accept applications via 2Apply and the Tenant App only.<br/>- Applications will be processed once you have attended a home open.<br/><br/>Please contact Nicci now for more information!','house','Yokine',-31.90391000,115.86639000,6060,'WA','2/74 Spencer Ave','Yokine',1,3,1,'Professionals Carroll Property Group','Courtyard, Garage: 1, Remote Garage, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Toilets: 2'),(5051,'TO REGISTER YOUR INTEREST, PLEASE CLICK \'\'BOOK INSPECTION\' OR \'EMAIL AGENT!',550,'Situated on a generous 916sqm block, this charming period-style home beautifully blends the elegance of yesteryear with thoughtful contemporary updates, offering both character and comfort.<br/><br/>Upon entry, you are welcomed into a lounge at the front of the home, where timber floors and an abundance of natural light create a warm and inviting atmosphere. The separate kitchen and meals area offer a functional and comfortable space for daily living, featuring electric cooking, ample cabinetry and an iconic Metters Canberra Wood Oven, a true centerpiece for anyone passionate about cooking.<br/><br/>The home accommodates three well proportioned bedrooms, with the main bedroom at the front of the house enjoying generous dimensions and plentiful natural light. The rear bedrooms are equally inviting and share a stylish bathroom featuring a freestanding bath, separate shower, vanity and a separate powder room for convenience. A practical laundry and generous storage throughout ensure everyday living remains organised and clutter-free.<br/><br/>Step outside to discover the oversized backyard, perfect for outdoor entertaining, family gatherings. The gravel driveway leads to a double garage, with extra space alongside for additional vehicles, caravans or trailers.<br/><br/><br/>Features:<br/>Hardwood floors<br/>Kitchen with ample storage<br/>600mm electric cooktop and oven<br/>Metters Canberra Wood Oven<br/>Three bedrooms<br/>Bathroom with freestanding bath<br/>Separate powder room<br/>Ducted heating and cooling<br/>Double car garage<br/>Laundry<br/><br/><br/>Conveniently positioned close to local schools, parks, and shops, this home offers a rare combination of timeless charm, functional living and future growth potential, a truly compelling opportunity in today\'s market.<br/><br/>Queanbeyan is approximately a 20 minute drive to Canberra City, 20 minute drive to Woden, 15 minute drive to HQJOC, 10 minute drive to Canberra Airport & a 15 minute drive to the parliamentary triangle.<br/><br/>To view this property you must register your attendance.<br/>You can do this by clicking on the Book Inspection button or by clicking on the link we send you when you enquire. Please note you are unable to apply for the property until you have attended the open home. A friend or family member is able to attend the open home on your behalf.<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Whilst White Rhino Property have diligently and conscientiously gathered details regarding each property for lease to ensure it is as current and as accurate as possible, we accept no responsibility for any inaccuracies or misstatements. All applicants should rely on their own research to confirm any information provided.<br/><br/>','house','Queanbeyan',-35.36056717,149.22890189,2620,'NSW','4 Karabar Street','Queanbeyan',1,3,2,'White Rhino Property - QUEANBEYAN / GOOGONG','Garage: 2, Air Conditioning'),(5052,'Cozy Charming Flat!',640,'This 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom home with modern design with comfort and convenience. Ideally situated in the heart of Cloverdale, you\'ll have effortless access to schools, parks, shopping centers, and major transport routes, making it the perfect place to call home.<br/>How does that sound? Let me know if you\'d like to tweak anything further!<br/><br/><br/><br/>Features:<br/>- Open-plan living and dining area with sleek floorboards<br/>- Modern kitchen with ample storage and quality appliances<br/>- Air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>- Two well-sized bedrooms with built-in wardrobes<br/>- Separate laundry <br/>- Low-maintenance courtyard – perfect for relaxation<br/>- Utility bills - Rent is at $640 per week and plus $22 per tenant as it is included gas, water and electricity usage. <br/><br/>Location:<br/>- Few nearby schools within 4KM distance<br/>- Walking distance to Belmont Park and Forster Park<br/>- 1.7 km to Belmont Forum<br/>- 4.4 km to Costco Airport<br/>- 5 km to DFO<br/>- 5.5 km to Perth International Airport<br/>- 10.5 km to Perth City<br/>- 17 km to Murdoch University<br/>- 18 km to University of WA<br/>- 8 km to Optus Stadium<br/>- Easy access to Abernethy Road, Leach Highway, Tokin Highway, Great Eastern Highway<br/><br/><br/>Available from 05/03/2026<br/>Lease: Minimum 12 months<br/><br/>For more information or to view this home, please contact S Class Property Group on [REDACTED PHONE] or email [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>','flat','Cloverdale',-31.97198655,115.94803268,6105,'WA','6A Tighe Street','Cloverdale',1,2,2,'S Class Property Group - WILLETTON','Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Built-in Wardrobes, Floorboards, Split-system Air Conditioning, Split-system Heating');
INSERT INTO `data` VALUES (5053,'A fantastic offering',725,'**Please note, the ensuite has been renovated prior to the photos being taken, updated ensuite photo coming soon**<br/><br/>Nestled in this highly desirable pocket of Lower Mitcham you will enjoy all the convenience that this wonderful location has to offer. You will appreciate the space, and features this home offers. <br/><br/>The home has a spacious floorplan offering 3 generous bedrooms, the master with its own walk in robe, and ensuite. The formal lounge is flooded with natural light with a Northerly aspect. The well-equipped kitchen has a host of cupboards and appliances including dishwasher. You will entertain friends and family in either the main open plan living or take the party outside under the paved undercover entertaining area overlooking the rear yard.<br/><br/>Extra features:<br/>- Ducted reverse cycle heating and cooling<br/>- Bay window to the master bedroom<br/>- Automatic Irrigation system<br/>- Only 7.4kms to the CBD<br/>- Garage with automatic roller door and direct indoor access<br/>- Garden shed<br/><br/>Just moments from great schools including Scotch College, Mercedes College (International Baccalaureate), Urrbrae High School, Unley High School and Mitcham Primary. Within close reach of the Torrens Arms and Edinburgh Hotels as well as outstanding shopping and Wallis Cinema complex at the Mitcham Square Shopping Centre. Easy public transport with the Belair line train and convenient buses. If you are looking for the perfect combination of location and lifestyle it doesn\'t get any better than this!<br/><br/>For more information please contact Alisha Francis on [REDACTED PHONE] or [REDACTED EMAIL] and head to www.apply.toop.com.au to apply for the property.<br/><br/>Rental Terms:<br/>Property is unfurnished<br/>Lease term: 12 months or longer upon enquiry<br/>No Exclusions<br/><br/>Rates and Charges - Tenants to pay: <br/>All water usage & supply charges<br/>Electricity<br/>Gas <br/><br/>The landlord has not advertised, does not intend to advertise and has not entered into an existing sales agency agreement for the sale of the premises.','house','Lower Mitcham',-34.98448930,138.60620101,5062,'SA','45 Catherine Street','Lower Mitcham',2,3,2,'TOOP+TOOP PROPERTY MANAGEMENT - (RLA 301302)','Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1'),(5054,'Brand New Four Bedroom Home in Baldivis',700,'Ray White Rockingham Baldivis are proud to present this brand new home in Baldivis which offers high quality inclusions, four bedrooms, two bathrooms and a separate theatre room. The property is located in close proximity to shops, local primary schools, parklands and is just a short drive to the freeway.<br/><br/>Property features include:<br/><br/>• Primary Suite with WIR and ensuite shower room with WC<br/>• Three further generous sized minor bedrooms with built in robes<br/>• Open plan living/dining/family area<br/>• Kitchen with island bench and stainless steel appliances <br/>• Theatre Room<br/>• Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning throughout<br/>• Double garage<br/>• Covered alfresco<br/>• Low maintenance gardens (landscaping and fencing to be completed soon)<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE<br/><br/>Applications are accepted and encouraged prior to viewing the property. The application form link will be sent to you as soon as you enquire about this property.<br/><br/>IMPORTANT - if you do not register online, we cannot notify you of any upcoming inspections, time changes or cancellations to inspections.<br/><br/>Please note, we do not accept 1form applications.','house','Baldivis',-32.31432359,115.82834166,6171,'WA','2 Gunbower Circuit','Baldivis',2,4,2,'Douglas Corby - Ray White Rockingham Baldivis','Garage: 2, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(5055,'Freshly Painted - Family Living!',790,'Welcome to 35 Madrona Crescent, Greenwood - a spacious four-bedroom, two-bathroom home that has just been freshly painted and is ready for its next chapter. If you\'re looking for comfort, space and practicality in a family-friendly location, this one deserves a spot at the top of your list.<br/><br/>Step inside to find a separate lounge for relaxing evenings, a formal dining area perfect for hosting, kitchen with ample cupboard space overlooking a light-filled meals area - ideal for busy mornings and casual family dinners.<br/><br/>Features you\'ll love:<br/><br/>- Freshly painted throughout<br/>- Four well-sized bedrooms<br/>- Master bedroom with built-in robe<br/>- Built-in robes to bedrooms 3 & 4<br/>- Two bathrooms for added convenience<br/>- Air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>- Spacious laundry<br/>- Double lock-up garage<br/><br/>Outside, enjoy a fantastic pergola area with a separate sitting space - perfect for weekend BBQs or winding down after a long day. The easy-care native gardens, plus there\'s a handy garden shed for extra storage.<br/><br/>Located in sought-after Greenwood, close to parks, schools, shopping and transport, this home offers practical family living in a super convenient setting.<br/><br/>WANT TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY? Simply click the BOOK INSPECTION button and you will immediately be able to see and book into any available viewing times. (if a date isn\'t currently available you will receive an SMS and Email as soon as it\'s available to view)<br/><br/>To ensure a smooth viewing and application process, please note the following:<br/>1- Please ensure you register to view (note; all attending parties MUST be registered)<br/>2- If a viewing is not available then please be patient, we will notify you as soon as a time becomes available.<br/>3- Upon viewing, you will be provided with a flyer on how to apply via the Tenant Options website where applications are to be submitted electronically<br/>4- Our application processing team will keep you updated on the progress and outcome of your application - please keep in mind that it can take 24-48 working hours to process when many applications are received. We suggest giving your references a heads up that we may be in touch - this will help expedite the process!<br/><br/>PROPERTY OWNERS/INVESTORS - PARTNER WITH A PROPERTY MANAGER YOU CAN TRUST<br/>Looking for professional, stress-free property management? Jane Hobson at Harcourts Alliance is here to help. Whether you\'re after expert advice or just exploring your options, feel free to get in touch for a confidential, no obligation conversation.<br/>[REDACTED PHONE] | [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/><br/><br/><br/>','house','Greenwood',-31.82326000,115.79536000,6024,'WA','35 Madrona Crescent','Greenwood',2,4,2,'Harcourts Alliance - JOONDALUP','Garage: 2'),(5056,'92 Hurcombe Crescent, Port Augusta West',450,'Fresh, modern and move-in ready, this beautifully updated 3-bedroom home offers comfort, space and practicality for the whole family.<br/><br/>Recently refreshed throughout, the property features fresh paint, brand new floor coverings and stylish new window furnishings, creating a bright and welcoming feel from the moment you step inside. All three bedrooms are well-sized.<br/><br/>A separate lounge provides a quiet retreat to relax, while the modern kitchen is well-appointed with ample cupboard and bench space, perfectly positioned adjacent to the dining area for easy everyday living and entertaining.<br/><br/>Adding to the versatility of the home is a fully lined rumpus room/teenage retreat – ideal as a second living space, games room, home office or private sanctuary for growing families.<br/><br/>Step outside to enjoy the undercover entertaining area, perfect for weekend BBQs and gatherings with friends. The large undercover carport offers excellent vehicle accommodation, while the low-maintenance gardens ensure more time enjoying the home and less time on upkeep. Also with the added bonus of solar to help reduce energy costs,','house','Port Augusta West',-32.46876261,137.74871274,5700,'SA','92 Hurcombe Crescent','Port Augusta West',1,3,4,'Port Augusta First National - Port Augusta (RLA 201493)','Garage: 4, Living Areas: 2'),(5057,'Freshly Renovated Studio Apartment',400,'Experience modern living in this beautifully renovated studio apartment, now with brand new flooring throughout and equipped with new appliances including a dishwasher. Perfectly located in the heart of Curtin, this home combines convenience, comfort, and lifestyle.<br/><br/>FEATURES: <br/>* Freshly renovated studio with brand new appliances, including dishwasher<br/>* New flooring installed throughout<br/>* Highly connected lifestyle - easy access to public transport and major roads<br/>* Less than a 15-minute drive to both Woden and City shopping precincts<br/>* Just a 5-minute stroll to Curtin Shopping Square, with village-style cafés and amenities<br/><br/>This property is ideal for anyone seeking a stylish, low-maintenance home in a prime location.<br/><br/>12 Month Lease<br/><br/>The property has a valid exemption and is not required to comply with the minimum ceiling insulation standard.<br/><br/>EER Unknown<br/><br/>TO INSPECT THIS PROPERTY<br/>1. You can Register to join an existing inspection or Register to be notified when inspection times are available.<br/>2. Click on the BOOK INSPECTION button and choose your inspection time.<br/>3. If this listing does not have the BOOK INSPECTION button, please go to Belconnen.ljhooker.com.au to Register.<br/>4. If you do not Register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations, or future inspection times.<br/>PETS: Please be aware that at all stages of your tenancy this property requires consent to be sought from the property owner for the keeping of any pets at the property. Consent must be provided before any pets are on the property.<br/><br/>Disclaimer<br/>Information contained herein is gathered from external sources we consider to be reliable.<br/>Whilst all care has been taken regarding all information compiled for this rental advertisement LJ Hooker Belconnen does not give any guarantee or warranty about the information provided and does not accept responsibility and disclaims all liabilities as to any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We advise prospective tenants to rely on their own investigations and in-person inspections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.','studio','Curtin',-35.32529512,149.08060381,2605,'ACT','70/3 Waddell Place','Curtin',1,1,2,'LJ Hooker - Belconnen',NULL),(5058,'The Only Way Is Up',700,'Welcome to 15 Uppingham Way, where modern comfort meets coastal convenience in the vibrant community of Butler. This stunning 4 bedroom family home is available now, unfurnished and ready for you to make your own. Perfectly positioned on a lovely street and boasting a great 430sqm block. <br/> <br/>What We Love: <br/>- Near new home with modern and neutral finishes. <br/>- Private master bedroom with walk in robe and ensuite bathroom. <br/>- The 3 additional bedrooms and shared bathroom provide ample space to suit your lifestyle. <br/>- Ducted split system air-conditioning provides essential cooling comfort throughout the home. <br/>- The light filled open plan kitchen, dining and living area is an entertainers dream. <br/>- Theatre room, parents retreat or kids chill out room! <br/>- Two dedicated parking spaces within your double lock-up garage. <br/>- Outdoor space for entertainment or relaxation with secure perimeter fencing. <br/> <br/>Location Highlights: <br/>- Nearby Butler Central Shopping Centre offers a range of shopping and dining options. <br/>- Beach Access: Pristine beaches are just a short drive away, perfect for swimming, surfing, or relaxing. <br/>- Parks & Recreation: Numerous parks and recreational facilities in the area are ideal for picnics, sports, or leisurely strolls. <br/>- Public Transport: Butler Train Station nearby provides convenient access to Perth CBD and beyond. <br/> <br/>What We Know: <br/>Available from 20th Mar\'26<br/>Unfurnished. <br/>Pets considered under application. <br/> <br/>To view this property: <br/>1. Please book an inspection from the website <br/>2. You\'ll receive a text or email to a book a viewing, please click the link and follow the prompts <br/>3. You\'ll receive a text or email confirming that you\'re registered to attend the next available viewing time <br/> <br/>Please note if you do not confirm your registered attendance and you were the only inquiry then the viewing may not go ahead. <br/> <br/>Please be advised that, while offers are considered, our clients are encouraged to accept the best quality application based on positive rental history, employment status, personal references and affordability.','house','Butler',-31.64007966,115.70326381,6036,'WA','15 Uppingham Way','Butler',2,4,2,'Realmark Urban - LEEDERVILLE','Garage: 2, Toilets: 2'),(5059,'Private Oasis only 4 minutes from the Sea',380,'APPLY VIA www.tenantoptions.com.au<br/><br/>New 2 bedroom home with charming appeal on half an acre<br/>Located only 4 minutes away from popular fishing town of Port MacDonnell <br/>Kitchen with electric oven and gas cooktop <br/>Lounge with slow combustion wood heating<br/>Collective bathroom and laundry with shower, toilet, vanity, sink and linen press<br/>Double garage with workshop and additional storage including concrete and power<br/>Proximity to Allendale East Area School (Reception to year 12)<br/>Pets negotiable <br/>Bore water only<br/>Available mid March 2026<br/>Applications prior to inspection <br/> <br/>Contact Jessie Gosden [REDACTED PHONE]<br/>','house','Allendale East',-38.00094593,140.70839537,5291,'SA','4 William Street','Allendale East',1,2,2,'Miller Whan & John Pty Ltd - Mount Gambier (RLA 65651)','Garage: 2, Secure Parking, Shed, Open Fireplace, Toilets: 1, Pets Allowed'),(5060,'Coastal Living Just Steps from the Beach!',570,'Positioned just one street back from the beach, this well-presented three-bedroom, one-bathroom home offers the perfect combination of relaxed coastal living and everyday convenience. Enjoy an easy stroll to local shops, cafés, restaurants, and schools, everything you need right at your doorstep.<br/><br/>Inside, the home features a spacious open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area designed for comfortable family living. The large kitchen is well-equipped with gas cooking appliances, a dishwasher, and ample bench and storage space, making meal preparation a breeze.<br/><br/>The main bedroom includes a semi-ensuite with an impressive oversized bath, perfect for unwinding at the end of the day, along with the convenience of a second, separate water closet for added functionality. The versatile front room offers flexibility to suit your lifestyle and can be used as a lounge, home office, or both, complete with a built-in study desk.<br/><br/>Step outside to a generous paved patio area, ideal for entertaining family and friends all year round. The property also includes a double carport, electric hot water system, garden shed, and easy-care gardens for low-maintenance living.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>Three bedrooms, one bathroom with semi-ensuite<br/>Second separate water closet<br/>Spacious open-plan living and dining<br/>Large kitchen with gas cooking and dishwasher<br/>Built-in study desk to front multi-purpose room<br/>Tiled flooring throughout<br/>Generous paved outdoor entertaining area<br/>Double carport<br/>Electric hot water system<br/>Garden shed<br/><br/>This home offers an excellent coastal lifestyle opportunity in a highly convenient location.<br/><br/>If you would like to know more about the property please contact 6383 7444 or click on contact agent to email your enquiry.<br/><br/>Please go directly to book your inspection or to register to join an existing inspection.<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE if you are not registered online we cannot notify you of any time changes or cancellations to inspections.<br/><br/>Please be aware you are not permitted to enter the premises without a Jones & Co Property representative accompanying you','house','Two Rocks',-31.49159000,115.58428000,6037,'WA','5 Gretel Court','Two Rocks',1,3,2,'Jones & Co Property - Yanchep','Carport: 2, Pets Allowed'),(5061,'Spacious Family Home with Self-Contained Granny Flat.',790,'Positioned on a generous corner block in a nice pocket of Latham, this well-maintained and thoughtfully updated 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom home offers comfort, flexibility and plenty of space both inside and out. With multiple parking options and easy-care yards, this property is ideal for families seeking convenience and versatility.<br/><br/>The home features three well-sized bedrooms, all with near-new carpet, along with a comfortable living room also fitted with near-new carpet for added warmth and comfort. Two bedrooms include wardrobes, while the third offers flexibility for use as a bedroom, nursery or home office. Reverse cycle split system air conditioning services the living room and main bedroom, and ducted heating ensures every room stays warm through the cooler months.<br/><br/>The updated kitchen, fully renovated approximately two years ago, is modern and practical, offering induction cooking, ample bench space and generous storage. The adjoining dining room is a great size with excellent natural light, creating a welcoming space for family meals and entertaining. Updated cork flooring runs through the hallway, dining room and kitchen, adding both style and durability. A full-size laundry with additional storage further enhances the functionality of the home.<br/><br/>Step outside to enjoy the private front yard and welcoming porch that captures the morning sun - the perfect spot to enjoy a coffee and start your day. The corner block provides easy-to-maintain gardens and lawns, along with plenty of parking options for multiple vehicles.<br/><br/>Adding exceptional value is the separate, fully self-contained granny flat. Recently fully painted and featuring brand new floorboards, it includes its own full-size bathroom, kitchen, laundry, lounge room, bedroom and a separate storage room. This space is ideal for an elderly parent, a teenager wanting independence, extended family living, or even a private work-from-home setup.<br/><br/>Offering flexibility, comfort and modern updates in a convenient location, 2 Milford St, Latham presents a rare opportunity to secure a home with genuine dual-living potential.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>- Brand new carpet & flooring<br/>- Freshly painted throughout<br/>- Near new updated kitchen & quality appliances<br/>- Fireplace to main living area is non functional<br/>- Reverse cycle split system air conditioner to living & main bed<br/>- Gas ducted heating throughout<br/>- Large back garden shed<br/>- Brand new R6 ceiling insulation<br/>- Electric off-peak hot water<br/>- Front porch, nice & private for your morning coffee<br/>- Established landscaping and gardens<br/>- Close to ample greenspace, playgrounds, public transport and local schools<br/>- Short drive to Belconnen and Canberra CBD<br/><br/>No current EER<br/><br/>The property complies with the minimum ceiling insulation standard.<br/><br/>PETS: Please be aware that at all stages of tenancy this property requires consent to be sought from the lessor for the keeping of any pets at the premises. Consent must be provided before any pets are at the premises.<br/><br/>BPG Disclaimer: Whilst all care has been taken to ensure accuracy, the material and information contained are approximate only and no warranty can be given. Bastion Property Group does not accept responsibility and disclaim all liabilities regarding any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. You should not rely upon this material as a basis for making any formal decisions. We recommend all interested parties to make further enquiries.','house','Latham',-35.22181794,149.03891386,2615,'ACT','2 Milford Street','Latham',2,4,2,'Bastion Property Group - Canberra','Carport: 1, Open Spaces: 1'),(5062,'Spacious Living Packed With Solar & Water Savings!',950,'Bring your boat, ca