ly appreciated. Register your interest today to avoid missing out.','house','Baldivis',-32.34447431,115.81609321,6171,'WA','10 Arwon Street','Baldivis',2,4,2,'Resident Property','Garage: 2, Ensuite: 1, Toilets: 2'),(5081,'Perfect Family Home in Gordon',660,'This property is strategically located across from the Gordon Ovals, providing a perfect spot for recreational activities. Just a short drive away, you\'ll find the convenience of Lanyon Shopping Centre and Tuggeranong Town Centre, offering a plethora of shopping, dining, and entertainment options.<br/><br/>The modern kitchen is a chef\'s delight, boasting a sleek oven and plated cooktop, along with ample storage space for all your culinary essentials. The open-plan dining and living room, seamlessly connected to the kitchen, create a warm and inviting atmosphere.<br/><br/>This home offers three spacious bedrooms, each equipped with built-in robes. The large bathroom, features a full-length bath tub, a shower, mirrored cupboards, and a modern vanity. <br/><br/>Enjoy the seamless transition from indoor to outdoor living as the living/dining room opens onto the spacious covered back deck, providing the ideal setting for family gatherings or entertaining friends. Embrace the large backyard and a double lock-up garage, ensuring secure parking for your vehicles, adding an extra layer of convenience to this already remarkable property.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Convenient location to Gordon Ovals, Lanyon Shops and Tuggeranong Town Centre.<br/>- Modern kitchen with sleek oven and plated cooktop, along with ample storage space.<br/>- Open-plan living and dining room expanses off the kitchen and provides the perfect family hub<br/>- Three spacious bedrooms equipped with built-in robes<br/>- Main bathroom includes large bath tub, shower, mirrored cupboards and modern vanity.<br/>- Spacious deck connecting to the Living room for seamless indoor/outdoor living and perfect for entertaining<br/>- Large backyard with clothes line<br/>- 2 car lock-up garage perfect for storage<br/><br/>EER: 2.5<br/><br/>Insulation: The property is compliant with the minimum ceiling insulation standard <br/><br/>Additional Clauses:<br/>Lessor\'s consent required to keep animals on the premises<br/>Break of lease <br/>No Smoking<br/>Carpet Cleaning<br/><br/>To INSPECT this property...<br/>Please click on the \'Book Inspection\' button & register your details to receive further instructions on how to view the property. You must register to inspect this property to ensure we can notify you of any changes or cancellations. A private inspection of the home may be arranged for pre-approved applicants.<br/> <br/>To APPLY for this property...<br/>You will receive an email containing a link to apply after attending the open home. Applications can be received at any time, however, cannot be processed until you have viewed the property in person or online.<br/> <br/>Disclaimer: Distinct Properties does not request any payments prior to the finalisation and signing of an approved lease agreement. If you are approached by someone claiming to represent our company or property and asking for payment before this stage, please be aware that this is not a legitimate request, and you should not proceed with any transaction. We advise you to contact us immediately to report the incident. We cannot be held responsible for any payments made to unauthorized parties claiming to represent our company or property prior to the finalization and signing of an approved lease agreement.<br/> <br/>Please note that while all care has been taken regarding general information & marketing information compiled for this rental advertisement, Distinct Property Management does not accept responsibility & disclaims all liabilities regarding any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We encourage prospective tenants to rely on their own investigation & in-person inspections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.','house','Gordon',-35.46016580,149.08739559,2906,'ACT','12 Midge Street','Gordon',1,3,2,'Distinct Properties','Open Spaces: 2'),(5082,'You don\'t want to miss out on this one!',920,'This freshly painted unfurnished 2 bedroom executive apartment features light and bright open modern spaces with high ceilings and a very private front courtyard. With only 3 apartments on this level along with a shared open alfresco space, you can\'t get better than this. Get ready to live within walking distance to some of Subiaco\'s best shops, bars and restaurants. <br/><br/>ACCOMMODATION<br/>2 bedroom<br/>2 bathroom<br/>Open plan kitchen/dining/living<br/>Laundry in 2nd bathroom<br/>2 wc<br/><br/>PARKING<br/>1 x car bay in secure lock up garage<br/><br/>FEATURES<br/>Unfurnished <br/>Double-height ceilings to living area<br/>Timber floorboards<br/>Double glass doors to northerly courtyard from living area<br/>Kitchen with mixture of white gloss and timber look cabinetry<br/>Gas top cooking <br/>Built-in stainless steel wall oven and microwave<br/>Integrated fridge<br/>2 good-sized bedrooms both with built in robes <br/>Ensuite to master with stone floor tiles, white textured wall tiles, shower with semi-frameless shower screen, vanity and wc<br/>Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning throughout<br/><br/><br/>OUTSIDE FEATURES<br/>Direct lift access to apartment provides the ultimate security <br/>Entry through private paved courtyard with gas bayonet (for BBQ)<br/>Shared alfresco area<br/>Generous store room off garage<br/><br/>Available: 26 February 2026<br/>Lease Term: 12 months plus<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER<br/>TV is available for tenant use but will not be replaced if malfunctions- owner will remove from site <br/><br/>INCLUSIONS:<br/>Fridge<br/>Washing Machine <br/>Drier <br/><br/>LOCATION<br/>This apartment is elevated above the heart of the action with plentiful shops, cafes, galleries and amenities within a short walk. Hop over Thomas Street to get the free CAT bus around the