rimary School and nearby schooling options<br/>• Local parks, playgrounds, and walking tracks<br/>• Easy access to public transport and major road connections<br/>• Shopping, dining, and everyday essentials at nearby Harrisdale Shopping Centre<br/><br/>This home offers the perfect balance of lifestyle, comfort, and convenience in a high-demand location.<br/><br/>Homes in this pocket of Piara Waters lease quickly - enquire today to arrange your inspection.<br/><br/>HOW TO INSPECT & APPLY:<br/>Simply click \"INSPECT\" and fill out your information to register yourself for the next available inspection. If the advertised time doesn\'t suit, click \"REQUEST NEW INSPECTION TIME.\" After the home open, you will be sent a digital application link to complete. Please note, the property must be viewed in person prior to processing your application.<br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>','house','Piara Waters',-32.12729316,115.91122703,6112,'WA','18 Padua Road','Piara Waters',2,3,2,'Attree Real Estate','Garage: 2'),(5103,'Modern Family Living in the Heart of South Jerrabomberra',1350,'Welcome to 36 Speargrass Road, Tralee NSW 2620 — a modern with high end inclusions and beautifully appointed 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom home offering modern living and family comfort in the highly sought-after South Jerrabomberra Estate. Thoughtfully designed with quality finishes and positioned in a peaceful corner location, this home captures the perfect balance of luxury, practicality, and community lifestyle.<br/><br/>Set within Tralee’s most exciting new master-planned precinct, you’ll enjoy close access to upcoming parks, dining, and recreational amenities — all surrounded by natural beauty and open green spaces.<br/><br/>Key Features:<br/> - 4 spacious bedrooms, including a master suite with ensuite and walk-in robe<br/> - 3 stylish bathrooms with quality fixtures and contemporary design<br/> - Open-plan living and dining area with abundant natural light<br/> - Modern kitchen featuring stone benchtops, pre