r suite with built-in robe and private ensuite<br/>- Additional generously sized bedrooms with built-in storage<br/>- Central family bathroom servicing the upper level<br/>- Large upstairs lounge and games room providing fantastic breakout spaces<br/>- Balcony access offering a peaceful place to unwind and take in west-facing seaviews<br/>- Front balcony with seating area — perfect for a glass of wine while watching the sunset<br/> <br/>Resort-Style Outdoor Living<br/>Step outside and you are instantly transported into your own private holiday retreat.<br/><br/>The expansive alfresco entertaining area overlooks a sparkling in-ground swimming pool, creating the ultimate setting for summer gatherings. The detached pool room, complete with bar, makes entertaining effortless all year round.<br/><br/>This is a home where weekends will be spent poolside, evenings shared with friends under the alfresco, and everyday living feels like a getaway.<br/> <br/>Important Information:<br/>- Property is offered fully furnished – possibility to review.<br/>- Garage is excluded from the tenancy – possibility to review.<br/> <br/>Location & Lifestyle<br/>Situated in the highly sought-after coastal suburb of Hallett Cove, you’ll enjoy:<br/>- Just a 6-minute walk to Hallett Cove Beach, the popular Boatshed Café, and scenic coastal walking trails<br/>- Direct access to Hallett Cove Beach Railway Station with direct links to the city<br/>- Stunning coastal walks and cliff-top views<br/>- Easy access to Hallett Cove Shopping Centre for everyday convenience<br/>- Nearby quality schools and childcare options<br/>- Short drive to southern beaches and the McLaren Vale wine region<br/> <br/>Hallett Cove is renowned for its natural beauty, spectacular coastal views, strong community feel, and relaxed lifestyle — and this home places you right at the centre of it all.<br/> <br/>Opportunities to secure a fully furnished home of this scale and calibre are rare.<br/> <br/>Enquire today to experience