gned to be enjoyed with minimal effort.<br/><br/>The home is close to schools, parks, shopping centres and public transport, with easy access to major roads. Offering space, storage and a strong lifestyle.<br/><br/>Features You\'ll Love:<br/>- The front door opens to a welcoming lounge, full of natural light and enhanced by ceiling fans for a cool, comfortable atmosphere all year.<br/>- As you continue through the home you will find the dining area, providing a central hub for family meals and gatherings.<br/>- The recently remodeled open-plan kitchen features striking black marbled waterfall benchtops, ample preparation space, pot drawers, and generous storage, while offering easy access to all entertainment areas.<br/>- All internal bedrooms are well-sized, all featuring built-in robes and ceiling fans, offering comfort and practicality for the whole family.<br/>- The spacious bathroom includes a separate toilet, and the double-entry laundry provides convenient access from both the kitchen and hallway.<br/>- A versatile detached room offers the option to be used as a fourth bedroom or a rumpus, perfect for a home office, gym, or private retreat<br/>- The home is designed for year-round comfort, featuring reverse cycle heating and cooling throughout, with ceiling fans in every room to keep the space comfortable in all seasons.<br/>- The property includes a 2.3KW solar system, helping to reduce energy costs while providing an eco-friendly and efficient power solution for the home.<br/>- Stepping outside from the kitchen to the pitched gable-roof pergola, a fantastic space for entertaining all year round, complete with ceiling fans and newly installed patio blinds.<br/>- A massive two-bay shed/workshop with separate storage, along with multiple garden sheds, offers exceptional storage and workspace options.<br/>- The backyard features a well-maintained grass area with irrigation, additional shaded pergolas, and multiple outdoor spaces to relax or play.<br/><br/><br/>