,'Taylor',-35.15058655,149.10075403,2913,'ACT','13 Marjorie Matthews Street','Taylor',2,4,2,'Stone Gungahlin - GUNGAHLIN','Garage: 2, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Cooling, Ducted Heating'),(5122,'Banksii in the heart of Jamison- Furnished convenience',550,'PLEASE CLICK \'BOOK INSPECTION\' TO REGISTER & BE NOTIFIED OF UPCOMING INSPECTIONS<br/><br/>This chic furnished 1-bedroom apartment in the \'Banksii\' development sits directly opposite Jamison Plaza in an exceptionally livable location. Located in the heart of Macquarie, you have the absolute convenience of being moments from the variety of shopping, cafes and services on offer at the Jamison Shopping Centre, as well as only minutes to the Belconnen Town Centre and a short drive to Canberra City. Excellent schools, colleges, CISAC and Calvary hospital are all within proximity to this great home offering a central and convenient lifestyle.<br/><br/>The apartment itself is filled with natural light, floating oak timber floors to an open plan living area, adding to the refined colour scheme & tastefully furnished with all your basic furniture needs, for the ultimate in convenience. The sleek kitchen has a stone-look benchtop & splashback, electric cooking and dishwasher for quick cleanups. The inside flows beautifully outdoors through large glass sliding doors to your private balcony, the perfect space for enjoying the tree outlook & fresh air. Double-glazing, along with reverse-cycle air conditioning to the living and bedroom, ensures your year-round comfort, and lift access adds to the ease of living here.<br/><br/>The complex offers a rooftop terrace with sweeping views over the surrounding precinct and an internal atrium with a residents\' garden. <br/><br/>The location\'s unique position, directly opposite Jamison Shopping Centre, ensures you have access to Coles Supermarket, Aldi, Bakers Delight, a Pharmacy and the renowned Ricardo\'s... all just across the road. No compromise on style or location, i