iently Located across the road from \'Greenwood Village Shopping\". Close to parks & easy access to transport.<br/><br/>* 2min drive to Greenwood Primary School <br/>* 5min drive to Warwick Senior High School<br/>* 6min drive to Glengarry Private Hospital<br/>* 7min drive to Warwick train station<br/>* 10min drive to the beautiful beaches<br/>Don’t miss your chance to make it your new home!<br/><br/>WHAT ARE WE AFTER?:<br/>We are seeking amazing tenants with a great rental references who will treat this home as their own.<br/><br/>NEED HELP WIITH BOND?<br/>Need help with your bond? Did you know if you are an approved tenant with Investors Edge R/E you can pay your bond monthly with easyBondpay? Just ask us for details or visit www.easybondpay.com.au<br/><br/>***BOOKING A VIEWING IS EASY!!***<br/>1. Simply enter your details in the email agent section.<br/>2. State your availability to view in the comment section and we will be in touch when a home open is available.<br/>3. You are now able to apply after viewing the video walk through, however we also suggest driving by the property to ensure it is right for you.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: This information is provided for general information purposes only and may be subject to change. No warranty or representation is made as to its accuracy and interested parties should place no reliance on it and should make their own independent inquiries.','unit','Greenwood',-31.83043000,115.80246000,6024,'WA','25 Calectasia Street','Greenwood',1,3,1,'Investors Edge Real Estate - Perth','Garage: 1, Swimming Pool - Inground, Dishwasher, Split-system Heating'),(5202,'Golf Course Living with Pool and Solar',800,'Enjoy uninterrupted golf course views from this beautifully positioned home on sought-after Golf Course Island. Offering relaxed coastal living with generous indoor and outdoor spaces, this property is perfectly suited to families seeking lifestyle and convenience.<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>3 bedrooms plus study or optional 4