-floor master suite with private ensuite.<br/>- Split-system air conditioning to living areas and all bedrooms for year-round comfort.<br/>- Well-appointed kitchen with dishwasher.<br/>- North-facing, low-maintenance courtyard.<br/>- Double garage with additional driveway parking.<br/>- Attractive brick and weatherboard exterior with front-positioned design.<br/><br/>Situated in Nollamara, this home offers easy access to local parks, shopping precincts and public transport, with the Perth CBD just a short drive away. A thoughtfully designed residence combining character, comfort and convenience - ready for its next chapter.<br/><br/>To attend a viewing, please register your details via the inspection time(s) below. If no viewing times are available please email [REDACTED EMAIL] and [REDACTED EMAIL] from Caporn Young Property Management PTY LTD.<br/><br/>We are happy to arrange a virtual inspection, if you\'re unable to attend an open for inspection. Please send a text message via WhatsApp to the agent, and they will provide a video tour, subsequent to availability, as soon as possible.<br/><br/>These details are provided for information purposes only and do not form part of any contract and are not to be taken as a representation by the seller or their agent.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: <br/>The particulars of this listing have been prepared for advertising and marketing purposes only. We have made every effort to ensure the information is reliable and accurate, however, clients must carry out their own independent due diligence to ensure the information provided is correct and meets their expectations.','unit','Nollamara',-31.88236427,115.84799225,6061,'WA','315A Flinders Street','Nollamara',2,3,2,'Caporn Young Estate Agents','Garage: 2'),(5211,'Modern 3x2 Home in Prime Baldivis!',695,'Positioned in the heart of Baldivis, this well-presented 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home offers modern living with comfort and convenience.<br/><br/>The home features a spacious open plan living