hen prompted.<br/> <br/>As we are proactive at leasing properties, home open times are subject to change/cancel due to the property leasing quickly. If your details are registered, you will be notified of any changes. <br/>If you do not confirm your attendance, the viewing may not proceed. To help you secure a rental property, we invite you to hit the \'apply now\' button. Thank you.<br/><br/>Check out our other properties at www.markhay.com.au.','house','Southern River',-32.08785402,115.94632026,6110,'WA','10 Buncrana View','Southern River',2,3,2,'Mark Hay - East Perth','Courtyard, Garage: 2, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes'),(5215,'Brand New High-Spec Family Home in Byford Meadows Estate',750,'Unfurnished: Welcome to this brand new, beautifully finished 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom home with a dedicated theatre room, positioned within the sought-after Byford Meadows Estate.<br/><br/>Designed with quality and comfort in mind, this high-spec home showcases recessed ceilings, timber flooring to the main living areas, plush carpets to the bedrooms, and reverse-cycle air-conditioning throughout.<br/><br/>Located in the heart of Byford, Byford Meadows Estate offers a strong community feel with excellent convenience. Just 2km to Tonkin and South West Highways, 13km to the Kwinana Freeway, and approximately 35 minutes to Perth CBD, with Byford Town Centre only minutes away.<br/><br/>The estate features a future commercial village centre, an impressive 19,000m² parkland corridor with a proposed living stream, walking and cycling paths, a planned primary school, and close proximity to established shopping centres, schools, equine facilities, and sporting grounds.<br/><br/>Main Features:<br/>· Four spacious bedrooms<br/>· Master suite with walk-in robe and private ensuite<br/>· Built-in robes to minor bedrooms<br/>· Separate theatre room - perfect for movie nights or entertaining<br/>· Light-filled open-plan living and dining area<br/>· Stylish kitchen with gas cooktop, dishwasher & ample storage<br/>· Reverse-cycle air-conditioning throughout<br/>· Timber flooring to living areas & carpeted bedrooms<br/>· Easy-care front and backyard<br/>· Brand new home with modern, high-quality finishes<br/><br/><br/><br/>*** ARE YOU A LANDLORD? If you are looking for property management services, we would love to hear from you. Contact our Business Development Manager Ervina on [REDACTED PHONE] or [REDACTED EMAIL] for a no-obligation and confidential conversation.','house','Byford',-32.20679222,115.99166806,6122,'WA','12 Briggs Road','Byford',2,4,2,'Harcourts Property Specialists','Garage: 2, Air Conditioning, Dishwasher, Toilets: 2'),(5216,'Coming soon!',700,'Perfectly designed for comfort and low-maintenance living, this modern 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom home offers convenience and functionality in a growing, family-friendly community.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>3 spacious bedrooms with built-in robes<br/><br/>Contemporary bathrooms with quality fixtures<br/><br/>Light-filled open plan living and dining area<br/><br/>Modern kitchen with stainless steel appliances and ample storage<br/><br/>Split system air conditioning<br/><br/>Low-maintenance yard – easy care living<br/><br/>Secure parking <br/><br/>Located in a peaceful street in Baldivis, you’ll enjoy easy access to local schools, parks, shopping centres, and public transport, making daily living effortless.<br/><br/>This home is ideal for couples, small families, or professionals seeking a fresh, modern space to call home.','house','Baldivis',-32.36055033,115.82305150,6171,'WA','14 Verdant Approach','Baldivis',2,3,2,'Westcoast Property Sales','Garage: 1, Open Spaces: 1'),(5217,'Gorgeous character home with pool available mid March 2026!',1300,'Beyond the white fence sits this stunning character style 3x2 home. Perfectly situated in the highly sought after suburb of Mount Hawthorn you\'ll enjoy all the features this quality home has to offer while being walkin