ow-maintenance, easy-care living<br/><br/>Perfectly located - in walking distance to the primary school, allowing quick trips to nearby shops, cafés and easy access to stunning beaches. Plus, you\'re only a short drive to the heart of Perth CBD, making commuting simple while enjoying a quieter, park side setting.<br/><br/>WANT TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY? Simply click the BOOK INSPECTION button and you will immediately be able to see and book into any available viewing times. (if a date isn\'t currently available you will receive an SMS and Email as soon as it\'s available to view)<br/><br/>To ensure a smooth viewing and application process, please note the following:<br/>1- Please ensure you register to view (note; all attending parties MUST be registered)<br/>2- If a viewing is not available then please be patient, we will notify you as soon as a time becomes available.<br/>3- Upon viewing, you will be provided with a flyer on how to apply via the Tenant Options website where applications are to be submitted electronically<br/>4- Our application processing team will keep you updated on the progress and outcome of your application - please keep in mind that it can take 24-48 working hours to process when many applications are received. We suggest giving your references a heads up that we may be in touch - this will help expedite the process!<br/><br/>PROPERTY OWNERS/INVESTORS - PARTNER WITH A PROPERTY MANAGER YOU CAN TRUST<br/>Looking for professional, stress-free property management? Jane Hobson at Harcourts Alliance is here to help. Whether you\'re after expert advice or just exploring your options, feel free to get in touch for a confidential, no obligation conversation.<br/>[REDACTED PHONE] | [REDACTED EMAIL]<br/><br/>','unit','Balcatta',-31.86796000,115.82060000,6021,'WA','33A Eversley Street','Balcatta',1,1,1,'Harcourts Alliance - JOONDALUP','Open Spaces: 1, Split-system Heating, Toilets: 1'),(5219,'Holiday at home every day of the year!',780,'What we love<br/>We love that it’s a genuine house with a genuine-sized backyard; we love that it’s directly opposite beautiful Trigg bushland with miles of beaten walking trails to explore, and we LOVE that it’s mere minutes on foot to the white sands of spectacular South Trigg beach, with an underground pedestrian tunnel crossing West Coast Hwy to ensure the kids can get to and from their after-school surf safely!<br/><br/>This is true ‘holiday-at home’ living in a location brimming with lifestyle and adventure, convenience, nature and beauty. <br/><br/>What to know<br/>AT A GLANCE:<br/>Side-by-side duplex - one of only two<br/>Peaceful location directly opposite Trigg Bushland<br/>Elevated position with scenic bushland views<br/>Miles of bush trails at the door<br/>Minutes walk to South Trigg Beach via underground tunnel (under West Coast Hwy)<br/>3 bedrooms - large main bedroom with robes and split system air-conditioner<br/>Stylish renovated bathroom & separate toilet<br/>Open plan living and dining room with split system air-conditioning<br/>Modern kitchen with stainless steel appliances<br/>Separate combined pantry, fridge recess & laundry with excellent storage and outside access<br/>Generous undercover outdoor entertaining<br/>Large backyard with plenty of lawn and space to enjoy and scope to explore your green thumb!<br/>Storage shed and a garden shed<br/>Carport parking<br/>Polished timber floorboards throughout<br/>Solar panels reducing your utility bills!<br/><br/>Surrounded by quality homes, wonderful neighbours and relaxed coastal vibes.<br/>An easy walk to the beach and amidst Trigg Bushland’s natural greenery and the sweet sounds of birdsong…<br/>Immerse yourself in the unsurpassed beauty of the stunning northern beaches, explore for miles on foot or bike along the coast; surf, swim or snorkel the reefs, and bask in surroundings you’ll never tire of!<br/><br/> <br/>HOW TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY <br/>Arranging an inspection is easy!<br/>Simply click the \'Make an enquiry\' or \'email agent\' button for that rental property. You then enter your details and choose an inspection time that suits you. An instant registration email and/or text message will be sent to you. Confirm your attendance by selecting \'register\'<br/>PLEASE NOTE: If you do not register to attend we can\'t notify you of any changes or cancellations to open. An open will be cancelled if no one has registered to attend.<br/><br/>Please note due to excessive interest in the property Home Opens will be capped at 15 people for each Home Open so if you are not successful that means we are at capacity.<br/>Please still register and the next Home Open you will be advised accordingly of times.','unit','Karrinyup',-31.88203345,115.76140995,6018,'WA','117A Elliott Road','Karrinyup',1,3,1,'Haiven Property','Garage: 1'),(5220,'Million dollar location facing Hyde Park',620,'This property is a rare find, it is located in a boutique complex, on a peaceful street only footsteps from the beautiful Hyde Park. <br/><br/>It\'s an unfurnished charming two bedroom character unit featuring delightful views of Hyde Park, including water views from the master bedroom.<br/><br/>You can enjoy the sunshine on the balcony from this North facing unit and spend your weekends strolling through the quiet Hyde Park, and then head into the city to enjoy some nightlife with easy public transport. Buses are free! <br/><br/>Features include<br/>- North facing balcony <br/>- Open plan kitchen/living area<br/>- Hyde Park tree & water views from every room<br/>- Excellent location<br/>- Recent renovations<br/>- One car bay<br/>** Sorry, No Pets **<br/><br/>We would love to see you at our next Home Open. To book an inspection, please register your details through the “Book an Inspection” button and confirm your attendance when prompted.<br/> <br/>As we are proactive at leasing properties, home open times are subject to change/cancel due to the property leasing quickly. If your details are registered, you will 