y errors, omissions, inaccuracies or misstatements contained. Reference to a school does not guarantee availability of that particular school. All distances are estimated using Google maps. Prospective purchasers/tenants should make their own enquiries with the relevant authorities to verify the information contained in this advert. ALL boundary lines and size on imagery is APPROX only.**','house','Gosnells',-32.09021231,115.98323505,6110,'WA','4 Minilya Court','Gosnells',1,4,2,'Ray White BPG - THORNLIE','Carport: 2'),(5222,'Beautiful Family Home',800,'Unfurnished near new low maintenance family home overlooking green open space. <br/><br/>Three bedroom two bathroom family home with an open plan family / dining and kitchen. Kitchen has plenty of bench space, walk-in pantry, double ovens, gas cook top and dishwasher. Laundry has plenty of cupboards and there is a huge linen cupboard. All bedrooms have built-in robes and are carpeted. A separate lounge / tv area located at the front of the home. The home features solar panels, ducted reverse cycle air-con and ceiling fans throughout. Low maintenance and easy care gardens and artificial turf. <br/><br/>At the rear it is mostly paved with an undercover patio area leading from the family area, a great spot of outdoor entertaining. Double garage with direct access to the house and additional parking at the front.<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE - we do not accept online applications (1Form) - application forms will be available at the property at the time of the inspection. We also strongly suggest checking the website on the day of the home open to confirm that the property is still available and has not been leased. Advertised home opens are subject to change without notice.<br/><br/>For any enquiries or more information please contact Ray White Midland & Hills.<br/><br/><br/><br/>','house','Midvale',-31.87612687,116.03014108,6056,'WA','5 Marsland Road','Midvale',2,3,2,'Ray White - Midland & Hills','Garage: 2'),(5223,'The Ultimate City-Fringe Retreat in Mile End',650,'Perfectly positioned on the CBD’s doorstep, this stylish two-storey residence offers the ultimate blend of quality, convenience, and low-maintenance living. Whether you\'re a professional seeking an urban lifestyle or a family prioritising premium education, this home delivers.<br/><br/>Light-Filled Living<br/>The ground floor features an inviting open-plan living and dining area, accented by elegant plantation shutters. The modern kitchen is a chef’s delight, equipped with a gas cooktop, abundant storage, and a social breakfast bar. This level also includes a versatile third bedroom or home office—complete with split-system cooling—plus a large laundry and guest powder room.<br/><br/>Private Sanctuary<br/>Upstairs, two spacious bedrooms offer plush comfort and the luxury of walk-in wardrobes. They share a central bathroom featuring a full bathtub and dual-access layout for maximum practicality.<br/><br/>Relax and Entertain<br/>Step outside to a private, low-maintenance courtyard. The undercover alfresco area is designed for year-round enjoyment, while secure garaging and additional driveway parking provide effortless convenience.<br/><br/>A Blue-Chip Location<br/>Located in a highly sought-after Mile End pocket, you are minutes from the CBD, vibrant cafés, and local parks. Most importantly, this property is zoned for the prestigious Adelaide High School and Adelaide Botanic High School, making it a premier choice for education-focused residents.<br/><br/>Key Features:<br/>- Modern Kitchen: Gas cooking and ample bench space.<br/>- Climate Control: Multiple split-system air conditioners.<br/>- Flexible Layout: Downstairs bedroom/office plus two upstairs suites with walk-in robes.<br/>- Secure Parking: Lock-up garage plus off-street space.<br/>- Elite Schooling: Zoned for Adelaide’s top secondary schools.<br/><br/>Water charges: Tenant responsible for supply and usage<br/>Bond - $2,600<br/>Lease term -12 months<br/>Applications -