ive windows frame the courtyard outlook, capturing the light from the coveted north-easterly aspect. Ceiling-hung ripple-fold sheers & plush carpet underfoot add yet another layer of elegance & comfort. The sleek modern kitchen is superbly appointed with integrated appliances, including a dishwasher, microwave & fridge/ freezer. High-gloss cabinetry wraps the linear bench, complete with a ceramic cooktop and sculptural rangehood. <br/><br/>The beautiful main bedroom incorporates a bank of glossy built-in robes and a dressing table, a chic open design ensuite and a verdant outlook to the courtyard. The second bedroom/ study is a wonderful multipurpose space, with an integrated pull-down bed adding flexibility for guest accommodation, and easy access to the second bathroom and separate powder room. <br/><br/>Other premium features include a generous entrance foyer with coat storage, floor-to-ceiling tiling in the ensuite and bathroom, a separate laundry, ducted reverse-cycle air-conditioning, & basement parking with additional lock-up storage. With high-end finishes, sleek modern styling and a strong sense of quality throughout, this home delivers exceptional comfort and privacy. <br/><br/>The apartment enjoys proximity to Deakin Shopping Centre, the Royal Canberra Golf Club, Fitness First gym just 200 metres away, John James Medical Centre, Canberra Private Hospital, Lake Burley Griffin, and the Red Hill Reserve with its extensive walking trails.<br/><br/>Features of the property include;<br/><br/>Expansive executive style 2-bedroom ensuite ground floor appartment<br/>Ceiling hung ripple fold sheers throughout <br/>Besoke built in entertainment unit to living space <br/>Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning throughout <br/>Stunning kitchen with integrated appliances, including fridge/ freezer, dishwasher and microwave & a ceramic cooktop <br/>Expansive wrap-around terrace with covered alfresco area, sunny timber decking and pebbled garden beds <br/>Main bedroom showcases a bank of glossy built-in robes & a custom vanity area<br/>Dressing room style ensuite with walk in shower situated behind a large walled vanity with a vessel sink <br/>Main bathroom with walk in shower and a vessel sink atop wall hung vanity <br/>Separate powder room<br/>Separate laundry with washing machine and dryer<br/>Lush manicured complex gardens <br/><br/>Available: 27th February 2026<br/><br/>PETS:<br/>The tenant/s must seek landlord consent to keep pets at this property.<br/><br/>ENERGY EFFICIENCY RATING:<br/>There is no current energy efficiency rating for this property.<br/><br/>MINIMUM STANDARDS:<br/>The property is exempt from the minimum housing standards for insulation.<br/><br/>VITAL INFORMATION:<br/>The property is unfurnished<br/>Please note that we request no videos or photos be taken inside occupied properties<br/>Please note you may be required to remove your shoes prior to inspecting the property<br/><br/>WISH TO INSPECT:<br/>1. Click on \"BOOK INSPECTION\" if this listing does not have the \"BOOK INSPECTION\" button please go to raywhitecanberra.com.au website and register<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection, if no time is offered or if the time does not suit, please register and we will contact you once access is arranged<br/>3. If you do not register, we cannot notify you of any time changes, cancellations or further inspection times<br/><br/>RENT INFORMATION:<br/>1. Rent is collected fortnightly unless otherwise nominated for a longer period<br/>2. Bond required is equal to 4 weeks rent<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER:<br/>All information regarding this property is from sources we believe to be accurate, however we cannot guarantee its accuracy. Interested persons should make and rely on their own enquiries in relation to inclusions, figures, measurements, dimensions, layout, furniture and descriptions.','apartment','Deakin',-35.31381135,149.10706868,2600,'ACT','206/2 Grose Street','Deakin',2,2,1,'Ray White - Canberra','Carport: 1, Cou