/>This spacious, modern 4-bedroom home at 10 Stacy Street is the perfect family retreat. Boasting generous living spaces, a well-equipped kitchen, and an easy-care backyard, it’s ideal for those seeking comfort and convenience.<br/><br/>Inside, you’ll find four bedrooms with 3 bedrooms with built-in robes, including a master with its own ensuite. The open-plan living and dining areas flow seamlessly into the kitchen, which comes with gas cooking, a dishwasher, and plenty of storage space. The home is kept comfortable year-round with ducted heating and 1 split system in the lounge.<br/><br/>Enjoy the privacy of a large, low-maintenance backyard—great for relaxing or entertaining guests. Plus, the double garage offers plenty of space for your vehicles and additional storage.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>-4 spacious bedrooms , 3 bedroom with built-in robes.<br/>-Master bedroom with ensuite.<br/>-Open-plan living and dining area.<br/>-Modern kitchen with gas cooking, dishwasher, and ample storage.<br/>-Main bathroom with bath and shower.<br/>-Separate laundry.<br/>-Ducted heating and 1x split system.<br/>-Double garage along with double tandem carport which is gated (very secure).<br/>- Ample of parking for boats, trailers.<br/>-Large, low-maintenance backyard, ideal for entertaining.<br/>- Large covered deck.<br/><br/>Additional Features:<br/>-Close to local schools, parks, and shops<br/>-Easy access to public transport and main roads<br/>-Quiet, family-friendly neighborhood<br/>-Pets considered upon application<br/><br/>***** A small, partitioned area at the rear of the garage is retained by the owner for storage, and may need to be accessed occasionally, although in reality these occasions are rare ******<br/><br/>Bond and Rent:<br/>A bond equal to four weeks rent will be required before the commencement of the lease. Here at Archer Canberra, we accept rent weekly, fortnightly or monthly and our preferred payment method is direct debit.<br/><br/>When can I see the property?<br/>Saturday exhibition times will be advertised by close of business each Wednesday. Should the open time not suit, please register to view the property and you will be first to be advised once an open is booked. Alternatively, please call our dedicated leasing department to arrange a personal inspection. Please note – if the property isn’t advertised as ‘available now’ this usually means that the property is currently tenanted, making Saturday viewings all that we will have available until after this date.<br/><br/>Interested in applying for this property?<br/>After you register or view the property, you’ll receive a link and code from our leasing system<br/>https://www.2apply.com.au/Agency/Archer<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Whilst care has been taken in gathering details for properties for lease, we accept no responsibility for any inaccuracies herein. All applicants should rely on their own research to confirm any information provided.<br/><br/>Useful Information<br/>• A 12 month lease is the standard lease term – anything longer or shorter will be advertised or considered upon application.<br/>• It is our company policy to either view the property, or have someone view the property on your behalf before your application can be accepted.<br/>• This property meets the minimum ceiling insulation standard','house','Gowrie',-35.41657929,149.10350472,2904,'ACT','10 Stacy Street','Gowrie',2,4,3,'Archer Canberra','Carport: 1, Garage: 2'),(5306,'GREAT LOCATION WITH STYLISH, MODERN AND FULLY FURNISHED APARTMENT IN AN EXCEPTIONAL LIFESTYLE.',570,'***FULLY FURNISHED - Photos for layout illustration purposes only***<br/><br/>Perfectly established for city lovers who love a modern home in the heart of the sparkling city lights. This CBD apartment complex has the best facilities in town!<br/><br/>Bathed in light and luxurious home comforts, this stylish accommodation enjoys communal amenities for year-round enjoyment. Impress yourself and your guests with 5-star facilities such as the rooftop entertaining and barbecue area, gymnasium, infinity pool, on-site cinema, billiards room and business centre!<br/><br/>Apartment living in this location means an easy stroll to Chinatown, the Central Markets, public transport, restaurants, cafes and bars. City-based universities, shopping, theatres and sporting facilities are all within easy reach.<br/><br/>- Secure FOB access and intercom system<br/>- Bedroom with direct bathroom access, built-in robe, reverse cycle a/c<br/>- Spacious open plan living & dining area.<br/>- Premium in-line kitchen with stone benchtops, AEG stainless appliances, gas cooktop, dishwasher<br/>- Fully-tiled modern bathroom/ensuite with a wall-hung vanity, frameless shower<br/>- Ducted reverse cycle air conditioning<br/>- FULLY FURNISHED<br/>- NO pets allowed<br/>- Water usage & supply charges apply<br/>- 12 months lease term preferred.<br/><br/>To inspect this property, please click \'Book an Inspection Time\' and register. Once an inspection has been scheduled you will receive an automated email advising the date and time.<br/><br/>* Please complete the online application through 2Apply (Powered by InspectRealEstate) by clicking on \"Request Inspection\" or \"Get in Touch\". Both buttons will send an email with the link to submit your application. *<br/><br/>* Please note applications will not be processed until the property has been viewed in person.*<br/><br/>For further information please contact Aaron Wong [REDACTED PHONE]','apartment','Adelaide',-34.92844007,138.59309691,5000,'SA','617/152-160 Grote Street','Adelaide',1,1,2,'Belle Property Adelaide City','Balcony, Secure Parking, Swimming Pool - Above Ground, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Intercom, Furnished'),(5307,'Where Modern Design Meets Effortless Lifestyle!',560,'Discover contemporary comfort in this well-designed two bedroom apartment, ideally located in the thriving suburb of Denman Prospect. Offering a practical yet stylish layout, the residence features a light-filled open plan living and dining area that flows effortlessly into a modern kitchen, creating a welcoming space suited to both relaxation and entertaining.<br/><br/>The bedrooms are thoughtfully positioned to maximise privacy and functionality, each offering generous proportions and built-in storage. A sleek, modern bathroom and internal laundry provide everyday convenience, while parking adds an extra layer of practicality.<br/><br/>Set within a rapidly growing community, this home places you moments from local cafés, parks, walking trails, and essential amenities, with easy access to major transport routes. Combining low-maintenance living with a contemporary lifestyle, this apartment presents an excellent opportunity to enjoy the best of Denman Prospect.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>– Spacious living areas with high ceilings <br/>– Hybrid timber-look flooring <br/>– Smeg stainless steel kitchen appliances <br/>– Built-in wardrobes in bedrooms <br/>– 100% wool loop pile carpet in bedrooms<br/>– Full height tiling in bathrooms <br/>– Double glazed windows<br/>– Stone benchtops<br/>No current EER<br/><br/>This property has a valid exemption and is not required to comply with the minimum ceiling insulation standard.<br/><br/>This property is awaiting insulation information from the Owners Corporation.<br/><br/>This property does not have embedded network.<br/><br/>Suburb Snapshot <br/>Denman Prospect is a suburb currently under development in the Molonglo Valley district of Canberra, located within the Australian Capital Territory, Australia. It is named in honour of Lady Denman GBE, the wife of the fifth Governor-General of Australia, The Right Honorable The Lord Denman. The principal ceremonial occasion during Lady Denman\'s term as first lady was the inauguration of the Federal capital on 12 March 1913. Lady Denman stood upon the newly laid Foundation Stones and pronounced, \"I name the capital of Australia – Canberra\". The name Denman Prospect was selected to distinguish the locality from the town of Denman, New South Wales. The use of the suffix \'prospect\' meaning view, vision or the outlook for the future, is considered significant in the context of the naming of Canberra by Lady Denman and Lord Denman\'s ensuing visionary speech for the future of the capital.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: <br/>Please note that while all care has been taken regarding general information and marketing information compiled for this rental advertisement, LJ HOOKER CANBERRA CITY does not accept responsibility and disclaim all liabilities in regard to any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We encourage prospective tenants to rely on their own investigation and in-person inspections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.<br/><br/>PETS: <br/>Please be aware that at all stages of tenancy this property requires consent to be sought from the lessor for the keeping of any pets at the premises. Consent must be provided before any pets are at the premises.<br/><br/>RENTING BOOK:<br/>https://www.justice.act.gov.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0008/2443472/Renting-Book-May-2024.pdf','apartment','Denman Prospect',-35.29486724,149.02235574,2611,'ACT','J120/3 Carden Street','Denman Prospect',1,2,1,'LJ Hooker - Canberra City','Garage: 1, Air Conditioning, Dishwasher'),(5308,'Family Living in the heart of Woodbridge',1400,'Nestled in a peaceful pocket of Woodbridge, this beautifully presented 4/5 bedroom home offers space, comfort, and convenience on an expansive north-facing 1,012sqm block. Perfect for families seeking room to move while remaining close to schools, parks, and transport.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• Spacious Accommodation<br/>• Four generously sized bedrooms plus a fifth bedroom or study<br/>• Light-filled interiors throughout<br/>• Large master bedroom with private ensuite overlooking courtyard<br/>• Ceiling fans to bedrooms<br/>• Modern & Functional Bathrooms<br/>• Two well-appointed bathrooms<br/>• Separate WC/powder room for added convenience<br/>• Open Plan Living - Expansive open-plan living and dining area overlooking the garden<br/>• Well-appointed kitchen featuring Smeg appliances<br/>• Polished floorboards throughout<br/>• Gas fireplace for cosy winter evenings<br/>• Ducted evaporative air conditioning throughout<br/>• Two reverse-cycle split systems<br/>• Fully reticulated gardens<br/>• Fire pit area<br/>• Unique outdoor powder room<br/>• Large powered shed/workshop<br/>• Double garage with secure parking and additional storage<br/><br/>Ideally located close to:<br/>• Guildford Grammar School<br/>• Woodbridge Primary School<br/>• Local parks, shopping precincts, and public transport options<br/>Enjoy the lifestyle benefits of a quiet neighbourhood while staying connected to everything you need.<br/><br/>Homes of this size and quality in Woodbridge are rarely available for lease.<br/><br/><br/>To register your interest and secure a viewing, please visit www.belleproperty.com/fremantle and click on \"For rent\" under \"Our featured properties\".<br/><br/>Click on \"Book Inspection\", enter your details and select your preferred inspection day and time from the available options.<br/><br/>To submit your application, click on \"Apply Now\". Only applicants that have viewed the property will be processed.<br/><br/>** Photo\'s are for display purposes only and maybe of another apartment. Inspection is recommended.','house','Woodbridge',-31.89241000,115.99485000,6056,'WA','12 Holmesdale Road','Woodbridge',2,5,4,'Acton | Belle Property Fremantle & Guildford','Garage: 2, Open Spaces: 2, Remote Garage, Shed, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Floorboards, Study, Toilets: 3, Workshop'),(5309,'Fully Furnished & Ready to Impress',555,'Move straight in and enjoy easy modern living in this fully furnished 2-bedroom apartment in the sought-after suburb of Coombs. With stunning views, stylish interiors, and internet included, this home offers convenience, comfort, and a seamless lifestyle experience.<br/><br/>Bask in the warmth of a sun-drenched living area featuring floor-to-ceiling windows that frame picturesque views. The textured grey feature wall adds sophistication, complemented by sleek timber furnishings and a soft neutral palette for a relaxing atmosphere. The space flows effortlessly to the outdoor balcony and includes reverse-cycle air conditioning to keep you comfortable year-round.<br/><br/>Enjoy outdoor living on the spacious, covered balcony with elevated views over the surrounding district, with access from both the living room and master bedroom, it\'s the perfect extension of your indoor space.<br/><br/>The sleek kitchen boasts stone benchtops, quality stainless steel appliances, soft-close cabinetry, and a stylish tiled splashback. A thoughtfully designed layout offers ample storage and bench space, ideal for everyday living or hosting guests. <br/><br/>Both bedrooms are generously proportioned and include built-in wardrobes for ample storage. The master retreat extends onto the balcony, offering a private sanctuary with a scenic outlook.<br/><br/>At Del-Rey, life is elevated. Enjoy a rooftop alfresco barbecue and entertaining area nestled among landscaped gardens with panoramic views. This is where indoor sophistication meets outdoor adventure – a peaceful home base that\'s just a short commute to the city, yet surrounded by nature and lifestyle amenities.<br/><br/>Note: open to accepting a short-term lease including a 6-month agreement.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>- Fully furnished<br/>- Internet included<br/>- Bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>- Reverse-cycle air conditioning<br/>- Kitchen with stainless steel appliances<br/>- One allocated car space<br/>- Secure building with lift access<br/>- Rooftop alfresco<br/><br/>Additional Clauses:<br/>Lessors consent is required to keep an animal on the premises<br/>No Smoking<br/>Break Lease Fee<br/>Electricity & Gas charges<br/><br/>EER: 6.0<br/><br/>Insulation: The property holds a valid exemption and is not required to comply with the minimum ceiling insulation standard.<br/><br/>To INSPECT this property...<br/>Please click on the \'Book Inspection\' button & register your details to receive further instructions on how to view the property. You must register to inspect this property to ensure we can notify you of any changes or cancellations. A private inspection of the home may be arranged for pre-approved applicants.<br/><br/>To APPLY for this property...<br/>You will receive an email containing a link to apply after attending the open home. Applications can be received at any time, however, cannot be processed until you have viewed the property in person or online.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: Distinct Properties does not request any payments prior to the finalisation and signing of an approved lease agreement. If you are approached by someone claiming to represent our company or property and asking for payment before this stage, please be aware that this is not a legitimate request, and you should not proceed with any transaction. We advise you to contact us immediately to report the incident. We cannot be held responsible for any payments made to unauthorized parties claiming to represent our company or property prior to the finalization and signing of an approved lease agreement.<br/><br/>Please note that while all care has been taken regarding general information & marketing information compiled for this rental advertisement, Distinct Property Management does not accept responsibility & disclaims all liabilities regarding any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We encourage prospective tenants to rely on their own investigation & in-person inspections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.','apartment','Coombs',-35.31605525,149.03610786,2611,'ACT','312/43 Arthur Blakeley Way','Coombs',1,2,1,'Distinct Properties','Open Spaces: 1, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, 