consent to be sought from the lessor for the keeping of any pets at the premises. Consent must be provided before any pets are at the premises.<br/><br/>RENTING BOOK:<br/>https://www.justice.act.gov.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0008/2443472/Renting-Book-May-2024.pdf','apartment','Braddon',-35.27458376,149.13144575,2612,'ACT','28/28 Mort Street','Braddon',1,1,1,'LJ Hooker - Canberra City','Balcony, Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Reverse-cycle Air Conditioning'),(5311,'Low Maintenance Living in Prime Plympton Location with Self-Contained Granny Flat',1000,'Open for inspection Tuesday 24th February at 5pm for 15 minutes<br/> <br/>$1,000.00 per week<br/>Available Now<br/><br/>To apply for this property, please visit Tenant Options<br/><br/>Welcome to 37 Glenburnie Terrace, Plympton - a beautifully updated character bungalow offering space, flexibility, and lifestyle convenience. Combining timeless heritage charm with modern upgrades, this home also features a fully self-contained granny flat, ideal for extended family, guests, or working from home.<br/><br/>The main residence offers multiple living zones including formal lounge, dining, and a rear family room with seamless indoor/outdoor flow. The main bedroom features an ensuite, sauna, and courtyard outlook, while three additional bedrooms include built-in robes and ceiling fans. A separate study and dedicated laundry add further practicality.<br/><br/>Features we love:<br/>• Multiple living zones with excellent indoor–outdoor flow<br/>• Main bedroom with ensuite and sauna<br/>• Three additional bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>• Self-contained studio with bedroom, bathroom, and living area<br/>• Separate study<br/>• Combustion fireplace<br/>• Multiple reverse-cycle systems for zoned comfort<br/>• 5.5kW solar system with Tesla Powerwall 2 battery<br/>• Alarm system and electric front gate<br/>• Cellar under studio<br/>• Double carport plus powered double garage<br/>• Irrigated gardens and established landscaping<br/>• NBN connectivity<br/><br/>Ideally located between the CBD and the coast, this home is minutes to the Glenelg tram, approximately 10–12 minutes to Glenelg Beach, and close to Weigall Oval, cafés, shopping precincts, and quality schools including Plympton International College. A rare opportunity to secure a spacious and versatile home in a highly sought-after suburb.<br/><br/>For more information, please contact Taylah at<br/>[REDACTED EMAIL]<br/><br/>Disclaimer at noakesnickolas.com.au | RLA 318522','house','Plympton',-34.95835305,138.55858728,5038,'SA','37 Glenburnie Terrace','Plympton',3,5,4,'Noakes Nickolas - RLA 315571','Garage: 4'),(5312,'Neat and Tidy Home Available For Rent!',380,'TO APPLY FOR THIS PROPERTY<br/>Submit your application via - www.2apply.com.au/login<br/><br/>Ray White Mount Gambier proudly presents 2 Burcham Street, Mt Gambier for Lease.<br/><br/>This well-presented, three-bedroom stone home is a fantastic property to move in to. Set amidst low-maintenance gardens, the home boasts a large lounge with polished timber floors, creating a warm and inviting space. The kitchen/dining area is equipped with an electric stove, perfect for family meals, while the renovated bathroom adds a modern touch to the home.<br/><br/>The main bedroom features built-in robes, providing plenty of storage, and the updated laundry adds further convenience. The freshly painted interior ensures the home is ready for you to move in and make it your own.<br/><br/>Outside, you\'ll find a single iron garage with power, a single carport, and a secure rear yard, offering privacy and space for outdoor activities. The beautiful established trees provide shade and atmosphere, while a garden shed is included for extra storage.<br/><br/>Additional Information:<br/>Lease Term: 12 Months<br/>Pets: Pets upon application<br/>RLA: 291952','house','Mount Gambier',-37.81656152,140.78168822,5290,'SA','2 Burcham Street','Mount Gambier',1,3,2,'Ray White Mt Gambier -