ingle garage with automatic roller door and built-in cupboard storage, providing both convenience and valuable extra space.<br/>- Solar panels and battery to keep your energy bills near zero.<br/>- Ducted reverse cycle heating and cooling for year-round comfort<br/><br/>Close the Door On:<br/>- Long commutes and weekend traffic, with Grange Beach just moments away and easy access to public transport connecting you directly to the CBD.<br/>- School run stress, with quality local schools including Grange Primary and Seaton High School close by, along with reputable private options within easy reach.<br/>- Limited shopping options, thanks to nearby Westfield West Lakes, specialty stores along Jetty Street and convenient local supermarkets just minutes from home.<br/><br/>This is your opportunity to secure a spacious, well-located coastal home designed for easy living. Move in, settle down, and experience the very best of Grange right at your doorstep.<br/><br/>Bond – $5,370<br/>Lease Term – 12 months<br/>Water Charges – Quarterly supply and usage<br/>Unfurnished<br/>Exclusions - The security cameras and the elite cloud remote security alarm access are excluded from this lease and not available for tenants use. <br/><br/>WOULD YOU LIKE TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY?<br/>Please submit an enquiry to register your details and be notified of all available inspection times plus receive our online application form.<br/>To view and apply for our other available properties please visit www.ocre.com.au/rent<br/><br/>OUWENS CASSERLY - MAKE IT HAPPEN ™<br/>RLA: 275403/223245<br/><br/>All information or material provided has been obtained from third party sources and, as such, we cannot guarantee that the information or material is accurate. Ouwens Casserly Real Estate Pty Ltd accepts no liability for any errors or omissions (including, but not limited to, a property\'s floor plans and land size, building condition or age). Interested parties should make their own enquiries and obtain thei