ms at our discretion. The inclusion of any images, descriptions, or amenities does not constitute a guarantee of their existence or condition.','house','Darch',-31.81346272,115.85257384,6065,'WA','22 Tony Martin Way','Darch',2,4,2,'Listed Estate Agents - HILLARYS','Garage: 2, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1'),(5340,'STUNNING 4 BEDROOM HOME',715,'To inspect and apply for this property you must register for the next open inspection by clicking the \'book inspection\' button in the inspection section.<br/><br/>Welcome to this stunning and contemporary rental property located in the sought-after suburb of Ingle Farm, SA 5098. Perfectly designed for modern living, this exquisite residence boasts high-end features and a versatile layout suited for families and professionals alike.<br/><br/>Upon entering, you are greeted by brand new 2.7m high ceilings that enhance the sense of space throughout the home. The open plan design seamlessly connects the kitchen, dining, and lounge areas, creating a welcoming environment for both relaxation and entertaining. The chef-inspired kitchen is a culinary delight with Caesar stone benchtops and gas hot plates, perfect for preparing gourmet meals.<br/><br/>This beautiful home offers 4 generously-sized bedrooms—4th bedroom\'s ideal as a home office or additional guest room. The main bedroom is a true retreat, featuring an ensuite with a double vanity and walk-in robe for all your wardrobe needs. Bedrooms 2 and 3 are equipped with built-in wardrobes, providing ample storage space.<br/><br/>Comfort is ensured year-round with ducted reverse cycle air conditioning, offering climate control at the touch of a button. The property includes two stylish bathrooms, each with a modern double vanity, catering to the demands of a busy household.<br/><br/>Step outside to discover a landscaped garden, beautifully maintained with an efficient watering system. The outdoor entertaining area is perfect for hosting gatherings with family and friends or simply