al living. <br/><br/>Ducted heating ensures warmth throughout the cooler months, while the low-maintenance gardens mean more time to relax and enjoy the home. Off-street parking for 3 cars provides ease and security, and the location is ideal-just a short drive to Queanbeyan\'s CBD and local amenities, with shops and public transport conveniently close by. <br/><br/>Full of character and space, this is a home that combines timeless appeal with modern practicality, ready to welcome its next residents. Enquire today to make it yours.<br/><br/><br/>More Details-<br/><br/>- Recently renovated throughout <br/>- Six-bedroom, two-storey home <br/>- North-facing aspect <br/>- Large kitchen with gas cooktop, fridge freezer, and dishwasher <br/>- Spacious laundry/utility room <br/>- Four upstairs bedrooms with raked ceilings, two downstairs bedrooms <br/>- Balcony off the second storey with views <br/>- Automatic electric shutters <br/>- Ducted heating throughout <br/>- Low-maintenance gardens <br/>- Off-street parking for 3 cars<br/>- Close to shops, transport, and Queanbeyan\'s CBD<br/><br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Please note that while all care has been taken regarding general information and marketing information compiled for this rental advertisement, Jonny Warren Properties does not accept responsibility and disclaim all liabilities in regard to any errors or inaccuracies contained herein. We encourage prospective tenants to rely on their own investigation and in-person inspections to ensure this property meets their individual needs and circumstances.<br/><br/>INSPECTIONS:<br/>1. Click on \'book inspection\'<br/>2. Register to join an existing inspection<br/>3. If no time available, please register your details to ensure you are advised when a time has been scheduled.<br/>4. If you do not register, we can\'t notify you of any changes or further inspection times <br/><br/>','house','Karabar',-35.36206283,149.23197944,2620,'NSW','10 Fergus Road','Karabar',2,6,3,'Jonny Warre