 this home is ready for modern living.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>- Four generous bedrooms with built-in wardrobes<br/>- Spacious master retreat with walk-in robe and private ensuite<br/>- Elegant formal living area plus expansive open-plan family and dining zone<br/>- Modern kitchen with ample bench space and storage<br/>- Dedicated study nook – ideal for working from home<br/>- Large covered pergola perfect for entertaining and weekend BBQs<br/>- Brand new heated swimming pool – ready for summer enjoyment<br/>- Monthly pool maintenance included (chemicals charged to tenants)<br/>- Solar panel system helping reduce electricity expenses<br/>- Tesla EV charger installed<br/>- Large backyard with plenty of space for children to play<br/><br/>Prime Location Convenience:<br/>- Enjoy easy access to everything your family needs:<br/>- Minutes to Quakers Hill railway station for an easy city commute<br/>- Short drive to Schofields railway station and Tallawong Metro<br/>- Close to quality schools including Quakers Hill Public School and Quakers Hill High School<br/>- Convenient shopping at Quakers Court<br/>- Easy access to the M7 Motorway<br/>- Moments from Quakers Hill Park for weekend recreation<br/><br/>Offering privacy, space, lifestyle upgrades and exceptional convenience, this stunning home presents a rare rental opportunity in a tightly held pocket of Quakers Hill.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: This advertisement is a guide only. Whilst all information has been gathered from sources, we deem to be reliable, we do not guarantee the accuracy of this information, nor do we accept responsibility for any action taken by intending tenants in reliance on this information. No warranty can be given either by the purchasers or their agents.<br/>less','house','Quakers Hill',-33.72226343,150.88577787,2763,'NSW','14 Scotney Place','Quakers Hill',2,4,2,'Louis Carr Hills District','Open Spaces: 2, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Ensuite: 1, Floorboards'),(5601,'Immaculate, Spacious Modern Family Home in a Quiet Location of Colyton!',850,'Leaving No Stone Unturned this Stunning Family Home is Positioned in a Quiet Cul-De-Sac of Colyton! Situated in a Prime Location just Minutes to Local Shops, Schools, Major Roads Including the Great Western Highway and M4, this Home is Perfect for Families Looking for Space with Convenience and Comfort! <br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>+ Spacious and Light Filled Living, Dining Area with Natural Flowing Access to Alfresco Areas! <br/>+ Immaculate Modern Kitchen fitted with Stainless Steel Appliances, Dishwasher, Rangehood, Electric Cooking and Stovetop! <br/>+ Secondary Living Area - Perfect for Entertaining and Relaxing!<br/>+ Master Bedroom fitted with a Generous Walk-In Wardrobe and Beautiful Ensuite!<br/>+ Three Remaining Bedrooms fitted with Double Built In Wardrobes and Ceiling Fans to All Rooms for Perfect Comfort and Convenience!<br/>+ Modern Main Bathroom fitted with Separate Shower and Bath! <br/>+ Perfect for the Entertainers - Separate Undercover Alfresco Areas, Perfect for Weekend BBQ\'s, Catch Up\'s and Relaxing! <br/>+ Ducted A/C Throughout for Extra Year Round Comfort! <br/>+ Double Lock Up Garage with Internal Access and Remote Control Access! <br/>+ Extra Peace of Mind with Alarm and Camera Systems! <br/>+ Low Maintenance Yards! <br/><br/>REGISTERING your interest for an upcoming property is easy.<br/><br/>If you are on Real Estate or Domain just click on VIRTUAL TOUR button and send us an email. You will receive an SMS reply to your phone or an email reply with a LINK TO REGISTER your interest in the property or details of the inspection time.<br/><br/>On Laing Simmons website simply CLICK the teal ‘Book Inspection’ button for that rental property<br/><br/>Disclaimer: We have been furnished with above information, however, Laing + Simmons gives no guarantees, undertakings or warnings concerning the accuracy, completeness or up-to-date nature of the information provided.<br/>All interested parties are responsible for their own independent enquiries in order to determine whether or not this information is in fact accurate.','house','Colyton',-33.77718737,150.79965570,2760,'NSW','17 Valma Place','Colyton',2,4,2,'Laing+Simmons - The Abassi Group','Fully Fenced, Garage: 2, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Shed, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher'),(5602,'Comfortable & Convenient 2 Bedroom Unit!',380,'Positioned on the first floor of a quiet, well-maintained complex, this neat and functional apartment offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience.<br/><br/>Key Features:<br/><br/>* Two well-sized bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes<br/>* Carpeted flooring throughout<br/>* Open-plan living area with split system air conditioning<br/>* Modern kitchen with electric cooking and ample storage<br/>* Tidy bathroom <br/>* Communal laundry facilities and washing machine connection<br/>* Designated car space for added ease<br/><br/>Located just moments from Kingswood Train Station, Nepean Hospital, Western Sydney University, and Penrith Selective High School, this property also offers easy access to local primary schools, childcare centres, takeaway shops, parks, ovals, and a variety of everyday amenities—all contributing to a highly convenient lifestyle.<br/><br/>Please be advised that times for inspections are subject to change based on enquiries. You will be contacted of any said changes to times if you are registered to property.<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: Every precaution has been taken to establish accuracy of the above information but does not constitute any representation by the owner or agent. Information is gathered from sources we believe to be reliable; we cannot guarantee its accuracy and interested persons should rely on their own enquiries.','unit','Kingswood',-33.75936489,150.72135788,2747,'NSW','5/174 Great Western Highway','Kingswood',1,2,1,'Laing+Simmons - Wentworthville','Open Spaces: 1'),(5603,'Low Maintenance Granny Flat in an Ideal Location!',490,'If you’re looking for a Neat and Tidy Granny Flat in a Great Location with Modern Features and an Easy Care Lifestyle, then this is for you! Situated in the Heart of Erskine Park, Minutes Drive to St Clair Shopping Centre, Erskine Park Shopping Strip and Easy Access to the M4!<br/><br/>Features Include:<br/>+ Two Fairly Sized Bedrooms Both with Mirorred Built-Ins!<br/>+ Open Plan Living and Dining!<br/>+ Carpeted Living and Bedroom Areas!<br/>+ Modern Bathroom Fitted with Spacious Shower!<br/>+ Split-System A/C in Lounge Area!<br/>+ Seperate Internal Laundry!<br/>+ Low Maintenance Yard!<br/>+ Modern Kitchen with Ample Cupboard Storage!<br/>+ Short Drive to all Local Amenities!<br/><br/>REGISTER TO INSPECT:<br/>If you are on Real Estate or Domain just click on REQUEST AN INSPECTION and you will be booked in. Please note you must be registered to inspect or you will not be able to view this as apart of NSW Public Health orders.<br/><br/>On Laing + Simmons website simply CLICK the teal \'Book Inspection\' button for that rental property & REGISTER your interest.','flat','Erskine Park',-33.81055846,150.80926312,2759,'NSW','25A Pegasus Street','Erskine Park',1,2,2,'Laing+Simmons - The Abassi Group','Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes'),(5604,'Luxury 2 Bedroom Apartment',660,'Move into Penrith\'s best built apartments in a premium location. One Eastside is one you don\'t want to miss. An all-encompassing lifestyle for lovers of river walks, café culture, door step amenity and world class design, ESQ marks a new milestone in this river city\'s inspiring journey.<br/><br/>This luxury apartment is located on the fourth floor and features the following:<br/><br/>- Resident access to resort-style pool, located in the neighbouring Aqua apartment block<br/>- Ducted Air conditioning <br/>- Built-in robes to both bedrooms<br/>- Ensuite bathroom to main bedroom<br/>- SMEG Appliances including dishwasher, microwave & clothes dryer<br/>- 40mm Stone Benchtops<br/>- Mirrored Splashbacks<br/>- Under cabinet LED lighting in kitchen and bathroom<br/>- Engineered Timber Flooring<br/>- 100% Wool Blend Carpet to Bedrooms<br/>- Floor to ceiling tiles in bathroom<br/>- Concealed Toilet Cistern<br/>- Frame less Glass Showers<br/>- 9 feet ceilings with shadow lining and blind recess<br/>- Double roller blinds<br/>- Large balcony<br/>- Single underground car space with storage cage and intercom access to building.<br/><br/><br/>Please note: Photos are generic and may not display the unit listed.<br/>Disclaimer: We have been furnished with the above information, however, PRD Penrith gives no guarantees, undertakings or warnings concerning the accuracy, completeness or up-to-date nature of the information provided. All interested parties are responsible for their own independent enquiries in order to determine whether or not this information is in fact accurate.','unit','Penrith',-33.75626644,150.68573714,2750,'NSW','A402/10 Ransley Street','Penrith',2,2,1,'PRD - PENRITH','Balcony, Courtyard, Open Spaces: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Floorboards, Intercom, Study, Toilets: 2'),(5605,'Newly renovated 2 bedroom unit',500,'This well-presented 2 bedroom unit is ideally located just a short walk to the station and local shops, offering convenience and comfort. <br/><br/>The property features:<br/>- 2 great sized bedrooms<br/>- built in robes to both bedrooms<br/>- Brand new carpet<br/>- freshly painted throughout <br/>- Aircon<br/>- spacious lounge & dining area<br/>- neat kitchen with plenty of storage and gas cooking<br/>- bathroom and laundry combined<br/>- single lock up garage for secure parking.<br/>- great balcony off the lounge room<br/><br/>Situated in a thriving suburb, close to public transport, schools, shopping centres, Nepean Hospital and the University of Western Sydney.<br/><br/>Call NSW Realty on [REDACTED PHONE] to book your inspection.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: All information contained herein is gathered by NSW Realty from sources we believe reliable. We have no reason to doubt its accuracy, however we cannot guarantee it. All interested parties should make & rely upon their own enquiries.','apartment','Kingswood',-33.76238230,150.72038285,2747,'NSW','8/26 Bringelly Road','Kingswood',1,2,1,'NSW Realty','Garage: 1, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes'),(5606,'4 Bedroom Family Home',730,'Located in a quiet area, this four bedroom family home offers a spacious layout including multiple indoor and outdoor living spaces. Conveniently positioned close by to local Village (1.1km), train station (1.5km) and schools (2kms).<br/><br/>- Updated modern kitchen has ample storage, dishwasher and adjacent dining space.<br/>- Upstairs living room at the front of the home, plus second large rumpus room or storage area downstairs.<br/>- Main bedroom boasts \'parents retreat\' living area, ensuite and WIR.<br/><br/>- 3 other well proportioned bedrooms, each with built-in robe.<br/>- Ducted gas heating, large covered rear deck overlooking the bush and rear yard.<br/>- Double tandem carport.<br/><br/>*Available 10/03/2026<br/><br/>*Please Note: Online applications will not be processed until applicant has viewed the property.','house','Hazelbrook',-33.71468811,150.44922137,2779,'NSW','21 Dunoon Drive','Hazelbrook',2,4,2,'Mid Mountains Real Estate','Carport: 2, Deck, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ducted Heating, Ensuite: 1, Floorboards, Rumpus Room, Toilets: 2'),(5607,'Well Presented Home with Space, Privacy & Convenience',620,'This well-presented home offers comfort, privacy, and plenty of room to move. With two living areas and well-separated bedrooms, it’s ideal for families or those needing extra space to work from home.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>*3 bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes<br/>*Large bathroom with separate toilet<br/>*Separate lounge and dining areas<br/>*Near new hybrid flooring throughout<br/>*Spacious kitchen with dishwasher<br/>*Private, low-maintenance backyard<br/>*Split system air conditioning<br/>*Single lock-up garage with internal access<br/><br/>Located in a peaceful street, just moments to local schools, parks, and shopping. Easy access to Dunheved Rd and The Northern Rd.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: We have been furnished with the above information however, PRD Penrith & PRD Blue Mountains gives no guarantees, undertakings or warnings concerning the accuracy, completeness or up-to-date nature of the information provided. All interested parties are responsible for their own independent enquiries in order to determine whether or not this information is in fact accurate.','house','Werrington Downs',-33.74251059,150.73084899,2747,'NSW','37 Ploughman Cres','Werrington Downs',1,3,1,'PRD - PENRITH','Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Air Conditioning, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Toilets: 1');
