mation is accurate, and do not have any belief one way or the other in its accuracy. We do not accept any responsibility to any person for its accuracy and do no more than pass it on. All interested parties should make and rely upon their own inquiries in order to determine whether or not this information is , in fact, accurate.<br/>','house','Glenmore Park',-33.80039030,150.67947173,2745,'NSW','145 Glenmore Ridge Drive','Glenmore Park',2,3,2,'Dukes Estate Agents','Garage: 2, Toilets: 2'),(5610,'Perfect Property In Prime Position',750,'This tightly held property is centrally located, close to amenities including: Wetherill Park TAFE , Fairfield Hospital, stockland Shopping Centre, School and Public transport.<br/>Property Features:<br/>* 4 bedroom with Mirrored Built-ins plus teenage retreat<br/>* Renovated Kitchen with Stone Bench Tops<br/><br/>* Combined Lounge and dinning room<br/>* Tiled flooring Throughout<br/>* Split-System A/C<br/>* Lock-Up Garage','house','Wetherill Park',-33.84819864,150.92075663,2164,'NSW','208 Victoria Road','Wetherill Park',2,4,3,'First National - Liverpool','Carport: 2, Garage: 1'),(5611,'Near New - Stunning Apartment',675,'Perfectly positioned above the Glenmore Village, this residence offers convenience, style, and modern comfort at its best.<br/><br/>It features two bedrooms, both with mirrored built-in robes. Master room with ensuite bathroom & private balcony.<br/><br/>Open-plan lounge & dining areas flowing onto a huge entertainer’s balcony. Perfect space to gather guests.<br/><br/>Sleek kitchen with gas cooking, stone benchtops, dishwasher, and breakfast bar.<br/><br/>If you work from home, the spacious study is the perfect space for your setup.<br/><br/>Internal laundry with dryer and second sleek bathroom.<br/><br/>Other inclusions this home offers include: ducted air-conditioning, intercom security, LED lighting, blinds, single carspace, and in a secure building with lift access.<br/><br/>Positioned within a few steps to:<br/>