a or unwinding on the balcony after a long day, this home offers countless opportunities to embrace the outdoor lifestyle.<br/><br/>Box Hill represents one of Sydney\'s most exciting residential developments, strategically positioned just 48 kilometres north-west of the CBD within The Hills Shire. This rapidly growing community is part of the NSW Government\'s North West Priority Growth Area, ensuring excellent infrastructure development and long-term value growth.<br/><br/>Families will appreciate the area\'s commitment to education and childcare facilities, with new schools and services continuously being developed to serve the growing community. The location offers excellent connectivity to major transport routes including Windsor Road and Annangrove Road, making commutes to the city or other business districts both convenient and efficient.<br/><br/>The suburb\'s planned growth to accommodate over 42,000 residents ensures a vibrant, established community atmosphere while maintaining the peaceful, family-friendly environment that makes Box Hill so special. Shopping centres and recreational facilities are being developed alongside the residential growth, creating a complete lifestyle destination.<br/><br/>','house','Box Hill',-33.66255790,150.90727975,2765,'NSW','10 Robbins Lane','Box Hill',3,4,1,'@realty - National Head Office Australia','Balcony, Courtyard, Fully Fenced, Garage: 1, Outdoor Entertaining Area, Remote Garage, Secure Parking, Air Conditioning, Alarm System, Broadband Internet Available, Built-in Wardrobes, Dishwasher, Ensuite: 1, Intercom'),(5752,'LAKESIDE LIVING IN JORDAN SPRINGS - 2 X CAR-SPACES!!',650,'This fantastic apartment offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience in the heart of Jordan Springs.<br/><br/>Features include;<br/><br/>Two bedrooms - both with built-in wardrobes<br/>Modern kitchen with stone bench tops and gas cooktop<br/>Open plan living area with split system air conditioner<br/>Two bedrooms - both with built-in wardro