-Term Accommodation (STA) or Respite<br/>• Medium-Term Accommodation (MTA)<br/>• Transitional or Community-Based Disability Housing<br/>• Student or Worker Accommodation<br/><br/>Every element of this home has been carefully considered to support participant wellbeing, provider efficiency, and long-term operational success.<br/><br/>This isn\'t just a place to live, it\'s a comprehensive supported-living solution.<br/><br/>The property\'s combination of private living spaces and well-appointed communal zones ensures residents experience both independence and connection. Its accessible, single-level design, high-quality construction, and premium inclusions make it an unparalleled option for head-lease or direct operation under the NDIS framework.<br/><br/>Enquire Now:<br/>Opportunities of this calibre are extremely limited.<br/>Contact us today to discuss this brand-new, purpose-built supported accommodation residence.','studio','St Marys',-33.76966695,150.77935015,2760,'NSW','165 Glossop Street','St Marys',10,10,5,'National Real Estate - Guildford','Open Spaces: 5'),(6726,'The Perfect Starter',510,'Positioned in Box Hill\'s newest land development, a prime offering in \'The Hills of Carmel\' Estate, this near new 2 bedroom granny flat presents the perfect opportunity to be part of this prestige family-friendly community close to major retail centres, National Parks, sporting facilities and schools.<br/><br/>Location Highlights: <br/>• Open plan lounge and dining room with lots of natural light which steps out onto private patio<br/>• Light filled kitchen with quality s/s appliances, gas cooking & stone benchtops<br/>• Main bedroom with walk in robe and mirrored built-in robe to the second <br/>• Ducted air conditioning throughout<br/>• Take advantage of a low maintenance and convenient lifestyle <br/>• Close to Rouse Hill Public School and Vineyard Public School<br/>• Located minutes\' drive to Vineyard railway, will provide direct access to Sydney CBD via the Richm